window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1501,"title":"Chapter 1501 - 809 Rouge","paragraphs":["Shouldn’t be the case...","Mo Hua thought about the time when he was trapped in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons: either disheartened or uneasy, without a bit of resolve, just munching on the jerky Mo Hua gave him as he got by. He silently shook his head at Song Jian.","The Sever Gold Sect is full of savvy people; with Song Jian’s level of intelligence and tactics, how could he possibly rise to power?","To manage to be an Elder is quite already decent.","Mo Hua then tossed the matter out of his mind.","After returning to the Sect, he taught Yu Er some Formation for a while, then returned to his room, reviewed his lessons for a bit, and once 1 p.m arrived, he continued practicing Formation at the Taoist Stele.","The Second Grade Eighteen-Pattern Formation given by Elder Master Xun, he had almost mastered it.","Now, he was practicing the Nineteen-Pattern Formation.","Nineteen Patterns is truly the Second Grade High-Level Formation.","It’s also the limit of what a general Second Grade Formation Master can control.","For an ordinary Formation Master, learning the Nineteen-Pattern Formation might require some time for comprehension, practice, and research to gradually grasp it.","But for Mo Hua, the Nineteen-Pattern Formation is practically no different from the Eighteen-Pattern Formation.","Benefiting from the Taoist Stele in his Sea of Consciousness, the strong foundation of his Divine Sense, and the quick recovery from Meditation Technique, his amount of Formation practice is almost ten times, or even dozens of times, that of regular Formation Masters.","Practice makes perfect.","And he himself has a high level of comprehension.","After Divine Sense Sublimation, a blend of Divinity, close to the Great Dao, his understanding of Formation is even more transparent.","Besides, with guidance from Elder Master Xun, as long as the Divine Sense is in place, this sort of general Formation, even if it’s the high-end Second Grade Nineteen-Pattern Formation, he learns it swiftly.","Practicing Nineteen-Pattern Formation also rather significantly enhances the Divine Sense.","But this enhancement is still far from enough.","Because beyond the Nineteen Patterns is the great hurdle of Twentieth Patterns, separated by the Heavenly Chasm.","Above this, each bit of progress requires a vast amount of Divine Sense.","Mo Hua sighed slightly.","\"It truly is too slow; at this rate, I’m afraid I won’t be able to give Elder Master Xun any surprises...\"","He still needs to find some other methods.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and immediately sent a transmission to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, how is the matchmaking going?\"","Soon, Gu Changhuai corrected, looking rather upset:","\"It’s not matchmaking, it’s investigating a case.\"","\"Mm-hmm, investigating a case.\"","\"There are clues.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, \"What clues?\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t say, but hesitated for a moment before furrowing his brows and saying, \"On my aunt’s side...\"","\"Don’t worry, leave it to me!\" Mo Hua assured boldly.","Gu Changhuai sighed, then said:","\"That woman named Hua, I took the initiative to meet with her, she didn’t refuse...\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Uncle Gu showed some progress after all.","Yet, that Instructor Hua agreed so simply, Mo Hua felt a bit suspicious.","But then he thought, it might be due to Uncle Gu’s face that the woman didn’t refuse.","After all, whether male or female, being good-looking does indeed serve well.","Gu Changhuai continued, \"I invited... that woman to dine in a private room at a restaurant in Hundred Flowers City. During the meal, I patiently chatted with her off and on, but didn’t gain much.\"","\"This woman kept a fake smile on her face, talked without leaving a trace, obviously quite guarded. When key topics arose, she either pretended to be reserved and smiled without speaking or acted coquettishly, tossing her head and batting her eyes, really annoying...\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","He imagined the scene at that time and internally criticized:","Pretending to be reserved, smiling without speaking, tossing her head and batting her eyes, isn’t that showing goodwill towards you...","Alas, it’s a pity Uncle Gu, who’s been a Supervisor too long, has a brain that works a bit differently from others.","That Instructor Hua truly threw her seductive glances at a blind man.","\"Then what?\" Mo Hua asked again.","\"Afterward, I simply sent her back to the Sect...\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but say, \"That’s it?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"What else do you want?\"","\"Alright,\" Mo Hua sighed, \"Then the clues? Surely there’s more than just this...\"","\"Mm,\" Gu Changhuai said, \"During the meal, she inadvertently said a few words...\"","\"What words?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"I asked her, when not teaching at the Sect, what does she usually do? She said cultivation, preparing lessons, occasionally going out with some sisters to buy flowers, making Flower Pills, or going to Bai Xiang Pavilion to buy some rouge...\"","Mo Hua pondered these words in his mind, then frowned, \"These are very ordinary things, aren’t they?\"","\"These words are indeed very ordinary.\" Gu Changhuai said, \"But when she said them, her tone changed slightly, her expression became a bit tense, and her gaze subconsciously evaded, as if suddenly realizing something she shouldn’t have mentioned.\"","\"The words are not the problem, but her demeanor is.","\"And that demeanor was fleeting; afterward, her smile widened, she became warmer to me, even deliberately drew close and poured me wine...\"","\"Clearly trying to use her looks to distract me from what she said.\"","Mo Hua paused for a moment.","For a moment, she genuinely felt Uncle Gu was impressive...","Observing keenly, staying composed, unfazed by charm.","\"Do you know which words are problematic?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"Bai Xiang Pavilion.\"","\"Bai Xiang Pavilion?\"","Gu Changhuai mused for a moment, then said:","\"I recalled carefully, when she said these three words, her expression was normal, but afterward, she clearly paused, then immediately realized she shouldn’t have said these three words and tried to cover it up...","\"Is there a Bai Xiang Pavilion in Hundred Flowers City?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes,\" Gu Changhuai said, \"I had Gu An and Gu Quan investigate, there are four Bai Xiang Pavilions in Hundred Flowers City, but that woman typically only goes to one, and this Bai Xiang Pavilion is also known as ’Bai Xiang Pavilion.’"]},{"number":1502,"title":"Chapter 1502 - 809 Rouge_2","paragraphs":["\"Bai Xiang Pavilion...\" Mo Hua pondered, then asked, \"Is there any problem with this Bai Xiang Pavilion?\"","\"On the surface, there’s no problem.\" Gu Changhuai said, \"So, I used this as a clue and looked into that woman again. After some investigation...\"","Gu Changhuai slightly frowned, \"...That woman with the surname ’Hua’, every ten days or half a month, she would visit Bai Xiang Pavilion to purchase rouge and powder. After buying, she doesn’t hurriedly return to the Sect but takes a Hundred Flower Valley carriage and leaves Hundred Flowers City, passing through several nearby Immortal Cities adjacent to the Sects, and continues outwards, leaving the Qianxue state boundary...\"","\"Afterwards, she would pass through a few nearby Little Immortal Cities, then from Qingzhou City, return to the Qianxue state boundary, passing by the Taoist Court’s entrance, and returns to Hundred Flower Valley.\"","Mo Hua was somewhat confused, \"What’s she doing by making such a big circle?\"","\"Buying rouge.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua was a bit incredulous, \"Just to buy rouge?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"Yes, I later checked it over again and discovered indeed she bought some different kinds of rouge and powder, more or less, in every Immortal City.\"","Mo Hua pondered, \"This... seems suspicious...\"","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"At first, I also thought it was suspicious, but then I asked my cousin, and she said it wasn’t. She said women are like this, they just have to buy so much rouge and powder...\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","\"Then what? Are there any other clues?\" Mo Hua asked again.","It can’t be that after all this fuss, it just comes down to this Instructor Hua loving to buy rouge and powder.","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"The time was short, and I found limited information. Having this much is already not bad. What more can you ask for? However...\"","Gu Changhuai hesitated for a moment, sending a message:","\"There is one last point that is somewhat suspicious... That woman, after leaving Bai Xiang Pavilion, making a circle and returning to Hundred Flower Valley, one of the Little Immortal Cities she passed through was Mistwater City!\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow.","\"Mistwater City!\"","Mistwater City, where the Ye family is located, is also the Mistwater City through which the Mistwater River flows.","Such clues begin to form a connection.","But there wasn’t more information from Gu Changhuai’s side either.","After all, he had only dined with Hua Ruyu once and talked not too much, to have gotten these clues was already quite good.","\"Uncle Gu, you should arrange a few more meetings, maybe you could learn something else,\" Mo Hua encouraged.","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"I won’t arrange more.\"","\"Why?\" Mo Hua was puzzled, \"It could be a meal, a date, and investigating the case, achieving three things with one move, isn’t that great?\"","\"If you want to go, go yourself. I don’t have time for now; in a few days, I’ll make a trip to Mistwater City.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua immediately said, \"I’ll go too, Uncle Gu, take me with you.\"","\"Why do you want to go?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","\"To find out the true cause of Senior Sister Ye Jin’s death and bring justice to her!\" Mo Hua said with determination.","Hearing this, Gu Changhuai, relying on his instinct as a Dao Court Canon, felt a hint of suspicion.","There’s something off.","This kid Mo Hua, while not bad-hearted, is definitely not the type of warm-hearted good person.","Why is he so concerned about the death of a female disciple from Hundred Flower Valley for no apparent reason?","What does the affair of Hundred Flower Valley have to do with a disciple of Taixu Gate?","Very suspicious...","Gu Changhuai sent a message: \"Are you hiding something from me? Be honest, what’s your real reason for investigating this?\"","Mo Hua felt a bit guilty but maintained a serious demeanor on the surface:","\"It’s really just to bring justice to Senior Sister Ye Jin!\"","The altar, Demon Monsters, Evil Spirits, are all just incidental.","Moreover, he had promised Senior Sister Ye Jin, who was a half-step Fierce Ghost in Hundred Flower Valley, to avenge her.","Some things cannot be spoken lightly.","Once spoken, one becomes entangled in karma, and words cannot be retracted.","Therefore, saying it’s to bring justice to Senior Sister Ye Jin isn’t wrong either.","Seeing that Mo Hua wouldn’t speak, Gu Changhuai could only drop it.","Even if words were gotten out of him, he wouldn’t know if the crafty Mo Hua would be telling the truth.","Let him be.","\"On the ten-day rest, come to the Taoist Court... no, go to the Gu family to find me, I’ll take you to Mistwater City.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua felt great joy and nodded repeatedly:","\"Uh-huh, thank you, Uncle Gu!\"","\"Also, remember Auntie’s side...\"","Gu Changhuai really couldn’t do much about Elder Gu Hong, so he repeated it again.","\"Don’t worry, I have my own way.\" Mo Hua assured.","Only then did Gu Changhuai feel at ease.","Afterwards, Mo Hua lingered in the Sect for a few more days, attending classes, hunting monsters, and painting formations. Soon it was the ten-day rest.","After being fully prepared, he went to the Gu family early in the morning.","Upon arriving at the Gu family, after greeting Aunt Wan and having some pastries, Mo Hua went to the study to find Gu Changhuai.","Beside Gu Changhuai, there were two other people.","Seeing this, Mo Hua was delighted and greeted with a smile, \"Little Brother An, Little Brother Quan, long time no see.\"","Gu An and Gu Quan also cupped their hands in salute, smiling, \"Good day, young master.\"","Mo Hua curiously asked, \"Are you going too?\"","\"Yes,\" Gu An nodded, \"since we’re investigating a case, more people mean more clues, and we can help the young master run errands as well.\"","\"Indeed.\"","Seeing Mo Hua had arrived, Gu Changhuai said directly, \"Let’s depart. The sooner we go, the sooner we return. Don’t delay.\"","\"Okay.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Afterward, the group set off in the Gu family’s carriage.","Leaving the Gu family, the carriage went straight along, passing through Qingzhou City, following the Mistwater River route, heading all the way to Mistwater City.","The Gu family’s carriage was very fast, not stopping at any of the Little Immortal Cities they passed. After about an hour, they arrived at Mistwater City.","In Mistwater City, there was a \"Water Incense Pavilion,\" which sold rouge and powder."]},{"number":1503,"title":"Chapter 1503 - 809 Rouge_3","paragraphs":["It was exactly at that Hundred Flowers Valley, the instructor named Hua Ruyu, on her way through Mistwater City, bought cosmetics.","Most of those who entered the Water Incense Pavilion were women.","Even if there were men, they were accompanying women inside, and it was rare for male cultivators to enter such cosmetic shops alone.","Mo Hua glanced at Gu Changhuai, then at Gu An and Gu Quan, and asked, \"How do we investigate?\"","The four of them, three grown men and a young boy like himself, entering and asking questions everywhere would surely be suspicious.","Gu An then said, \"I know a few female officers. They come from reputable families and are reliable. I’ve already spoken to them to come to the cosmetic shop and help gather some information. They’ll be here later.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, looked at Gu An, somewhat shocked.","It truly goes to show one can’t judge by appearances. Who would have thought honest and stable Little Brother An had such connections?","He then turned his head to look at Gu Changhuai and shook his head slightly.","The implication was, look at Little Brother An, an enforcement leader who knows several female officers, while you, Uncle Gu, a supervisor, don’t even know a single female cultivator.","Mo Hua didn’t say this explicitly.","But Gu Changhuai, seeing his expression, largely understood what he meant, and his face darkened immediately.","However, in front of Gu An and Gu Quan, he didn’t bother to argue with Mo Hua.","After a while, sure enough, two women came over.","Both had Foundation Establishment cultivation and weren’t wearing Taoist Court official robes, but instead wore pretty dresses, dressed like ordinary beauty-loving women from respected families.","The two women first saluted Gu Changhuai and then greeted Gu An.","Gu An smiled and said, \"I entrust you two ladies with this task.\"","The two female officers smiled back and replied, \"It’s our duty.\"","Afterward, the two female officers walked hand in hand into the Water Incense Pavilion, while Gu An and Gu Quan gathered information outside the shop.","Mo Hua and Gu Changhuai looked for a tea house, drinking tea and eating pine nuts while gossiping.","After more than an hour, everyone reconvened at the tea house, got a private room, and compiled the gathered intelligence.","\"The owner of the Water Incense Pavilion is a Foundation Establishment Peak cultivator, slightly plump, and a native of Mistwater City.\"","\"We asked him if his rouge was good, and he boasted about how his rouge was the most popular in Mistwater City. Not only would local noblewomen come to choose his cosmetics, but even women from great families and sects in Qianxue State would often visit to buy rouge from him...\"","\"I said I didn’t believe him, so he listed some, including a female elder from the Hundred Flowers Sect.\"","\"Elder?\"","\"I guess he’s exaggerating, deliberately calling the instructor an elder.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","The female officer continued, \"We took the opportunity to ask about the ’female elder’ from the Hundred Flowers Valley. It turns out this ’female elder’ does come by now and then to buy cosmetics.\"","\"Moreover, not only does she buy cosmetics, but when she sees beautiful young women, she approaches to chat. She’s stunning herself and knows a lot about cosmetics, with exquisite makeup. Plus, being an ’elder’ from the Hundred Flowers Valley, she easily gets along with these young women.\"","\"The owner said if they hit it off, this Hundred Flowers Valley ’female elder’ might even recommend some girls to join the ’Twelve Streams’ of Qianxue, one of which is the Hundred Flowers Valley.\"","Recommending... joining the Hundred Flowers Valley?","Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed slightly.","Gu Changhuai’s expression also darkened slightly.","This Instructor Hua, lingering in cosmetic shops across the immortal cities, probably has ulterior motives...","\"That’s all the information we gathered...\"","The two female officers said.","Gu Quan interjected, \"I asked some of the nearby shop owners, and indeed, every now and then, a luxurious carriage embroidered with hundreds of flowers would stop outside the Water Incense Pavilion.\"","\"This carriage is likely from the Hundred Flowers Valley.\"","\"But the carriage is enclosed, so it’s practically impossible to see inside from the outside.\"","\"And after staying for a while, approximately half an hour each time, the carriage would leave Mistwater City and head upstream along the Mistwater River...\"","\"Based on their descriptions, I’ve roughly recreated the appearance of the carriage...\"","...","Following that, everyone shared some fragmented, varied small pieces of information.","This information might not be useful, but just in case, nothing could be overlooked.","After the information was shared, Gu Changhuai nodded:","\"Thank you for your hard work.\"","Then he nodded at Gu An.","Gu An stood up and said with a smile, \"I’ll escort the two ladies and buy some cosmetics as a thank you gift.\"","The two female officers thanked him with smiles, evidently very happy.","Afterward, Gu An escorted the two female officers away.","Gu Quan took out a jade slip and meticulously recorded the corresponding information to prevent any seemingly trivial but potentially crucial details from being overlooked.","When Gu An returned, Gu Changhuai had a thoughtful look.","Gu An frowned and said, \"Supervisor, this Instructor Hua indeed seems suspicious.\"","Gu Changhuai nodded slightly.","\"Though there’s an issue, as it stands, it seems we have no solid evidence, not even clear leads...\" Gu Quan said.","\"Yes, you can see she’s cautious in her actions, leaving no glaring flaws for us to figure out her intentions.\"","Gu An thought for a while, without much insight, then asked Gu Changhuai:","\"Where should we start next?\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment and said, \"Follow the carriage’s route along the Mistwater River. We’ll also go check. A snake cannot slither without leaving a trace.\"","Having said that, he glanced at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua nodded and said, \"Yes, that’s what I was thinking too!\"","Then everyone left Mistwater City, driving the carriage along the main road to the next place, all the while keeping a watchful eye along the way for any possible clues.","Yet, after watching for a long time, even upon reaching the next city, Yun Shui City, no suspicious traces were found.","Gu Changhuai frowned and said, \"Let’s keep moving forward...\"","But Mo Hua said, \"Wait a moment.\"","Gu Changhuai was startled.","Mo Hua felt the copper coin left by his master and closed his eyes slightly, silently urging his divine sense for a calculation.","Moments later, Mo Hua suddenly opened his eyes and looked back, his gaze shining brightly:","\"We shouldn’t go forward, but retrace our steps.\"","\"Retrace our steps?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"The way we came has some issues...\"","The thread of causality was broken for a segment..."]},{"number":1504,"title":"Chapter 1504 - 810: Using Punishment","paragraphs":["On the way back to Mistwater City from Yun Shui City, they didn’t take a carriage.","Mo Hua walked with his hands behind his back, lightly pinching his fingers, then, as if with a shared understanding, he led the way ahead.","Gu Changhuai and the other two silently followed behind.","Gu Quan couldn’t help but whisper, \"Supervisor, how is Young Master Mo identifying the route?\"","He couldn’t understand it at all.","Gu Changhuai slightly furrowed his brows, \"Just follow along...\"","\"Yes.\" Gu Quan dared not say more.","Gu Changhuai quietly glanced at Mo Hua, who was swaggering in front like a \"religious con man\", and silently sighed in his heart.","Even before, he couldn’t understand this kid Mo Hua.","But now he realized he understood him even less.","These strange skills, who knows where he learned them...","Mo Hua walked ahead, sometimes confident, sometimes pausing and looking around, sometimes using Divine Sense to probe, discerning causes and effects. After walking for a while, he suddenly stopped, pointing to a small grove by the roadside:","\"Here...\"","The line of causality cuts off here.","Or rather, something has obscured the traces, cutting off the inference of causality.","This small grove is very suspicious.","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"Let’s go over and take a look. You stay behind, be careful.\"","\"Mm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","He had a grasp on this situation.","With Uncle Gu here, he could afford to be lazy. If he didn’t have to do it himself, he wouldn’t.","Gu Changhuai walked in front, heading toward the grove.","Mo Hua obediently followed behind him, treating Gu Changhuai as a \"shield\".","Gu An and Gu Quan guarded Mo Hua from either side.","The four of them advanced toward the grove in this formation.","After walking for about 30 minutes, the trees became sparse, revealing a small inn ahead.","The inn looked somewhat dilapidated and was in a remote location, not far from a branch of the Mistwater River, where the water flowed gently.","In front of the inn, there was a stable with two horses and a simple-looking carriage.","Mo Hua and the others exchanged glances, their expressions somewhat puzzled.","\"An inn?\"","In such a remote place, they built an inn?","Moreover, it was hidden among the thick forest, as if afraid of being discovered.","Gu Changhuai released his Divine Sense, scanned briefly, and then said, \"Let’s go inside and have a look.\"","\"Yes.\" Gu An and Gu Quan nodded.","As they approached closer, even before entering the inn, a big man suddenly came out of the entrance, his face covered in a thick beard, with a fierce gleam in his eyes, shouting at them:","\"What are you folks up to?\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression remained calm, \"We’re traveling, saw there’s an inn here, and want to rent a few horses.\"","\"Traveling?\" The big man frowned, his eyes scanning over Gu Changhuai and the others, then bluntly said, \"A deposit of ten thousand Spirit Stones. The rent is one hundred Spirit Stones per horse per day. If the horse dies, the deposit is not refundable.\"","Gu Changhuai’s eyes slightly narrowed, \"Isn’t that a bit expensive?\"","\"If you think it’s expensive, don’t rent.\" The big man said impatiently, \"You look like a noble family young master, what, can’t even afford ten thousand Spirit Stones?\"","Gu Changhuai’s eyebrows raised slightly, \"Fine.\"","The big man extended his hand, \"Hand over the Spirit Stones, and I’ll give you the horses.\"","\"No rush,\" Gu Changhuai let out a breath, \"travelling has been tiring, so we’d like to rest here for a bit and have some tea.\"","The big man’s face soured, \"No tea, only horses. Give me the Spirit Stones and take the horses quickly.\"","Gu Changhuai said calmly, \"You’re running an inn and don’t even do a tea business?\"","The big man hesitated for a moment, then smirked, \"Tea business can be done too, a thousand Spirit Stones for a pot of tea.\"","He thought he was making an exorbitant demand and that Gu Changhuai would retreat.","Who knew Gu Changhuai would nod and say, \"Fine.\"","The big man was stunned, his expression turning hostile, \"You heard me right, I said a thousand Spirit Stones for a pot of tea.\"","Gu Changhuai looked at him with disdain, \"What, you think this princely young man can’t afford a mere thousand Spirit Stones?\"","Hiding behind Gu Changhuai, Mo Hua couldn’t help but internally grouse:","A thousand Spirit Stones for a pot of tea?","No matter how many Spirit Stones, you can’t just spend them like this.","Uncle Gu is really too corrupt.","Upon hearing this, the big man’s face changed, his eyes coldly fixed on Gu Changhuai:","\"You’re not here to drink tea, nor to rent horses. Who are you really, and what do you want here?\"","Gu Changhuai calmly replied, \"I am here to invite you for tea.\"","\"Invite us for tea?\" The big man frowned.","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"To invite you to the Taoist Court for tea.\"","At the mention of \"Taoist Court\", the big man’s eyes turned vicious, murderous intent flaring up.","From the woods, stable, inn, and the broken tower, several sinister hidden weapons, gleaming with green light, flew toward the four of them.","Gu An drew his sword, blocking one of the hidden weapons.","Gu Quan parried another and then shielded Mo Hua in front, horizontally sweeping his long sword to intercept the weapon aimed at Mo Hua.","Gu Changhuai merely extended his hand gently.","The poison-coated weapon heading straight for his heart halted mid-air, and was then crushed into powder by his hand.","Seeing the ineffective hidden weapons, several cultivators immediately charged out from all directions.","Most of these cultivators had their cultivation between the Foundation Building Middle Stage to Foundation Establishment Late Stage, their expressions fierce and methods skilled, indicating they had likely done such ambushes and robberies before.","However, in front of Mo Hua’s group, especially in front of Gu Changhuai, the Court Official of the Taoist Court with Golden Core Realm cultivation, they were largely insignificant.","Gu An and Gu Quan combined their dual blades, the blade light sharp.","Gu Changhuai condensed a Wind Blade, his Spiritual Power dazzling.","Mo Hua used the Fireball Technique here and there.","Even though they were still within the Second Grade State Border, and Gu Changhuai couldn’t utilize his Golden Core Power, it took less than ten breaths of time to subdue them all.","The only one who got away was the big man.","When Gu Changhuai crushed the hidden weapon with his bare hands, the big man looked terrified, aware that Gu Changhuai’s cultivation was undoubtedly extraordinary. Even if he wasn’t a Golden Core, he must be at the Foundation Establishment Peak, so he fled early on."]},{"number":1505,"title":"Chapter 1505 - 810: Punishment_2","paragraphs":["But Mo Hua didn’t let him off.","A Water Prison Technique condensed out of thin air, immobilizing the big man for two breaths.","Gu Changhuai lightly flicked his finger, a Wind Blade severed one of his legs.","A stream of blood trickled from the man’s leg, and then he immediately fell to the ground, struggling but unable to get up.","Gu An stepped forward, using the Taoist Court’s Spirit-binding Lock to restrain him.","By this point, all the cultivators at the station were captured.","Gu An and Gu Quan dragged all the cultivators from the station to the dilapidated building, shut the doors and windows, and then sharply asked:","\"Speak, who are you?\"","The cultivators lowered their brows, remaining silent.","Gu An drew his sword, placing it against the neck of one of the cultivators, and said in a deep voice:","\"Will you speak?\"","The blade pressed against his flesh, blood seeping out, but the cultivator bit his lip, saying nothing still.","Mo Hua shook his head, \"They’re not being honest, refusing to speak the truth...\" then his eyes lit up, \"Shall we use torture?\"","Gu An and Gu Quan were startled.","Gu Changhuai’s eyelids also twitched slightly.","Gu An hesitated, \"The Taoist Court’s torture instruments are inconvenient to carry around, and we left in a hurry, didn’t bring any...\"","\"No worries,\" Mo Hua looked excited, \"I brought some!\"","After saying this, Mo Hua took out a Formation Punishment Board from his Storage Bag, boasting:","\"This is the latest model, improved many times, and I’ve added numerous formations on it...\"","It’s the Eighteen Patterns Formation!","Previously, Mo Hua learned the Eighteen Patterns, had nowhere to use them, and in a moment of itch, he drew them on the punishment board.","However, he hadn’t used this Formation Punishment Board for a long time.","After all, he was previously grounded, only able to move within the Qian Learning State Boundary, and had no chance to use this board.","Mo Hua felt quite regretful.","Unexpectedly, just days after being released, the opportunity arose.","Mo Hua was very happy.","He had long wanted to test the power of this updated formation device.","Seeing Mo Hua’s delighted face, Gu An went silent, then quietly glanced at Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai looked at the slightly familiar but improved torture device in Mo Hua’s hand, sighed, and nodded, indicating his consent.","Mo Hua handed over the instrument to Gu An, saying: \"Make them kneel, maybe they’ll be honest.\"","Gu An had no choice but to place the iron board on the floor, forcing one of the cultivators to kneel on it.","In an instant, the board glowed, spiritual power intertwined, and the cultivator let out a pig-like scream.","The other cultivators, seeing this, turned pale and then angrily glared at Mo Hua.","\"Why are you looking at me?\"","\"Oh, I understand!\" Mo Hua thought for a moment and then realized, \"You’re brothers, wanting to share adversity, you want to experience this board too!\"","\"What a coincidence, I made a few more for testing, just enough for each of you to have one.\"","After saying this, Mo Hua took out four more punishment boards from his Storage Bag.","With this, the group of cultivators turned deathly pale, looking at Mo Hua as if seeing the \"Evil Ghost\" from Hell.","When Mo Hua looked at them again, they were filled with fear, their eyes darting away, not daring to meet his gaze.","Mo Hua nodded, indicating satisfaction.","The previously sneering big man said coldly: \"Forget it, brat, you underestimate us. Even if you kill us, you’ll never get anything out of us.\"","\"Oh?\" Mo Hua became interested, \"Tough guys, I like that.\"","His divine thought moved slightly, and the cultivator kneeling on the board howled even louder.","The Eighteen Patterns Formation was something he couldn’t endure.","He wanted to speak, but seeing the big man’s threatening eyes, he bit his tongue till he fainted, unable to say a word.","\"This board’s power is sufficient, but the ’torture’ process is still a bit monotonous...\"","Mo Hua noted in his mind.","On the other side, the big man looked mockingly at Mo Hua.","\"We brothers are desperate men, living with our heads tied to our belts. Using this method for interrogation, brat, you’re too naive.\"","Too naive?","Then let’s play something less naive.","Mo Hua said with a sly smile:","\"Since that’s the case, let’s play a game.\"","The head man sneered, \"What game?\"","Mo Hua said: \"You’ll all be punished together, kneeling on the punishment boards, answering my questions.\"","\"Whoever answers first, I’ll lift the punishment, sparing them from suffering.\"","\"How about it?\" Mo Hua asked with interest, \"The time has come to test your brotherly bonds, and I’m curious whether you can share adversity...\"","The head man’s expression changed.","This kid, such a sinister tactic!","Mo Hua glanced at Gu An and Gu Quan, both understood and laid the punishment boards on the ground, pressing the desperate bandit cultivators onto them.","Mo Hua activated the formations one by one.","As the Formation Patterns flowed, the spiritual power of the formations turned into swords, fire, and ice, creating indescribable anguish.","The bandit cultivators turned white as paper, cold sweat streaming from their foreheads, some even cried out in pain.","\"Alright, now listen to the first question!\" Mo Hua said seriously, \"What did you have for lunch?\"","This question was utterly offbeat.","Even the three of Gu Changhuai were taken aback for a moment.","Instead of asking serious matters, he asked them what they ate for lunch?","The group of desperados had no idea what Mo Hua was plotting, biting their lips without speaking.","But their silence meant the punishment wouldn’t stop, and the torment of alternating swords, water, and fire wasn’t easy to endure.","Finally, someone spoke.","\"We ate... beef...\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow and praised, \"Very good!\" then waved his hand, turning off his punishment board.","That person narrowly escaped, panting heavily, with a look of relief on his face."]},{"number":1506,"title":"Chapter 1506 - 810 Torture_3","paragraphs":["Others, seeing that Mo Hua indeed kept his promise, and asked only \"harmless\" questions, all hesitated in their hearts.","\"Now, the second question!\" Mo Hua continued, \"How old are you?\"","This time, after just a few breaths, someone replied: \"One hundred and thirty years old....\"","Mo Hua nodded and spared him from punishment.","Then he asked, \"What is your surname?\"","Before the words fell, someone answered: \"My surname is Zhao!\"","Mo Hua honored the agreement and paused his formation instruments.","Afterwards, Mo Hua asked another round of questions, mostly \"trivial matters,\" aiming to foster a habit of answering questions among these people.","After a round, only the leading brute bit his teeth, saying nothing.","Mo Hua ignored him and continued:","\"Alright, we’re starting the second round.\"","After saying that, he reactivated all the punishing formations.","In an instant, these cultivators, who barely had a moment to breathe, faced yet another round of \"torture.\"","\"Second round, first question...\" Mo Hua’s eyes flickered, \"What name do you use on the Dao?\"","This question was slightly more confidential, yet handled just right.","Soon, someone couldn’t endure the formation’s punishment and spoke up:","\"Brothers in the Dao honor me with the name ’Poisonous Sixth Master’...\"","Mo Hua slightly frowned.","He had no impression of this name.","Could it be an outsider?","Mo Hua nodded slightly and asked the second question.","From this question on, the intensity would step up bit by bit.","\"Why did you come here?\"","The atmosphere suddenly became somewhat heavy.","This group of desperate bandit cultivators remained silent.","Some things they could say, but some they clearly couldn’t.","Mo Hua was not in a hurry either.","Even among the same group, robbing and plundering together, sworn brothers, ruthless, their endurance to pain was different.","Some could withstand it, but inevitably, some could not.","Sure enough, after a moment, someone whispered: \"We are... ordered to manage this station...\"","\"Manage?\" Mo Hua sneered.","Since the person had spoken, they could only grit their teeth and say: \"This place is remote and sparsely populated, if a fat sheep passes by, we can earn some extra...\"","\"You mentioned being ordered, whose order?\" Mo Hua asked again.","\"I...\"","Before he could speak, the leading brute scolded: \"Shut up!\"","Mo Hua gave the leading brute a glance.","Gu An understood his intention, and immediately took out a black cloth, tying the brute’s mouth to prevent him from speaking.","\"Continue,\" Mo Hua said.","The cultivator gritted his teeth, enduring the pain, tremblingly said: \"You said... just one question, but I already answered two...\"","Mo Hua realized, \"Right!\"","One should keep their word, even when using punishment.","Indeed, Mo Hua spared him and turned his gaze to the remaining few, \"I’ll give you this opportunity to answer.\"","Immediately someone, unable to endure the pain of blades cutting and fire water entering the body, hastily said:","\"It’s Big Brother! Big Brother told us to guard this station!\"","Seeing that brothers who answered questions were spared from suffering, while he still dealt with the unbearable pain in shackles.","People are not afraid of scarcity but of inequality.","He feared his brothers’ suffering.","More so feared their enjoyment while he suffered.","\"Big Brother also said to do our best, clean-handedly without causing trouble, and after the task, a large amount of Spirit Stones would be given, with special permission to enjoy a night on the boat...\"","Upon hearing this, Gu Changhuai and others were slightly moved.","Mo Hua asked: \"What boat?\"","\"It’s... a Flower Boat.\"","\"What Flower Boat?\"","The cultivator said: \"We are from out of town, we don’t know the boat’s name, just know that it’s full of singing, dancing, and... many women...\"","\"How do you get on the boat?\"","\"I don’t know, unless someone leads the way, nobody knows the entrance to board, and getting on the boat is impossible.\"","Mo Hua nodded and spared him from punishment, then turned to continue asking:","\"Who exactly is this ’Big Brother’ you mention?\"","He pointed to the whiskery, mouth-tied leading brute, \"...shouldn’t be this trash, right?\"","The leading brute made muffled sounds, looking angrily at Mo Hua.","\"No...\" a scar-faced cultivator said.","Mo Hua asked: \"Who is he?\"","The scarred cultivator looked anxious.","He wanted to say, yet he could not...","Mo Hua roughly understood, after a thought, said: \"Alright then, you don’t have to say, I’ll say it, you just need to answer.\"","The scarred cultivator nodded.","\"This Big Brother of yours...\" Mo Hua’s gaze was profound, calculating in secret, \"is he proficient in water system skills?\"","The scarred cultivator showed a look of shock, nodding.","\"Has he... killed many people?\"","The scarred cultivator silently nodded.","\"So is his title... Water Yama?\" Mo Hua’s gaze suddenly sharpened.","The leading brute was both anxious and angry, eyes wide open but couldn’t speak.","The scarred cultivator looked at the brute, after a pause, slowly nodded, \"Yes.\"","Indeed!","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened slightly.","Finally caught something!","Afterwards, Mo Hua asked some other miscellaneous things.","These desperate bandit cultivators, after this torment, were no longer desperate, obediently telling everything.","Brothers should share weal and woe.","Whoever spoke slower, whoever would suffer more.","They naturally weren’t willing.","After asking, Gu Changhuai tied them up, then, with Gu An and Gu Quan, separately searched the station.","Gu An walking beside Gu Changhuai, said somewhat sentimentally:","\"Young Master Mo is indeed clever, he has many ideas...\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze paused, but his expression seemed somewhat heavy.","Not clever, too clever...","The child, unknown raised by whom, influenced by whom, seeming innocent but with eyes revealing insight into human nature.","Playing with this group of desperate bandit cultivators in the palm of his hand.","Sowing discord, mixing grace and punishment, prying open these bandits’ mouths.","Such methods, many old Supervisors can’t play.","If this child follows the Righteous Dao in the future, it’s all good, but if he strays and becomes a Gui Tao and Demon cultivator manipulating minds, that scene, simply unimaginable...","Gu Changhuai deeply sighed."]},{"number":1507,"title":"Chapter 1507 - 811 Mechanism","paragraphs":["The station was searched thoroughly.","A small pill furnace for refining poisonous pills was discovered, along with some poisonous herbs and concealed weapons laced with poison.","Additionally, there were several evil artifacts, a few white bones, the origin of which was unknown, but they seemed to be resentful spirits who had died at the hands of these bandit cultivators. Their flesh had been scraped clean and used for alchemy.","This group of bandit cultivators was quite complex in composition.","Some were bandits who killed and robbed people, some were pill masters who had betrayed their sects, and others were cultivators who had taken up the evil path halfway through their journey.","They were wanted by the Taoist Court and fled everywhere until they were gathered here by Water Yama.","But they knew little about Water Yama’s affairs, and had been subjected to unknown means of silence, preventing them from speaking.","They could only speculate, but simply asking them yielded no results.","Mo Hua and the others had no choice but to investigate on their own.","Another round of searching revealed that, aside from the station itself, the most suspicious area was near the stable outside, where there was a carriage.","Near the carriage, Gu An found some petals.","These petals were scattered on the ground, pressed by carriage tracks, mixed with dirt, looking filthy.","But Mo Hua recognized them at a glance:","\"These are flowers from the Hundred Flower Valley, but I don’t know their names.\"","The flowers from the Hundred Flower Valley were vibrant clusters of varied species, which Mo Hua couldn’t clearly identify, but he could vaguely remember their forms.","Gu Changhuai nodded slightly, then expressed some surprise and asked Mo Hua:","\"How do you know they’re flowers from the Hundred Flower Valley... have you been inside?\"","\"Um...\"","Mo Hua instinctively nodded, but halfway through nodding, he suddenly realized that the fact he had infiltrated the Hundred Flower Valley disguised in the Taoist robe, posing as a young sister, absolutely could not be known by anyone!","\"No! I haven’t been there! A senior sister in the Hundred Flower Valley planted some flowers, and I just happened to see them!\"","Mo Hua felt a bit guilty.","\"Oh.\" Gu Changhuai replied indifferently.","He didn’t suspect anything.","Because entry by male cultivators to the Hundred Flower Valley was strictly forbidden, Mo Hua, no matter how skilled, couldn’t possibly sneak in.","Gu Changhuai pondered.","The flowers of the Hundred Flower Valley.","Hua Ruyu’s carriage.","This seemed to suggest that Hua Ruyu’s carriage had indeed stopped at this station.","This was somewhat peculiar...","Gu Changhuai said: \"Bring someone over to question.\"","\"Yes.\" Gu An accepted the order, returned to the station, and picked a seemingly cowardly and talkative bandit cultivator, bringing him before Gu Changhuai.","\"Let me ask you,\" Gu Changhuai said calmly, \"is there often a carriage stopping here?\"","The bandit cultivator looked flustered and didn’t respond.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was cold: \"Speak honestly, or I have ways to make you wish you were dead.\"","As a Golden Core cultivator and a Taoist Court Canon, having captured or killed countless sin cultivators, his presence carried an imposing authority.","The bandit cultivator showed a terrified expression and stammered: \"Yes... there is a carriage...\"","Gu Changhuai asked: \"What kind of carriage?\"","\"A luxurious, pink carriage with floral patterns on it,\" the bandit cultivator described.","\"Who was riding the carriage?\"","\"I, don’t know...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"How could you not know?\"","The bandit cultivator said: \"Every ten days or half a month, that floral carriage would come by, but Big Brother... \"","\"Which Big Brother? Water Yama?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","\"Yes, all brothers in the Dao refer to Big Brother by that title,\" the bandit cultivator said, pale-faced, \"Big Brother instructed us that once that carriage came, everyone should hide in the station and not go out—nothing should be seen or heard, or else...\"","The bandit cultivator swallowed, \"Otherwise, if one sees something they shouldn’t, their soul will be taken and they will certainly die.\"","The soul would be taken, and they would certainly die?","Gu Changhuai frowned.","Gu An and Gu Quan were stunned, showing puzzled expressions.","Only Mo Hua seemed to be pondering.","Afterward, Gu Changhuai asked a few more questions but got nothing further and instructed Gu An to take the bandit cultivator back to the station and keep him locked up.","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment and summarized:","\"Firstly, the evidence is not conclusive, so many things cannot be determined, but we can make assumptions first...\"","\"Assuming that woman’s carriage did indeed stop here, it suggests that inside the station or nearby, there must be something crucial she had to do.\"","\"And in this stable, there is another carriage...\"","Gu Quan nodded and said, \"I have just examined the carriage tracks with my brother and found some subtle traces. It can be deduced that someone drove to this place, got off the floral carriage, switched to the station’s carriage, and went somewhere else.\"","Everyone’s gaze then turned to the single carriage in the station.","This carriage looked ordinary from the outside, without decorations, inconspicuous, like the cheap carriages seen everywhere on city streets.","But on closer inspection, the materials used for the carriage were quite exceptional.","Though not ostentatious, it was unusually sturdy.","Moreover, the carriage was enclosed.","The door was locked as well.","One could not discern from outside what the situation inside was.","After pacing around the carriage several times without finding anything, Gu Changhuai stretched out his hand, concentrating spiritual power, intending to forcefully break through the carriage’s locked door.","But the moment his palm touched the carriage, a flash of light appeared on the door.","The carriage trembled, almost self-destructing.","Fortunately, Gu Changhuai had some experience. At the sight of the light, he withdrew his hand, preventing the carriage from self-destructing.","\"It’s a self-destruction formation...\" Gu Changhuai murmured.","Gu An and Gu Quan’s expressions were grave, and then, without prior agreement, they both looked at Mo Hua."]},{"number":1508,"title":"Chapter 1508 - 811 Mechanism_2","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai also glanced at Mo Hua.","Among them, Mo Hua was the best at Formations.","Although Gu Changhuai was a Golden Core Cultivator, he was not as skilled in Formations as Mo Hua.","Mo Hua immediately straightened up:","\"Let me take a look...\"","He touched the door frame, with his back to Gu Changhuai, his eyes deep, using Tricky Calculation to amplify and deduce the Formation Patterns inside the carriage.","Gu Changhuai’s expression stiffened; he sensed that the aura on Mo Hua’s body had changed, becoming somewhat profound and eerie, but he was gradually getting used to it, so he said nothing.","After a moment, Mo Hua concluded:","\"There’s a Door Lock Array on the carriage, and a self-destruct array, it’s a Compound Formation...\"","Following the deduction of the Formation Patterns and the flow of Spiritual Power, he found the \"keyhole\" in the right lower corner of the carriage door, among some carved wooden Patterns.","This hole merged with the wood Patterns, making it hard to detect.","Mo Hua speculated:","\"There should be a key in Hua Ruyu’s hand.\"","\"Only with the key can this carriage door be opened. Forcibly opening the door without it will cause the Formation to go awry, and the carriage will self-destruct...\"","Gu An’s expression was a bit heavy, \"So, we need to think of a way to get the key from Hua Ruyu?\"","\"No need.\" Mo Hua replied calmly, \"Using a key to unlock the Formation Lock is what a Cultivator does. For a Formation Master, knowing the principle of the Formation Lock makes the key unnecessary.\"","Mo Hua’s tone was casual, but there was unmistakable pride in his eyes.","Gu An and Gu Quan were delighted, nodding and praising:","\"Truly, Young Master Mo.\"","But Gu Changhuai still had some concerns, \"This Formation’s grade doesn’t seem low; is it alright?\"","He realized the complexity through the force of the counter-shock just now.","\"They’re all Second-Grade Formations, no problem.\" Mo Hua stated.","Gu Changhuai pondered, \"Even within Second-Grade Formations, there are elementary, intermediate, and high levels. Even at the high level, there are thresholds of seventeen, eighteen, and nineteen Patterns. Aren’t you in the Foundation Building Middle Stage...\"","\"No worries,\" Mo Hua smiled, \"I did a bit of ’Chao Gang’.\"","Seeing Mo Hua’s confidence, Gu Changhuai chose not to question further.","As a Supervisor of the Taoist Court, with hundreds of Enforcement Leaders, Gu Changhuai knew that \"professional\" matters should be left to professionals.","Formation-related matters were best entrusted to the most professional, Mo Hua.","He watched silently from the side.","Mo Hua stared at the carriage for a while, reaching out, stopping mid-point, then sensibly taking out a brush and ink to draw something on the door.","As he drew, Gu Changhuai felt a twitch in his forehead.","He guessed that Mo Hua was likely deciphering the Formation.","He didn’t quite understand the specifics of how, but at least he could count the Formation Patterns.","Eighteen Patterns!","He was deciphering an Eighteen-Pattern Formation!","A Foundation Building Middle Stage Cultivator, deciphering an Eighteen-Pattern Formation.","Even someone like Gu Changhuai, who was used to Mo Hua’s incredible feats, felt a bit unsettled.","\"Eighteen Patterns...\"","Gu Changhuai took a sharp breath.","Even some old Formation Masters at the Foundation Establishment Peak level with slightly weaker Divine Sense might not be able to inscribe an Eighteen-Pattern Formation, let alone decipher it.","This was surely more than just \"Chao Gang\"...","Gu Changhuai felt a wave of emotions.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua continued focusing on deciphering the Formation.","He inscribed the Formation Patterns for deciphering, then injected Spiritual Power to activate them. With a flash of Golden Light, the Patterns canceled each other out.","The Second-Grade Door Lock Array was thus dismantled by Mo Hua.","Then Mo Hua drew a circle on the door, turning to Gu Changhuai, \"Uncle Gu, hit here with your fist.\"","Gu Changhuai then snapped back to attention, nodding.","He stepped forward, delivering a gentle punch, creating a hole in the door, but the carriage remained intact without self-destructing.","Mo Hua reached his hand through the hole, fumbled for something inside, and with a click, opened the carriage door.","The inside of the carriage was dim and dark.","With the door open, a sliver of light seeped in.","Narrowing his eyes, Mo Hua saw that it was empty, not a single person, just a few cushions.","A long-stored, somewhat stale scent of rouge lingered at the tip of his brush.","Mo Hua gingerly stepped inside, rifled through the cushions, and found two handkerchiefs, a scented sachet, some bits of incense, like flower pollen from the sachet, and some powdery traces.","\"Many women had sat in this carriage...\"","Mo Hua silently pondered.","Moreover, the assortment of scents clearly wasn’t from the same group of women.","This Hua Ruyu, outwardly an Instructor at Hundred Flower Valley, secretly perhaps engaging in some shady dealings.","Mo Hua glanced at Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was icy, his gaze sharp, evidently realizing this as well.","However...","Gu Changhuai furrowed his brow.","This woman Hua Ruyu was very cautious, leaving very few traces in the carriage.","Here, the clues broke off.","Where this carriage had been, and what it actually transported, they still didn’t know...","Mo Hua also frowned.","He examined the carriage for a while longer, suddenly paused, noticing something odd, squatted down, and started knocking on the floorboards of the carriage one by one.","When he tapped on a particular board near the carriage head, a hollow sound echoed from within.","Mo Hua lifted the wooden board, discovering inside a remaining Formation.","He examined the Formation Patterns, his eyes lighting up instantly.","Seeing this, Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but ask, \"What is this?\""]},{"number":1509,"title":"Chapter 1509 - 811: Mechanism_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua said: \"It’s the internal driving formation of the carriage.\"","Seeing that Gu Changhuai didn’t quite understand, Mo Hua explained:","\"This carriage has a frame but no reins, which I found peculiar before. Now that I see the formation, it makes sense. This carriage looks like a carriage, but it’s not actually a ’horse’ carriage.\"","\"This vehicle doesn’t rely on horses to pull it. Instead, it uses mechanical techniques, embedding a composite formation inside to drive the vehicle forward.\"","\"And the formation hidden beneath this wooden board is precisely the embedded set of the mechanical driving composite formation in this carriage.\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment, a thought striking him, \"Does that mean...\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Once the composite formation is activated and the spiritual power flows, it will automatically drive the mechanism to move the carriage forward.\"","\"Moreover, this composite formation also has an embedded Yuan Magnetic Southerner Formation.\"","\"This Southerner Formation is used for navigation.\"","\"The carriage will follow the navigation of the Yuan Magnetic Southerner Formation and take us to our destination on its own...\"","Mo Hua said logically and clearly.","The expressions of Gu Changhuai and his two companions slightly shifted, and then they were amazed in their hearts.","This is what formations are, encompassing the myriad phenomena of the world.","This is also what Formation Masters are, using formations to comprehend and control various kinds of knowledge and abilities...","\"Then, can this vehicle move now?\" Gu Changhuai asked with a slightly solemn expression.","Mo Hua said: \"This is a new composite formation system. It will take me some time to study it a bit.\"","\"Alright.\" Gu Changhuai nodded.","After that, the three of them held their breath and kept absolutely silent, lest they disturbed Mo Hua.","Mo Hua, on the other hand, concentrated on studying this composite formation that integrates the Yuan Magnetic Southerner Formation and mechanical driving formations.","Mo Hua was barely familiar with the Yuan Magnetic Southerner Formation.","But he hadn’t really come into contact with mechanical driving formations before.","However, he had studied the First Grade Twelve Patterns, the Ultimate Technique of the Minor Hidden Spirit Sect—the Soul Pivot Ultimate Formation.","The Soul Pivot Ultimate Formation involves formation sequences, spiritual thread manipulation, and shares a resemblance with mechanical techniques.","In South Yue City, Mo Hua had even used the Soul Pivot Ultimate Formation to create some labor-saving, mineral-transporting \"Wooden Ox and Flowing Horses\" for the impoverished mining cultivators.","So, he understood the basic principles of the formation.","Time was limited, and he didn’t need to master it thoroughly. He just needed to reactivate the formation.","The formation before his eyes was dim and lifeless, evidently out of order.","Mo Hua pondered carefully.","In about an hour, his eyes brightened as he gradually grasped some understanding.","This mechanical composite formation, like the carriage door, is opened with a shared key.","But the formation on the door had been resolved by Mo Hua, and the lock was broken; thus, the control entrance of this mechanical composite formation was effectively destroyed as well.","With the \"entrance\" intervened gone, the formation could not be opened naturally, the formation eye could not be energized, and the mechanical driving formation failed, leaving the carriage immobile.","\"In that case, the structure of the Formation Pivot has to be altered, severing the original entrance, externally connecting open-close formation patterns, and establishing a Spirit Gathering Array to serve as the formation eye, embedding it into the composite formation to power the existing mechanical formation...\"","Mo Hua muttered to himself, speaking words that Gu Changhuai and the others could not understand at all.","Then Mo Hua took out pen and ink, beginning to reconstruct the formation step by step according to his own ideas.","Gu Changhuai and his companions watched intently.","Yet, they had no idea what they were actually watching...","About 30 minutes later, Mo Hua finally completed drawing the formation, and after checking it over once more, he couldn’t help but breathe a sigh of relief.","\"It should be about right...\"","Mo Hua reached into his Storage Bag to take out Spirit Stones.","Halfway through taking them out, he silently pocketed his own Spirit Stones again, instead reaching out to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, we need Spirit Stones.\"","This was business, and the Spirit Stones used should appropriately be reimbursed.","Gu Changhuai was not stingy, and he took out a Storage Bag and tossed it directly to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua took the Storage Bag, extracting the Spirit Stones and crushing them, placing them on the Spirit Gathering Array to let it absorb the spiritual power, serving as the formation eye to empower the mechanical formation.","The Spirit Gathering Array absorbed the spiritual power, glowing with a blue sheen.","Mo Hua concentrated his thoughts, activating the formation through the interface he had constructed.","A stream of pure spiritual power flowed from the Spirit Gathering Array into the mechanical composite formation built into the carriage.","Then the carriage shuddered, and with a wobble, it began to move on its own.","The few of them quickly held onto the carriage.","Gu Changhuai even reached out to steady the swaying Mo Hua.","As the carriage trembled, it turned and spun around.","The Yuan Magnetic Southerner Formation lit up, setting a direction.","The carriage then, as though guided by some mysterious force, moved forward on its own along that direction.","\"Supervisor, should we...\" Gu An asked worriedly.","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment and said, \"We’ll just sit in the carriage and see where it stops...\"","\"Yes.\" Gu An and Gu Quan nodded.","The carriage creaked on as it silently moved forward.","Mo Hua picked a cushion and sat down honestly.","He also wanted to see where the Yuan Magnetic Southerner Formation ultimately pointed to and where this carriage would take him.","It would be best if it could directly lead to the lair of the Evil God.","If he got off the carriage and saw an altar, it would be perfect.","Of course, it was just a thought.","He knew such good luck would not happen...","Mo Hua took out some Spirit Stones again, crushed them, and recharged the Spirit Gathering Array.","These Spirit Stones should be sufficient.","But there were still quite a few Spirit Stones left in the Storage Bag.","Mo Hua initially wanted to return the Storage Bag to Uncle Gu, but on second thought, considering Uncle Gu’s wealth and status, returning something he had given could be seen as disrespectful, looking down on this Official of the Taoist Court?","Mo Hua nodded quietly and slipped the Spirit Stones into his clothing.","This was considered a fee for his hard work.","Even without a formal assessment, it was quite reasonable for him, as a ’quasi’ Second-grade High-level Array Master, to help out and receive some Spirit Stones as compensation.","Mo Hua felt at ease.","The mechanical formation churned, and the carriage moved along with the \"creak\" completely on its own.","Inside the carriage was enclosed, with a heavy atmosphere all around.","Sitting in the carriage, heading to an unknown place, Mo Hua couldn’t help feeling a bit nervous, but thinking of Gu Changhuai beside him, he felt more at ease.","This was the Second Grade Territory, and judging by the carriage, it didn’t seem likely they would go too far, so clinging to Uncle Gu would be enough to keep him safe.","Mo Hua eased his mind, then turned and felt a bit bored, so he redirected his attention to the mechanical composite formation inside the carriage.","This was his first time seeing a real \"mechanical formation.\"","It was yet another special formation system with its unique structure.","The mechanical formation inside the carriage seemed to share some common ground with the Five Elements and Eight Trigrams, as well as the Soul Pivot Ultimate Formation he had seen before.","Yet, upon careful deduction, there seemed to be many discrepancies as well.","\"In the future, I should find an opportunity to study mechanical formations too...\"","If he could learn mechanical formations and integrate them with the Soul Pivot Ultimate Formation, coordinating the two, he might be able to create a \"Puppet Army\"...","Mo Hua couldn’t help but imagine.","Thus, as Mo Hua pondered, while the mechanical formation flowed, the carriage continued its journey...","No one knew how long it went on before the carriage suddenly halted.","It seemed they had arrived at their destination.","Their expressions subtly grew somber.","Gu An gave Gu Changhuai a querying glance, whispering, \"Should we get out?\"","Gu Changhuai shook his head slightly.","\"Let’s wait and see.\"","They all waited in the carriage, not making any rash moves.","After another short while, amid the sound of water and the bumping of a boat awning, it seemed something was coming ashore.","At the same time, a clear male voice sounded:","\"It’s not the fifteenth yet, why have you brought people over?\"","Inside the carriage, Gu Changhuai and his companions remained silent.","The atmosphere momentarily tensed.","The man outside, sounding puzzled, said: \"Why aren’t you speaking? Angry? Didn’t you before...\"","Before the man could finish speaking, he realized something was amiss.","His face changed, and an inexplicable Evil Qi emanated from him, seemingly soaked in icy blood and ruthless malice.","Sensing this aura, Mo Hua’s pupils shrank slightly.","This aura...","Could this man be...","The Water Yama?!"]},{"number":1510,"title":"Chapter 1510 - 812 Battle","paragraphs":["\"Uncle Gu!\"","Mo Hua’s expression was grave. He glanced at Gu Changhuai, a hint of coldness flashing in his eyes, and said in a low voice:","\"It might be Shui Yanluo. If we can’t capture him, kill him...\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze trembled slightly, and he nodded.","Gu An and Gu Quan also placed their hands on the hilt of their swords, spiritual power circulating in secret, the blades poised to strike.","The man outside the carriage fell silent, but the atmosphere grew ever more oppressive.","Just before they made their move, Mo Hua suddenly remembered something and said:","\"Cover your face.\"","Gu Changhuai was slightly taken aback.","As a Supervisor of the Taoist Court, he acted according to the Taoist Law, capturing or killing people openly and honestly, rarely needing to disguise himself.","\"If we can’t catch him, we must not reveal our identity...\" Mo Hua whispered.","Though he was a young disciple of the Taixu Gate and had captured or killed many Sin Cultivators, he didn’t want to be targeted by such a notorious Sin Cultivator like Shui Yanluo.","Besides, Uncle Gu’s identity was, for now, not something to be revealed.","Hua Ruyu seemed to be in league with this Shui Yanluo.","Uncle Gu was also Hua Ruyu’s match for a marriage proposal.","If Shui Yanluo saw Gu Changhuai’s face and learned about his identity as a Supervisor of the Taoist Court, it would certainly alert them.","Hua Ruyu would also realize that her identity and whereabouts had been exposed and that Uncle Gu’s dating her had other motives.","And currently, there was no concrete evidence of her crimes.","Once she became alert and covered her tracks, it would be extremely difficult to investigate her further.","Of course, besides this, there was another important reason.","Mo Hua sighed in his heart.","Uncle Gu had helped him a lot, and it seemed his name was already on the Evil God’s list.","If he wasn’t more low-key, who knows how many people would want to kill him.","Gu Changhuai nodded, and so everyone in the carriage took out black cloths and covered their faces.","Just as Mo Hua covered his face, he heard Gu Changhuai shout \"Be careful,\" and then a killing intent suddenly descended.","A dark blue water whip, like a venomous snake, sliced open the carriage roof and struck towards him.","Mo Hua’s heart tightened, and he immediately sidestepped to avoid it.","Gu Changhuai stood in front of Mo Hua, drew a longsword, and gathered several strands of Sword Qi to counteract the force of the water whip.","The spiritual powers of wind and water intertwined, strength surged, and the entire carriage exploded.","Mo Hua and his companions had no choice but to abandon the carriage.","After the fluctuations of spiritual power dissipated.","Hiding behind Gu Changhuai, Mo Hua opened his eyes and looked around, seeing a desolate place, overgrown with wild grass, the soil damp underfoot, and a rapid river not far away, with a shabby ferry docked by the shore.","And by the dock, a small boat was moored.","The small boat had come ashore.","A man was standing by the shore.","The man looked young, with fair skin, handsome features, but his gaze was obsessive, with a hint of cold malice.","The man’s right hand was wrapped in a chain whip.","The whip had nine sections connected by iron chains, appearing both as a weapon for attack and as shackles to restrain an enemy.","But to Mo Hua, it looked more like an instrument of torture.","In the Yu Family’s water village, the image of Fish Cultivators being bound by chains and dying miserably resurfaced in Mo Hua’s mind, and his heart sank slightly.","Eight or nine out of ten, this man was the \"Water Yama\" who replaced the Fire Buddha as the head henchman of the Evil God.","But Mo Hua was still surprised.","The appearance of this Water Yama was completely different from what he had imagined.","From his appearance alone, he resembled nothing more than a young white-faced man who lived by the water, made a living by fishing, and spent so much time in the water that his skin was as pale as a big white fish.","If not for the chilling evil qi emanating from him, as if soaking in blood, Mo Hua would never have associated him with \"Water Yama.\"","Water Yama’s gaze swept over Mo Hua and the others, especially lingering on Gu Changhuai at the forefront. His eyebrows slightly raised, and a trace of apprehension flickered in his eyes.","But as everyone was masked and dressed casually, Water Yama couldn’t determine their identities at the moment.","After a moment, he slowly opened his mouth:","\"Who are you? Why are you on this carriage?\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze was stern, and he didn’t speak.","There was certainly nothing good about talking to such scum.","Seeing that Gu Changhuai didn’t answer, Water Yama looked somewhat impatient, the killing intent in his eyes growing stronger.","As he looked about to make a move, Mo Hua thought for a moment and stepped out from behind Gu Changhuai, speaking in a rough voice:","\"That’s exactly what we want to ask you...\"","\"Who are you? Why out of nowhere, did you attack us and destroy our carriage?\"","Mo Hua preemptively accused him.","Water Yama sneered, \"Your carriage? This carriage clearly belongs to Miaoer...\"","Miaoer?","Mo Hua felt a slight change in his expression.","He had heard another new name.","Water Yama also realized he misspoke and stopped immediately after saying these two words, his gaze becoming even colder:","\"This is my carriage, and you stole it and expect me to give you an explanation?\"","\"On what basis do you say this is your carriage? Did you carve your name on it? Can you call it and see if it responds?\"","Mo Hua argued unreasonably.","Unable to win an argument against Mo Hua, Water Yama’s eyes darkened with killing intent, and he snorted coldly, \"Sharp-tongued brat, be careful, I’ll skin you alive.\"","Mo Hua stepped closer to Gu Changhuai, using his authority, and said:","\"If you have the guts, come over here.\"","Water Yama’s expression was indifferent, unaffected by Mo Hua’s provocation, as he showed a thoughtful look.","Mo Hua and his companions were masked and suppressing their aura, not having made a move, and he couldn’t determine their origins.","And it was indeed strange for these people to be at the ferry with the carriage.","Did their plan get exposed on this side?","Or was there a problem on Miaoer’s side?","Moreover, the carriage was heavily fortified with Formation, and without the proper keys, it couldn’t be opened."]},{"number":1511,"title":"Chapter 1511 - 812 Battle_2","paragraphs":["For ordinary cultivators, it’s simply impossible to know about this carriage, let alone this ferry crossing.","Even more impossible to be riding the carriage to this ferry crossing.","\"Who on earth are these people? And what is their purpose?\"","Water Yama’s gaze turned cold, pondering in his heart, but just as he was deep in thought, a sudden premonition arose.","This was the Divine Lord’s warning.","He looked down at his feet and saw pale yellow Formation Patterns creeping along, like venomous snakes born from the earth, continuously winding around.","\"Formation?!\"","Water Yama’s expression changed, and he immediately swayed to escape the range of the Formation.","However, the moment he bowed his head, Mo Hua realized that his secret Formation Painting had been exposed and immediately shouted:","\"Catch him!\"","At the same time, he activated the Earth Prison Formation.","Water Yama was just too alert; even chatting with him hadn’t completely diverted his attention, so the Formation hadn’t been completed and was discovered.","At this hurried activation, the Formation’s effectiveness was not as desired.","The ground flashed with light, earthen barriers rose, transformed into a cage, aiming to imprison Water Yama using earth to counter water.","But Water Yama’s figure flicked, half of his body already escaped the Formation’s range.","The remaining earth barriers trapped one of his legs, but he shook them off with his solid water strength.","After breaking free from the Earth Prison Formation, Water Yama had just stabilized himself when Gu An and Gu Quan jointly attacked him.","The two blades of light formed two crescent moons, converging towards Water Yama’s neck.","Gu An and Gu Quan went all out with their late-stage Foundation Establishment cultivation, without any reservation.","\"Chain Blade Skill?\"","Water Yama’s gaze deepened but he didn’t panic.","His thick water spiritual power surged, flicking the lock whip in his hand, turning it into multiple whip shadows to offset the blade light of Gu An and Gu Quan.","Gu An and Gu Quan’s attack was nullified.","Water Yama countered with another whip, the whip wrapped with sinister water spiritual power, attacking Gu An.","Gu An blocked horizontally with his blade, but was flung back several meters by the whip’s strength, and simultaneously, his shoulder was slightly grazed by the tip of the water whip.","An icy cold spiritual power instantly seeped into his shoulder, causing pain like torture.","Gu An’s face turned pale, and he exclaimed:","\"Water Punishment Whip!\"","Water Yama sneered, \"Consider yourself perceptive.\"","Then he raised the whip like a venomous snake, intending to take advantage of the momentum and first deal with Gu An.","Gu An, poisoned by water, was in unbearable pain, trying to dodge but unable.","Gu Quan wanted to rescue him, but was a step too late.","At this moment, a wind-based sword light broke through the air, heading straight for Water Yama’s head.","Wind-based sword light was renowned for its speed.","And this sword light was not only fast, but its Sword Qi was extremely sharp and formidable.","Water Yama uttered \"Tch,\" reluctantly abandoning Gu An, using all his strength to exhibit his whipping skill to directly block the wind-based Sword Qi.","The Sword Qi tore through his whip shadows but didn’t do much harm to Water Yama.","Yet Water Yama dared not be careless.","As expected, the next instant, a clear shadow flashed before him, Gu Changhuai had already approached him, wielding a longsword and suddenly slashing down.","Water Yama’s expression turned serious, swinging his lock whip to bluntly meet this sword move.","Momentarily, the two were evenly matched, then separated after an explosion of strength.","After stabilizing himself, Water Yama looked at Gu Changhuai with a grave expression and coldly said, \"Golden Core?\"","Gu Changhuai did not respond.","Perhaps he didn’t want to speak to avoid exposing his identity.","Or possibly he found nothing worthy to say to this murderous beast.","Water Yama frowned, then sneered, \"A dignified Golden Core, yet you’re wearing a mask hiding your face, afraid of embarrassment?\"","This is the Second Grade State Boundary.","And he was already at the Foundation Establishment Peak.","Under the suppression of the Heavenly Dao, the cultivation that a Golden Core cultivator could employ wasn’t much different from his.","He couldn’t kill the Golden Core, but the Golden Core may not be able to deal with him either.","Therefore Water Yama wasn’t afraid, merely pondering silently in his mind.","\"Golden Core Realm cultivator, Wind-System Spiritual Root, Sword Cultivator...\"","In his knowledge, there seemed to be no such figure.","Moreover, though this person was a Golden Core, it was evident his swordsmanship was somewhat unfamiliar, not an exceptionally formidable Sword Cultivator.","Is it that his strength is inherently this way, or...","Is he using clumsy swordsmanship to conceal his own Taoist Skill inheritance, to avoid revealing his identity?","\"I must find a way to probe these people’s background to prevent the Young Master’s matter from being exposed, ruining the grand plan...\"","Water Yama silently thought.","Then his eyes flashed with cold light, suddenly launched an attack, his long whip like a snake, whip tail like snake tongue, heading straight towards the other side’s Gu Quan.","Gu Quan looked alert, but helplessly, there was a noticeable gap in strength, his reaction was a beat too slow, and by the time he saw Water Yama make a move, it was too late.","Caught off guard, he could only block horizontally with his blade.","But he couldn’t fully block, his arm was still swept by the whip tail, and instantly he, too, experienced the taste of water poison entering his body.","Water Yama intended to pursue him.","Gu Changhuai’s longsword arrived again, the sword tip pointing directly at the back of his head.","Water Yama had no choice but to abandon Gu Quan, turn around, and continue dealing with Gu Changhuai, feeling inevitably a bit angry.","Gu Changhuai was even angrier.","If this were a Third-Grade State Boundary, he could unleash his Golden Core cultivation, then dealing with Water Yama, whether capturing or killing, would be a mere flip of the hand.","But this place is only a Second Grade Territory, he had to forcibly suppress his cultivation, unable to fully utilize his skills.","Without the power of the Golden Core, he was just at the Foundation Establishment Peak.","Perhaps slightly stronger than ordinary Foundation Establishment Peak, but not by much.","Moreover, to conceal his identity from being recognized by interested parties, he didn’t employ his own Life Spiritual Artifact or the Gu Family’s spells."]},{"number":1512,"title":"Chapter 1512 - 812 Confrontation_3","paragraphs":["So at the moment, passively saving people under the hands of this Water Yama inevitably leads to being overwhelmed.","And from the few encounters earlier, this Water Yama possesses profound cultivation and sinister Taoist skills and should not be underestimated.","If one truly wants to take him down, it will definitely require considerable effort.","Gu Changhuai wielded his longsword, his figure swift as the wind, rushing towards Water Yama.","Water Yama’s eyes flickered, water system spiritual power circulated, the long whip tainted with water poison, clashing with Gu Changhuai.","Gu An and Gu Quan, caught off guard, were poisoned by water. At this moment, they were not fit to join the battle rashly, only able to support from the side to prevent Water Yama from escaping.","Mo Hua, on the other hand, stood by.","It’s not that he doesn’t want to intervene, but some of his small tricks would be of little use even if deployed, and might even hinder.","Currently, the situation is unclear.","The trump cards he holds might not guarantee a decisive blow if exposed, it would be better not to use them yet.","After all, once the trump cards are revealed, causing the enemy to be wary, it’s not easy to go for a backstab.","As for this Water Yama...","Mo Hua observed the battle from the side, estimated the fight:","Firstly, not as strong as the Fire Buddha.","Mainly because it lacks the oppressive aura compared to the Fire Buddha.","In terms of cultivation, there’s a noticeable gap.","Taoist skills lean towards sinister, using a nine-section chained whip as a spiritual artifact, the whip skill, according to Little Brother An earlier, is a technique called \"Water Punishment Whip.\"","The grade of this technique is currently unclear.","But in terms of power, it’s evidently inferior to the Meteor Fire Forbidden Art of the Fire Buddha, though its sinister aspect surpasses it.","Both Gu An and Gu Quan have Foundation Establishment Late Stage cultivation, yet due to a moment’s negligence, they’ve fallen into disadvantage after being hit by Water Yama’s Water Punishment Whip, nearly meeting disaster.","Cultivators in combat, one’s strength may be guarded against, but a sinister opponent is hard to preempt.","Strong adversaries can be defended against, but sinister ones are tough to foresee.","Yet Mo Hua doesn’t believe that Water Yama replaced the deceased Fire Buddha as the leader of the Evil God’s henchmen simply due to his sinister nature.","It’s hard to gauge whether Water Yama possesses other hidden skills...","So Mo Hua focused intently, watching the duel between Water Yama and Gu Changhuai, firstly as a live demonstration to gain experience in magic battles;","Secondly, to dissect Water Yama’s moves for clues, seeing if he has other fearsome trump cards.","Knowing both oneself and the enemy, forewarned is forearmed, is the motto of the Monster Hunter.","When facing a formidable enemy, the primary task is also to assess his strength and techniques, to know oneself and the enemy, and not rush headlong.","This constitutes the qualifications of a competent Monster Hunter.","Otherwise, no matter how many lives one has, they won’t be enough.","Mo Hua observed on the side, trying to see through Water Yama.","Meanwhile, Gu Changhuai continued his intense duel with Water Yama.","Gu Changhuai held a slight advantage, but not markedly so.","Water Yama was at a disadvantage but showed no signs of defeat.","The battle was somewhat stalemated, yet Water Yama felt increasingly unsettled, always feeling a pair of deep eyes were secretly watching and seeing through him.","He glanced at Mo Hua and the other three.","Did not find where those penetrating eyes were...","A Golden Core, two defeated Late-stage Foundation Establishment cultivators, plus a short Foundation Building Middle Stage.","These four didn’t seem to be the owners of those eyes.","Combining the inexplicable betrayal of the carriage, bringing this group of unknown cultivators to this deserted dock.","And the formation placed on the ground unknowingly...","Water Yama felt a strange sense.","\"Something is amiss...\"","\"Can’t hold back anymore, need to break this stalemate, if delayed further, unexpected changes might occur...\"","Water Yama’s heart tightened.","He intensified his attack, infused more spiritual power into his whip, causing the water poison to turn dark blue, seemingly intending rapid resolution.","Gu Changhuai’s gaze was cold, his sword moves steady, watertight.","Though perhaps not superb in swordsmanship, it suffices to hold Water Yama.","Thus the duel continued for several more rounds.","Water Yama suddenly slipped away from Gu Changhuai, turned and fled towards the riverbank.","\"He’s trying to escape!\"","Gu Changhuai and the others felt a chill in their hearts.","Gu An, prepared in advance, rushed forward, clenching his teeth, resolutely blocking before Water Yama.","But in the next instant, something occurred, and Gu An’s gaze suddenly became unfocused, seemingly intimidated, frozen.","What’s happening?","Mo Hua was startled, then his expression changed, crying out:","\"Watch out!\"","Yet moments later, Gu Quan, rushing to assist Gu An, similarly had his pupils unfocused, as if suddenly overtaken by something, losing his senses.","Gu Changhuai realized something, his expression solemn.","Focusing intensely, with sharp insight, he remained alert to Water Yama.","Yet Mo Hua found it incredible that, in the next instant, even Golden Core stage Gu Changhuai became absent-minded.","His gaze lost focus, standing rigidly.","Mo Hua felt a chill welling from within.","\"This Water Yama, what on earth is he...\"","What did he do?","This series of changes happened in the blink of an eye.","Seeing Gu Changhuai and the others losing focus, momentarily dazed, while Water Yama raised his whip, seemingly about to strike viciously.","Mo Hua was anxious, unable to think thoroughly, immediately converging Fireball Technique, preparing to attack Water Yama to delay time.","But once his Fireball Technique was formed, Water Yama’s silhouette had already vanished.","At the same time, a cold chill surged from behind him.","Mo Hua decisively deployed Water Passing Step, his body flowing like water, darting forward.","In the instant he left, a sinister whip struck the empty ground.","A light \"Huh?\" sound was heard.","Water Yama revealed himself, looking curiously at Mo Hua.","\"Water system movement technique?\"","Water Yama muttered.","Moreover, it’s not a common water system movement technique...","This technique is very sophisticated.","And this kid evidently poured a lot of effort into mastering this technique, so he uses it with proficient skill.","Against ordinary cultivators, even peak Foundation Establishment, one wouldn’t dodge this whip.","What kind of movement technique is it?","Water Yama’s gaze turned cold, then his figure flashed, like a monster’s shadow hidden in water, perilous and inscrutable, in rapid succession, he approached Mo Hua again.","Another water whip lashed down.","Yet at the critical moment, Mo Hua dodged again.","At the same time, Mo Hua was equally shocked internally.","What movement technique did this Water Yama use?","Appearing just like a Water Ghost’s shadow, elusive and hard to guard against..."]},{"number":1513,"title":"Chapter 1513 - 813: Eye Curse","paragraphs":["On the other side, Shui Yan Luo’s expression also darkened.","\"It’s not just good movement technique; this little brat’s perception is incredibly sharp. The water shadows are layered, like ghosts and specters, yet he can distinguish which water shadow I’m launching my deadly strike from...\"","Why?","How does a Foundation Building Middle Stage brat discern it?","Shui Yan Luo was puzzled.","In just this moment of chase between the two, not far away, Gu Changhuai’s aura gradually showed some struggle, as if he was about to awaken from \"intimidation.\"","Shui Yan Luo’s expression tensed.","\"No wonder he’s a Golden Core; he was intimidated for only this brief time...\"","He thought silently, then turned his head to look at Mo Hua.","\"Can’t drag this out any longer...\"","Must capture this brat as soon as possible!","In doing so, that Golden Core won’t dare act impulsively.","The other two Foundation Establishment Late Stage are not worth fearing.","And this little brat with a special identity will become a hostage, taken back, tortured, and interrogated about their origins and purposes!","Shui Yan Luo’s figure flickered, he fused with water and transformed into layers of ghost shadows, approaching Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed slightly, extending his Divine Sense, discerning the external situation, and could see that seven or eight water-colored ghost shadows had suddenly appeared all around.","And this Shui Yan Luo, his figure was elusive, continually weaving in and out of these water shadows.","Using water shadows to confuse the enemy, hiding a deadly strike.","Once you can’t distinguish which ghost shadow is real, which is false, you can easily fall into a disadvantage.","If you don’t strike, you’re just waiting to die.","And once you do, if not careful, you’ll expose a fatal flaw and receive a deadly blow.","Mo Hua marvelled in his heart:","Such powerful movement technique!","It can both evade the enemy and confuse them, and even lurk in the dark, used for killing.","This movement technique, if compared to Water Passing Step in graceful maneuvering, perhaps lacks.","But when it comes to tricky killing, it’s clearly superior.","But, his movement technique even if more elusive, is far inferior to Mo Hua’s Divine Sense.","In Mo Hua’s Divine Sense vision, all interference can be discarded, clearly distinguishing Shui Yan Luo’s figure.","A moment later, behind Mo Hua, a ghost shadow flickered and then solidified.","The ice-cold face, skin deathly pale of Shui Yan Luo appeared out of thin air.","He waved his hand, attached with water poison, like a venomous water snake, the water torture whip suddenly lashed towards Mo Hua.","With the insidiousness of this water torture whip, even if it doesn’t hit, just brushing against it, Mo Hua would lose half his life if not killed.","But unsurprisingly, the whip struck empty.","Mo Hua’s figure flashed, water light wrapped around him, with a light nimble step back, he withdrew from beneath Shui Yan Luo’s deathly water torture whip.","Shui Yan Luo’s face looked unpleasant.","\"Sure enough, this brat is not ordinary...\"","Since that’s the case, he must not be let go.","Capture him, slowly torture and extract the secrets, origins, movement techniques, perception, etc., bit by bit.","Shui Yan Luo’s eyes flashed with fierceness.","Seeing Mo Hua about to walk away, Shui Yan Luo was silent for a moment, suddenly hoarsely shouted:","\"Brat, you’re dead...\"","Mo Hua’s heart froze at the words, involuntarily turning back to look at Shui Yan Luo.","In just one glance, his expression shocked.","Shui Yan Luo’s eyes suddenly turned bright red, as if soaked in bloody water.","And within this bloody water, countless peculiar shapes gathered, resembling humans and monsters, as if they were in Purgatory, enduring eighteen types of torture, constantly struggling, suffering, screaming.","A strong wave of deadly evilness surged from his eyes.","At the moment Mo Hua met his gaze, this wave of evil qi also poured into Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness through his eyes.","Mo Hua felt a sudden fear of death, a bone-chilling coldness, and the wrath and pain of countless vengeful souls, snarling and screaming.","These emotions intimidated his mind.","Then...","There was no more.","All resentment was melted instantly upon touching Mo Hua’s Divine Thought.","All evil qi dissipated without a trace.","Mo Hua involuntarily blinked.","His eyes, clear as water.","And Shui Yan Luo, casting evil technique, still locking eyes with Mo Hua, the smile on his lips didn’t have time to fully form before freezing there.","His heart sank immediately, and his expression changed dramatically.","Failed?!","Pupil Skill useless?!","How is it possible?!","Shui Yan Luo’s gaze was somewhat incredulous.","A Golden Core Initial Stage cultivator, unexpectedly, can condense evil qi and attack with a gaze, intimidating for several breaths.","But this little brat...","How could a mere Foundation Building Middle Stage cultivator, unprepared, be unaffected after seeing his eyes and being hit by the Evil Transformation Skill?","Not only that, after being hit by the Pupil Skill, the brat’s eyes grew ever brighter, even revealing excitement, as if...","As if a hunter seeing prey?","\"What an arrogant little brat!\"","Shui Yan Luo showed killing intent, immediately wanting to strike Mo Hua again, but suddenly felt a sense of danger, using his movement technique, he retreated a step back.","Just then, a sword light slashed down at his head.","Shui Yan Luo had retreated, so it wasn’t fully hit.","But the sword light still glanced across his face.","A blood mark appeared on his face, his hair scattered, looking quite disheveled.","The face of Gu Changhuai, stern as water, holding a longsword, appeared in front of him, also blocking Mo Hua.","\"Damn it!\"","Shui Yan Luo cursed inwardly, thoughts racing.","\"Miscalculated, didn’t think this brat would be so odd, with so many tricks, causing all my previous plotting to be wrong...\"","He also didn’t anticipate himself, a renowned killer among Foundation Establishment Peak Demon Cultivators, couldn’t even capture a mere Foundation Building Middle Stage brat!"]},{"number":1514,"title":"Chapter 1514 - 813 Eye Fiend_2","paragraphs":["And now, with this Golden Core blocking in front, don’t even think about catching that little brat.","As for the pupil technique of the Evil Transformation Skill, he had used it several times, and his divine thought was now exhausted. He couldn’t use it again for a while.","Especially when dealing with a Golden Core, the pupil technique consumes tremendously.","Water Yama immediately flickered, transforming into more water shadows.","Mo Hua saw this and quickly shouted, \"Uncle Gu, he’s trying to escape!\"","Gu Changhuai swept his divine sense, and after several breaths, he barely discerned Water Yama’s true form among the numerous ghostly shadows. Immediately, he swung his longsword, cutting forth a sword light.","The sword light broke through the void, but it landed on empty space.","Water Yama’s figure flickered, narrowly dodging, but his heart tightened, and he couldn’t help but curse.","Afterward, he no longer hesitated, fully employing his movement technique, accelerating towards the shore to flee.","At this moment, a peculiar sense of crisis arose.","Whose divine sense... locked onto him?","Water Yama’s expression changed.","In just an instant, a water light descended, transforming into chains locked him securely.","But in just another moment, Water Yama flashed, as if coated in a layer of water light, the water force circulated, easily breaking free from the Water Prison Technique that Mo Hua had previously wielded with ease.","After breaking free, Water Yama was already fleeing to the water’s edge.","Yet he did not flee further but turned his head, looking at Mo Hua with disbelief and sudden realization.","\"Such a precise Water Prison Technique! You’re actually... a remnant of the Water Prison Sect?! No wonder, no wonder...\"","Water Yama muttered.","Mo Hua was stunned.","Water Prison Sect?","Did this Water Yama mistakenly think I was from the Water Prison Sect?","Gu Changhuai wouldn’t waste words with him, he held his sword horizontally, and within a few steps, he approached Water Yama again, intending to completely capture him.","Water Yama gave Mo Hua one last silent glance, a cold killing intent in his eyes.","\"Those from the Water Prison Sect must die!\"","Then he forcefully took another sword from Gu Changhuai, shaking his vitality and blood, his face turning pale, knowing things couldn’t be accomplished at this moment. He no longer hesitated, leaping into Mistwater River.","Once he entered the river, it was like a dragon returning to the sea.","Water Yama’s aura merged with the entire river, his movement technique even faster, like a demonic creature in the water, turning into a torrent, swimming deeper into Mistwater River.","Gu Changhuai stepped by the riverbank, chased a few steps, but scanning ahead, Water Yama’s trace was already gone, his face sank unwittingly.","This Water Yama could come and go freely in water.","It seemed Mistwater River was indeed his life territory.","This kind of cultivator proficient in water, once they dive into water, it is as if a fierce tiger returns to the mountain, catching him again might be as hard as climbing the sky.","Not to mention catching, finding him again might be extremely difficult...","Gu Changhuai glanced at the undulating and unfathomable Mistwater River, his expression became more grave for a while.","Then he could only sheathe his longsword, turned around, checking on Gu An and Gu Quan’s status.","Gu An and Gu Quan had already regained composure, but their lips were pale, seemingly disturbed by the evil qi, still trembling slightly.","Mo Hua stared into their eyes for a while, relaxed, and said:","\"Luckily, just evil qi entered the body, light an incense and meditate quietly, calm the mind, and recuperate for a while, then it will be fine.\"","Water Yama used evil qi, not evil spirits.","If it was evil spirits, it would be much more troublesome.","In his own Sea of Consciousness, even if it were demon monsters, Mo Hua wouldn’t be afraid.","But in someone else’s Sea of Consciousness, he currently had not much way.","Seeing Mo Hua say this, Gu Changhuai was relieved.","Mo Hua understood these strange things more.","\"Let’s go back first, as for Water Yama’s matter, plan further...\" Gu Changhuai said solemnly.","\"Hmm.\"","Mo Hua responded, then turned back, glanced at the vast Mistwater River, expression complex.","...","After Gu An and Gu Quan had adjusted their breath for a while, their bodies seemed fine, and everyone returned along the same path to the previous station.","In the station, those bandit cultivators who were tied up were still there.","\"These bandit cultivators, should we escort them back to the Taoist Court?\" Mo Hua inquired.","\"Yes,\" Gu Changhuai nodded, his eyes flashed, and said, \"Escort them to the Taoist Court in Qingzhou City.\"","Mo Hua understood.","The Gu Family was in Qingzhou City, most of the Taoist Court in Qingzhou City were from the Gu Family, so if the people were escorted there, usually no big problem would occur.","But the Fifth Grade Taoist Court at the Qian Learning State Boundary was different, it was mixed with various families, many eyes and ears, surprisingly not very safe.","Gu Changhuai summoned people using a letter token.","After a while, people from the Gu Family followed Gu Changhuai’s orders and hired two carriages from the nearby Immortal City, driving over.","One carriage was used to detain these bandit cultivators.","Gu Changhuai and the others, including Mo Hua, sat in another carriage.","The group set off back, heading for Qingzhou City.","On the way, Gu An and Gu Quan were meditating, they were afflicted by Water Yama’s sinister evil qi pupil technique, not completely recovered, needing to adjust their breath.","Gu Changhuai sat quietly drinking tea, pondering something.","Mo Hua thought for a while, then quietly asked him:","\"Uncle Gu, do you know about the Water Prison Sect?\"","Gu Changhuai pondered briefly, shook his head, \"I haven’t heard of it before.\"","Mo Hua frowned.","Uncle Gu hasn’t heard of it, but it shouldn’t be...","He had some impression, while learning the Water Prison Technique, there seemed to be related records in the spell secret manual.","But exactly how it was recorded, he couldn’t recall for a moment.","Gu Changhuai was also puzzled, asked Mo Hua:","\"Why did Water Yama call you ’a remnant of the Water Prison Sect’? Are you colluding with this Water Prison Sect secretly? Or did you steal the spell from the Water Prison Sect?\"","\"How could I steal!\" Mo Hua said with a righteous look, \"Uncle Gu, don’t randomly make rumors and slander my innocence! My spells are all properly learned from the sect!\""]},{"number":1515,"title":"Chapter 1515 - 813 Eye Hex_3","paragraphs":["Of course, except for the Mini Meteorite Skill.","This was learned from Fire Buddha.","Water Passing Step is also excluded.","This was taught by Uncle Zhang Lan.","Oh right, the Sever Gold Sword Control Jue is also excluded.","This was seized from the human trafficker Boss Jiang...","As Mo Hua thought about it, he felt a bit guilty.","Many of the Taoist Skills he possessed were seemingly not taught by the Sect.","Luckily, Gu Changhuai didn’t mind and instead asked, \"Are you saying that within the Taixu Gate, the Water Prison Sect’s inheritance is recorded?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"It’s the Water Prison Technique I often use.\"","Gu Changhuai frowned slightly, \"That’s strange...\"","\"What’s strange?\" Mo Hua was curious.","But Gu Changhuai didn’t say and just shook his head, speaking lightly:","\"It’s nothing.\"","Uncle Gu was all good, except that he wasn’t sociable and sometimes liked to keep secrets.","Mo Hua silently shook his head.","However, when he thought about it carefully, he also felt that this matter was a bit puzzling.","He had to investigate it thoroughly later...","Gu Changhuai said, \"It’s getting late, you need to return to the Sect for cultivation. The Water Yama matter, I’ll keep an eye on it and capture him soon...\"","But he knew that this matter was likely not so simple.","Judging from this confrontation, Water Yama was certainly not an ordinary character.","Mo Hua asked again, \"What about that Instructor from Hundred Flower Valley?\"","Gu Changhuai responded with a displeased face, \"I’ve found someone to monitor her.\"","\"Finding someone to monitor isn’t enough,\" Mo Hua said. \"You should watch her yourself, preferably invite her a few times, have some meals, drink some tea. It’s both to dispel her suspicions and to gather more information...\"","Gu Changhuai was stared at intently by Mo Hua. After thinking for a moment, he reluctantly agreed:","\"Alright...\"","Mo Hua nodded satisfied.","After that, he took the carriage with Gu Changhuai all the way back to Qingzhou City.","Arriving at the Gu Family in Qingzhou City, he shared a meal with Aunt Wan and Yu Er, and then rode the Gu Family’s carriage to return stably to Taixu Gate.","Following matters, including the aftermath at the inn, bandit cultivator recruitment, Hua Ruyu’s side’s appeasement, and Water Yama’s investigation, Mo Hua temporarily did not interfere.","Even if he wanted to inquire, he couldn’t.","Being in the Sect, he couldn’t reach out, there wasn’t much he could do.","He could only leave these matters to Uncle Gu and occasionally use the Letter Token to ask about the progress.","Moreover, he had his own matters to investigate.","Returning to the Sect, Mo Hua settled Yu Er and returned to the Disciple’s Residence.","All around was quiet.","Mo Hua immediately took out the Taixu Token and flipped through the pages one by one in the \"Merit Scroll\". Within a cup of tea’s time, he found the record related to the Water Prison Technique:","\"Water Prison Technique, rare spell...\"","\"Formerly an Ultimate Technique of the Water Prison Sect, not propagated.\"","\"In the winter of Taoist Calendar 19080, the entire Sect of Water Prison Sect fell into the Demon path, suppressed by the Taoist Court, and exterminated thereafter, the Water Prison Technique spread, scattered across the world, but the spell was largely incomplete...\"","\"In Taoist Calendar 19900, True Man Yi compiled this technique into a book, included in Taixu Gate...\"","\"The functionality of the Water Prison Technique is obscure, easy to learn but difficult to master, choose carefully.\"","Mo Hua stroked his chin, silently contemplating.","Taoist Calendar 19080 winter...","Calculating, it’s been nearly a thousand years.","This is already quite an old event.","Uncle Gu is only over two hundred years old, before he was born, the Water Prison Sect was long exterminated, so it’s understandable he didn’t know.","But the same question persists.","The entire Sect fell into the Demon path...","The inheritance of the Water Prison Sect, by its name alone, should be proper water series cultivation techniques and Taoist Skills.","If so, how could the entire Sect suddenly fall into the Demon path?","\"Having one or two fall into the Demon path can be understood, even if the majority of the disciples fell into the Demon path isn’t impossible, but ’entire Sect’ into the Demon path is quite peculiar.\"","One bad apple spoils the whole barrel.","But a whole barrel can’t be entirely bad apples...","The entire Sect fell into the Demon path, then was suppressed and eradicated, being so absolute, there must be something fishy within.","Another strange point is the timing when the Water Prison Technique was included.","\"In Taoist Calendar 19900, True Man Yi compiled the Water Prison Technique, and included it in Taixu Gate.\"","This time point is just over a hundred years ago.","The Water Prison Sect was exterminated over a thousand years ago, but the Water Prison Technique was included in Taixu Gate only over a hundred years ago.","There’s an interval of nearly nine hundred years in between.","Thinking about it is quite incongruous.","\"Water Prison Sect, Water Yama...\"","Mo Hua’s mind again recalled Water Yama’s shocked expression upon seeing the Water Prison Technique, causing him to furrow his brows.","The Water Prison Technique seems ineffective against Water Yama?","This obscure, rare, hard to master yet extremely useful control spell seems to be precisely countered by Water Yama’s cultivation of water energy.","This shouldn’t be a coincidence.","\"Could Water Yama’s entire skillset... be related to the exiled Water Prison Sect?\"","Besides ignoring the control of the Water Prison Technique, there are two more spells on Water Yama that Mo Hua particularly focused on.","One is Water Yama’s movement technique.","This movement technique, like Water Passing Step, is also a water system body skill. However, when performed, its actions are more elusive, with hidden murderous intent in the water shadow.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but think, if he could master this movement technique and try to merge it with Water Passing Step, wouldn’t his movement technique greatly improve?","By then, the movement technique wouldn’t only be used for hiding, but could also confuse enemies during frontal engagements and secretly attack.","Another technique, also the most important one...","Is the Pupil Skill!","Water Yama’s eyes can gather Evil Qi and release it through the eyes, intimidating the mind and spirit of others!","This pupil skill is very powerful and hard to defend against.","Even the Golden Core Realm Uncle Gu was caught off guard by this Taoist Skill.","Eyes emitting Evil Qi!","This Taoist Skill, in form, surprisingly resembles the method of \"Eyes Emitting Sword Light\" used by the legendary former Sword Cultivator of Taixu Gate that Lord Yellow Mountain mentioned, achieving a similar effect.","If this spell could also be obtained and comprehended...","Could I then be able to use my eyes as a pivotal point, transform Divine Thought into a sword and release it externally to kill the enemy?","Mo Hua’s gaze grew more excited.","This Water Yama, a treasure just like Fire Buddha."]},{"number":1516,"title":"Chapter 1516 - 814: Water Prison","paragraphs":["In the evening, Mo Hua went to the Dao Room and found Elder Yi, who specializes in teaching Taoist skills within the Taixu Gate.","Elder Yi was idly flipping through the roster, and upon seeing Mo Hua, he was somewhat surprised and a little cautious:","\"You’re here to practice spells again?\"","Mo Hua had once practiced the Fireball Technique and injured himself, causing Elder Master Xun to give him the cold shoulder for two months, a fact Elder Yi remembered vividly.","Thus, every time Mo Hua came to practice spells, Elder Yi prepared himself thoroughly.","\"No,\" Mo Hua waved his hand, \"I want to ask you some questions...\"","\"Ask questions?\" Elder Yi was slightly taken aback, then slightly relieved, \"Asking questions is good...\"","As long as he didn’t practice those dangerous spells, Mo Hua was considered a good child.","\"Tell me, what questions do you want to ask,\" said Elder Yi.","Mo Hua handed over a jade slip containing transcribed records about the Water Prison Technique to Elder Yi and asked:","\"Elder, do you know about the Water Prison Technique?\"","Elder Yi took the jade slip, glanced at it, and nodded: \"Of course.\"","He was the Elder of Daoist Law.","The Yi family was also known for their expertise in spells.","Elder Yi knew more or less about all the spells recorded within the Taixu Gate.","Even though the Water Prison Technique was somewhat obscure and had limited uses with only a handful of disciples learning it, as the Elder of Daoist Law, he needed to be knowledgeable.","\"I was looking through the sect’s records, and it’s said that this Water Prison Technique was an ultimate technique of the Water Prison Sect in the past?\" Mo Hua quietly asked, \"Elder Yi, do you know about it?\"","Elder Yi furrowed his brows.","\"Why are you asking about this?\"","Mo Hua could tell from Elder Yi’s expression that he knew something.","After some thought, Mo Hua explained, \"I learned this Water Prison Technique within the sect. But recently, when I used it outside, someone recognized it and said it was something from the Water Prison Sect, so I became curious and came to ask.\"","\"Oh...\"","Elder Yi nodded slightly, not suspecting anything.","Mo Hua’s explanation was simple, so he assumed it was nothing special and didn’t think about why or on whom Mo Hua used the Water Prison Technique.","He couldn’t have imagined that the person now regarded Mo Hua as a \"survivor of the Water Prison Sect,\" desperately wanting to kill him.","\"I do know a bit about the Water Prison Sect...\"","Elder Yi contemplated for a moment, then continued, \"A thousand years ago, the Water Prison Sect was quite prominent. At that time, the sect structure of the Qian Learning State Boundary was different from today’s Four Great Sects and Eight Great Gates.\"","\"Back then, in terms of strength, the Water Prison Sect was not top-tier, but it could rank among the ’Twelve Streams’ level sects.\"","\"Additionally, the Twelve Streams sects of that time were genuinely top-notch in a particular field of Taoist cultivation.\"","\"Unlike today, where many Twelve Streams sects are even inferior to some of the Four Great Sects in their core skills. The most typical example is the Ten Thousand Formations Sect...\"","Elder Yi sighed, \"I don’t even know how they pass down their Formation, each generation worse than the last...\"","Mo Hua asked, \"So, the Water Prison Sect back then had perfected the Water System Dao Law?\"","\"I wouldn’t say perfected,\" Elder Yi shook his head, \"There are always higher mountains, and the Great Dao is vast. No one dares claim they can achieve perfection. But at least within the Qian Learning State Boundary, and even most of Qian State, the Water Prison Sect’s Water System Dao Law was among the best.\"","\"And not only that, in terms of Water System Dao Law, the Water Prison Sect had specializations. Their transmitted Water System Spells focused on precision over variety...\"","Precision over variety?","Mo Hua pondered slightly and slowly said, \"The ’Prison’ in Water Prison Sect’s name suggests they specialize in control and imprisonment type of Water System Spells?\"","\"Furthermore, from the name, the sect might have connections with the Court Officials?\"","Elder Yi looked slightly surprised.","This child is indeed quick-witted.","Perhaps it’s because he studies Formation, which tends to attract clever individuals.","But then again, some who study Formation in the sect do seem rather dull...","Elder Yi thought to himself.","\"Correct, the Water Prison Sect was specialized in control, restraint, imprisonment, including penal-type Water System Spells. Some spells were even forbidden techniques...\"","Elder Yi continued, \"Most of the disciples who graduated from the Water Prison Sect also joined various Taoist Courts, and these cultivators from the Water Prison Sect were proficient in Water Prison techniques, delighting in using harsh punishments to torment people, even though they tormented only Sin Cultivators. But this resulted in a bad reputation for the Water Prison Sect.\"","\"Later on...\"","Elder Yi frowned, \"I’m not too clear about what happened after that, but it’s said that something fundamentally went wrong with the Water Prison Sect’s cultivation techniques. Those who delved deeply became sinister and cruel.\"","\"At that time, there were also scandals of Water Prison Sect disciples falling into the Demon Path, abusing their power in the Taoist Courts to indiscriminately kill innocents.\"","\"The Taoist Court conducted a thorough investigation, and this investigation uncovered a significant issue that infuriated the Taoist Court.\"","\"What exactly it was, the Taoist Court did not disclose, and the truth is likely sealed in the files of the Central Dao Court.\"","\"In any case, after that, many people of the Water Prison Sect died, and the remaining disciples were all imprisoned. All their core inheritances were sealed, and some fragmented techniques, like the ’Water Prison Technique,’ scattered throughout the Cultivation World as an obscure Daoist cultivation method, were preserved...\"","Elder Yi lamented.","Mo Hua’s expression turned grim.","He hadn’t expected that behind the name \"Water Prison Sect\" lay such an unknown secret.","The matters of the Cultivation World are indeed perilous and complex, shrouded in mystery.","For such a Great Sect to vanish so suddenly...","\"Then the Water Prison Technique, being a spell of the Water Prison Sect, might it have issues? Didn’t the Taoist Court seal it?\" Mo Hua asked."]},{"number":1517,"title":"Chapter 1517 - 814 Water Prison_2","paragraphs":["Elder Yi waved his hand, \"How could they all be banned? Besides, since this spell has been passed down and even included in the Taixu Gate, it indicates there’s not much of a problem.\"","\"Moreover, the Water Prison Technique is peculiar and tricky; a normal person, who would learn such a spell?\"","Mo Hua silently looked at Elder Yi.","Only then did Elder Yi realize that the person in front of him had learned the Water Prison Technique, and he laughed sheepishly:","\"I didn’t mean you, it’s just... your situation is unique, with a strong divine sense but weak spiritual power. Taking a different path and learning these control spells is quite good, quite good...\"","Mo Hua nodded and said:","\"Elder, there’s one more question...\"","He thought for a moment, looking puzzled, \"I was reviewing the sect’s records, and the Water Prison Sect was destroyed a thousand years ago, but the Water Prison Technique was only included in the Taixu Gate by a ’True Man Yi’ over a hundred years ago.\"","\"This ’True Man Yi’ is a senior of the Feather Transformation Realm from the Yi family, right?\"","Elder Yi nodded, \"If you calculate, he should be my uncle.\"","\"Then about this ’True Man Yi’, where did he find this Water Prison Technique inheritance, and from whom specifically?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Now you’re making things difficult for me...\" Elder Yi sighed, \"How would I possibly know about such things.\"","\"Then...\" Mo Hua whispered, \"Could you perhaps ask True Man Yi for me?\"","Elder Yi looked at Mo Hua with a meaningful gaze, \"You youngster, did you have this intention from the start?\"","Mo Hua smiled awkwardly.","He actually wanted to ask directly, but as a mere disciple, True Man Yi wouldn’t know who he was.","Of course, he actually didn’t know who this True Man Yi was either.","Given that, he could only ask Elder Yi for help.","Elder Yi pondered for a moment, then nodded, \"Alright, I’ll ask for you.\"","Mo Hua’s expression lit up with joy, and he immediately said, \"Thank you, Elder Yi!\"","Then he patted his chest, \"In the future, if Elder Yi ever has any difficulties, feel free to come to me. As long as it’s something within my capability, I will do my best.\"","Elder Yi laughed.","As a dignified Golden Core Cultivator, Elder of Daoist Law at Taixu Gate, how would I need a favor from a mere disciple?","I...","Elder Yi paused.","It seems it’s not entirely impossible...","At least with Elder Master Xun, Mo Hua’s face is more valuable than that of a Golden Core Elder like him.","\"Alright!\" Elder Yi didn’t put on airs and said cheerfully, \"In the future, if there’s anything, I’ll come to you for help.\"","\"Yes, yes!\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"However,\" Elder Yi hesitated a bit, \"I can ask for you, but my uncle... or rather, True Man Yi, is passionate about spells and loves to travel the world, collecting various Taoist skills across the Nine State.\"","\"I don’t even know where my uncle is traveling now. The flying sword transmission might not reach him for some time, and who knows when he might reply—it could be days, months, or even a year or two...\"","\"That long?\" Mo Hua was a bit disappointed.","\"It’s a matter of luck,\" Elder Yi said, \"After all, the cultivation world is vast, wandering who knows where, and letters may not find their way.\"","Mo Hua sighed, \"Alright, it’s the only way...\"","Elder Yi nodded, \"Once I have news, I’ll inform you.\"","Mo Hua bowed and said, \"Thank you for your trouble, Elder.\"","Afterward, Mo Hua attended classes and cultivated as usual.","Unexpectedly, a few days later, during a break, Elder Yi stood at the door, waving at Mo Hua, \"Mo Hua, come.\"","In a secluded spot, Elder Yi looked at Mo Hua with a strange expression.","\"You kid, you truly have good luck...\"","It’s unknown whether heavenly destiny favors him.","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, \"Did True Man Yi reply?\"","\"Yes.\" Elder Yi nodded, \"My uncle was passing through Kun State, preparing to return to the sect, staying at a Yi family branch when he received my flying sword transmission.\"","\"According to my uncle, the events of a thousand years ago at the Water Prison Sect also seemed odd to him, but too much time has passed, and both people and things have changed, making it untraceable now.\"","\"As for the Water Prison Technique, he acquired it by sheer chance...\"","\"By chance?\" Mo Hua was curious.","Elder Yi said, \"Over a hundred years ago, my uncle wasn’t wandering and, having nothing else to do, taught at the Taixu Gate.\"","\"One day, while visiting a friend and fishing by the river, he came across a cultivator in distress and saved him casually. In gratitude, that cultivator offered all his spirit stones and wealth to my uncle.\"","\"Such things my uncle wouldn’t care about, so he waved it off, saying saving someone was a small effort not worth remembering. He told him to keep those spirit stones to cultivate well.\"","\"But that person was very loyal and insisted on repaying the life-saving grace, saying he had nothing except some Daoist cultivation methods passed down from his ancestors. If my uncle didn’t mind, he would repay with these methods.\"","\"Originally, my uncle didn’t care; as a Taixu Gate Elder of Daoist Law and a Feathered Immortal, he had seen all kinds of spells.\"","\"But as soon as he saw what the man had, it was something he had truly never seen before...\"","\"After much deliberation, from the properties of the spell, the meridian flow, and its uses, he deduced that it might be the genuine Water Prison Technique of the Water Prison Sect, very different from the ’castrated’ versions circulating outside.\"","\"Filled with joy, my uncle asked about the origin of this Water Prison Technique.\"","\"Yet that man didn’t even know the term ’Water Prison Technique,’ only saying this spell was handed down by his ancestors, its name unknown and extremely difficult to learn, not very effective either, so he kept it like an old relic, remembering it as a family treasure.\"","\"The origins of the Water Prison Sect, indeed, are not illustrious, and after pondering it, my uncle chose not to mention it.\""]},{"number":1518,"title":"Chapter 1518 - 814 Water Prison_3","paragraphs":["\"But the Water Prison Technique, he really liked it, so he accepted it. At the same time, he felt a bit uneasy in his heart, seeing that the cultivator was impoverished. Therefore, he also gave him some Spirit Stones and helped him find a village to settle down and establish a livelihood...\"","Elder Yi’s words ended here.","Mo Hua gradually furrowed his brows, \"True Man Yi fishing by the river... This river, is it the Mistwater River?\"","Elder Yi nodded, \"Precisely the Mistwater River.\"","\"Did True Man Yi mention where by the Mistwater River that was?\"","Elder Yi said: \"My uncle didn’t mention it, but since it was fishing, I suppose it should be at the downstream river bend. Back then, I also went fishing there with my uncle a few times...\"","\"Downstream river bend?\"","Mo Hua didn’t have any impression.","\"Around thirty miles west along the turning of the Mistwater River,\" Elder Yi said, \"The water is deep there, and Water Demons are abundant. Swamp and mud accumulate, cultivators rarely go there, but a few miles away, there’s a water village...\"","Mo Hua was suddenly startled.","\"A water village?!\"","Elder Yi was startled by Mo Hua’s sudden shock and couldn’t help but ask:","\"What’s the matter?\"","\"What water village?\" Mo Hua asked urgently.","Elder Yi shook his head, \"I just went fishing twice, caught only three or four fish, how could I pay attention to what the nearby water village was...\"","Mo Hua’s heart was heavy.","He had a strong premonition.","The water village Elder Yi mentioned was likely the \"Yu Family Water Village\" that was recently exterminated by Water Yama!","The cultivator True Man Yi saved was likely a cultivator from the Yu Family Water Village.","The cultivators from the Yu Family Water Village possessed the heritage of the Water Prison Technique.","The Yu Family Water Village was exterminated by Water Yama.","Water Yama said, \"The cultivators of the Water Prison Sect must die!\"","That being said...","This Yu Family Water Village is the remaining descendants of the Water Prison Sect.","Water Yama exterminated the entire Yu Family Water Village not just to build an altar but also to kill the descendants of the Water Prison Sect to silence them?","And Yu Family Water Village... Yu...","Mo Hua’s pupils shrank.","He hadn’t realized before, but now he suddenly remembered, in the small fishing village, Old Yu, Yu Dachuan, Little Shunzi, and Little Shuizi’s family, they all bore the surname \"Yu\"!","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","Could Old Yu’s family also have ties to the Yu Family Water Village?","Mo Hua’s thoughts fluctuated, his expression uncertain.","Elder Yi couldn’t help but ask, \"What are you thinking?\"","Seeing Mo Hua unresponsive, Elder Yi asked again.","Mo Hua finally came back to his senses, said: \"Nothing, I’m thinking about the Formation I haven’t finished drawing, I’ll go back first, thank you Elder Yi...\"","\"If you ever need anything, I will definitely help you!\"","Mo Hua promised, then dashed off.","Elder Yi watched Mo Hua’s departing figure, shaking his head in confusion.","...","Mo Hua returned to the Disciple’s Residence, his mood still unsteady.","He immediately transmitted a message to Gu Changhuai, asking: \"Uncle Gu, is there anything happening over at the small fishing village?\"","After a while, Gu Changhuai asked:","\"What matter?\"","\"Just...\" Mo Hua thought for a moment, \"Are there any Sin Cultivators or Evil Cultivators wandering nearby?\"","\"I have people from the Gu Family keeping an eye, for now, nothing unusual,\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief.","\"What happened?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","Water Yama might also exterminate the small fishing village...","Mo Hua thought about it, decided to keep it from Uncle Gu for now, since he doesn’t have evidence yet.","\"I was just asking casually.\"","Gu Changhuai seemed a bit alert, \"Are you... hiding something from me again?\"","\"No!\" Mo Hua said.","Seeing Gu Changhuai wanting to ask more, he preemptively asked:","\"Uncle Gu, have you met with the Hundred Flower Valley instructor recently?\"","Gu Changhuai knew Mo Hua’s little schemes, but he knew asking would be futile, so he said:","\"I have met, but she seems to have realized something, more vigilant than before.\"","\"She suspects you?\"","\"For now, it seems not. Regarding matters between men and women, I pretend to be clumsy, she hasn’t been suspicious,\" Gu Changhuai said.","The word \"pretend\" was a bit redundant...","Mo Hua murmured inwardly.","But he didn’t say it out loud, fearing Uncle Gu’s pettiness and holding grudges.","\"Uncle Gu, it’s up to you,\" Mo Hua encouraged.","Regarding Hua Ruyu, it’s up to Uncle Gu to find clues through matchmaking.","Gu Changhuai only responded with a faint \"Hmm.\"","The conversation ended.","Mo Hua felt slightly relieved but hadn’t completely let go.","\"Yu Family Water Village, small fishing village...\"","Mo Hua felt he still had to personally go and take a look.","A few days later, as the rest day arrived, Mo Hua drove alone away from Taixu Gate, followed along the Mistwater River, passed several Immortal Cities, purchased some items, and eventually reached the small fishing village.","The small fishing village was indeed safe and sound.","Old Yu was overjoyed to see Mo Hua.","In his eyes, Mo Hua was truly an \"Honored Guest.\"","Not the right time to talk, seeing other Fish Cultivators around, Mo Hua said:","\"Can I go pay respects to the...\" Mo Hua pointed to the back of the village, \"Little Immortal?\"","Old Yu said happily: \"Of course, of course, hoping that Little Immortal may also bless the benefactor with prosperity like the East Sea and boundless Dao path.\"","I bless myself...","Mo Hua felt a bit delicate.","Reaching the back of the village, Mo Hua placed some melons and fruits up, then pretended to pray to his statue.","It was still morning, Fish Cultivators busy with livelihoods, Old Yu didn’t follow, no other people around.","Mo Hua quietly said: \"Come out.\"","After a moment, a bright white silver fish swam out from behind the majestic Little Immortal statue and nodded in reverence to Mo Hua.","\"Greetings Benefactor.\"","\"You’re too thin, I brought some food for you, to nourish you.\" Mo Hua pointed to the Spirit Melons and Spirit Fruits on the offering table.","He had always fed Lord Yellow Mountain..."]},{"number":1519,"title":"Chapter 1519 - 814 Water Prison_4","paragraphs":["But Lord Yellow Mountain lives far away, and somewhat isolated, so he doesn’t often have the time to come by.","This time on his way, he happened to visit and feed the Little Silver Fish.","No matter how miserable Lord Yellow Mountain is, he still retains a human shape. If the Little Silver Fish isn’t fed, it might become so thin it’s unrecognizable as a fish.","The Little Silver Fish is extremely grateful to Mo Hua.","It barely counts as a deity in its two lifetimes, yet no one has ever treated it this well.","The Little Silver Fish nibbled happily on the fruits.","Mo Hua then asked, \"Little Silver Fish, do you know the origins of this small fishing village?\"","The Little Silver Fish shook its head and said, \"To repay a favor to my benefactor, I’ve forgotten...\"","After speaking, it continued eating the sweet offerings.","Well, it’s a little glutton, somewhat unreliable...","Mo Hua felt helpless.","He could only go ask Old Yu.","At mealtime, Mo Hua once again had a meal at Old Yu’s place.","Except this time he brought some Spiritual Meat along.","Although it wasn’t extremely valuable, to Old Yu’s family—poor loose cultivators who lived off fishing and hunting—it was something not even seen during holidays or festivals.","Old Yu felt both grateful and guilty.","\"I made my benefactor spend money...\"","\"It’s nothing,\" Mo Hua replied, \"It didn’t cost many Spirit Stones.\"","Mainly because in the sect, food, clothing, and daily necessities could be exchanged for Merit Points.","Outside the sect, the large Gu Family provided meals and drinks, so he didn’t have much opportunity to spend Spirit Stones himself and thus saved quite a bit of wealth.","Old Yu and Yu Dachuan kept toasting Mo Hua with wine.","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi happily ate the Spiritual Meat.","Throughout the year, there were hardly any pieces of meat they could eat; they could count them all.","After the meal, Yu Dachuan headed downriver again.","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi lay in the shade in the courtyard for a nap.","Old Yu made Mo Hua a pot of good tea.","The tea wasn’t particularly great, but it was the best their family could offer.","Mo Hua then lowered his voice and asked, \"Old man, do you know about the Yu Family Water Fort?\"","Upon hearing this, Old Yu immediately looked alarmed, his face turned pale:","\"I’ve heard about it, right on Mistwater River, an entire fort of people died cleanly, blood-stained half the river...\"","Mo Hua pondered, \"The Yu Family Water Fort bears the Yu surname, and your surname is also Yu...\"","\"Yes,\" Old Yu said without doubt, sighing, \"speaking of it, there’s a bit of kinship. Counting back two generations, we might also have been people of the Yu Family Water Fort, living in the fort...\"","Mo Hua thought, surely, and then curiously asked, \"Then why are you living in this small fishing village?\"","\"Ashamed to say,\" Old Yu sighed, \"it’s said in my grandfather’s generation, due to his poor character, he was lazy and gluttonous, and was driven out of the fort to fend for himself. Looking back, it seems to be a blessing in disguise...\"","Old Yu was somewhat frightened, \"Otherwise, our whole family might have also died at the fort without knowing whose hands poisoned everyone there.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze slightly tightened.","Driven out...","This matter might not be so simple.","\"How much do you know about the fort?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Old Yu thought for a moment, shook his head, \"We stopped associating long ago, the ancestral blood ties, once separated, cut off completely, if you hadn’t mentioned it, I wouldn’t have brought it up.\"","\"All of us are struggling souls, it’s hard enough to live, who would care about these old troubles...\"","Old Yu said with emotion.","Mo Hua also sighed softly.","It seems Old Yu doesn’t know much indeed.","After that, the two continued drinking tea.","Mo Hua was pondering to himself, wondering if he had missed any clues that could unravel the purpose of Water Yama and discover the truth about the Yu Family Water Fort...","But turning thoughts over and over, he had no good leads.","Just at this time, a gentle breeze passed by, Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi unconsciously turned over.","The spiritual power within the two children circulated, and their aura spread out.","Mo Hua looked at them, suddenly stupefied.","He had previously noticed that these two children’s cultivation was advancing quickly, but now it seemed their cultivation progress was even faster than he had imagined.","Furthermore, the aura seemed somewhat special...","Mo Hua’s gaze slightly tightened."]},{"number":1520,"title":"Chapter 1520 - 815: The Cave","paragraphs":["\"How have Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi been progressing with their cultivation recently?\" Mo Hua asked Old Yu.","On hearing this, Old Yu looked gratified, \"These two kids have been quite diligent in their cultivation, and their advancement isn’t slow, which has saved me a lot of worry. To speak honestly, it’s all thanks to you, my benefactor. If it weren’t for your help, these two might not have fared so well, let alone be full of life as they are now...\"","At this, Old Yu sighed deeply and his expression turned reflective.","Mo Hua replied modestly, \"I didn’t do much.\"","He then turned his head, gazed deeply at the two children in the courtyard, and spoke slowly, \"Have they shown any abnormalities recently?\"","\"Abnormalities?\" Old Yu was puzzled.","Mo Hua said, \"I mean, is there anything wrong with their cultivation? After they were captured the last time, are there any lingering aftereffects?\"","Concerning his two grandsons, Old Yu’s expression grew serious.","He thought hard, furrowed his brow, but finally shook his head, \"Nothing abnormal.\"","Then his expression grew a bit tense, \"Did something happen, my benefactor?\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua also relaxed, \"I was just being cautious, so I asked. It’s good that there’s nothing unusual.\"","Only then did Old Yu feel at ease.","He personally poured Mo Hua another cup of tea, saying, \"Have some tea, please.\"","Mo Hua did not say anything further.","Thus, they passed the time until noon, and as the sun began to set, Mo Hua got up to take his leave.","\"My benefactor, won’t you stay a bit longer? Tonight, I can prepare some fresh food as a treat...\"","Old Yu insisted warmly.","But Mo Hua felt obliged to respond, \"I still have matters at the Sect that I cannot delay.\"","Understanding that a cultivator prioritizes Tao cultivation, Old Yu couldn’t insist further.","The two children, Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi, had woken up. Seeing Mo Hua about to leave again, they looked a bit dismayed, reluctantly escorting Mo Hua to the village outskirts.","Mo Hua patted their small heads, smiled, and gave them a few words of advice before turning and leaving.","Afterwards, Old Yu’s family resumed their busy lives for their livelihood.","Old Yu repaired the nets for a while and tidied up the fishing equipment before, with his back bent and hands behind, leading his two grandchildren out of the small fishing village to the banks of Mistwater River.","They set some fish traps along the riverbank.","The grandfather and his two grandsons then started checking the traps along the riverbank to see if they had caught any greedy, clumsy fish or shrimp.","After collecting along the way for a while, they reached the ferry.","A boat was docked at the ferry.","On the boat was Old Yu’s son, Yu Dachuan, who had gone out to the river early and caught quite a lot of fish. After that, the four members of the family started sorting through the fish on the boat.","The energetic and well-shaped big fish were kept for sale.","The ones with average appearance or minor defects were not worth much selling, so they kept them for themselves.","Some of the smaller fish were released back into the river.","The family worked hard but found joy in the labor despite the toil.","Once done, Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi spoke up:","\"Grandpa, we want to go fish poaching.\"","Old Yu knew his two grandsons were tired and wanted to have some fun, so he waved them off, \"Go, go...\"","But he sternly warned, \"Stay by the riverbank, no diving into deep waters, or the Water Demon will drag you under and gobble you whole.\"","Both grandsons nodded, \"Yes, Grandpa. Don’t worry.\"","\"Go on then.\"","The two children cheerfully ran off.","They followed the river downstream to the shallows where they began their fishing.","The water at the riverbank was shallow, populated with small fish not worthy of catching but also devoid of Water Demons, making it an ideal playground for children to practice swimming and fish poaching.","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi played in the shallow water for a while before starting to fish.","They were catching a type of very small fish, like grass seedlings, with plump bodies and no spines.","The two children practiced the \"White Wave Skill\" granted by Mo Hua, along with its same-origin White Wave movement technique and the Water Avoiding and Demon Repelling techniques, and so had developed great water skills.","Moreover, once offered as sacrifices to the River God, their Divine Souls had been assimilated, touching somewhat upon the River God’s aura. This made them adept in water, whether playing or catching fish.","Their auras harmonized with the river water, and with sharp eyes and quick hands, a quick scoop would net them a small fish.","After a while, the slightly taller Little Shunzi said:","\"I caught ten! How about you?\"","Little Shuizi counted and replied, \"Nine.\"","Little Shunzi nodded, \"Then I’ll catch ten more, and you catch eleven more, just the same, and we can head back. These little fish can be kept alive with some clean water so that when Brother Mo visits next, we can offer him some grilled fish.\"","Little Shuizi eagerly replied, \"Okay!\"","They remembered Mo Hua fondly, also recalling the Spiritual Meat he treated them to today, so they wished to treat him to some delicious grilled fish as well.","Mo Hua stood by, slightly stunned, his expression somewhat complex.","He had observed everything quietly.","When he left the village earlier, instead of returning to the Sect, he had concealed his presence and followed Old Yu’s family.","With his now nineteen-pattern Divine Sense and his mastery of the Minor Five Elements Stealth Skill, in the entire small fishing village, no cultivator could possibly pierce through his concealment.","He hadn’t expected Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi to hold him in such high regard.","Mo Hua felt touched for a moment.","The purer the goodwill, the more precious it often becomes.","The two children continued fishing.","Little Shunzi, being slightly older and more clever, was quicker and soon caught ten more small fish.","Then he stopped and waited for his younger sibling, Little Shuizi, to catch up with eleven fish, until both had twenty fish. Only then did he say:"]},{"number":1521,"title":"Chapter 1521 - 815: Cave_2","paragraphs":["\"Go back.\"","\"Mm.\" Little Shuizi said happily.","The two children, each carrying a small fish basket, held hands and returned to the village without a care in the world.","After they left, in front of the empty riverbank, Mo Hua slowly appeared.","Gazing at the backs of the two children, Mo Hua looked confused and murmured softly:","\"Nothing unusual... Could it be that I’m wrong?\"","A moment later, Mo Hua’s figure disappeared again.","The sunset dyed the evening glow red.","In the small fishing village, the Fish Cultivators who went out to fish also returned home one after another, with smoke curling up from the chimneys.","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi, too, returned to their homes.","The family gathered together, chatting and laughing over dinner. After the meal, Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi practiced cultivation for a while, then fell asleep peacefully.","Mo Hua’s gaze was slightly concentrated as he sat cross-legged on the branches of a large tree outside the village, closing his eyes to rest.","Time slowly passed.","The crescent moon hung high, the night deepened, and the small fishing village grew increasingly quiet.","Approaching midnight, Mo Hua suddenly opened his eyes.","At the same time, there was movement in the fishing village.","Two small black shadows quietly climbed over the wall of Old Yu’s house. After landing, they walked together along the village path towards the outskirts of the village.","It was precisely Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi.","Mo Hua’s eyes slightly flickered, moving silently like a specter, quietly following them.","The two children were completely unaware.","They kept walking out of the village, along the desolate riverbank in the pitch-black night, heading downstream, gradually straying farther away.","They walked to the foot of a desolate mountain.","The two children exchanged glances, then supported each other as they climbed up the rugged mountain stones.","They climbed to the mountainside, where the terrain was gentle, covered with wild grass.","Amidst the cover of wild plants, there was a cave.","The two children knelt in front of the cave, respectfully saying: \"Senior, we have arrived.\"","Before long, an aged voice came from within the cave: \"Good, have you diligently practiced the cultivation technique I taught you?\"","Little Shunzi said respectfully: \"We have remembered Senior’s instructions and have not slacked off.\"","Little Shuizi nodded in agreement.","\"Very well...\"","The voice inside the cave seemed somewhat weak and was accompanied by suppressed coughing.","After a while, the aged voice spoke again:","\"Next, I will teach you something else.\"","The two children’s eyes lit up, \"Senior, what else will you teach us?\"","\"Didn’t you say...\" the person within the cave coughed, \"that your grandfather, father, and mother often go down to the river and you are afraid that the Water Demon might eat them, so you want to learn some protective spell points, so you have the power to save yourselves and others in times of emergency...\"","\"Next, what I will teach you is a spell. It can transform the water energy you cultivate into dense hidden weapons, used to paralyze and harm enemies.\"","The two children were overjoyed and bowed repeatedly, saying:","\"Thank you, Senior!\"","Little Shuizi, however, was somewhat curious and asked: \"Senior, what is the name of this spell?\"","\"Yes, and the cultivation technique you taught us, I also don’t know its name...\" Little Shunzi added.","The person within the cave said hoarsely: \"You do not need to ask or concern yourselves with it. Whatever inheritance I teach you, just learn it well.\"","The two children hesitated slightly.","Although they were young and were grateful for the Senior’s teachings, they were not foolish. A heritage that discloses neither its origin nor name inherently had some issues.","The aged voice inside the cave then said:","\"Some things, knowing is trouble, not knowing is fortune.\"","\"Knowing everything too clearly is not necessarily a good thing.\"","\"Don’t you want to advance your cultivation? Don’t you want to achieve Foundation Establishment? Don’t you want to reach Golden Core after Foundation Establishment? Don’t you want to learn great skills and live with dignity, free from bullying?\"","The expression of the two children grew solemn, and they nodded, saying:","\"We do!\"","\"Since you do, then study earnestly and don’t ask too many questions about other matters.\"","\"Yes, Senior.\"","The person within the cave said: \"Now, I’ll teach you the mantra of this spell, the critical points for circulating spiritual power, and the meridians to be traversed... Remember carefully.\"","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi said solemnly: \"Alright!\"","Then that old voice began to teach the spell’s key points.","The two children listened very attentively.","\"This spell is in the same line as the cultivation technique I passed on to you. With the cultivation technique, the spell’s power can be greatly enhanced. Without the support of the cultivation technique, the spell is just ordinary. \"","\"The most important aspect of using this spell is to attack when the opponent is unprepared, catching them off guard. Once spiritual power condenses into a hidden weapon and infiltrates the body, it is like a deeply poisonous parasite, causing immense pain and being difficult to eradicate.\"","\"The difficult part of this spell lies in the high requirement for spiritual power control and the complex meridian circuits, which require years of practice to master...\"","The person in the cave stopped speaking suddenly.","Little Shunzi asked in confusion, \"Senior, master what?\"","\"It’s nothing...\" The old voice slowly said, \"Did you remember what I just taught you?\"","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi nodded, \"We remembered it all.\"","\"Good, and one more thing... You must diligently practice this spell usually, but unless absolutely necessary, do not use it lightly, and do not mention that I have taught you the cultivation technique and spell to anyone.\" The person in the cave said seriously.","\"Senior, we have remembered.\" Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi earnestly said.","\"Hmm, that’s all for today, you may leave now.\"","Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi respectfully bowed toward the cave, then climbed back down the mountain following the path along the mountain wall.","After the two children left.","In front of the cave halfway up the mountain, it became silent for a while.","The night was deep and the moonlight was cool.","A moment later, that old voice again came from the cave, \"What Taoist friend, since you are here, why not show yourself?\"","Mo Hua, who was outside the cave and deep in thought, was startled upon hearing.","Did he actually discover me?","He must be a master...","The person in the cave spoke again: \"We are just passing acquaintances, I mean no harm, why hide and not show up, Taoist friend, come and meet.\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment and slowly revealed his form, but the night was pitch black, blurring his silhouette, making it indiscernible.","The person in the cave, seeing someone indeed present, immediately had his tone deepen and asked:","\"This Taoist friend, what might be your background? Why have you come here?\"","Although he feigned calmness, Mo Hua could hear deep vigilance and a hint of hidden hostility in his tone.","This person behaves strangely...","Mo Hua silently pondered:","\"I don’t know how he detected my concealment, but since he can discover me, it shows that his divine sense is stronger than mine...\"","\"At least the Foundation Establishment Peak, no, even the Foundation Establishment Peak might not detect me, should be at least Golden Core...\"","\"However, his breath is weak, lacking qi, clearly suffering from serious injuries.\"","\"Hiding in the cave not daring to show himself, the situation seems quite unfavorable.\"","\"And this is the Second Grade State Border, even if he is Golden Core, under the suppression of the Heavenly Dao, he’s just as useless as Uncle Gu, only able to exert Foundation Establishment Peak strength...\"","Mo Hua quickly assessed the general situation, then began setting an array formation outside the cave without saying a word.","The person in the cave immediately sensed something unusual and promptly changed his tone:","\"Taoist friend, what is your intention?\"","\"Taoist friend?\"","\"Why is the Taoist friend silent?\"","...","Mo Hua completely ignored him.","In a situation where the details are unknown and he doesn’t hold the reins, he didn’t bother with unnecessary words.","As more formations were set, the person in the cave became much more conciliatory.","\"Taoist friend, if you have any needs, feel free to ask.\"","\"Taoist friend, I have no ill intentions.\"","\"Taoist friend, why not come into the cave, let’s talk and become friends...\"","Mo Hua continued to act as though he heard nothing, proceeding to draw his formations alone.","Only after finishing the formation did he stop his hand.","By this time, the surroundings of the cave were covered with densely packed killing formations.","These killing formations were like an enormous spider web, encasing the entire cave, filled with dangerous killing intent.","Mo Hua nodded and then said:","\"Alright, now we can talk...\""]},{"number":1522,"title":"Chapter 1522 - 816: Old Grudges","paragraphs":["Words are powerless.","Only with a sword in hand can one have the power to speak.","The sharper the sword in hand, the more confident one is to speak.","Now, the surroundings of the cave are filled with Killing Formations set by Mo Hua, giving him more confidence to speak.","\"Come out.\"","Mo Hua said indifferently.","The person inside the cave, unaware of what exactly Mo Hua had set up outside, could faintly feel a sense of killing intent, along with a pressing sense of oppression.","\"Taoist friend, to tell you the truth, I am seriously injured, my legs are not convenient, it really is not easy for me to come out...\"","\"If you don’t mind, perhaps you could come into the cave for a chat?\"","Mo Hua scoffed coldly in his heart.","He definitely wouldn’t go in.","This person’s background is unclear, the dangers inside the cave are unknown, only a fool would rashly enter.","\"I won’t go in, you come out.\"","Mo Hua said firmly.","\"Taoist friend, I am indeed too severely injured to move freely, I ask for your understanding...\" The old voice from within the cave said with a hint of apology.","Mo Hua shook his head, coldly said:","\"I don’t listen to excuses, don’t listen to reasons, don’t listen to explanations. I give you five breaths’ time, with two choices: either you come out on your own in five breaths, or I will blow up the cave to force you out.\"","The person inside the cave heard these words, secretly filled with resentment.","\"To encounter such a stubborn ’old hand’ that nothing works on is really troublesome...\"","Outside the cave, Mo Hua had already started counting.","Counting down from five to one, regardless of who the cultivator inside the cave was, he was ready to blow it up.","Time is precious, he did not wish to waste it.","\"Five, four...\"","The person inside could feel Mo Hua’s decisiveness, his expression immediately changed, saying: \"Wait, Taoist friend, let’s talk about this...\"","\"Three...\"","\"Alright, alright, I’m coming out!\"","The old voice from inside the cave said repeatedly.","Only then did Mo Hua stop counting, while watching the cave warily, spiritual power circulating within him, a strand reaching his fingertips, ready to throw a fireball if things went south.","Two other strands of spiritual power circulated to his feet, ready to flee immediately if things went awry.","After a moment, rustling noises came from the cave, as if someone was standing up, followed by light footsteps accompanied by the sound of a bamboo stick hitting the ground.","The sound grew closer.","Within a few breaths, a figure appeared at the cave entrance.","Under the moonlight, Mo Hua roughly saw his appearance.","The person from inside the cave was an old man, short and skinny, his expression somewhat sullen under the moonlight, his gaze slightly fierce.","He was leaning on a bamboo stick, his breath unstable, his steps light and unsteady, evidently injured.","As Mo Hua looked at the old man, the old man also saw Mo Hua, besides the sullen expression, there was clear astonishment.","Although listening to the voice before made him feel that the cultivator outside the cave was not very old, seeing Mo Hua’s face in person was still somewhat unbelievable for the old man.","Someone who acts flawlessly and speaks without giving an inch, turns out to be such a tender-faced kid?","Moreover, judging from the cultivation aura, he was only in the Middle Phase of Foundation Building.","Even his spiritual power was weak, among the Middle Phase of Foundation Building, he was just in the lower-middle tier.","The old man couldn’t help feeling angry.","To think a dignified Golden Core cultivator, forced to such an extent by a junior foundation-builder, was really absurd!","The old man wanted to advance, but Mo Hua said: \"Alright, don’t move.\"","The old man halted his steps, looking around, only to realize he was seemingly standing right in the middle of layered Killing Formations, his eyelid twitched immediately.","High-level Second Grade Formation!","Within the Formation, there flowed a daunting killing intent.","The anger in the old man’s heart dissipated immediately, his demeanor softened as he said to Mo Hua, \"Alright.\"","Under the eaves, people have no choice but to bow their heads.","He didn’t know how this kid of the Middle Phase of Foundation Building had set up so many high-level Second Grade Killing Formations in such a short time.","But a Killing Formation is a Killing Formation.","The Formation won’t reason.","Even in a Third-Grade State Boundary, a Golden Core cultivator wouldn’t wish to be \"baptized\" by so many high-level Second Grade Killing Formations without cause.","Moreover, being in a Second Grade State Border, his cultivation was restricted.","And now, he was also severely injured, running for days like a candle flickering in the wind.","The old man looked gloomily, slightly raised his eyes, glanced at Mo Hua, and bowed, asking:","\"May I know this young friend’s esteemed surname, where do you inherit from, and who is your venerable master?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I ask, you answer!\"","Now that this old man was standing in the middle of his Killing Formation, the initiative was in his own hands, how could he give him the opportunity to ask questions?","The old man’s face twitched, nodded, and said: \"Alright.\"","\"What is your surname?\" Mo Hua asked.","The old man remained unchanged in expression, \"I am surnamed Zhao.\"","\"And your name?\"","\"A single character, ’Hai’.\"","\"You’re not from Qian Learning State Boundary?\" Mo Hua slightly narrowed his eyes and asked.","\"Young friend, you are correct,\" the old man replied, \"I am a cultivator of the Zhao family, a trifling Elder within my clan, south of the Chaoyun State Boundary, west of the Qian Learning State Boundary...\"","Zhao Hai, an elder of the third-grade Zhao family.","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","This old man was much like himself, fabricating lies effortlessly, no draft needed for his bragging.","He certainly was not named Zhao.","Nor was he called ’Zhao Hai’.","As for being south of Chaoyun State Boundary, an elder of the third-grade Zhao family, such far-fetched claims were just nonsensical fabrications which Mo Hua couldn’t immediately verify.","\"Elder Zhao.\" Mo Hua cupped his hands.","The old man returned the greeting, \"May I know the young friend’s esteemed surname, could you...\"","\"I haven’t finished asking yet.\" Mo Hua said.","The old man paused, had to bear with patience and said:","\"Please ask, young friend.\"","Mo Hua glanced at the old man who called himself \"Elder Zhao\", and asked: \"Who injured you?\"","The old man sighed, \"A group of passing Evil Cultivators, suddenly attacked me for some unknown reason, I was caught off guard, thus severely injured.\""]},{"number":1523,"title":"Chapter 1523 - 816: Old Grudges","paragraphs":["\"Oh.\" Mo Hua nodded, indifferent, and asked again:","\"Why teach...\"","Mo Hua paused, not mentioning the names Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi, pretending not to know them, and said, \"Why teach those two children cultivation techniques and spells?\"","\"Young friend, do you know those two children?\" the old man asked in confusion.","Mo Hua looked at him silently, without speaking.","The implication was, I ask, you answer, you’re not in a position to ask questions.","The old man’s eyelids twitched slightly, then he sighed heavily, reminiscing:","\"I was healing in this cave, and these two children, with sincere hearts, brought me food and water. Such character is rare. I thought I would pass on some of my Zhao Family’s heritage to them, as a way to settle cause and effect and form a good connection.\"","Mo Hua nodded, but thought to himself:","More nonsense...","Poor kids never have a full stomach, and if they have anything, they’d eat it themselves. How could they have leftovers for you?","As for cause and effect and good connections, that’s utter nonsense.","Do you even know what cause and effect are? What good connections are?","The old man scrutinized Mo Hua’s expression, unsure if he believed him or not, and softly asked:","\"I’ve answered your questions, young friend, might I...\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Since you’ve said so, I won’t make it difficult for you. I will remove these formations.\"","The old man sighed in relief and turned to return to the cave.","Mo Hua watched him, suddenly his eyes sharpened, and he said in a deep voice:","\"You are from the Water Prison Sect!\"","The words \"Water Prison Sect\" made the old man’s pupils dilate and his fingers imperceptibly flicked. Three water needles, from extremely tricky angles, swiftly attacked Mo Hua.","Mo Hua had already sensed the killing intent.","This old thing had murder in his heart from the start.","At the moment the old man attacked, Mo Hua used the Water Passing Step, with agile steps, sidestepping this vicious attack.","What a nimble movement technique!","The old man, seeing his long-prepared strike failed, then flickered and aimed to pounce again.","However, Mo Hua pointed from afar, water qi condensed, and a cage descended, binding the old man tightly.","Yet in the next moment, a blue light flashed on the old man, water force circulated, and he easily broke free from Mo Hua’s Water Prison Technique.","After breaking free from the Water Prison Technique, the old man’s expression trembled:","Water Prison Technique?!","And, it was cultivated to such a proficient level.","He looked at Mo Hua incredulously, asking, \"Who exactly are you?\"","After landing, Mo Hua stood firm, calmly said:","\"You are indeed from the Water Prison Sect...\"","The Water Prison Technique is from the Water Prison Sect, the ultimate technique of the Water Prison Sect.","So far, only two people couldn’t be trapped.","One is the Water Yama, and the other is this old man.","Water Yama must be related to the Water Prison Sect.","And this old man, it seems, must be a descendant of the Water Prison Sect as well.","The old man stared intensely at Mo Hua, his expression fluctuating, unable to discern if Mo Hua was a foe or friend.","\"A true man senior from my sect once saved a descendant of the Yu Family, receiving their gift of a secret manual of the Water Prison Technique, so I learned this spell as well.\"","Mo Hua explained concisely.","The old man, hearing the words \"true man senior,\" felt a chill in his heart.","True Man, the title of Feather Transformation.","If the sect has a true man senior, then this kid’s background may not be small.","Even if it’s not a top Great Sect, it’s at least of the Qian Learning Hundred Gates level.","The Water Prison Sect was once prominent, but that was a thousand years ago, and now it’s in decline, completely incomparable.","The old man’s attitude toward Mo Hua became more respectful.","\"Since there’s such an origin, it was my blunder earlier, I apologize for my rash action, please forgive me, young brother. However...\"","The old man’s expression became solemn, \"Please, young brother, do not pursue the matters of the Water Prison Sect any further. This affair involves too much, it’s not something you can meddle in.\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow, \"Is someone hunting you?\"","The old man’s expression darkened, \"I said, please, young brother, do not...\"","\"I can help you,\" Mo Hua said.","\"Help me?\" the old man was stunned, then his expression turned unsightly, \"Do you know how deep this water is?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"I know a bit.\"","The old man sneered.","A naive child, unaware of the vastness of the heavens, does he really think he can get entangled in the past of the Water Prison Sect?","Rash interference could lead to an unmarked grave.","Mo Hua said, \"In my sect, there’s the Heaven Void Ancestor, true man senior, and many Golden Core Elders, all with close ties to me.\"","\"In the family circles, I have acquaintances, and among the Taoist Court officials, I have friends.\"","\"If you tell me what happened, perhaps I can help you. But if you don’t...\"","Mo Hua looked at the old man’s forehead where a faint black line swirled, and confidently said, \"You might not live past two months!\"","The old man was completely intimidated by Mo Hua.","He didn’t expect that the young cultivator before him would have such a vast network.","Most importantly, when he spoke, he exuded an aura of calm and ease.","If he didn’t really have the ability or network, he wouldn’t dare to boast like that.","This kid could likely be a scion of a great family, a disciple of a great sect...","Not someone to offend.","Moreover, the young man wasn’t wrong.","The old man knew that if he continued to hide, it wouldn’t be long before he was cornered.","And his lifelong wish was far from being fulfilled...","The old man’s expression was conflicted, finally he sighed, \"Alright, young friend, whatever you want to know, just ask, I will tell you everything I know.\"","\"If afterwards you are willing to help, that would be best; but if not, please leave safely and do not reveal my whereabouts.\"","\"Alright!\" Mo Hua nodded."]},{"number":1524,"title":"Chapter 1524 - 816: Old Grudges","paragraphs":["This old man, although he resorts to underhanded tactics, is barely considered honest.","\"Your surname isn’t Zhao, is it?\" Mo Hua asked.","The old man clasped his fists, \"I hope you understand, little friend, that such a chance encounter naturally wouldn’t allow me to reveal my real name.\"","\"Is your surname also Yu?\"","The old man was silent for a moment, then nodded, \"Yes, my surname is Yu, and my name is Yu Canghai.\"","\"Yu Canghai...\"","Mo Hua silently memorized the name, then asked, \"Who is pursuing you?\"","The old man sighed, a look of gnashing hatred appeared on his face, \"It’s... the Gui Water Sect...\"","\"The Gui Water Sect?\"","Mo Hua was slightly taken aback.","He hadn’t expected that the Gui Water Sect was involved in this matter.","But something was amiss...","Mo Hua frowned, \"Did you see with your own eyes, the disciples of the Gui Water Sect pursuing you?\"","The old man shook his head, \"The Gui Water Sect won’t act directly. They hide in the shadows, while those who actually hunt me down are mercenary evil cultivators they hired.\"","Mo Hua’s pupils constricted slightly, \"Do you have any evidence?\"","The old man sneered, \"What need is there for evidence? The current high-ranking officials of the Gui Water Sect are the same traitors who betrayed the Water Prison Sect back then. They defected to the Taoist Court, and after the Water Prison Sect was destroyed, they stole its legacy, altered its name, and replaced ’Water Prison Sect’, becoming the current Gui Water Sect, one of the Twelve Streams!\"","\"There is a blood feud between the Gui Water Sect and our Water Prison Sect! To cover up their disgraceful deeds of the past, these bastards from the Gui Water Sect want nothing more than to eradicate the descendants of the Water Prison Sect!\"","Mo Hua’s expression remained calm, but his heart was shaken.","He hadn’t known that there was such a history between the Gui Water Sect and the Water Prison Sect.","Then it could be said that the matter of the Yu Family Water Village also had the Gui Water Sect’s involvement?","Mo Hua silently reflected:","\"The relationships between family sects are indeed intricate and complex; without delving into them personally, one wouldn’t know there are so many entanglements.\"","Then Mo Hua frowned again, \"When the Water Prison Sect was destroyed a thousand years ago, the rumor was... your entire sect had fallen into demonhood, is there any truth to this?\"","The old man said firmly, \"It’s naturally impossible; it’s a frame-up, a slander!\"","The old man’s tone was full of certainty.","But when Mo Hua asked what exactly had happened.","The old man faltered and couldn’t explain clearly.","Mo Hua roughly understood.","He probably didn’t know either, but was simply defending his sect’s honor with the belief that \"his sect must be innocent.\"","After all, it was events from over a thousand years ago, and as a Golden Core, he couldn’t have lived that long, let alone know it clearly.","\"Then if the Water Prison Sect was destroyed, wasn’t everyone supposed to be imprisoned? How come there are still descendants?\"","Mo Hua asked curiously.","The old man sighed, \"When a tree falls, the monkeys scatter. A sect is expansive, with many elders, disciples, and in-laws married into various families, it’s deeply entangled, and it’s impossible to completely clear out.\"","\"It simply means capturing and killing the main Sect Leader, Elders, and some disciples from the Inner Gate to make a show of it.\"","\"Many other cultivators with even slight familial connections would give some bribes, seek favors, and even the Taoist Court would turn a blind eye and not really pursue the matter.\"","\"Some cultivators from our Yu Family survived using this chance...\"","The old man looked forlorn, \"But still, we could only run as exiles, hiding our identities, not daring to return to Qian State...\"","Mo Hua asked, \"Then why did you come back?\"","\"Because...\" the old man’s expression was covered with a layer of sorrow and bitterness, \"Most of us have died...\"","\"Living a life of wandering outside wasn’t easy, and after facing a major disaster, almost none of the Yu Family bloodline remains...\"","\"Seeing the bloodline about to be cut off, the Taoist inheritance of the Water Prison Sect left without anyone to pass it on, I had no other choice but to take the risk and return to Qian State, trying to find any descendants of the Yu Family we might have overlooked from the past.\"","\"Fate was kind, and I did find them...\"","The old man’s expression was not one of relief, but was instead covered with a deeper pain.","Mo Hua’s pupils constricted.","The words \"Yu Family Water Village\" came to mind once again.","He then looked at the old man with a hint of unwillingness and sympathy in his gaze.","From this, Mo Hua could roughly deduce what happened next.","The old man found the Yu Family Water Village, but in doing so, also revealed the fact that the Yu Family Water Village were descendants of the Water Prison Sect.","This fact, perhaps even the people of the Yu Family Water Village didn’t know themselves.","Otherwise, some of their ancestral water system dao laws wouldn’t have disappeared without a trace.","And this old man, he found descendants of the Yu Family, found relatives connected by blood.","But it was also because of him that...","The Yu Family Water Village was wiped out.","The old man looked grim and despondent.","He clearly knew what he had done.","He had intended to pass on the Taoist inheritance, but ended up experiencing an even more total annihilation.","The struggle for the Taoist inheritance is cold and ruthless.","The old man, stricken with grief, spat out a mouthful of blood.","Mo Hua took out a pill and handed it to him, \"Is this also the work of the Gui Water Sect?\"","The old man accepted Mo Hua’s pill but didn’t take it. Instead, he gritted his teeth and said:","\"It must be the Gui Water Sect!\"","\"It must be these bastards!\"","\"One day, I will make them pay with blood, make them die without a burial place, use their flesh to honor the ancestors of my Water Prison Sect!\"","Mo Hua remained silent.","The old man’s words sounded a bit like those of a demon cultivator.","But if one hasn’t suffered another’s plight, they shouldn’t persuade others to be kind.","If he himself fell to such a situation, he was afraid he would be even more vicious than him.","\"You haven’t told the Taoist Court officials about this matter?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Unexpectedly, upon hearing this, the old man suddenly wore a hideous expression, with a mocking look, as he coldly laughed like a night owl:","\"Can you guess... why the Gui Water Sect could know my identity? Why they could track my whereabouts? Why they could silently wipe out the entire Yu Family Water Village?\"","Mo Hua’s pupils trembled, his heart chilled.","\"You’re saying...\"","The old man sneered, \"When it comes to filth, the dirtiest place in the world is probably the Taoist Court officials...\""]},{"number":1525,"title":"Chapter 1525 - 817: Pursuit and Assassination","paragraphs":["\"Daoist Court...\"","Mo Hua’s expression was solemn as he murmured, \"So, according to you, it was Gui Water Sect colluding with the Daoist Court, secretly targeting you?\"","\"That’s right.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"How do you know about these things?\"","Gui Water Sect alone is insignificant.","The Daoist Court is deep and turbulent; even if there are some sordid collusions internally, it’s not something a \"dog of a fallen family\" like the descendant of the Water Prison Sect would know about.","The old man sneered, \"Don’t forget, what my Water Prison Sect originates from. The ’Prison’ in Water ’Prison’ Sect is derived from ’Daoist Prison.’ All cultivators from my Water Prison Sect have held positions in the Daoist Court, specializing in pursuits, administrating punishments, even being used as the Daoist Court’s dog in secret, doing all the dirty work. How could I not know of the filth within the Daoist Court?\"","\"Moreover, Gui Water Sect is the ’possession’ of Water Prison Sect’s ’borrowed corpse to resurrect the soul,’ colluding with the Daoist Court is all too normal.\"","\"I was pursued, and the descendants of the Yu Family were exterminated. These events, though seemingly devoid of the Daoist Court’s involvement, are in the eyes of a seasoned insider like me, filled with traces of the Daoist Court.\"","Mo Hua said, \"The situation within the Daoist Court is also very complex, mixing cultivators from different families and sects, not to be generalized.\"","The old man said, \"The Daoist Court is a huge vat of dye; once you step in, you’ll be dyed sooner or later. Does your previous color even matter?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","The old man looked at Mo Hua, sighed deeply, and sincerely said:","\"Young brother, although you are clever, meticulous in action, and your means are even superior to some old cultivators who’ve dwelled in the cultivation world for years, yet you’re still young, have seen too little, unaware of the true treachery of human hearts.\"","\"In this world, lust entices, wealth corrupts, and power—the corrosion of human hearts—is the most severe.\"","\"The Daoist Court holds power, controlling life and death, inheriting through generations, which inevitably breeds corruption, an immutable truth.\"","\"Moreover, the Daoist Court has already spanned two thousand years; this time is ample for nurturing mere pests into enormous brutes.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze condensed slightly, \"In the Daoist Court, there are also pure streams, right...\"","The old man laughed mockingly, \"Is it genuinely pure or falsely pure, who can tell? Even the purest water, once flowing into the dye vat, changes its color. If you wish not to be colored, how many wish for your demise... \"","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","The old man looked at Mo Hua, complexly sighed:","\"I’ve said all I can; the decision lies with the young friend now. I won’t expect assistance, merely hope you keep your promise not to disclose my whereabouts. Otherwise, causing disaster, severing Water Prison Sect’s Taoist inheritance, I would die restless, even if I become a fierce ghost, I’ll demand an explanation from you...\"","No matter what fierce ghost you become, I’m not afraid at all...","Mo Hua silently thought, but he pondered for a moment and still said:","\"This burden is a bit too heavy; involves both Gui Water Sect and the Daoist Court, I might not be able to handle it. I’ll try to help you as much as possible, but ultimately, whether I can help is uncertain. As for your whereabouts, rest assured, I won’t disclose it to outsiders.\"","The old man looked grateful, \"In that case, many thanks, young friend.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"There’s one more thing...\"","His expression turned slightly cold, \"Those two children just now are also descendants of the Yu Family, right? Passing down Water Prison Sect’s cultivation technique to them, are you not afraid of Gui Water Sect discovering and exterminating the entire village?\"","The old man’s expression stalled.","He had deliberately concealed this beforehand, not wanting to expose the identities of Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi.","Yet unaware, the youth cultivator before him already knew everything.","The old man appeared bitter and sighed:","\"I truly... have no choice...\"","\"Passing it on may result in their deaths. But if not passed, upon my death, the entire Water Prison Sect’s inheritance ends completely. How can I face the ancestors... \"","The old man’s emotions surged, his face briefly turned pale, followed by fierce coughing, spitting blood from the corner of his mouth.","Mo Hua shook his head, not blaming him.","\"Rest well, if you’d like, I’ll find a ride tomorrow to take you somewhere to recover.\"","The old man cupped his hands, calmly said: \"Sorry to trouble you, young friend.\"","\"I won’t disturb you anymore.\" Mo Hua turned to leave but was suddenly called back by the old man, \"Young friend...\"","He turned his head, examining the cave surrounded densely by the Killing Formation, his scalp slightly numbing, \"These formations...\"","\"Oh, it’s okay, I won’t kill you.\" Mo Hua said.","\"It’s not that...\" the old man’s head was aching.","At least dismantle them.","The cave is filled to the brim with Killing Formation, akin to having explosives inside; slightest touch might explode, making it impossible for him to sleep?","Mo Hua ignored him, turned and walked away.","If dismantle, let him do it himself.","Spending so much effort drawing the formations, they haven’t been used, how could he bear to dismantle them?","Of course, mainly because he was lazy.","Anyway, the Killing Formation isn’t placed at his own doorstep.","The old man in front of the cave watched Mo Hua gradually drift away without a care and helplessly shook his head.","This little cultivator truly was a bit ’rogue.’","The night was deep, the moonlight desolate, with nowhere to shelter on the desolate mountain.","The old man could only sigh bitterly and return to the cave.","After all, it’s just one last night...","...","Leaving the desolate mountain, Mo Hua returned to the small fishing village, ensuring Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi had returned home safely and were asleep soundly, then he finally felt relieved.","But this isn’t a solution.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then took out a letter token and transmitted to Gu Changhuai: \"Uncle Gu, there’s something very important...\"","Moments later, Gu Changhuai responded displeased:"]},{"number":1526,"title":"Chapter 1526 - 817: Pursuit (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"What hour is it, and you’re still not asleep?\"","Mo Hua looked up, realizing the sky was very dark, it was well past midnight, probably already 2 a.m.","It seems it’s a bit late...","However, Mo Hua said, \"Uncle Gu, you’re not asleep either?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"The Taoist Court is quite busy...\"","Mo Hua: \"Weren’t you ’sidelined’?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"...\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, suddenly realizing, \"Uncle Gu, you’re... not courting that Instructor Hua and developed feelings, so you can neither eat nor sleep, right?\"","\"What nonsense are you spouting?!\"","Gu Changhuai was so angry his teeth itched.","If Mo Hua were in front of him, he would have tugged his ear off.","\"The Taoist Court has a new Supervisor, kind of troublesome, lots of things to handle...\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"New Supervisor?\" Mo Hua was startled, \"Who is it?\"","Gu Changhuai was speechless, \"Telling you wouldn’t help, also, don’t snoop around about the Taoist Court’s matters.\"","\"Oh.\"","Gu Changhuai continued, \"It’s so late, what do you need me for?\"","Mo Hua was about to speak but suddenly recalled the words of the elder from the Water Prison Sect named \"Yu Canghai\", and felt a slight chill in his heart, asking:","\"Uncle Gu, is the Gu Family considered ’upright’?\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, thought for a moment, and slowly said:","\"I don’t like those two words ’upright’. Cultivators of the Taoist Court ought to follow the Taoist Law, seek truth from facts, arrest who needs arresting, kill who needs killing, act impartially, no such thing as being upright or not.\"","\"However, in the eyes of others, our Gu Family seems indeed viewed as ’upright’...\"","Mo Hua nodded, his heart understood, and then he began to speak:","\"I encountered someone related to the Yu Family’s Water Fort. He said the Yu Family’s Water Fort was annihilated by Evil Cultivators incited by the Gui Water Sect.\"","\"Moreover, this person is also a descendant of the Water Prison Sect...\"","It was deep into the night; Gu Changhuai had been busy all day, initially looking tired, but upon hearing this, his expression immediately shook.","\"Really?\"","Mo Hua was speechless, \"When have I ever lied to you?\"","You’ve lied to me plenty.","Gu Changhuai thought inwardly.","But now wasn’t the time for idle chatter, Gu Changhuai then asked, \"Where are you now?\"","Mo Hua: \"I’m in the small fishing village.\"","\"The small fishing village by the Mistwater River?\" Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Why are you there?\"","\"It’s a long story, I’ll explain more when we meet.\" Mo Hua said.","The Letter Token is too slow to explain it.","Moreover, he still needed to consider what can and cannot be said.","\"Alright!\" Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment then said, \"I’m currently at the Taoist Court in Qianxue State Boundary and can’t leave right now, I’ll come and find you after handling the matters in hand tomorrow morning.\"","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua nodded.","After the conversation, Mo Hua put away the Letter Token, crouched on a big tree at the village entrance, and pondered alone.","This matter is too significant, involving many influential bodies.","Going it alone and fishing in troubled waters might be fine, but to hold it down, he didn’t have the capability yet.","Even to ensure the well-being of that Water Prison Sect elder exceeded his capabilities.","Thinking it over, he could only rely on Uncle Gu.","But there was a problem.","Mo Hua himself trusted Uncle Gu very much.","Though he had a bad temper, a sour face, his words were sometimes harsh, and he wasn’t gentle or considerate, but he was indeed a good person.","However, that old man from the Water Prison Sect, perhaps not.","He was very wary of the cultivators from the Taoist Court; if he knew of Uncle Gu’s identity as a Supervisor of the Taoist Court, he might not want to cooperate.","\"Forget it, we’ll talk about it when the time comes...\"","Mo Hua thought to himself.","Besides, that old man might not be a good person either, and not everything he said might be true.","When the time comes, having Uncle Gu’s presence as a Golden Core Steward might yield more information.","Afterward, Mo Hua started meditating, immersing his Divine Sense into his Sea of Consciousness, seizing the time to practice Formation on the Taoist Stele.","Now, with his Divine Sense at Nineteen Patterns, he could learn more Formations, so every moment had to be fully utilized.","Only by learning more Formations and honing his Divine Sense to the extreme would he have access to more Formations in the future.","Until dawn, with the eastern light breaking.","Mo Hua opened his eyes, exhaled a long breath, and stretched.","Then, seizing the moment of morning light, with the purple qi coming from the east, Mo Hua took out the Spirit Stone, cultivated for a while, and began waiting for Gu Changhuai.","In the small fishing village, the Fish Cultivators also got up one after another, starting their industrious day.","Mo Hua sat tall in the tree, waited for a while, feeling inexplicably anxious, then used the Letter Token to ask:","\"Uncle Gu, when are you coming over?\"","No response from the other side.","After a long while, Gu Changhuai finally replied, seemingly a bit helpless: \"The new Supervisor is rather tricky, I can’t come right now, but I’ll be there in four hours.\"","\"Alright, remember to hire a bigger carriage.\" Mo Hua said.","\"Okay.\"","After that, Mo Hua could only patiently continue waiting.","But as he waited, he suddenly realized a problem:","The old man from the Water Prison Sect, might he have escaped?","Meeting by chance, no ties whatsoever, though he shared so many past stories, it didn’t mean he truly trusted him.","\"Better go and check...\"","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","He didn’t delay, directly stood up, and followed the path Little Shunzi and Little Shuizi took last night, going to the Desolate Mountain, and lightly climbed up the cliff.","Upon reaching the cave entrance, the dense Killing Formation was still there.","But with a sweep of his Divine Sense, Mo Hua found the cave inside was empty, not a trace of anyone.","\"He’s gone...\"","Mo Hua sighed.","But thinking about it, it wasn’t too surprising either.","That Water Prison Sect elder, whose clan was destroyed, being hunted down, with enemies everywhere, it wouldn’t be easy for him to trust anyone.","It was just that his forehead was dark, a Death Omen looming, and this escape might truly be the end for him."]},{"number":1527,"title":"Chapter 1527 - 817: Pursuit and Kill_3","paragraphs":["\"To pursue?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then decided against it.","Since he didn’t trust himself, he couldn’t be bothered to meddle further and save him.","One must respect others’ fate.","Those who should die must die.","Mo Hua intended to leave, but halfway through, he suddenly furrowed his brows.","\"Something’s wrong...\"","Mo Hua turned around, released his Divine Sense, and scanned the surroundings. His gaze tightened, \"Someone else has been here...\"","There were traces of flattened grass, footprints of multiple people.","Nearby lingered mixed traces of Spiritual Power, faint, involving the Five Elements, but with an excess of cool Water Spiritual Power.","This was the aura of people.","Mo Hua’s Divine Sense sublimated, reaching near deity-like Divine Thought, making him very sensitive to such aura.","He walked to the cave entrance.","Despite the daylight, the cave was still dark.","Mo Hua hesitated for a while, but did not rush in recklessly. Instead, he took out a Little Tiger, letting it scouted the way. Seeing no activation of killing intent, he quietly went into the cave.","The cave was narrow, with worn-out walls.","Inside the cave, there were bloodstains, some damaged Spiritual Artifacts, empty pill bottles, clothes stained with blood, and so forth...","The old man had already left.","Going by the traces, he left in a hurry, seeming to realize someone was coming to kill him, so he had to leave earlier.","\"The pursuers have arrived?\"","Mo Hua’s expression shifted slightly, gaze suddenly deepening, pupils blackened, as Cause and Effect patterns emerged.","Moments later, he performed a Concealment Technique, hid his figure, left the cave, and followed a direction deeper into the mountain.","This mountain was a Desolate Mountain, with only some weeds and trees, no Monster Beasts, nor any other minerals.","Nearby Fish Cultivators lived by fishing, rarely entering the mountains.","The deeper he went, the more desolate it became.","But precisely due to its desolation, human’s Spiritual Power aura and Cause and Effect aura became more distinct.","Mo Hua followed the aura, kept walking into the mountains, not knowing how long he walked, suddenly hearing disturbances ahead.","Approaching, Mo Hua saw seven or eight cultivators besieging an old man.","The old man was Yu Canghai from the Water Prison Sect.","Besides him, seven or eight were dressed differently but all masked, full of killing intent, cultivation between Foundation Establishment Late Stage and Foundation Establishment Peak.","They weren’t fighting head-on, instead using a war of attrition, intending to exhaust the Water Prison Sect’s old man until he ran out of steam.","Yu Canghai was already severely injured, being besieged by several, consuming continuously, his face turning paper-white.","Among the seven or eight cultivators, the leader shouted:","\"Old bastard, you’re facing death, why not surrender early and avoid unnecessary suffering.\"","Yu Canghai’s aura was unstable, voice trembling, but still angrily replied:","\"A bunch of wretches, even if I die today, I’ll drag you down with me.\"","His Spiritual Power surged, Water Spiritual Power condensed into water needles, shooting outward.","Seeing him serious, the seven or eight cultivators immediately retreated, not confronting him directly, instead waiting until his Spiritual Power weakened before swarming back like mad dogs.","Even a fierce tiger fears packs of wolves tearing.","Not to mention this fierce tiger was severely wounded.","He was merely relying on his Golden Core foundation, barely holding on.","But clearly, he couldn’t hold on much longer.","Yu Canghai’s face showed despair, inner cold, thinking whether my Water Prison Sect’s Taoist inheritance would be cut off here...","At that moment, a clear voice of a young cultivator came from the side:","\"Senior!\"","There was a brief silence.","The combatants all stopped and looked towards the sound, seeing Mo Hua ’nervous’.","Mo Hua’s expression was determined, saying: \"Senior, I will properly pass on the Water Prison Sect’s lineage, not disappointing Senior’s expectations!\"","Finishing, he ’painfully’ turned and ran away.","Everyone was momentarily stunned.","Yu Canghai also paused, then understood, this young man was drawing fire away for him.","Indeed, those seven or eight masked cultivators appeared shocked.","\"Big Brother, what now?\"","\"How was there a slip through?\"","\"He’s running!\"","The leading masked cultivator angrily said:","\"Split up, three of you chase that kid, the rest follow me to hold off this old man, leave no survivors!\"","\"Yes!\"","Among them, a masked cultivator with sinister eyes said: \"I’ll go too, I’m experienced in pursuit, this brat can’t escape my grasp.\"","The leader hesitated briefly, then nodded.","Thus, four from the group chased Mo Hua.","The remaining four continued besieging Yu Canghai.","Yu Canghai’s pressure decreased sharply, but at the same time, his heart sank.","\"That kid is only Foundation Building Middle Stage, chased by four Foundation Establishment Late Stage killers, not knowing if he’ll escape...\"","Though it’s meant to draw attention, it’s too reckless ultimately...","Yu Canghai thought with a sigh.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua indeed did not ’escape’.","He was tightly pursued by four Foundation Establishment Late Stage killers, making a big loop through the forest.","\"Kid, stop running!\"","\"Keep running, I’ll break your legs, leave you no way to live or die!\"","Mo Hua looked ’panicked’, his silhouette fleeing hastily.","After some time, Mo Hua suddenly took a detour to the mountainside, returning to the cave Yu Canghai previously hid in.","He seemed ’panic-stricken’, diving headlong into the cave.","His pursuers hesitated briefly, stopping.","\"There’s a Formation outside the cave.\"","\"Do we go in?\"","Three of them looked at the sinister-eyed cultivator, clearly deferring to his decision.","The sinister-eyed cultivator pondered briefly and said coldly:","\"The Formation outside the cave must be set up by that old Yu Canghai.\""]},{"number":1528,"title":"Chapter 1528 - 817: Pursuit and Slaughter (Part 4)","paragraphs":["\"This little imp, at such an age, what could he know about Formations?\"","\"But if by any chance...\" someone hesitated.","\"No worries,\" said the Cultivator with a sinister gaze, glancing at the surrounding Formation, calmly remarked, \"These Formations should be a Killing Formation. If it explodes, that little imp will certainly die as well. Even if he somehow can control these Formations, he wouldn’t have the guts to go down with us.\"","The others nodded in agreement.","\"There’s no time to waste, let’s go in early to ’catch the turtle in the jar’ and capture that little imp, and then use him to threaten that old fool.\"","\"Capture both of them and torment them to death, and the Water Prison Sect will be completely cut off.\"","The Cultivator with the sinister gaze sneered.","Then the four formed a formation and walked towards the cave side by side.","But upon entering the cave, they found there wasn’t a single figure inside.","\"What’s going on...\"","\"Where are the people?\"","The Cultivator with the sinister gaze frowned and pondered. Suddenly, he felt a sense of unease and swiftly turned to look outside the cave.","Only then did they realize that the young Cultivator they were chasing earlier was already standing outside the cave with a smile, looking completely calm without the earlier panic.","Mo Hua had only pretended to enter the cave.","When he first entered the cave’s entrance, he quietly used a Concealment Technique and exited, fooling the four into going inside.","\"Not good, we’ve been tricked!\"","The four were suddenly alarmed, desperately trying to run outside.","But Mo Hua wouldn’t give them a chance.","Before the four could move, Mo Hua outside the cave softly said:","\"Explode!\"","The densely packed second-grade High-level Killing Array suddenly exploded, with flames scattering and Golden Blades slashing, the ground exuded killing intent.","Amidst the booming sound, the Killing Formation was activated.","The surging Spiritual Power intertwined and trembled, shattering the cave and slaughtering these four masked Cultivators entirely!","With so many High-Rank Killing Formations, even Golden Core Realm’s Yu Canghai felt a faint fear, let alone these Late-stage Foundation Establishment Cultivators.","Mo Hua nodded in satisfaction.","In this way, the Killing Formations he had drawn came into play and were not wasted.","Waste is disgraceful.","After all, he had painstakingly spent Spiritual Ink and Spirit Stones, consuming Divine Thought to draw the Formations; it would be too wasteful not to use them.","Having dealt with the four, Mo Hua retraced his steps to find Yu Canghai.","Upon reaching the deep mountains, he found that the four attacking Yu Canghai had turned into three.","There was another person lying on the ground, with a cold expression, seemingly poisoned by Water Poison, barely breathing.","Mo Hua was a bit surprised.","Indeed, a skinny camel is bigger than a horse.","This Yu Canghai is still quite formidable.","Upon seeing Mo Hua return, not only Yu Canghai but also the remaining three assassins were greatly astonished.","\"Little imp, how did you escape?\"","The leading Cultivator said in a deep voice.","Mo Hua smiled gently, \"Killed those chasing me, and naturally, I escaped.\"","Upon these words, the Cultivators present all changed their expressions.","But Mo Hua didn’t waste time talking to them and already began preparing to conjure Fireballs.","About 30 minutes later, the remaining three were also dead.","In a two-against-three situation, under the joint efforts of Mo Hua and Yu Canghai, without a numbers advantage, these three Foundation Building Cultivators were like lambs to the slaughter, with no power to resist at all.","As such, all eight assassins were wiped out.","Several bodies lay strewn on the ground.","Yu Canghai looked at Mo Hua with astonishment and a tremor in his heart.","This young boy, what divine being is he? Clearly only in the Foundation Building Middle Stage, he doesn’t seem strong, yet he can effortlessly kill Late-stage Foundation Establishment Cultivators...","Mo Hua remained unaffected, saying to Yu Canghai, \"You sit and meditate to heal your wounds.\"","He thought it would be a waste if the person died after being saved.","Yu Canghai sighed, cupped his hands, and said:","\"Thank you!\"","This \"thank you\" was much more heartfelt.","Afterwards, Yu Canghai began meditating while Mo Hua started \"searching the bodies.\"","However, he didn’t find anything valuable on the bodies of the four deceased, with the Storage Bag containing only some spare Spirit Stones and Pills.","Mo Hua was somewhat disappointed.","\"Quite cautious...\"","He thought for a moment and remembered there were also four masked Cultivators he had blown up at the cave.","Once Yu Canghai had healed somewhat, Mo Hua returned with him to the cave.","The cave was blown to pieces, with traces of the Formation all around.","Yu Canghai only then realized Mo Hua hadn’t lied, and indeed, the other four also died at his hands, causing a chill to rise in his heart.","Truly, people cannot be judged by their appearances.","The more naive-looking, the more ruthless in killing.","Mo Hua paused to think and pointed at the cave, saying to Yu Canghai:","\"Senior, help me dig out those four.\"","Yu Canghai didn’t know what Mo Hua intended but followed his instructions and started digging the stones.","Though wounded, after resting for a while, it wasn’t difficult to dig out some stones.","In less than an hour, four bodies were dug out and placed in a neat row.","Mo Hua uncovered their masks, finding he didn’t recognize any of them.","Moreover, the faces of these four were mostly destroyed by the Formation, making it even harder to identify them.","Mo Hua began searching their bodies.","After a while, the search yielded little gain.","Seemingly to act low-key, these people traveled light, with the Storage Bag containing only some simple Pills and Spiritual Artifacts, along with scattered Spirit Stones.","\"No clues...\"","Mo Hua shook his head and sighed.","But still somewhat unwilling, based on his experience with the Tao Court and dealing with Sin Cultivators for so long, he began to gather Divine Sense, conducting a meticulous search from head to toe...","Sure enough, after a period, Mo Hua discovered something unusual.","Among the four, one person’s tooth had a distinctly different material.","\"Tooth!\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened.","From his dealings with Sin Cultivators, he remembered some would break their teeth and re-embed a \"Storage Box\" shaped like a tooth.","This Storage Box was very small, only able to hold items the size of a palm, but it was indeed very concealed.","If not for his extensive experience in chasing Sin Cultivators, he wouldn’t notice at all.","Mo Hua extracted the person’s tooth and, using Divine Sense, pulled out an item from within.","It was a Token.","And the design was very familiar.","Furrowing his brow, Mo Hua examined it for a moment before suddenly recognizing it as a Taoist Court’s Enforcement Leader’s Command Token!","Having worked with Gu Changhuai for so long, Mo Hua recognized most Tokens from the Taoist Court.","The low-level ones, like his \"extra-official\" Bronze waist tag, the slightly higher ones, like Gu Changhuai’s Tribunal Command Token.","The most common were in the Taoist Court, the type of \"Enforcement Leader Command\" worn by Court Officials.","Gu An and Gu Quan carried this kind.","Mo Hua felt a slight heaviness in his heart, flipped the Enforcement Leader Command over, glanced at it, and his pupils constricted slightly.","On the back of the Enforcement Leader Command was carved a word:","\"Xiao!\"","Taoist Court Xiao family!","This person who was blown up was an Enforcement Leader from the Taoist Court’s Xiao family?!","Mo Hua remained silent for a moment, growing increasingly uneasy in his heart.","He thought for a moment, took out a Letter Token, and silently sent a message to Gu Changhuai: \"Uncle Gu, hurry and come...\"","Moments later, Gu Changhuai replied:","\"What’s wrong?\"","Mo Hua: \"I seem to have... blown up an Enforcement Leader from the Xiao family...\"","In the Qianxue Court Tribunal, seeing these words, Gu Changhuai’s heart suddenly shuddered, and his right hand gripped with force, nearly crushing the Letter Token."]},{"number":1529,"title":"Chapter 1529 - 818: Water Prison Legacy","paragraphs":["Two hours ago, everything was fine.","In the blink of an eye, he blew up an enforcement leader of the Taoist Court from the Xiao family?!","Gu Changhuai took a sharp breath.","This little brat!","When it comes to causing trouble, he truly defies the heavens!","The entire Taixu Gate, when counting all the disciples together, probably can’t compare to him.","\"What happened?\" Gu Changhuai asked urgently.","Mo Hua: \"I...\"","\"Never mind, don’t say anything yet. The Letter Token says it’s not safe...\" Gu Changhuai said.","Ever since he saw Mo Hua effortlessly restoring the erased text in the Letter Token, he never fully trusted the confidentiality of the Letter Token.","Even if it is a secret-made Letter Token by the Taoist Court.","\"Does anyone else know?\"","\"Not yet.\" Mo Hua replied.","Yu Canghai counts as an insider, not an \"other\" person.","As for those masked cultivators, they are all dead, so they are naturally no longer \"people\".","Gu Changhuai sighed in relief, \"Stay where you are, conceal yourself a bit, don’t let others find out. I shouldn’t need to teach you this.\"","\"Mm-hmm, I understand.\" Mo Hua said.","Putting away the Letter Token, Gu Changhuai, anxious at heart, was eager to leave, only to be called by a gentle voice.","\"Supervisor Gu, where are you going?\"","Gu Changhuai turned his head and saw Master Xiao squinting with a smile on his face.","This Master Xiao is a real powerholder amongst the Xiao family in the Qianxue Court Tribunal, having held the position for over one hundred and fifty years.","He always wears a smile, yet he’s insincere; he smiles with his face but not with his heart.","Originally, Gu Changhuai thought nothing of it.","But ever since Mo Hua secretly gave him the nickname \"Smiling Tiger\" after seeing Master Xiao once,","every time Gu Changhuai sees Master Xiao, those three words \"Smiling Tiger\" involuntarily conjure in his heart.","\"Smi...Master Xiao,\" Gu Changhuai’s brow twitched slightly, almost saying the nickname aloud, \"...I have something to deal with.\"","\"Oh?\" Master Xiao smiled, \"What’s so urgent?\"","A Xiao family enforcement leader got blown up.","Gu Changhuai said silently in his heart.","But on the surface, he just said: \"A Sin Cultivator got blown up during the capture process. I’m going to take a look.\"","Master Xiao dismissed: \"A Sin Cultivator, guilty as charged, if blown up then it’s deserved, why does Supervisor Gu need to attend personally?\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression was a bit subtle, then calmly said:","\"I’m not at ease, I need to see it.\"","\"Then about Xia Canonical Official...\" Master Xiao hesitated.","\"I’ll explain later.\" Gu Changhuai said.","Master Xiao shook his head and sighed: \"Supervisor Gu, it’s not that I’m saying this, diligence is a good thing, but sometimes you have to watch the wind; this Xia Canonical Official...\"","He gestured upwards, lowered his voice, \"was sent by the higher-ups, offending them wouldn’t bode well for your career, it would be greatly detrimental.\"","’The higher-ups’ naturally referred to the Taoist Court.","Gu Changhuai understood.","He also knew that there were undercurrents surging at the Qianxue state boundary, and the Central Dao Court suddenly dispatching a canonical official might have another meaning.","But that had nothing to do with him.","Gu Changhuai said in a deep voice: \"I am a Supervisor, my work is governed by the rules, even if people from the Taoist Court come, what needs to be done is still done.\"","Master Xiao looked at Gu Changhuai like he was a fool, unable to contain his laughter, \"Supervisor Gu has his principles, admirable indeed.\"","Gu Changhuai symbolically cupped his hands as a salute and then turned to leave.","Master Xiao watched his departing back, shaking his head with a cold smile.","...","Leaving the Taoist Court, Gu Changhuai, anxious at heart, galloped back to Qingzhou City, changed into the Taoist Robe of the Taoist Court, selected a good horse from the Gu Family, and without stopping, rode along the Mistwater River to the small fishing village.","Arriving at the fishing village, he followed Mo Hua’s instructions, walked downstream, climbed the Desolate Mountain, and at a glance saw Mo Hua squatting on the ground, researching something unknown.","Beside him was an unfamiliar elderly man with weak breath.","And on the ground lay four neatly aligned corpses.","Gu Changhuai glanced at Mo Hua, then at the four corpses, immediately took another sharp breath, \"You blew up four people?\"","\"No, no,\" Mo Hua waved his hands repeatedly, \"not that many, just one.\"","\"You think that’s not enough?\" Gu Changhuai retorted angrily.","Mo Hua chuckled awkwardly.","\"What exactly happened?\" Gu Changhuai frowned and asked.","Mo Hua briefly explained:","\"These people were assassins, masked, chasing this elder. I happened to encounter them, so I helped the elder counter-kill them. Of course, I only made a slight move, offering a little help...\"","Mo Hua tried to distance himself from the situation.","Gu Changhuai didn’t believe it one bit.","Traces of formation explosions everywhere, and these people with wounds cut and burned by formations...","This is called a slight move to offer a little help?","It’s likely these people were all killed by this kid Mo Hua.","Mo Hua continued, \"After they died, I searched them but found nothing suspicious, but one of them...\"","Mo Hua pointed at a disfigured corpse and said, \"He used Sin Cultivator tactics, embedding a small Storage Box in his teeth, containing an enforcement token with a ’Xiao’ character inscribed...\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze sharpened.","Mo Hua handed the token to Gu Changhuai, \"Uncle Gu, see if this is an enforcement token from the Xiao family?\"","Gu Changhuai took it, glanced at it, his expression slightly grave.","The token was indeed an enforcement token from the Xiao family in the Taoist Court.","Gu Changhuai turned, looked at Mo Hua, assessed the current situation, and silently breathed a sigh of relief."]},{"number":1530,"title":"Chapter 1530 - 818: Water Prison Inheritance (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"Thank goodness...\"","He initially thought that Mo Hua had a conflict with the Xiao family and deliberately set up a Formation to blow up the Xiao family’s Enforcement Leader.","Given the current situation, it’s not difficult to handle.","Gu Changhuai silently put away the Token.","Mo Hua said worriedly, \"Uncle Gu, what do we do now?\"","Gu Changhuai raised an eyebrow, \"What do you mean, what do we do?\"","Mo Hua pointed to the corpse on the ground, \"This Xiao family’s Enforcement Leader...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"What Xiao family’s Enforcement Leader? Where is there an Enforcement Leader from the Xiao family?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback.","\"You acted bravely for justice, only killing a few masked bandits. What’s it got to do with the Xiao family?\"","Gu Changhuai said seriously, \"In this desolate wild area, there are only Sin Cultivators who failed to kill and got killed instead. Where’s the Enforcement Leader?\"","Mo Hua suddenly understood and nodded.","Uncle Gu is indeed an experienced Dao Court Canon.","The procedure is really well-versed.","It seems there’s still a lot for me to learn.","Gu Changhuai’s gaze shifted to Yu Canghai, frowning slightly.","Mo Hua said, \"This senior is a disciple of the Water Prison Sect, surnamed Yu, given name Canghai.\"","Upon seeing Gu Changhuai, Yu Canghai’s eyes were fierce, \"Are you from the Taoist Court?\"","Even though Gu Changhuai wasn’t wearing the Tao Court’s official Taoist Robe, his imposing demeanor and conduct were different from ordinary cultivators, something Yu Canghai could recognize at a glance.","Moreover, he had Golden Core Cultivation.","A Golden Core Realm Cultivator in the Taoist Court is at least a Supervisor wielding power!","Yu Canghai’s expression was vigilant.","Gu Changhuai looked at him coldly, \"So what if I am?\"","Yu Canghai then sneered, \"There’s not a single good person in the Taoist Court!\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression was displeased.","Mo Hua quickly said, \"Alright, alright.\"","A Golden Core old man of indeterminate age, arguing with a two-hundred-year-old Golden Core Steward.","Mo Hua said to Yu Canghai, \"Your enemy is the Gui Water Sect. I can’t protect you; only Uncle Gu can help you.\"","Yu Canghai shook his head, \"I can’t trust the people of the Taoist Court. Even if I die, I won’t accept their kindness. Once you lightly trust the Taoist Court, my Water Prison Sect’s Taoist inheritance will be cut off sooner or later...\"","\"But if you die now, the Water Prison Sect’s Taoist inheritance is already broken.\" Mo Hua said.","Yu Canghai was stunned.","Mo Hua sighed, \"This is already the worst situation. If you listen to Uncle Gu, you might still survive to pass on the Taoist inheritance. Otherwise, your Water Prison Sect is really doomed.\"","Yu Canghai’s expression fluctuated and finally sighed.","Although he was a bit stubborn, he wasn’t foolish, and soon he understood.","He now had no room for bargaining.","Mo Hua then said another sentence to Gu Changhuai:","\"He is from the Water Prison Sect, pursued by Evil Cultivators directed by the Gui Water Sect, which is secretly connected to the Taoist Court.\"","Secret connections with the Taoist Court inevitably involved internal traitors of the Court.","The Gui Water Sect’s direction involved internal corruption within the Sect.","The Evil Cultivators likely involved Water Yama and the annihilation case of the Yu family’s water fortress.","In a flash, Gu Changhuai understood that this Golden Core old man was a key witness.","The displeasure in Gu Changhuai’s eyes slightly faded, and he nodded, saying:","\"Okay.\"","Now that it was explained clearly, Mo Hua also breathed a sigh of relief.","Next, it was the aftermath.","Gu Changhuai said, \"I’ll call someone over to collect the bodies, and outwardly claim that the bandits on the Mistwater River intended to commit robbery but were killed by the Taoist Court. Don’t leak any information.\"","\"Yes, yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, then added, \"By the way, Uncle Gu, there are a few more...\"","Gu Changhuai froze, \"A few of what?\"","Mo Hua pointed towards the deep mountains, \"There are four more, dead over there...\"","Gu Changhuai silently looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua looked a bit embarrassed, whispering, \"I just helped a little, not that I did it myself.\"","Gu Changhuai took a deep breath and sighed, \"Good.\"","One move took eight lives.","Plus, an Enforcement Leader of the Xiao family.","Fortunately, this rascal Mo Hua wasn’t his own nephew, otherwise, he’d either be exhausted to death or driven mad sooner or later.","...","Afterward, Gu Changhuai called the Gu family members to collect the bodies and clean up the scene.","Mo Hua then took the Gu family’s carriage, returning to Qingzhou City with Yu Canghai.","Yu Canghai was temporarily settled at the Gu family, with the public identity of a Taoist Friend of Gu Changhuai visiting specifically while passing through the Qian Learning State Boundary.","This claim wouldn’t raise suspicion among outsiders.","Who in their lifetime of cultivation hasn’t had a few Taoist Friends?","But internally within the Gu family, those who knew Gu Changhuai suspected something was amiss.","Because Gu Changhuai had a bad temper and indeed had few Taoist Friends.","But they presumed it was a matter of the Taoist Court, so no one inquired further.","Yu Canghai was temporarily settled down.","In the Gu family, the environment was peaceful, with food and drink, no lack of healing Pills, and no fear of being hunted. Given time, his injuries would gradually heal.","About the matters of the Water Prison Sect, Gui Water Sect, and the Taoist Court, he recounted everything to Gu Changhuai.","Mo Hua also listened on the side.","Yu Canghai’s account was more or less the same as what he had previously heard, offering little new.","The only difference was Water Yama.","\"Have you seen Water Yama?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","Mentioning Water Yama, anger immediately appeared on Yu Canghai’s face, his eyes filled with deep hatred:","\"Even if he turned into ashes, I wouldn’t forget him!\"","\"What does he look like?\" Mo Hua asked.","Yu Canghai’s gaze was cold, \"He looks like a clean young man, fair-skinned, with cold eyes, a sinister expression, skilled in water manipulation, and adept with a Nine-Locked Snake Whip.\"","Mo Hua and Gu Changhuai exchanged a glance and nodded slightly.","This matched the \"Water Yama\" they had briefly encountered at the dock that night."]},{"number":1531,"title":"Chapter 1531 - 818: Water Prison Legacy (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Yu Canghai said, \"I concealed my identity and came to the Qian Learning State Boundary, enduring countless hardships before finally finding the surviving descendants of the Water Prison Sect from those days.\"","\"They live in the water village, leading a life of poverty, with the highest cultivation no more than Foundation Establishment. They know nothing about the past of the Water Prison Sect, nor their own identities, and they can’t make sense of or learn the Taoist Skills passed down from their ancestors.\"","\"I suppressed my cultivation, hid my presence, disguised myself as a fish merchant, and interacted with them for some time. I was torn about whether to tell them the truth and pass on the Taoist inheritance of the Water Prison Sect to fulfil my lifelong wish, when suddenly...\"","The old man looked pained, \"My whereabouts were discovered, and the entire water village was slaughtered.\"","\"I’m in the Golden Core stage, but here I’m merely a Golden Core cultivator, limited to Foundation Establishment Peak strength in a Second-Grade State Boundary. I could only watch helplessly as the descendants of my Yu family fell one by one beneath the blades of those vile beasts.\"","\"In a fit of wrath, I was ambushed by the Water Yama, poisoned by water, and had to painfully flee to save my life.\"","\"After that, I was constantly hunted by them, hiding here and there, despairing, deciding to make a final stand and end it all. Until I inadvertently discovered that there were still surviving descendants of my Yu family in a small fishing village by the Mistwater River, giving me a sliver of hope again...\"","\"I secretly passed on some cultivation techniques and spells to those two children, though it might bring about the disaster of annihilation, at this point I can’t care so much...\"","Yu Canghai sighed, looked at Mo Hua, \"You know everything that happened after.\"","Mo Hua nodded, then thought for a moment, puzzled:","\"In the Second-Grade State Boundary, your strength was limited and you were hunted by Foundation Building Cultivators, why not go to a Third-Grade State Boundary?\"","The old man gave a bitter smile, \"Going to a Third-Grade State Boundary would get me killed even faster.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled.","The old man sighed, \"In a Second-Grade State Boundary, my pursuers are all Foundation Establishment Late Stage cultivators. Even while suppressing my cultivation, I still had the upper hand.\"","\"But once I headed to a Third-Grade State Boundary, those who would come after me would be the Golden Core cultivators of the Gui Water Sect, and possibly several Late Golden Core cultivators. As a Middle Golden Core cultivator, surrounded by them, I’d be dead for sure!\"","Mo Hua suddenly understood.","The laws of the Heavenly Dao, inseparable intertwined harm and fortune, both suppressed his cultivation, making him powerless to save others, but also saved his life.","Otherwise, if the Twelve Streams’ Gui Water Sect directly sent Golden Core cultivators or ruthlessly sent Feathered Immortals to silence him, then not only the Yu family’s water village, but Yu Canghai himself, would be annihilated in the blink of an eye.","Mo Hua had an epiphany.","The Heavenly Dao Formation, balance of laws, seemingly with many drawbacks...","Like Uncle Gu, a Golden Core, capturing the likes of the Fire Buddha or Water Yama at the Foundation Establishment Peak, it’s a struggle even for top-tier demon cultivators.","But conversely, without the constraints of Heavenly Dao Laws,","they might not be facing demon cultivators like \"Fire Buddha\" or \"Water Yama\" anymore.","Higher-rank demon cultivators might turn their hands to exterminate large numbers of mid to low-level cultivators, causing untold killing.","A place like a small fishing village would likely have been wiped out many times over.","And evil gods on the level of the Master of the Great Wilderness, without the restriction of Heavenly Dao, could just cast a glance at the multitudes, corrupting numerous cultivators’ Taoist hearts, causing endless living beings to fall into the evil path, turning into his sacrifices...","\"Wealth, power, even cultivation, cannot infinitely expand unchecked, without balance, will cause immense disaster for the poor and the weak, leading to the ruin of all beings and the collapse of the Great Dao, resulting in karmic mutations, causing everything in the world to be annihilated and return to the void...\"","\"That perhaps, is the Heavenly Dao...\"","Mo Hua was momentarily dumbfounded, feeling a trace of cold and harsh yet utterly real understanding emerging within.","Cultivators seek the Dao, attain the Dao and become immortal.","He seemed to vaguely understand the embryonic form of his \"Dao\" he pursued.","Yu Canghai and Gu Changhuai, who were speaking with him, were taken aback upon seeing this.","They didn’t understand how merely saying a few words seemed to give Mo Hua some kind of epiphany, with unknown, ancient, and profound meanings flowing through his eyes.","For a moment, neither dared to speak.","After a moment, Mo Hua came back to his senses, seeing both Gu Changhuai and Yu Canghai looking at him, with a slightly puzzled expression:","\"What is it?\"","Gu Changhuai pondered, \"What... are you thinking?\"","\"It’s nothing, just a small realization.\" Mo Hua replied modestly.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was complex.","Yu Canghai cast a subtle glance at Mo Hua as well.","After talking for a while, Gu Changhuai got up to leave.","\"There’s something to attend to with the Taoist Court, I must go back...\" Gu Changhuai said, then glanced at Yu Canghai, \"You stay here and rest, if I have more questions, I’ll come ask you later.\"","Even though he was only at the Initial Golden Core stage and Yu Canghai was at the Middle Golden Core, he spoke without the slightest courtesy.","Yu Canghai knew well the principle of bowing to those under the eaves, so he cupped his hands without saying much.","Mo Hua waved his hand, \"Uncle Gu, take care.\"","Gu Changhuai glanced again at Mo Hua, advising:","\"Return to the sect early, try to go out less, and remember not to mention the matter with the Xiao family’s Enforcement Leader to anyone.\"","Mo Hua nodded repeatedly, \"Don’t worry, I won’t tell anyone.\"","Only then did Gu Changhuai leave.","Though he was not really worried.","This kid, Mo Hua, didn’t know how many secrets he hid in his belly.","If talking about \"unspeakable\" matters, blowing up a Taoist Court Official, being in cahoots with the Sin Cultivator-affiliated Xiao family’s Enforcement Leader might not even reach the top of his list.","After Gu Changhuai left, Mo Hua quietly asked Yu Canghai, \"Old... Senior Yu...\"","Uncle Gu was a Golden Core, who could afford to disrespect him.","But I, merely a Foundation Establishment, must show some manners and call him \"Senior.\"","Yu Canghai, somewhat apprehensive about Mo Hua, guessing Mo Hua’s background was extraordinary, quickly said:","\"This old senior dares not assume the title, if you feel fit, just call me Elder.\"","He indeed had been an elder in his clan before.","If the Water Prison Sect were still there, his Middle Golden Core cultivation could certainly hold the position of an elder.","\"Alright, Elder Yu,\" Mo Hua curiously asked, \"what exactly are the inheritances of your Water Prison Sect?\"","Yu Canghai was stunned for a moment, then looked at Mo Hua somewhat warily, and said cautiously:","\"Our Water Prison Sect’s inheritance can only be passed to the descendants of the Water Prison Sect.\"","Meaning, don’t ask, there’s no way I can tell you.","\"I’m just asking.\" Mo Hua grumbled.","He was a little bit interested in learning, but just a little bit, and not that eager to learn.","Yu Canghai said nothing.","\"By the way,\" Mo Hua suddenly remembered something, asking, \"Previously, when I used the Water Prison Technique to trap that Water Yama, it was of little use, and when used on you, it wasn’t very effective either, why is that?\"","Yu Canghai was shocked upon hearing this, \"You’ve encountered Water Yama?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"You could say that...\"","He had indeed crossed paths with Water Yama, and barely called it a draw.","Yu Canghai looked at Mo Hua with newfound respect.","A Middle Foundation Establishment cultivator, able to engage with Water Yama and emerge unscathed, was not something ordinary cultivators could achieve.","Yu Canghai had faced Water Yama before and knew how troublesome he could be.","Moreover, being able to confront Water Yama...","Yu Canghai’s impression of Mo Hua improved further.","Considering for a moment, he finally decided to say, \"In our Water Prison Sect, the inheritance is also divided into a hierarchy.\"","\"And within this hierarchy, there exists an ’upper controls lower’ relationship.\"","\"The ordinary Water Prison Technique is considered a lower-level inheritance within the Water Prison Sect’s magical system. Even mastering it can’t counter the superior inheritance methods of the Water Prison Sect.\""]},{"number":1532,"title":"Chapter 1532 - 819: Water Prison Skill","paragraphs":["\"Grades and ranks of three, six, and nine, where the higher suppresses the lower?\" Mo Hua looked puzzled, \"Why have I never heard of this kind of differentiation within the Taixu Gate?\"","\"Taixu Gate?\" Yu Canghai was momentarily taken aback, somewhat surprised, \"You are actually a disciple of the Taixu Gate?\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Yu Canghai sighed, \"No wonder...\"","He is, after all, a disciple of one of the Eight Great Sects.","He often heard that the Taixu Gate had declined in recent years, with each generation of disciples being less competent than the last.","Yet unexpectedly, meeting a disciple of the Taixu Gate at random outside revealed such an unfathomable strength.","It seems that most of the rumors in this world are untrue.","The Taixu Gate, being a branch of an ancient sect, indeed has unfathomable roots and a deep legacy...","Yu Canghai couldn’t help but view the Taixu Gate with newfound respect.","He sighed again and slowly said,","\"The legacy of the Taixu Gate differs somewhat from that of my Water Prison Sect. You follow a dignified and rightful path of passing on teachings, where the inheritance within the gate may have grades and ranks but does not make such blatant distinctions as higher suppressing lower.\"","Mo Hua curiously asked, \"You also know about the legacy of our Taixu Gate?\"","Yu Canghai nodded slightly, \"Of course, although the Water Prison Sect has declined, we still retained some sect classics that record the grand situations of the various sects a thousand years ago.\"","\"A thousand years ago...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened, showing interest.","Yu Canghai pondered for a moment before continuing,","\"According to the classics of my Water Prison Sect, the Taixu Gate of that time was not the most powerful among the hundreds of sects within the Qianxue State Boundary, but it was enough to make everyone apprehensive. The fundamental reason lay in the inheritance of its Sword Intent.\"","\"Sword Intent?\"","\"Indeed.\" Yu Canghai nodded, \"Taia God-Forging Sword, Rushing Void Proliferating Sword Qi, Tai Xu Sword Intent, these are recorded in the history of my Water Prison Sect as the three oldest Sword Dao heritages of the Fifth Grade Qianxue State Boundary.\"","Taia God-Forging Sword, Rushing Void Proliferating Sword Qi, Tai Xu Sword Intent...","Upon hearing this, Mo Hua recalled and asked,","\"Elder Yu, I heard that the Tai’a Sect, Rushing Void Sect, and Taixu Gate originated from the same sect. What was the name of that sect?\"","Yu Canghai spoke with a regretful expression,","\"That, I do not know either. The classics of the Water Prison Sect do not record it. All that is known is that it is likely one very ancient sect, but after splitting into three, the name of this ancient sect was erased and was no longer mentioned nor recorded in any books or jade slips thereafter.\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows, his expression somewhat solemn, then he asked,","\"How is the Tai Xu Sword Intent cultivated, exactly?\"","Yu Canghai looked at Mo Hua with a complex expression.","A disciple of the Taixu Gate asking an elder of the Water Prison Sect about cultivating Sword Intent?","Mo Hua had no choice but to say, \"We don’t teach it now.\"","Indeed, the current disciples of Taixu Gate seldom receive instruction on Sword Intent.","He himself is a spiritual cultivator, usually relying on spells for sustenance, not skilled in swordsmanship. Strictly speaking, his sword control is not even swordsmanship.","In regular swordsmanship courses, he merely attends to observe the means of sword cultivation.","To date, he has cultivated in the Taixu Gate for five years, during which he has rarely seen elders impart the technique of Sword Intent to disciples.","It’s seldom even mentioned.","A sword cultivator like Situ Jian, within the Taixu Gate, learns a bit of everything but specifically not the sword.","His Sword Dao heritage is still the Li Fire Sword technique from his own family, not the Sword Dao methods of the Taixu Gate.","Yu Canghai was also a bit surprised, \"No longer taught?\"","He frowned, muttering, \"...That’s strange, how come it’s not taught anymore?\"","How could a sect open its doors to take in disciples and yet not pass on its Taoist inheritance?","Yu Canghai pondered for a moment and slowly said, \"It’s likely because Sword Intent is too difficult to impart...\"","\"Cultivating Qi and nourishing the sword, learning techniques at the Foundation Establishment, toiling day and night at the Sword Dao, comprehending Sword Intent, possibly seeing initial success only by the time of Golden Core or even the late Golden Core stage, and finally showcasing brilliance at Feather Transformation, breaking through the nine heavens with the sword.\"","\"This process is too slow, in today’s world, it seems somewhat outdated...\"","\"Now the sects abound, the competition among them intense. Something like Sword Intent, if unable to be learned during the Foundation Establishment, even if learned, takes too long to show results, making it disadvantageous. Perhaps disciples of other sects have already gained renown through their fierce swordsmanship, while you’re still painstakingly laying your groundwork and nurturing Sword Intent. Although mastering it eventually brings remarkable stature, before that you must endure considerable solitude and years of confinement...\"","At this point, Yu Canghai grew somewhat contemplative.","The evolution of cultivation methods has indeed improved greatly compared to the past.","But today’s cultivators are often too eager for quick success, unwilling to patiently cultivate.","Great achievements come late.","The reason why some ancient Taoist skills are formidable is that one must withstand solitude, accrue effort, and gradually hone skills to see results.","Mo Hua slowly nodded.","The sword intent heritage of Taixu Gate exerts power later, indeed suffering at the Foundation Establishment level.","This is Elder Yu’s perspective.","But Mo Hua knew, it was not merely so.","For if the Tai Xu Sword Intent was about cumulative post-development force, the Inner Sect of today’s Taixu Gate should surpass the Eight Great Gates in strength.","But reality was otherwise.","Among the Inner Sect disciples, including the elders of the Eight Great Sects, the strength did not seem outstanding.","Not that Xun Ziyou, Xun Zixian, along with other elders were weak, but rather they didn’t hold an \"exceptional\" power.","At the root of it, perhaps it’s because the method for the latter stages of Sword Intent also became lost.","It was inherently difficult, learned slowly.","Even after mastering it later, some unknown reason led to a lack of methods to wield Sword Intent.","No wonder the Taixu Gate now hardly teaches about Sword Intent..."]},{"number":1533,"title":"Chapter 1533 - 819: Water Prison Skill (2)","paragraphs":["This inheritance, or rather the Taoist inheritance of the Taixu Gate, is obstructed at every turn, making it extremely difficult to pass down. So much so that the Taixu Gate, originally known for its \"Sword Intent\" and sharpness, has now become a sluggish ’straggler’.","Yu Canghai, after commenting on the Taixu Gate, pondered:","\"So, the Taixu Gate, you have the most orthodox inheritance from the Ancient Sect. The difficulty in transmitting it lies in its nature. You only need to focus on teaching your disciples, while we, in the Water Prison Sect, have too much to consider.\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","\"What do you have to consider?\" Mo Hua asked.","Yu Canghai sighed: \"In our Water Prison Sect, our entire heritage is related to the Taoist Court, accustomed to scheming and intrigue, so we must guard against others as well as ourselves.\"","\"Even the founding ancestor of our Water Prison Sect, who established the Taoist inheritance, was a deeply calculating and scheming ancestor.\"","\"The ancestor didn’t trust anyone, not even his own clan or children, let alone the sect disciples.\"","\"So he established grades for the spells within the sect, with strict hierarchy.\"","\"The direct lineage learns the superior, the Inner Gate learns the intermediate, and the Outer Gate learns the inferior.\"","\"The inferior cultivation techniques are naturally restrained by the superior ones.\"","\"Inferior spells are naturally ineffective against superior spells.\"","Mo Hua frowned, puzzled: \"Even with such obvious ’discrimination’ in inheritance, do disciples still wish to join your Water Prison Sect to learn?\"","\"Naturally,\" Yu Canghai said, \"human nature is like this: without benefit, they talk about self-respect and dignity. Once benefits are attainable, they will cast self-respect and dignity aside.\"","\"A mere discrimination in inheritance, what does it count for?\"","\"Moreover, in the realm of water system skills and Taoist skill inheritance, our Water Prison Sect is foremost within the Qianxue State boundary.\"","\"Even if it’s divided into levels, those inferior spells still perform powerfully against other cultivators.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","The Water Prison Technique he learned was indeed like this.","So far, it has only been ineffective against the Water Yama and Elder Yu, but it’s very effective on other cultivators, almost hitting one with each bind.","\"Such a powerful Water Prison Technique is only an inferior spell of the Water Prison Sect?\" Mo Hua felt a bit sentimental.","Yu Canghai hesitated for a moment and said, \"Actually, it’s not exactly.\"","\"Not exactly?\"","Yu Canghai said, \"Even the Water Prison Technique is graded into ’levels’.\"","Mo Hua was confused, \"Levels? How come I didn’t know?\"","Yu Canghai sighed, \"You’re not a disciple of our Water Prison Sect, so you’ve only received some inheritance on paper, which is just a rough understanding.\"","\"The subtleties of spells lie in their application. Many internal intricacies are passed down orally and are not documented.\"","Mo Hua was somewhat shocked, \"The Water Prison Technique has other intricacies?\"","Despite learning and using it for so long, he had not discovered any of them.","Yu Canghai didn’t want to say, but seeing Mo Hua’s eager eyes, and considering that he owed his life to Mo Hua, he felt he had to repay him in some way.","Moreover, these little intricacies on the Water Prison Technique shouldn’t have much impact if shared.","Even if mentioned, it’s unlikely that he could learn them.","Yu Canghai said, \"When you perform the Water Prison Technique, you must have noticed the spell pattern condenses several water series spiritual power chains, right?\"","Mo Hua nodded.","\"How many?\" Yu Canghai asked.","Mo Hua recalled, \"It seems to be three.\"","Yu Canghai said, \"These spiritual locks form what is known as the grades.\"","\"Each spiritual lock is a small threshold. Every time you cross a small threshold, the consumption of spiritual power increases, but the ’binding’ effect of the Water Prison Technique also becomes stronger.\"","\"And every three spiritual locks form a major threshold. Crossing a major threshold causes a quality change in the Water Prison Technique and elevates it by a level.\"","\"Three spiritual locks are just entry-level, six represent a moderate mastery, and nine signify great mastery.\"","\"With three spiritual locks, the Water Prison Technique can hardly restrain any disciple who has practiced the Water Prison Sect’s cultivation techniques.\"","\"Six spiritual locks are a notch higher, showing a clear restraining effect on some Outer Disciples.\"","\"A Water Prison Technique cultivated to the ultimate, with nine spiritual locks, poses a notable threat even to Inner Gate cultivators or less skilled direct lineage members of the Water Prison Sect.\"","Mo Hua was amazed, \"There are that many subtleties?\"","\"Indeed,\" Yu Canghai replied with emotion, \"the inheritance in the Cultivation World is inherently complex, and these matters are never recorded in the Secret Manual but are passed from person to person. Only those who are truly proficient in such spells understand the intricacies.\"","\"Oh...\" Mo Hua nodded.","The Cultivation World has a long-standing heritage, and it seems that not just formations but also the inheritance of Taoist skills is far more complicated than he imagined.","Indeed, as long as one keeps learning, one will always discover something new.","\"Then how are the three, six, nine spiritual locks in the Water Prison Technique cultivated?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"This...\" Yu Canghai hesitated a bit.","\"Can’t you tell?\"","\"It involves specific inheritance, and I can only briefly explain,\" Yu Canghai sighed and then said, \"When performing the Water Prison Technique, spiritual power is mobilized from the Qi Sea, merging into the forearm, flowing through acupoints such as the Chi Ze, Wai Guan, and the right palm—Fen Bai, Ling Gu, Zhong Bai, Zhong Zhu...Finally condensing into a skill pattern, flowing out from the Shang Yang acupoint at the forefinger, forming the spell.\"","\"These acupoints are the key.\"","\"Spiritual power travels through these acupoints to form a small circulation. Within the few breaths during which the skill pattern is formed, each additional pass through the circulation generates an extra spiritual lock.\"","\"It sounds simple, but performing it is extremely complicated, requiring years of practice. Not only must it be fast, but also precise, ensuring the spiritual power doesn’t become chaotic to...\""]},{"number":1534,"title":"Chapter 1534 - 819: Water Prison Skill (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Before Yu Canghai could finish speaking, Mo Hua said:","\"Is that so?\"","He turned his head and saw Mo Hua pointing, conjuring a Water Prison Technique with four Spirit Locks out of thin air, one more than before.","Yu Canghai fell silent.","\"Should I be faster?\"","Mo Hua pondered and then concentrated, manipulating his Spiritual Power to cast the Water Prison Technique again.","His Spiritual Power flowed more swiftly and accurately.","Soon, the Water Prison Technique formed five Spirit Locks.","Yu Canghai was stunned.","Mo Hua seemed a bit dissatisfied.","\"It could be a bit faster still, the flow of the Spiritual Power circulation and the acupuncture points could be more precise...\"","Mo Hua tried five or six more times.","Some attempts failed, but eventually, he managed to form six Spirit Locks, albeit with some difficulty.","For now, this seemed to be the limit. If he circulated it any more, it would take too long, and the skill pattern of the Water Prison Technique would be unstable.","However, six Spirit Locks was still an improvement, at least stronger than before.","His previous Water Prison Technique only had three Spirit Locks.","Thinking of this, Mo Hua felt a bit puzzled and asked Yu Canghai:","\"Isn’t your grading system a bit hasty? There’s not much difficulty between three, four, five, and six locks, so why such detailed divisions?\"","Yu Canghai stood expressionlessly on the spot, feeling a bit numb, unable to utter a single word.","What could he say?","That the usual disciples of the Water Prison Sect don’t train like this?","That forming each additional Spirit Lock takes years, even over a decade of practice?","How could he possibly say that?","It would be too humiliating to mention.","Yu Canghai spoke with a numb expression:","\"Well... perhaps the sect elders were indeed a bit careless, but after all, it’s a low-level spell, not very difficult, and by dividing it finely, it’s to... to... instill confidence in the disciples to learn spells and encourage their cultivation...\"","By the end, Yu Canghai didn’t even know what he was saying.","Mo Hua genuinely believed it, \"I didn’t expect, the elders of your Water Prison Sect are quite kind-hearted.\"","Yu Canghai smiled bitterly.","How would he know?","He was just making it up.","\"So does your Water Prison Sect have more powerful spells?\" Mo Hua asked curiously.","Yu Canghai’s spirit was uplifted.","Regarding matters concerning the sect’s heritage secrets, he wasn’t originally inclined to talk about them.","But at this point, he couldn’t let the Water Prison Sect be looked down upon by this young fellow.","Otherwise, where would the Water Prison Sect’s dignity be?","\"Of course.\" Yu Canghai said solemnly, with a hint of arrogance, \"My Water Prison Sect was once prestigious and has a long heritage, mastering countless water-based spells.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, \"For example?\"","Yu Canghai pondered for a moment and said, \"To not mention others, even among control spells like the Water Prison Technique, my Water Prison Sect has superior Daoist Magic heritage.\"","\"There’s an even stronger control spell than the Water Prison Technique?\" Mo Hua’s eyes brightened.","Yu Canghai nodded and said, \"The Water Prison Technique can at most form nine Spirit Locks...\"","\"Above the Water Prison Technique, there is a Daoist Magic that starts with forming eighteen Spirit Locks.\"","\"This is the Water Prison Sect’s sect-protecting superior control Daoist Magic—Water Prison Skill!\"","Water Prison Skill?!","Mo Hua’s heart was slightly shocked.","The name alone sounded extraordinary.","Seeing Mo Hua’s surprised expression, Yu Canghai felt slightly proud and continued:","\"There are many superior Daoist Magics for attack in the Cultivation World, but very few for control.\"","\"This Water Prison Skill is an extremely rare superior control technique!\"","\"Moreover, it is the finest ’control technique’ in our Water Prison Sect’s inheritance system, capable of restraining all cultivators who have practiced the Water Prison Sect’s techniques and movement techniques, only the Sect Leader’s direct lineage can learn it!\"","\"At the same time, most importantly, the Water Prison Skill is a strong control type spell that can ignore the immunity effects of the Golden Body Technique and the Golden Body Talisman, enforcing control over the cultivator.\"","\"In the face of the Water Prison Skill, the Golden Body is nothing more than a useless sheet of white paper.\"","This truly stunned Mo Hua.","A superior Daoist magic, a powerful control spell, disregarding the Golden Body.","He immediately said, \"Then if one learns the Water Prison Skill, can one catch the Water Yama?\"","Elder Yu Canghai shook his head.","\"Not possible?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"It’s not impossible,\" Elder Yu Canghai said, \"to learn the Water Prison Skill is even harder than capturing the Water Yama...\"","\"This is an extremely complex spell, and a superior Daoist magic at that, how can it be so easy to learn? Throughout the generations in the Water Prison Sect, only the sect leader and the direct lineage of the leader are eligible to learn it, and even then, not all leaders can master it.\"","Mo Hua said, \"Then...\"","Elder Yu Canghai said, \"I naturally wouldn’t, and besides, I am not a sect leader, nor could I possibly have the Water Prison Skill heritage in my possession.\"","Mo Hua was somewhat disappointed, then asked, \"Aside from the Water Prison Skill, are there even more powerful spells?\"","\"The Water Prison Skill is a superior skill, beyond that would be a forbi...\"","Elder Yu Canghai abruptly stopped talking.","\"Forbi what?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Nothing...\" Elder Yu Canghai forced a smile, saying, \"There are indeed more powerful ones than the Water Prison Skill, but those are not control spells. In terms of control, naturally, none surpass the Water Prison Skill.\"","\"I see.\" Mo Hua nodded.","After that, Elder Yu Canghai no longer said much.","He still had injuries on him, so Mo Hua did not want to disturb him further and took his leave.","However, this conversation had enlightened Mo Hua on many things.","Firstly, there is a more advanced practice of the Water Prison Technique.","He could practice more upon returning to see if he could perfect the Water Prison Technique to its utmost, the Nine Spirit Locks.","The Water Prison Technique with the Nine Spirit Locks would likely have a higher effectiveness.","Secondly, the Water Prison Skill.","Almost exclusively learned by the sect leader of the Water Prison Sect, able to counteract the Water Prison Sect cultivation techniques and disregard the Golden Body Skill, an extremely rare superior control-type spell.","Mo Hua was not greedy for offensive spells.","But this type of control spell, however, held an inexplicable attraction to him.","Mo Hua felt eager yet somewhat regrettable.","Elder Yu said he did not possess the heritage of the Water Prison Skill; whether this was true or false was uncertain, but even if he did have it, he certainly would not let Mo Hua learn it.","After all, this was the sect protecting skill of the Water Prison Sect, only to be learned by the \"sect leader.\"","Moreover, being a superior Daoist magic, the consumption of spiritual power was staggering.","With his meager spiritual power, even if he learned it, he might not be able to use it...","And when Elder Yu mentioned, \"spells stronger than the Water Prison Skill\", he said the word \"forbi\", Mo Hua could almost conclude his intention was to say \"forbidden technique\".","Was there forbidden techniques within the Water Prison Sect as well?","This Elder Yu had quite a number of hidden secrets...","Mo Hua marveled in his heart.","However, these are the inheritance of the Water Prison Sect, and it’s not appropriate to demand forcefully.","He could only calm his thoughts and returned to the Taixu Gate.","As soon as he returned to the sect, stepping through the mountain gate, he looked up at the plaque reading \"Taixu Gate\" and couldn’t help but recall the record of the Taixu Gate’s predecessor in the millennia-old documents of the Water Prison Sect as mentioned by Elder Yu.","\"Tai’a God-Forging Sword, Rushing Void Proliferating Sword Qi, Taixu Sword Intent...\"","\"What sect were they exactly before the split into the Three Sects?\"","\"If the Three Sects were united, merging the divine sword, sword qi, and sword intent together, what kind of powerful sword dao heritage would that form?\"","Mo Hua looked up at the sky, his heart longing.","Then his expression became somewhat forlorn.","Unfortunately, the Three Sects had already split apart.","Looking at the current situation, they probably couldn’t come together again, pondering such questions seemed futile.","\"If only the Three Sects could be united...\"","Mo Hua thought silently, then shook his head and stepped through the mountain gate of the Taixu Gate.","Above the mountain gate, white smoke still spiraled upwards, intertwining with the distant clouds and mist, becoming one with the sky.","An ancient sword intent roamed amidst it."]},{"number":1535,"title":"Chapter 1535 - 820: Lure","paragraphs":["After returning to the Sect, life was peaceful.","Mo Hua cultivated daily as usual, studying Formation techniques.","Yet, in his spare time, he remained highly interested in the Sect before the divisions of Tai’a, Chongxu, and Taixu, known for its ancient Sword Dao heritage.","So he subtly inquired and asked around, hoping to find someone within Taixu Gate who knew the name of this ancient Sect.","No disciples knew.","Among the Elders, including Xun Ziyou, Xun Zixian, and the gentle Elder Murong, he asked, but they too could not say for sure.","After much thought, Mo Hua decided to ask Elder Master Xun.","That day, after consulting Elder Master Xun about the essentials of the Nineteen Patterns Bagua Formation Method, he took the opportunity to voice his query:","\"Gentleman, I heard others say that our Taixu Gate’s predecessor was an ancient Sword Dao Sect. Do you know the name of this ancient Sect?\"","Elder Master Xun was startled, looking at Mo Hua with a strange expression, \"Why ask about this?\"","\"I’m just a bit curious,\" Mo Hua replied.","Elder Master Xun’s expression grew subtle, and after a moment, he sighed, somewhat wistfully:","\"This matter is too ancient, and that name is not to be mentioned again. I don’t know either...\"","Although Elder Master Xun claimed not to know, Mo Hua sensed from his demeanor that he might not be oblivious.","Mo Hua pondered briefly, then suddenly realized something and asked again:","\"When you say ’not to be mentioned again,’ who forbade it?\"","Elder Master Xun’s gaze sharpened but said nothing further, merely patting Mo Hua’s shoulder, \"Focus on learning Formations and don’t ask about other matters.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua nodded.","If Elder Master Xun wouldn’t say and also forbade inquiries, then surely there was some unspeakable secret involved.","Elder Master Xun glanced at Mo Hua again, contemplated for a moment, then couldn’t help but ask:","\"How has your Divine Sense progressed?\"","Mo Hua answered truthfully: \"It has improved a bit, but very slowly...\"","\"Is that so...\" Elder Master Xun sighed softly.","He knew that such a pace was normal.","After all, Second Grade Nineteen Patterns were nearing the limits of Divine Sense at the Foundation Establishment level, making any further advancement exceedingly difficult.","Cultivation has its limits.","Once approaching these limits, even with the Spiritual Power gained from cultivating with Spirit Stones and Cultivation Techniques, progress becomes arduous, as difficult as ascending to the heavens.","Let alone the Divine Sense, which has no Cultivation Technique to rely on.","Yet, Elder Master Xun still felt a tinge of regret.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but ask: \"Gentleman, is my Divine Sense really that important?\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, said gently: \"It’s nothing, just focus on your cultivation, don’t let other matters distract you...\"","Some things can’t be said yet.","Nor could he let Mo Hua bear a burden too heavy.","But after speaking, Elder Master Xun suddenly fell silent.","He gazed at the gradually maturing Mo Hua, pondered for a moment, then suddenly his eyes flickered, speaking solemnly:","\"Mo Hua.\"","Mo Hua looked toward Elder Master Xun.","Elder Master Xun’s expression was grave as he slowly said:","\"The Qian Learning State Boundary, with its treacherous and unpredictable nature, events soon to occur may very well concern the rise and fall of our Taixu Gate...\"","\"This matter is entangled with many Causes and Effects, too many variables, no one can predict the outcome. Therefore, with each enhancement of your Divine Sense, you gain an increment of safety.\"","Mo Hua’s heart trembled.","Concern the rise and fall of Taixu Gate?","He had only guessed before that the matter wouldn’t be minor, but hadn’t imagined it would be this serious.","And these words were uttered by the profound and inscrutable Elder Master Xun.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then nodded earnestly:","\"Gentleman, I understand.\"","...","After leaving Elder Master Xun, Mo Hua suddenly felt the weight of the burden on his shoulders.","Strengthening his Divine Sense, since it’s a major issue concerning the rise and fall of the Sect, he could not slack off.","It’s not about willingly consuming Evil Spirits.","But the circumstances force it, there’s no choice but to devour them.","Consuming a little isn’t sufficient, a significant consumption is necessary.","Time was pressing...","Mo Hua thought for a bit and sent a Transmission to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, have you investigated the Xiao family?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"That’s the matter of the Taoist Court, you don’t meddle.\"","Mo Hua felt a bit displeased, then said:","\"Uncle Gu, I’ve already told you about the Water Prison Sect and Elder Yu. Shouldn’t you also show some camaraderie and tell me about the Xiao family matter, so it would be ’reciprocity’?\"","Gu Changhuai fell silent.","Being pressed by Mo Hua like this, he surprisingly felt a pang of guilt.","He indeed seemed to have taken advantage of Mo Hua.","After pondering for a while, Gu Changhuai sighed: \"I can tell you, but be careful with the Xiao family.\"","\"The Xiao family cultivators, mostly hold positions in the Taoist Court, skilled in the ways of prison and punishment, and their methods are ruthless. Moreover, now, you have a life of the Xiao family on your hands, so it’s best to avoid entanglements with them...\"","\"Mm.\" Mo Hua replied, \"I understand.\"","Gu Changhuai sighed.","He didn’t know whether Mo Hua truly understood or was just pretending to understand, but he still said:","\"I have investigated, indeed there’s a shadow of the Xiao family in these matters.\"","\"Ye Jin’s older brother, that man named Ye Xiu, when he died on Mistwater River, the Ye family deregistered from the Taoist Court, and the Enforcement Leader responsible was someone from the Xiao family.\"","\"Simultaneously, the case where Crossing River Dragon killed Ye Xiu, who went by the alias ’Young Master Lin,’ was also handled by someone from the Xiao family at the time.\"","\"And coincidentally, the same person handled both matters.\"","\"This person treated one case as two unrelated matters.\"","\"And this person, you know as well...\"","\"I know as well?\" Mo Hua was startled.","He didn’t know many people from the Xiao family, could it be...","\"Howling Celestial Dog?\" Mo Hua asked."]},{"number":1536,"title":"Chapter 1536 - 820: Lure_2","paragraphs":["The Xiao family over there, the people he remembers, apart from the Smiling Tiger, are the Howling Celestial Dog.","The Smiling Tiger is the Supervisor in the Taoist Court at Qian Learning State Boundary, whose face carries a smile, but it’s a mere facade without true emotion.","The Howling Celestial Dog is Xiao Tianquan of the Xiao family, who just joined the Taoist Court and has a legion of people striving to earn merit points for him, a distinguished Heavenly Pride of the direct lineage with promising prospects.","The Smiling Tiger is a Supervisor, not something he can personally attend to on all occasions.","Besides him, it could only be the Howling Celestial Dog...","Gu Changhuai, resignedly, \"I told you, don’t randomly give people nicknames.\"","\"It’s not my fault; it’s because he chose a bad name...\" Mo Hua argued confidently.","Xiao Tianquan, Howling Celestial Dog, almost sounds the same.","Gu Changhuai couldn’t argue with Mo Hua, so he silently acquiesced and continued, \"Not only the Ye family’s matters, but over at the Gui Water Sect, the Xiao family indeed maintains close ties with them. In fact, many disciples of the Xiao family originally hail from the Gui Water Sect, having learned its traditions.\"","\"Not only that, I perused through the records of Qian Learning State Boundary over the past two hundred years and discovered many cases involving Sin Cultivators, with traces of the Xiao family’s involvement.\"","\"Some Sin Cultivators were caught, but insufficient evidence led to their release; some received death sentences, only to mysteriously die in the Taoist Prison before the execution; even some Sin Cultivators had questionable identities, one person having two names, or two people sharing one name, with the Xiao family handling the aftermath in the records...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"No one investigates the Xiao family for doing these things?\"","Gu Changhuai replied indifferently, \"No one would investigate.\"","Mo Hua paused, pondering for a moment, and somewhat understood.","The Taoist Court’s bureaucratic structure is cumbersome, with many idle staff, so tasks lacking tangible benefits naturally get brushed off, bypassed if possible.","As long as the Xiao family maintains discretion and outwardly appears acceptable, no one would voluntarily trouble themselves by going through these old accounts.","Moreover, delving into these old accounts would offend the leading figures of the Taoist Court—the Xiao family.","Anyone with even a bit of insight wouldn’t go stirring up this trouble.","\"What about the dead Enforcement Leader?\"","\"Which one?\"","\"The one I blew up...\" Mo Hua quietly said.","Someone died, and the Xiao family should have reacted somehow.","Gu Changhuai’s expression grew complex, transmitted in a letter, saying:","\"The Xiao family came to handle the cancellation of the roster, claiming that one of their Xiao family members fought fiercely against bandits at the Mistwater River, endeavoring with full effort but unfortunately dying at the hands of a ’vicious and fierce’ water bandit.\"","Mo Hua: \"This ’vicious and fierce’ water bandit wouldn’t be me, would it...\"","Gu Changhuai: \"As long as you know it yourself.\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","Gu Changhuai: \"Thus, the matter is officially put to rest, but secretly, the Xiao family won’t let it go so easily. Be careful, and don’t inadvertently let slip anything that could cause trouble for yourself.\"","Mo Hua: \"I understand, thank you, Uncle Gu.\"","Having said everything necessary, Gu Changhuai added:","\"I have other matters to attend to, so no more chatting. The Taoist Court sent a Supervisor down here, and they’re quite difficult, with an abominable temper. These days, I’ll be quite busy too, take care of yourself.\"","A Supervisor sent down by the Taoist Court?","Mo Hua wanted to ask who this Supervisor was, but Gu Changhuai’s side had already fallen silent.","Mo Hua shook his head.","Uncle Gu is really not transparent at all.","He decided that from now on, any intel would be temporarily withheld from Uncle Gu.","Only when he needed Uncle Gu’s help, would he use these intel for \"blackmail\"... no, to engage in \"equivalent exchange\" with Uncle Gu.","Knowledge is valuable, and shouldn’t be disclosed carelessly.","Putting away the Letter Token, Mo Hua sat in the Disciple’s Residence at the table, silently contemplating.","This way, he also has a vague understanding of the situation at Mistwater River.","The Xiao family in the Taoist Court is the \"protector\".","Gui Water Sect is the apparent master.","Water Yama and the others are the covert henchmen.","Hundred Flower Valley...","Mo Hua was unsure how deeply Hundred Flower Valley was involved, but at least the Instructor Hua over there was responsible for \"supplying goods,\" possibly even \"shipping goods.\"","All these forces together weave a net, covering Mistwater River.","And the center of this net is likely...","Rouge Boat.","Yet, knowing this net, Mo Hua hesitated to take action.","No progress had been made on the Hundred Flower Valley side.","According to Uncle Gu, Hua Ruyu has been overly cautious recently, staying in the Hundred Flower Valley, with hardly any contact with the outside world.","As for the Gui Water Sect, he was utterly unfamiliar with them, nor did he know anyone from the Gui Water Sect, nor had he placed any spies within it.","Water Yama was also hard to catch, not to mention that they couldn’t be apprehended arbitrarily.","Given Water Yama’s alertness and impressive water skills, capturing him next time would require utmost preparedness, meticulous planning, making him escape-proof.","Otherwise, if failed again, exposing his trump card, alerting him, it would be nearly impossible to capture him again.","As for the Xiao family, no need to mention.","Having blown up one of the Xiao family’s Enforcement Leaders, he’s tangled in cause and effect, better stay away from the Xiao family for now.","\"It seems like there are clues everywhere, but when actually investigating, it’s hard to find a point of entry...\"","Mo Hua sighed.","\"What’s the best point of entry?\"","In the days that followed, Mo Hua kept pondering this issue, but remained in a stalemate.","Until one day, while having lunch in the Disciple’s Residence cafeteria, Hao Xuan suddenly came looking for him.","\"Junior Brother, there’s a situation!\"","\"A situation?\" Mo Hua was startled.","\"Yes!\" Hao Xuan nodded, his expression earnest, \"Someone tried to seduce me!\"","At the side, Cheng Mo, who had been drinking, was choked directly. He coughed several times, his face reddening, unable to resist asking:","\"Seduce you?\"","\"Yes!\" Hao Xuan looked serious.","\"A woman?\""]},{"number":1537,"title":"Chapter 1537 - 820: Temptation (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"A man.\"","Cheng Mo’s expression became a bit subtle.","Hao Xuan quickly waved his hand and explained, \"It’s not like that. It’s not him seducing me. It’s him seducing me to go to a place I shouldn’t go.\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow, intrigued, \"What place?\"","\"He didn’t say,\" Hao Xuan replied, \"just said he wanted to take me to a place for ’eating, drinking, and having fun’, with not only good-looking but also fun things.\"","\"I asked him what was so good-looking and fun, and he didn’t say, just smiled ambiguously and said I’d know when I got there. I didn’t believe it, so he said that place was the ultimate pleasure ground of the mortal world, that once you visited, you’d never forget it for life.\"","\"I was a bit tempted...\"","Hao Xuan admitted honestly, his face a bit red, but he still seriously said, \"But I remembered, Junior Brother, you warned us that someone might plot against our Taixu Gate, secretly enticing us to do wrong. I got a wake-up call and pretended to agree, then came back to tell you.\"","Mo Hua nodded gratifyingly, \"Very good.\"","After speaking, he personally poured Hao Xuan a glass of fruit wine.","Hao Xuan drank the wine poured by his Junior Brother, unable to hide a bit of pride on his face.","\"Who was trying to seduce you?\" Situ Jian, on the side, asked with some curiosity.","Hao Xuan took a sip of wine and said:","\"It’s a childhood friend of mine. Our two families are quite close, and we’re the same age, so we played together as kids. But later, we joined different sects and got busy with cultivation, so we rarely contacted each other.\"","\"Which sect did he join?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Gui Water Sect,\" Hao Xuan replied.","Gui Water Sect...","Mo Hua’s eyes twitched slightly.","\"Junior Brother, what should we do now? Should I reject him?\" Hao Xuan asked.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, shook his head, \"No, agree to him.\"","Hao Xuan was taken aback, \"Agree to him?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua said, \"Not only should you agree to him but also casually mention that you have a fellow member who wants to join and see if he’s willing to bring him along.\"","Hao Xuan said, \"Junior Brother, that fellow member you’re talking about, wouldn’t that be you?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"That’s right!\"","Meanwhile, Cheng Mo immediately got curious, \"Junior Brother, you want to go? Then I’ll go too!\"","Even the usually serious Situ Jian chimed in, \"I’ll go as well.\"","Mo Hua was speechless, \"What are you guys tagging along for?\"","Cheng Mo replied earnestly, \"We have no other intentions; we just fear you might encounter danger, so we want to protect you.\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","Situ Jian thought for a moment, not joking but rather seriously said, \"Junior Brother, it might indeed be a bit dangerous for you to go alone.\"","Mo Hua pondered quietly for a moment, then sighed, \"Alright.\"","While he wasn’t afraid of any danger by himself, after all, there was still Hao Xuan involved. Hao Xuan’s strength was average, and in case of an unforeseen event, Cheng Mo and Situ Jian could lend a helping hand.","Another reason was that bringing only Hao Xuan might not be agreed upon by the Gui Water Sect.","But if he brought three Taixu Sect Disciples over at once, the likelihood of the Gui Water Sect agreeing would be higher.","Mo Hua guessed blindly that the Gui Water Sect disciple might be needing \"headcount performance.\"","Bringing one more might not matter much, but bringing three more might be impossible to refuse.","\"Hao Xuan, ask your childhood friend, say you have three fellow members who also want to take a look and see if it’s okay with him.\" Mo Hua instructed.","Hao Xuan nodded, \"Okay, I’ll ask.\"","The next day, Hao Xuan reported after asking, then said to Mo Hua:","\"I told my childhood friend, and he was a bit hesitant, even wary, asking which three fellow members. I told him one was a noble family’s son from Gen State, another from Li State’s Sword Dao noble family. As for you, Junior Brother, I said your family was not prominent, but you are a Formation genius.\"","\"A noble family’s son, a Sword Dao noble family’s son, and a Formation genius. My childhood friend was indeed overjoyed after hearing this, but he pretended it was a difficult decision, saying he needed to consult his senior brother. However, it wasn’t long before he told me that his senior brother agreed, and you all could come along.\"","Mo Hua nodded and asked, \"When will we go?\"","\"This upcoming break,\" Hao Xuan said, \"He said sooner rather than later since not everyone can visit that place. Even if you qualify, you must queue. If we go too late, there may not be a spot.\"","\"Since it’s our first time going, we will receive special treatment.\"","The more Mo Hua listened, the more it sounded like a \"pig butchering scam.\"","In a way, it could indeed be a \"pig butchering scam.\"","Except they were not shedding blood but slaughtering the Taoist Heart.","Without the Taoist Heart, one is merely a pig.","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua nodded.","A few days later, the break came.","Mo Hua, Cheng Mo, Situ Jian, and Hao Xuan gathered and then, led by Hao Xuan, went to Gui Water City outside the Gui Water Sect.","Inside the Qianxue State Boundary, outside each sect, there is an Immortal City for the study of Dao.","This Immortal City serves the sect disciples by providing daily necessities such as pills, runes, spiritual artifacts, formations, etc.","There are also inns, restaurants, teahouses, and other places for dining and leisure.","It is also home to many cultivators in their daily lives.","Gui Water Sect was no exception.","Upon reaching Gui Water City, Hao Xuan led Mo Hua and the others to an inn where they met his childhood friend.","Hao Xuan introduced, \"This is Wang Chen, who grew up with me and now cultivates at the Gui Water Sect.\"","Mo Hua took a look at this Wang Chen.","He was about the same height as Hao Xuan, slender, and his appearance wasn’t handsome or ugly, just possessing a nondescript demeanor, though his eyes often flickered, indicating he had some cunning.","While Mo Hua was assessing Wang Chen,","Wang Chen was also looking at Mo Hua and his companions.","Seeing Cheng Mo and Situ Jian was fine, but when he saw Mo Hua, he suddenly showed a troubled expression and said to Hao Xuan:","\"Brother Xuan, it’s not doable.\"","\"Why not?\"","Wang Chen stealthily glanced at Mo Hua and whispered to Hao Xuan, \"Didn’t you say you brought three fellow members? Why is there a Junior Brother here?\"","Mo Hua’s face turned black.","Hao Xuan quickly corrected, \"He’s a fellow member, not a Junior Brother.\"","Not only not a Junior Brother, he was even a Junior Brother of Taixu Gate.","Wang Chen was troubled and sighed, \"But he looks quite young...\"","His face was just too youthful.","And those eyes, pure and clear, untouched by worldly dust.","Wang Chen then lowered his voice and said in Hao Xuan’s ear, \"...that kind of place, he’s not suitable to go.\"","There was one thing he didn’t say out loud.","In his eyes, this \"Junior Brother\" from Taixu Gate looked much too appealing to certain types of people.","If he were really brought inside and caught the eye of some noble sons, it would only harm him."]},{"number":1538,"title":"Chapter 1538 - 821: Sneak Attack","paragraphs":["Mo Hua’s face looked even worse.","As a dignified man, being looked down upon by these people was truly outrageous.","Hao Xuan said to Wang Chen, \"Could you make an exception?\"","Wang Chen shook his head, \"Even if I made an exception, it wouldn’t work. Even if I let him in, those brothers inside wouldn’t let him on the boat.\"","\"On the boat?\" Hao Xuan asked.","Wang Chen realized he’d slipped up and quickly said, \"Nothing, nothing, but this Junior Brother...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze was cold.","Wang Chen, feeling chilled under Mo Hua’s gaze for some reason, quickly changed tone with a forced smile:","\"...This young brother, ’young’ and talented, really isn’t suitable to go upstairs, please don’t make it difficult for me.\"","Hao Xuan gave Mo Hua a look, asking what to do.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then sighed, \"Then you all go up...\"","After that, he secretly used the Taixu Token to send a transmission to Hao Xuan and the others:","\"Go inside and check out the situation, stay vigilant, don’t fall for their tricks, and if anything unexpected happens, don’t hesitate to make a scene to find a way to get out.\"","\"Also, don’t go looking at those ’nice sights’ or playing those ’fun games’ behind my back; there’s definitely something odd in there.\"","Hao Xuan and the others silently nodded.","Mo Hua then said, \"I’ll wander around Gui Water City, and when you’re done, we’ll return to the sect together.\"","\"Alright.\"","Then, Hao Xuan and the others followed Wang Chen into a bustling and noisy tavern.","Mo Hua could only watch eagerly.","He was extremely curious, wanting to know what was inside the tavern, but others simply wouldn’t let him in.","Mo Hua could only be patient, turning and wandering around Gui Water City.","Gui Water City was quite bustling, with many disciples from the Gui Water Sect.","According to Yu Canghai, the higher-ups of the Gui Water Sect colluded with the Taoist Court, betrayed the Water Prison Sect, and stole the Water Prison Sect’s heritage, establishing the Gui Water Sect, now ranked among the Twelve Streams, on that basis.","Most disciples of the Gui Water Sect practiced the Water System Dao Law and were involved in the path of interrogation, and after graduation, most entered the Taoist Court.","In the city, there were many disciples wearing Gui Water Sect Taoist Robes, their eyes obscure, and their expressions somewhat gloomy.","Besides, there were also some industries of the Gui Water Sect.","The Gui Water Sect’s heritage was related to water, sustaining themselves through water, and their industries were mostly water-related.","There were ferries, spirit boats, as well as taverns, fish markets, and they would even rent out some cave residences built by the water.","Mo Hua wandered around, taking notes as he went, familiarizing himself with the layout of Gui Water City, and then returned to the tavern.","The tavern was called \"Lin Shui Tower.\"","The inside was bustling with noise, and Hao Xuan and the others were still inside, their activities unknown.","Mo Hua sent them a transmission asking, but they didn’t respond.","Mo Hua was a bit unhappy.","He didn’t know if those three idiots had gotten too engrossed or if some formation in the tavern had blocked the Original Magnet signals, preventing them from receiving his messages.","\"Should I go invisibly to take a look?\"","Mo Hua circled the tavern, discovering a high-grade Reveal Concealment Formation set up around it at a significant cost.","If he approached invisibly, he would be discovered.","Mo Hua felt displeased, \"Being so guarded against me? There’s definitely something suspicious inside.\"","As he was contemplating how to sneak in, suddenly the entrance became noisy, and many cultivators came out.","Among the crowd were Hao Xuan and the others.","As soon as they exited the tavern, Mo Hua heard Wang Chen repeatedly apologizing:","\"Brother Xuan, two brothers, I’m really sorry, everything was properly arranged, but unexpectedly, the higher-ups changed plans last minute, ruining the fun for everyone. Here, I sincerely apologize.\"","After speaking, Wang Chen took out a storage bag and handed it to them, \"This is Lin Shui Tower’s treasured wine, along with specially made marinated meat, just small tokens, as an apology.\"","Wang Chen’s attitude was quite humble.","Cheng Mo looked displeased and sneered:","\"What’s a little wine and meat worth? Did we come here for such things? It’s a waste of my time.\"","Cheng Mo was quite unhappy.","Despite what he said, he still accepted the wine and meat.","The three of them parted ways with Wang Chen, leaving the tavern, and then met up with Mo Hua, heading to a teahouse across the street.","Cheng Mo then \"honored\" the marinated meat and fine wine Wang Chen had given them to Mo Hua:","\"Junior Brother, try it.\"","Mo Hua inspected it and found nothing wrong with the wine and meat, so he shared it with everyone to eat.","The wine was excellent, well-aged. The meat was also top-quality, rich in taste with a lasting aroma, usually hard to buy.","It seemed the Gui Water Sect’s apology was quite sincere.","Mo Hua ate the meat and drank the wine, extending his divine sense, observing the lively tea house patrons around, and seeing no suspicious people, then whispered:","\"What did you do inside?\"","Hao Xuan and the others exchanged glances, shaking their heads.","\"Not much, just watched some song and dance...\"","\"Were these song and dance proper?\" Mo Hua asked quietly.","Hao Xuan nodded hesitantly, \"I guess... fairly proper.\"","\"How proper?\"","Hao Xuan seemed uncertain, \"They were all dressed. Does that count as proper?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"That does sound quite proper.\"","\"And then?\" Mo Hua continued to ask, \"That’s it?\"","Situ Jian also nodded, \"It was just song and dance, but I suspect that was just a warm-up. Wang Chen apparently wanted to take us somewhere else...\"","\"But before he could arrange it, a Senior Brother from the Gui Water Sect came over, looking grim, said something to him, and then the whole event was canceled.\"","Mo Hua felt a bit regretful but also puzzled.","Why was it canceled?"]},{"number":1539,"title":"Chapter 1539 - 821: Sneak Attack (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Is it because the Gui Water Sect discovered our ulterior motives?","Or has Water Yama become more vigilant due to previous events?","Or perhaps for other reasons?","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, found no clues, and said, \"Let’s head back first.\"","This is Gui Water City, considered the territory of the Gui Water Sect, and staying here too long made Mo Hua feel uneasy.","\"Alright.\" Hao Xuan and the others nodded.","Leaving the teahouse, they hired a carriage and drove from Gui Water City towards the Taixu Sect.","Sitting in the carriage, Mo Hua continued to contemplate the affairs of the Gui Water Sect.","The carriage passed through the city gate of Gui Water City, leisurely moving forward on the broad road.","Halfway there, Mo Hua, who was frowning and deep in thought, seemed to sense something, his expression changed, and he quickly lifted the curtain to look, his pupils contracting.","In the distance, there was another carriage.","The carriage was enclosed and lavishly decorated, embroidered with colorful flowers of various hues.","A carriage from the Hundred Flower Valley!","It seemed to have just exited Gui Water City, just like their carriage, moving one behind the other.","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat, and he immediately shouted:","\"Cheng Mo!\"","Cheng Mo, who was driving the carriage, turned his head.","Mo Hua pointed at the \"florid\" carriage and said, \"Follow that carriage.\"","Cheng Mo was slightly taken aback but didn’t hesitate and drove the carriage to catch up.","Mo Hua said, \"Keep it low-key, don’t get noticed!\"","\"Oh, okay.\"","Only then did the big guy Cheng Mo pull the reins, slow down the carriage, and silently followed behind that \"flower carriage.\"","The carriage from the Hundred Flower Valley proceeded straight ahead.","Mo Hua and the others, in their carriage, discreetly followed, passing through Tai Xu City, then Tai’a City, circled around a few times, and eventually arrived at Hundred Flowers City.","The flower carriage, exuding a faint fragrance, drove into Hundred Flowers City.","Seeing this, Cheng Mo asked, \"Junior Brother, should we enter the city?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment and said, \"Leave the carriage, we go in on foot.\"","Cheng Mo nodded.","After leaving the carriage outside Hundred Flowers City, they entered the city on foot. Fortunately, the carriage they were following was not moving fast, so Mo Hua and the others managed to catch up.","They continued following until the carriage reached the Mountain Gate of Hundred Flower Valley.","The door of the carriage opened, and four or five women, each wearing the Taoist Robe of Hundred Flower Valley and possessing exquisite beauty, each with their own merits, entered the Hundred Flower Valley together.","They chatted and laughed along the way, but their subtle expressions were a bit nuanced.","Some appeared normal, some seemed downcast, some silently let out a sigh of relief, while others had dim eyes and expressionless faces.","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","\"No Hua Ruyu?\"","He had thought Hua Ruyu would be in the carriage as well.","He then concentrated and memorized the appearance of the female cultivators who stepped out of the carriage before silently sighing inwardly.","It seems the matters of the Hundred Flower Valley are far from over...","Beside him, Hao Xuan, seeing Mo Hua squatting in the bushes with eyes fixed keenly on the female cultivators of the Hundred Flower Valley, couldn’t help but remind:","\"Junior Brother, you better not be like my cousin?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback.","Hao Xuan pointed towards the Hundred Flower Valley, \"You’ll get beaten up, badly.\"","Mainly, it’s embarrassing.","His cousin, Hao Se, had a thick skin since childhood, so it didn’t matter much to him.","But Mo Hua, being the Junior Brother among these Taixu Sect Disciples, couldn’t afford to lose face like that.","\"Don’t worry,\" Mo Hua waved his hand, \"it’s not what you think, and I won’t be caught, anyhow.\"","Hao Xuan thought of Mo Hua’s movement technique and Concealment Technique, and nodded, saying, \"That’s true.\"","To this day, he had never seen Junior Brother caught by anyone.","Seeing the female cultivators who had been on the carriage, all entering the Hundred Flower Valley and disappearing among the vibrant flower bushes, Mo Hua then said:","\"Let’s head back.\"","Even though Hao Xuan and the others didn’t know what Mo Hua was up to, they had gradually grown accustomed to it, trusting whatever Junior Brother said.","However, on the way back, Cheng Mo couldn’t contain his curiosity and asked:","\"Junior Brother, why were you following that carriage?\"","\"I’m investigating a case related to the Taoist Court,\" Mo Hua didn’t hide it, \"but I can’t disclose the specifics right now.\"","\"Investigating a case?\" Cheng Mo’s eyes lit up with interest, \"Are there any merit points involved?\"","Mo Hua’s eyes shifted as he thought carefully and said, \"There’s none from the Taoist Court, but if you help out, I’ll give you some myself.\"","He was now a major holder of Merit Points, earning a considerable amount through Formation Painting, Monster Hunting, and reward commissions.","During that time in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Elder Master Xun had rewarded him with a large sum of merit points on behalf of the Sect.","The Tai’a Sect and the Rushing Void Sect also gave him merit points as a token of appreciation.","With so many merit points, he was initially excited, glancing at the Xun Token now and then, but as the excitement waned, over time, he found it less thrilling.","He hardly checked the number of merit points now, as there were too many, more than he could ever use.","Cheng Mo, knowing Mo Hua was a wealthy holder of merit points, didn’t hold back and said with a smile, \"Thank you, Junior Brother, if you ever need anything, just let me know.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Of course, concerning the matters of Gui Water Sect and Water Yama, it was complicated, and he wouldn’t let Cheng Mo and the others get deeply involved, just letting them do some minor tasks, errands, and gather information.","A valiant warrior is supported by three mighty aides, learning to leverage resources is key.","Going solo would inevitably lead to oversights.","\"This trip doesn’t seem to have yielded much,\" Situ Jian asked, \"What should we do next? Should we head back to the Sect directly?\"","There were indeed some gains, but not significant ones.","Mo Hua mused to himself.","And they were merely \"loose ends,\" requiring considerable effort to investigate further.","Mo Hua pondered for a while, then his eyes sparkled as he turned to Hao Xuan and asked:","\"Hao Xuan, how’s your relationship with your childhood friend Wang Chen?\"","\"We used to be close...\" Hao Xuan felt a bit nervous, whispering, \"Junior Brother, you won’t target him, will you?\""]},{"number":1540,"title":"Chapter 1540 - 821: Knockout Blows (Part 3)","paragraphs":["After all, we’ve been childhood friends, playing together since we were little, there’s still some affection there.","If Junior Brother really takes action, then Wang Chen would be in big trouble.","Hao Xuan understood in his heart, that despite Wang Chen’s stature, even ten of him combined couldn’t withstand Junior Brother’s antics.","Mo Hua asked, \"How is his temperament?\"","Hao Xuan deliberated, \"A bit slick, a bit cowardly, occasionally scheming, but his nature isn’t bad.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"I see, then we’ll take action against him.\"","Hao Xuan’s face turned bitter, \"Junior Brother...\"","\"You don’t understand,\" Mo Hua looked at Hao Xuan and said, \"The situation with the Gui Water Sect is very complex. Once something happens, your childhood friend might really be beyond redemption.\"","\"Taking action against him now is saving him. If we do nothing, that would be truly harming him.\"","Hao Xuan’s expression turned solemn at these words.","He didn’t expect the situation to be so serious. Feeling a bit heavy-hearted, he wanted to ask what exactly was going on, but seeing Mo Hua’s serious demeanor, he wisely refrained.","The greater your abilities, the more secrets you know.","Hao Xuan knew he didn’t have such great abilities, so it was better not to pry into certain secrets.","\"So, Junior Brother, how will you take action?\" Hao Xuan asked softly.","\"What are your requirements?\" Mo Hua asked.","Hao Xuan gritted his teeth and said, \"After all, he’s my childhood friend. It’s best to be gentle and give him some dignity.\"","Mo Hua was slightly taken aback, \"It’s not that serious. Just knock him out and drag him aside to ask a few questions.\"","Hao Xuan breathed a sigh of relief.","Thankfully, it’s just a knockout, no blood...","Mo Hua looked at Hao Xuan and said, \"As for knocking him out, I’ll let Cheng Mo handle it. You and he have a good rapport, and I’m afraid you won’t be able to do it.\"","Surprisingly, Hao Xuan shook his head and said, \"He’s my childhood friend. We’ve grown up together, so I’ll handle the knockout. I won’t trust anyone else with it.\"","Hao Xuan’s expression was very determined.","Mo Hua couldn’t quite discern whether Hao Xuan was worried about Wang Chen’s safety, or simply addicted to the act of \"knocking out,\" afraid someone else might take over his task.","\"Alright...\" Mo Hua nodded.","The group then made a simple plan.","In the evening, Hao Xuan invited Wang Chen out, saying he had something to discuss.","Wang Chen suspected nothing.","As it was still the rest period, and there was no curfew at the Gui Water Sect, he boldly left the sect alone, heading towards the nearby Gui Water City.","As he reached the foot of the mountain, on a secluded, deserted path, Hao Xuan used his movement technique to skillfully circle behind Wang Chen, activated the formation, and knocked him out with a stick.","Cheng Mo and Situ Jian rushed forward, tied up Wang Chen, and dragged him into the nearby bushes.","Mo Hua set up a Small Yuan Magnetic Formation nearby for vigilance, along with a Sound Isolation Formation and other concealed measures, ensuring nothing could go wrong.","Afterward, Cheng Mo slapped Wang Chen awake.","Wang Chen woke up with a throbbing headache, still woozy, and as he suddenly became aware, he instinctively wanted to shout.","Cheng Mo immediately covered his mouth and warned in a hoarse voice:","\"Don’t make a sound, or I’ll be unkind to you.\"","Wang Chen instantly realized he was surrounded by a group of masked \"villains,\" chained up with restrictive formations, unable to move, and quickly understood his situation, nodding obediently.","Cheng Mo released his hand.","Only then did Wang Chen tremble and say, \"Who are you... and what do you want? I’m from the Gui Water...\"","\"Shut up, I ask, you answer!\" Cheng Mo barked fiercely.","Having spent considerable time with Mo Hua, he had learned that during \"interrogations,\" one must be tough and not let the other side ramble.","\"Alright...\"","Wang Chen said timidly.","But as he looked at Cheng Mo, the more he looked, the more familiar he seemed. Looking at the figures beside Cheng Mo, they appeared even more familiar.","Wang Chen, not being a fool, thought through the sequence of events and immediately realized the truth, exclaiming in disbelief:","\"You guys... Brother Xuan?!\"","Behind him, Hao Xuan replied helplessly, \"I told you, the masks were a bit unnecessary. He was bound to recognize us.\"","\"Whether he recognizes us or not doesn’t matter, it’s about respect.\"","\"Take pride in your work.\"","\"One must follow the industry standards...\"","Wang Chen was stunned for a moment, then angrily said, \"Brother Xuan, we’ve done nothing to each other, why are you harming me?\"","Hao Xuan sighed and used the \"explanation\" Mo Hua taught him:","\"It’s not me, it’s... my big brothers here think you are messing with them. You promised to take them to something exciting, but it ended up being a huge letdown...\"","\"Exactly,\" Cheng Mo, tall and burly, grabbed Wang Chen by the neck, growling, \"You punk, are you mocking us? Just a few women writhing up there, plain as water, is that all you’ve got? Do you think this noble family’s son can’t enjoy himself?\"","Recognizing his fault, Wang Chen couldn’t blame Hao Xuan and quickly pleaded:","\"Please, Sir, forgive me. It’s not that I didn’t want to take you, it’s just... something unexpected happened, and the venue was shut down. I had no choice.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes slighted as he gave Cheng Mo a look.","Cheng Mo got the hint and tightened his grip slightly:","\"Still trying to deceive us? Does it suddenly happen just because I’m here? Am I that unlucky?\"","\"Really! I swear! I wouldn’t dare lie!\" Wang Chen swore.","\"Alright,\" Cheng Mo relaxed his grip a bit, \"Tell us, what exactly happened that ruined our fun?\"","\"Well...\" Wang Chen hesitated.","Cheng Mo tightened his grip on his neck again, \"What’s wrong? Can’t make up an excuse?\"","\"No, it’s not an excuse,\" Wang Chen, uncomfortable from being choked, hurriedly said, \"It’s, it’s the Taoist Court.\"","\"The Taoist Court?\" Cheng Mo was a bit surprised.","\"Yes...\" Wang Chen was short of breath.","Cheng Mo eased his grip slightly, \"Explain yourself.\"","Wang Chen gasped for air, coughed a few times, then slowly began to speak:","\"Senior brothers said... the Taoist Court is investigating, the venue was closed, and we were told to keep a low profile, to send off all the guests.\"","Cheng Mo couldn’t help but glance at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua frowned slightly, speaking in a deep voice, \"Why would the Taoist Court investigate? Don’t think we don’t know about the close relationship between your Gui Water Sect and the Taoist Court. Why would they investigate you?\"","Wang Chen gave a bitter smile, \"I don’t know either, but I heard this time it’s not the local Taoist Court, it’s higher up investigating...\"","\"Higher up?\"","Wang Chen trembled and said, \"The Taoist Court.\""]},{"number":1541,"title":"Chapter 1541 - 822: Taoist Court","paragraphs":["Central Dao Court!","Mo Hua’s gaze hardened, asked: \"Why would the Daoist Court come to investigate? What are they investigating? How are they investigating it?\"","Wang Chen’s face was bitter, \"This... you overestimate me, how could I possibly know...\"","Mo Hua thought about it and agreed.","The Daoist Court intervening now must have deeper motives.","Wang Chen, a regular disciple of the Gui Water Sect, probably wouldn’t know either.","\"Then let me ask you again,\" Mo Hua pondered for a moment and continued, \"What are these beautiful and fun things you mentioned? Where are they? What benefits do you gain by bringing us there?\"","Wang Chen replied helplessly:","\"I... I just took a job to earn some merit points.\"","\"My senior brothers said if I bring disciples from the Eight Great Gates and Twelve Streams onto the ship, each head counted for two hundred merit points.\"","\"It’s just a flower boat, where people enjoy food, drinks, and games, nothing bad. Going there could even help form connections with fellow Daoists...\"","Mo Hua sneered, \"It’s fine to fool others, but don’t fool yourself.\"","Wang Chen said nothing.","But after a moment of reflection, his expression became cold, \"You captured me... Do you have other motives? You don’t truly want to board the ship.\"","Mo Hua was somewhat surprised.","This Wang Chen is not actually foolish.","Mo Hua then said calmly, \"Do you dare to listen if I dare to tell you?\"","Wang Chen was stunned.","Mo Hua’s voice was low, \"In this matter, if you don’t know, it’s fine. But if you do, it won’t be long before you find yourself in deep trouble, dying without knowing how.\"","Mo Hua wasn’t lying to him.","Generally, someone like Wang Chen, once they learn a secret, they won’t survive for too long.","That’s how it always plays out in dramatic tales.","Wang Chen didn’t dare question further.","He was born into the Wang family and grew up with Hao Xuan.","The Wang family’s power isn’t as great as the Hao family’s. His status in the family is far from Hao Xuan’s, therefore he has always acted cautiously.","He is aware of certain taboo matters.","But although he stopped asking, it’s clear he doesn’t want to say much either.","Mo Hua glanced at him and said calmly:","\"Let me be honest with you, originally we intended to torture you, kill you quietly, and throw you into the river to feed the Water Demons, without anyone knowing, but Hao Xuan persuaded us otherwise...\"","Hao Xuan was a bit shocked.","I persuaded them? How could I not know?","Mo Hua didn’t blink, continuing to say:","\"Hao Xuan said he grew up with you and couldn’t bear to see you die tragically, buried in a demon’s stomach, and urged us to give you a chance, so we only knocked you out to ask questions. Otherwise, you’d be sunken in the river now...\"","\"Brother Xuan...\"","Wang Chen’s gaze towards Hao Xuan was filled with a touch of gratitude.","Hao Xuan, however, was momentarily unsure of how to react.","\"But...\" Mo Hua’s face turned slightly solemn, \"You should know what you’ve been doing.\"","\"If this continues, not only will you face bad consequences, but you’ll certainly implicate the Wang family, bringing shame to your parents, dying disgracefully...\"","Wang Chen’s face turned pale, \"But, but...\"","He lifted his head, glanced at Mo Hua, and chuckled bitterly, \"The Sect’s atmosphere is like this, what can I do?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"The truth can’t be hidden forever. If Gui Water Sect continues this way, it will end. You need to think carefully...\"","Mo Hua quietly observed Wang Chen, \"Once Gui Water Sect falls, surely a group of disciples will be purged. Do you think you can escape when that time comes?\"","\"This...\"","Wang Chen lifted his head, looking at Mo Hua, discerning his voice and countenance.","Only then did he suddenly realize the person before him was the Taixu Sect disciple he saw earlier, looking attractive and youthful, feeling both surprised and puzzled.","\"But... can you help me?\"","Mo Hua said arrogantly, \"I can’t reveal my true identity to you for now. I can only say that behind me stands the Ancestor; among fellow disciples, my word is law; I have close ties with numerous Elders; and connections within the Taoist Court...\"","Mo Hua exaggerated his influence, embellishing his own image.","But Hao Xuan and the others knew he was speaking the truth.","Wang Chen was also fooled by Mo Hua’s words.","\"If you help me with something, in case Gui Water Sect gets exposed, I can protect you through the Taoist Court.\" Mo Hua stated firmly.","Wang Chen replied hesitantly, \"Really?\"","\"Don’t you trust me, but at least trust Hao Xuan?\" Mo Hua said.","Hao Xuan finally came to his senses, nodded, and sighed, \"We are saving you. If you get too deep, there’s no turning back.\"","Wang Chen was somewhat swayed, \"But, I’m only an ordinary disciple, I can’t do much...\"","\"No worries,\" Mo Hua said, \"It’s just some small matters, won’t trouble you.\"","Wang Chen was still torn, \"Can I... go back and consider it?\"","\"Sure,\" Mo Hua said, \"But you mustn’t tell anyone about today, or it will leak, and no one can save you.\"","Wang Chen nodded.","Mo Hua gave Cheng Mo a glance, and Cheng Mo released Wang Chen.","Wang Chen found it surprising that Cheng Mo really let him go. He glanced at everyone, then nervously left, unsure of what he was thinking.","Watching Wang Chen’s departing figure, Situ Jian frowned and asked, \"Junior Brother, do you think he’ll really help us?\"","\"Doesn’t matter,\" Mo Hua said.","Situ Jian was taken aback.","Mo Hua said, \"If he agrees, it’ll ease things with Gui Water Sect. If not, I have other ways, it might just be more troublesome.\"","\"However, if he doesn’t agree, when things get exposed, he can only hope for the best on his own.\"","Cheng Mo and Situ Jian nodded.","But Hao Xuan seemed a bit uneasy."]},{"number":1542,"title":"Chapter 1542 - 822: Taoist Court (2)","paragraphs":["From the bottom of his heart, he still hoped that his old friend wouldn’t go astray.","Afterwards, the few people returned to the Taixu Gate.","In the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua lay on the bed, still thinking about the events of the day.","Taoist Court...","The Taoist Court and the Taoist Court Official, though only differing by one character, had vastly different meanings.","The Taoist Court unified the Cultivation World for over twenty thousand years, with a terrifyingly deep foundation.","Who knows how many cultivation resources they’ve accumulated, how many cultivation heritages they’ve monopolized, and behind the Taoist Court, who knows how many unfathomable old monsters lurk.","In the Qian Learning State Boundary, though there is a Taoist Court Official.","However, this Taoist Court Official, though under the supervision and jurisdiction of the Central Dao Court, has been infiltrated by major families.","Previously, the Taoist Court also turned a blind eye.","Not sure if it’s a kind of compromise.","Or perhaps, the major families in the Qian Learning State Boundary have people in the Taoist Court, colluding with each other and blinding the public.","But now the situation seems a bit different...","The Taoist Court began investigating the Gui Water Sect, which seemed like a small issue, but might be a trigger.","However...","What exactly does the Taoist Court want to investigate about the Gui Water Sect?","Why did they start with the Gui Water Sect?","How much does the Taoist Court actually know?","Mo Hua thought for half a day, without any clue.","After all, if it’s the Taoist Court Official, he has had some dealings, knows some insights, and has some acquaintances.","But the Taoist Court is like a colossal entity, far above him, completely out of his reach.","\"I need to find someone who knows the inside story...\"","Mo Hua took out the Letter Token again, thought for a while, and felt it was better to ask directly, so he sent a message to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, has someone from the Taoist Court come?\"","He waited for a long time, but Gu Changhuai didn’t reply.","Not sure if he was busy and didn’t see it, or simply didn’t want to talk about the Taoist Court.","But this matter is quite crucial.","Mo Hua considered it and decided to ask in person.","Early the next morning, he left the Taixu Gate and went to the Taoist Court Official in the Qian Learning State Boundary.","At the Taoist Court Official, no one stopped him.","Gu Changhuai had served as a Supervisor at the Taoist Court Official for many years, with considerable prestige.","Ordinary Enforcement Leaders might make things difficult for new cultivators, but Mo Hua was a familiar face and had a good relationship with Gu Changhuai, so naturally, no one dared to trouble him.","There was even an Enforcement Leader from the Gu Family who poured Mo Hua a cup of tea, politely saying:","\"The Supervisor is busy with affairs, young master please wait a moment.\"","Mo Hua politely thanked him, then quietly sat down to drink tea, while secretly observing the cultivators coming and going in the Taoist Court Official.","After drinking about four or five cups of tea, Mo Hua saw Gu Changhuai come out and quickly greeted:","\"Uncle Gu.\"","Seeing Mo Hua’s handsome face, Gu Changhuai’s head involuntarily began to ache.","If it weren’t for being at the Taoist Court Official and having to maintain an image, he would probably have turned and left.","\"What’s the matter?\" Gu Changhuai said indifferently.","\"I sent you a Letter Token, you didn’t respond, so I came to find you.\" Mo Hua said straightforwardly.","Gu Changhuai sighed, just about to say something, when suddenly a cold but clear voice sounded nearby:","\"Supervisor Gu, you seem quite leisurely, still have time to chat here...\"","Mo Hua was a little surprised, looking up, he found that the speaker was a woman wearing a Supervisor’s Taoist Robe.","This woman was tall and beautiful, with a cold expression and a slightly raised chin, exuding an aura of arrogance.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was indifferent, obviously in a bad mood:","\"Why, I can’t even say a few words? Don’t forget, you are a Supervisor, so am I, you have no authority over me.\"","The woman’s expression became colder.","After that, neither of them spoke, staring at each other, eyes equally cold, expressions equally indifferent, creating a slightly tense atmosphere.","Mo Hua sat between the two, looking innocent.","After a moment, he moved closer to Gu Changhuai, lowered his voice and asked: \"Uncle Gu, who is this beautiful sister?\"","Gu Changhuai’s eyelid twitched.","This little brat, spouting nonsense, where did he learn this flattery from?","Outwardly, he deliberately kept his voice low, but in front of a Golden Core expert, who could he fool with this?","The woman across also obviously heard Mo Hua’s words, her expression remained as cold as ever, but her eyes softened when looking at Mo Hua.","No woman dislikes being complimented on her beauty.","What’s more, coming from a pure-intentioned youth, with clear eyes, like a spring breeze, refreshing the heart.","Her voice unconsciously softened as well, \"Little brother, you can’t call me ’sister’, I’m much older than you...\"","Mo Hua curiously asked: \"Then what should I call?\"","Beside him, Gu Changhuai snorted, \"What else can you call, naturally ’aunt’.\"","The woman’s gaze towards Gu Changhuai was now mixed with some killing intent, \"Supervisor Gu, if you can’t speak nicely, you might as well be silent.\"","After finishing, she turned back to Mo Hua and said: \"My surname is Xia, you can call me Xia Canonical Official.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Hello, Xia Canonical Official.\"","Xia Canonical Official slightly nodded and asked: \"You’ve come to the Taoist Court Official, is there something you need?\"","Mo Hua glanced at Gu Changhuai, starting to fabricate a story, \"Elder Gu Hong sent me to call Uncle Gu back to the Gu Family, there’s something at home.\"","Xia Canonical Official was somewhat surprised, \"What is it?\"","Mo Hua looked at Gu Changhuai, then at Xia Canonical Official, hesitating, unsure whether to say or not.","After a moment, he gestured to Xia Canonical Official.","Xia Canonical Official was slightly startled, then understood Mo Hua’s intention, subconsciously leaned over, and heard Mo Hua whisper in her ear:"]},{"number":1543,"title":"Chapter 1543 - 822: Taoist Court (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"Tell Uncle Gu to go on a blind date...\"","Similarly, Mo Hua’s voice was very low, but it couldn’t escape Gu Changhuai’s ears.","Before Mo Hua could finish, anger flashed across Gu Changhuai’s face. Unable to hold back any longer, he grabbed Mo Hua by his collar and marched out of the Taoist Court without looking back.","His back showed a hint of panic and embarrassment.","Xia Canonical Official watched Gu Changhuai’s retreating figure, his eyes flickering, and his expression became somewhat subtle.","...","Mo Hua had grown quite a bit taller, but he was still far from reaching Gu Changhuai’s height.","Moreover, Gu Changhuai was a Golden Core, his body much stronger, and carrying the slender Mo Hua was not at all difficult for him.","When they reached a secluded place, Gu Changhuai finally set Mo Hua down and couldn’t help but say with a cold face:","\"If you talk nonsense again next time, be careful, I won’t be nice to you.\"","Mo Hua simply replied, \"Oh.\"","Gu Changhuai, seeing Mo Hua’s fearless attitude, was at a loss.","These words were just for show.","If he were really \"not nice\" to Mo Hua, Mo Hua would just go \"tell on him,\" lodging a complaint to Wenren Wan or Elder Gu Hong, which would give Gu Changhuai a real headache.","Even though his surname was Gu and Mo Hua’s was Mo.","But in the Gu Family, especially in front of Elder Gu Hong and Wenren Wan, Mo Hua was the one who had the final say.","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"So, what do you want from me?\"","Mo Hua said, \"I told you before.\"","Only then did Gu Changhuai remember the Letter Token matter and said, \"The Taoist Court’s affairs can’t be discussed with you?\"","\"Why?\"","\"Because it’s confidential, and the Taoist Court is no ordinary power. If you really offend their taboo, not only you but even the Gu Family might be obliterated.\"","Mo Hua’s expression slightly stiffened.","However, he was just asking, not actually going to offend any taboo, let alone being obliterated.","After thinking for a moment, Mo Hua’s eyes lit up as he asked:","\"That Xia Canonical Official just now, is he from the Taoist Court?\"","Gu Changhuai remained silent.","Mo Hua, observing Gu Changhuai’s expression, nodded and said, \"It seems so...\"","\"Uncle Gu, you said before, a new Canonical Official came to the Taoist Court, troublesome and difficult to deal with. Is it that Xia Canonical Official you were talking about?\"","After speaking, Mo Hua once again gauged Gu Changhuai’s reaction and received confirmation.","\"Xia Canonical Official, Xia...could this Xia be from a Great Family of the Taoist Court?\"","Gu Changhuai sighed helplessly, \"Yes.\"","He realized that whenever Mo Hua got curious, he was bound to get to the bottom of it. Instead of being evasive, it was easier to just tell him directly.","Gu Changhuai said, \"The Xia family is an ancient family from when the Taoist Court was first established. They have held key positions in the Taoist Court’s central office, the Seven Pavilions, and even the Heavenly Observatory for generations, with Pavilion Elders and Supervisors coming from their ranks.\"","\"The Xia family is truly a giant among families.\"","Mo Hua’s expression turned solemn.","The Xia family was indeed formidable.","\"Then why did the Taoist Court send the Xia family over this time? To investigate Gui Water Sect?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"You know about the Taoist Court investigating Gui Water Sect?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"I just found out.\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t know what to say.","It hadn’t been many days since the Taoist Court started their investigation.","This kid, he had surprisingly quick information.","\"Why is the Taoist Court investigating Gui Water Sect?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, then shook his head, \"Hard to say...\"","\"Hard to say?\"","After contemplating for a moment, Gu Changhuai finally spoke slowly:","\"Within the Qian Learning State Boundary, there are many sects, and the family’s influence is vast. Each family’s Ancestors may have their own calculations and engage in open and covert struggles, but their attitude towards the Taoist Court is consistent: in the Qian Learning State Boundary, the Taoist Court can establish a Court to maintain the Taoist Law, but they cannot directly interfere in internal affairs.\"","\"Unless there’s a case where a family defies or conspires against the Taoist Court, which touches their bottom line, otherwise, the Taoist Court lets things slide.\"","\"Occasionally, when a serious incident occurs, the Taoist Court usually just holds someone accountable and takes some profit from the families, that’s it.\"","\"But, recently, things have been different...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"The Taoist Court seems unwilling to turn a blind eye to the Qian Learning State Boundary anymore.\"","\"Or maybe, they’ve coveted the Qian Learning State Boundary for a long time but never had a good opportunity to intervene.\"","\"But recently, the perfect ’opportunity’ has emerged.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze sharpened, \"What opportunity?\"","Gu Changhuai looked at Mo Hua and asked, \"You are a Sect disciple; you should have gone to Refining Demon Mountain to hunt Monster Beasts, and you should be familiar with the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, right?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"The Valley of Ten Thousand Demons?!\"","Gu Changhuai nodded, hesitating a moment, just about to reveal the secret to Mo Hua, but suddenly stopped, \"You wouldn’t...already know, would you?\"","Mo Hua was silent for a moment, then slowly nodded.","\"How much do you know?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","\"I should...more or less, know everything...\" Mo Hua said softly.","Across the entire Qian Learning State Boundary, except for Mr. Tu and that mysterious gentleman, nobody knows the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons better than he does.","Those monster cultivator stewards might have known, but they are all dead.","Gu Changhuai’s eyelids twitched.","The affairs of the \"Valley of Ten Thousand Demons\" were only something he’d heard from the Gu Family Clan Leader.","The higher-ups kept this matter extremely secretive, leaking only a few scraps of information.","But now, Mo Hua claimed he knew it all, which meant...","\"You...didn’t enter the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, did you...\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Sort of...\"","But it wasn’t just as simple as entering.","He had wandered around the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons for God knows how long.","A vast majority of monster cultivator stewards were eliminated by him, their Divine Souls erased.","The family’s wealth of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, those tens of thousands of Demon Wraiths, were devoured by him completely.","Of course, these details couldn’t be revealed."]},{"number":1544,"title":"Chapter 1544 - 822: Taoist Court_4","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai couldn’t have expected this.","Even so, he silently took a deep breath, feeling somewhat incredulous.","This kid, how is it that trouble follows him everywhere...","It’s so uncanny.","\"What happened with the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai calmed himself and sighed, \"The matter of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons is precisely the opportunity...\"","\"This affair has serious negative repercussions. Although it was eventually suppressed, it gave the Taoist Court an excuse to directly send people to station in the Taoist Court, to conduct inspection...\"","Gu Changhuai’s face looked somewhat unpleasant, \"...which is that Xia Canonical Official of the Xia family.\"","Mo Hua slowly nodded.","In this world, there are consequences to every action.","He had thought the matter of the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons was over, but little did he expect it to secretly lead to this series of changes.","It not only extended the hand of the Taoist Court into the Qian Learning State Boundary.","It also attracted this \"Xia Canonical Official.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled and asked, \"The Taoist Court’s intervention, what impact will it have on the Qianxue State?\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression was somewhat grave: \"That’s the unpredictable part, they might just be going through the motions, inspecting for a while and then leaving; it could also be they’re secretly investigating some truth; or perhaps, they want to take this opportunity to infiltrate their power into the Qianxue State Boundary...\"","\"In any case, this is just the beginning.\"","\"It means, the Central Dao Court is also stepping into the game...\"","...","Until Mo Hua left the Taoist Court and returned to the Disciple’s Residence, Gu Changhuai’s words lingered in his mind.","The Taoist Court entering the fray.","Whether it’s good or bad is unknown...","Mo Hua frowned.","However, the grand schemes of such a colossal entity like the Taoist Court should have little to do with him, at least it’s not something he needs to worry about.","Mo Hua gathered his thoughts and pondered over the matter of Water Yama again.","The most important thing now is to capture Water Yama as soon as possible.","Capturing Water Yama, and inquiring about the extermination of the Yu Family’s water village, and especially matters related to \"sacrifice,\" is needed to find the altar that would advance his Divine Sense.","But Mo Hua soon realized, with the clues he currently possessed, it’s very difficult to find Water Yama, let alone capture him.","The main issue is the limited time he has, and the restrictions of his cycle rest, which makes it impossible to personally investigate many matters.","In this way, slowly unraveling the mystery, even if he could catch Water Yama, who knows how long it would take.","Too slow.","Even if he could wait, Elder Master Xun, on the other side, concerning major events about the Sect’s prosperity or decline, probably couldn’t afford to wait.","Mo Hua quietly pondered for a moment, gradually forming an idea in his mind.","One must have self-awareness.","If it’s something you can’t achieve, then honestly borrow strength.","A gentleman is of no different nature, but is good at utilizing things.","\"The people who can help with this matter, Uncle Gu, Yu Canghai, Senior Sister Qianqian from the Hundred Flower Valley, and Wang Chen from the Gui Water Sect, are all part of the plan...\"","\"But it’s still not enough...\"","\"Still missing a stronger ally.\"","\"And that ally is...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened, \"The Taoist Court!\"","\"The Taoist Court’s strength is unfathomable, it’s truly a colossal entity.\"","\"Within the Qianxue State Boundary, if the Taoist Court wants to do something, they need not fear anyone’s hindrance or reprisal.\"","\"Now, the Taoist Court wants to set up, investigate the Gui Water Sect, so I’ll hitch a ride, and lure Water Yama into the Taoist Court’s net, then fish in troubled waters.\"","\"Moreover, I can take the opportunity to build a good relationship with some of the Taoist Court’s factions.\"","\"Any faction, not just families and Sects, also including the Taoist Court, internally is very complex.\"","\"There are different interests, entanglements, and objectives, it’s not absolutely united.\"","\"Building good relations with some factions within the Taoist Court, in case I ever touch on some colossal taboo and face the iron-blood suppression from the upper Taoist Court, I won’t be completely isolated.\"","\"However...\"","Mo Hua pondered, \"How can I connect with the Taoist Court?\"","Mo Hua thought and thought, but could only think of one person.","He took out the Letter Token and sent a message to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, no need to worry about Instructor Hua’s side anymore, there’s no result, use your free time to interact more with Xia Canonical Official...\"","Gu Changhuai, having interacted with Mo Hua for a long time, was influenced by Mo Hua, and occasionally used Magnetic Ink to manifest some strange symbols to express his emotions.","At this moment, he sent Mo Hua a big question mark."]},{"number":1545,"title":"Chapter 1545 - 823: Xia Canonical Official","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai was at a loss for words.","This kid, what on earth is he talking about?","Get in touch with that woman surnamed Xia?","What a joke...","Women are nothing but trouble, out of sight, out of mind. How could he possibly approach her on his own, unless something was wrong with his head?","Gu Changhuai thought to himself sarcastically.","Mo Hua then brought out the \"old excuse,\" \"It’s all for the investigation, for the truth!\"","Gu Changhuai: \"Say something practical.\"","Having spent so much time with Mo Hua, he was now immune to these so-called \"righteous\" words.","\"Alright then,\" Mo Hua sighed, \"I realize that on our own, we probably can’t catch Water Yama.\"","\"This is the Second Grade State Border, and Water Yama is powerful, his methods are strange, and what’s more troublesome is that he’s skilled in water nature skills...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned.","Though unwilling to admit it, he knew in his heart that Water Yama might be even more troublesome than Fire Buddha.","In terms of sheer strength, Water Yama couldn’t match Fire Buddha.","In a head-to-head confrontation, Water Yama definitely wasn’t a match for Fire Buddha.","But catching Water Yama, or killing him, was even harder than taking on Fire Buddha.","Fire Buddha’s strength lay in his boundless, beast-like spiritual power, and his unbeatable fire-series forbidden techniques.","In the same realm, in a direct fight, Fire Buddha feared almost no cultivator.","But Water Yama walked a \"strange\" path; his Taoist skill was ruthless, his movement technique ghostly, and his pupil skill mysterious.","Most troublesome of all was his affinity with water.","If on land, it wouldn’t be so bad.","But once Water Yama swims into Mistwater River, with the additional water nature boost, his power increases greatly.","With this, he could stir up trouble as he pleased, coming and going freely, and no one could do anything about it.","Finding a cultivator who practices water nature skills, with water nature and strength comparable to Water Yama, was nearly impossible.","Gu Changhuai sighed.","That’s just how cultivators are.","Cultivation is the foundation of everything, but it’s not everything.","Having cultivation without enough experience, depth in strategy, understanding of Taoist skills, proficiency in many branches of Tao cultivation, or means to apply one’s cultivation, one would still face obstacles everywhere, feeling helpless and at a loss in situations.","\"So, you want Xia Canonical Official to help?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Yes.\"","\"But she’s with the Taoist Court, who knows what she’s thinking.\" Gu Changhuai was a bit wary.","Mo Hua said, \"Uncle Gu, didn’t you say before that Court Officials from the Taoist Court should follow the Taoist Law, be pragmatic, catch who needs to be caught, kill who needs to be killed, and act impartially...\"","\"Since that’s the case, as long as we act according to the Taoist Law, and can catch Water Yama and eliminate this scourge together, why worry about Xia Canonical Official’s identity or motives?\"","Gu Changhuai was taken aback, pondered it carefully, and found there seemed to be some reason in it.","The Taoist Court Officials naturally belonged to the Taoist Court.","And though the Gu family was a family, it came from an official’s lineage, inherently different from other industrial-like families.","The Gu family’s house rules have always emphasized following the Taoist Law and acting impartially.","Given that, no matter what motives the Taoist Court has, as long as they follow the Gu family’s house rules, it should be fine.","Gu Changhuai suddenly realized something.","This could be the \"clear stream\" path the Gu family follows.","Abide by the Taoist Law, act according to principles.","That way, they neither collude with other families nor flattery the Taoist Court.","Because even the Taoist Court might not necessarily abide by the Taoist Law...","Gu Changhuai frowned.","Such a \"clear stream\" would inevitably arouse envy, perhaps even make enemies everywhere.","But this is the path the Gu family chose.","To persist in this path, although full of obstacles and hardship, abandoning it could lead to \"annihilation of the family\" in no time once its roots and bones are lost.","Sometimes before, he would think the Family Head’s ways were too pedantic, but now upon close reflection, he slightly understood some of the Family Head’s painstaking efforts.","After a moment of contemplation, Gu Changhuai said, \"Alright!\"","Mo Hua was a bit surprised.","He hadn’t expected Uncle Gu to agree so quickly.","He hadn’t even finished his prepared speech.","But it’s good that Uncle Gu figured it out himself.","Though Mo Hua also didn’t know what exactly he had figured out...","\"Then, Uncle Gu, find some time to meet with Xia Canonical Official.\" Mo Hua took advantage of the opportunity.","Gu Changhuai didn’t speak, but deep down he was still somewhat resistant.","\"No worries, I’ll go too when the time comes.\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Why are you going?\"","If I don’t go, you two will probably end up sitting there coldly staring at each other...","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","\"I also have important matters to discuss with Xia Canonical Official.\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, \"Alright then...\"","It’s good if Mo Hua goes too; if it were up to him alone, he really wouldn’t want to see that woman surnamed Xia.","Women are too troublesome.","\"It’s just that even if I invite her, she may not be willing to come out.\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"No worries, Uncle Gu, just try inviting her.\" Mo Hua said.","Mo Hua had thought it over and felt that Uncle Gu inviting Xia Canonical Official was highly likely to succeed.","In terms of identity, they were both Court Officials.","Uncle Gu had been a Court Official at the Qian Learning State Boundary for over two hundred years; having handled countless cases and dealt with countless Sin Cultivators.","Although Xia Canonical Official backed by the Xia family had the Taoist Court to rely on, she was new to the Qian Learning State Boundary and unfamiliar with its internal workings.","In such a situation, she certainly wouldn’t mind consulting Uncle Gu for information.","On the other hand, to be honest, Uncle Gu is at least quite handsome.","Men like beautiful women.","And in this world, there’s no woman who doesn’t like a handsome young man.","Therefore, Uncle Gu’s good looks shouldn’t be wasted; they should be put to good use."]},{"number":1546,"title":"Chapter 1546 - 823: Xia Canonical Official (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai was unaware of the many little thoughts turning in Mo Hua’s heart, so he could only say: \"Alright, I’ll give it a try...\"","Thus, Gu Changhuai went to give it a try.","A few days later, Gu Changhuai sent a transmission to Mo Hua: \"Xia Canonical Official agreed. Are you free tomorrow evening?\"","Tomorrow evening?","Mo Hua thought for a moment, tomorrow after classes, he had to teach Yu Er the Formation, but teaching the Formation wasn’t urgent.","Mo Hua then said: \"I’m free.\"","\"In Tai Xu City, there’s a Gus’ Restaurant, come around 5 p.m.\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"Gus’ Restaurant? Is it the Gu family’s establishment?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua agreed.","The next day, after finishing classes, Mo Hua assigned some Formation tasks to Yu Er, then left Taixu Gate, and headed to Gus’ Restaurant in Tai Xu City.","The restaurant was decorated in an ancient style.","Elegant yet not lacking in opulence, opulent yet restrained.","Upon seeing this, Mo Hua guessed that Aunt Wan must be overseeing the arrangements.","Upon entering the restaurant, a waiter came forward, but before saying a few words, a surprised voice said: \"Is it Young Master Mo?\"","Mo Hua looked up and saw a chubby, smiling man, resembling a manager, a Golden Core Cultivator, bowing respectfully towards him.","He looked somewhat familiar, but Mo Hua couldn’t recall who he was.","The manager then said: \"I am the steward at the Gu Family, and also the manager of this restaurant. I have seen you at the Gu family’s banquet, Young Master.\"","Mo Hua courteously replied: \"Greetings, Manager Gu.\"","Manager Gu smiled and asked: \"Young Master, are you here to dine alone or to attend a banquet?\"","\"Uncle Gu invited me,\" Mo Hua replied.","Manager Gu was slightly startled, then nodded slightly, thinking it was no surprise that even Master Gu Changhuai, usually aloof and unapproachable, would invite Young Master Mo for a meal.","Manager Gu then smiled and said: \"Master Changhuai indeed instructed, and has reserved a room. Let me guide you there.\"","Mo Hua bowed and said: \"Much obliged.\"","Manager Gu then led Mo Hua to a quiet and elegantly decorated room on the second floor.","Mo Hua lightly scanned the room with his Divine Sense and found formations set around it to prevent eavesdropping and disturbances.","At the moment, the room was empty, and Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official hadn’t arrived yet, nor were any dishes served; the table was bare, with only a pot of tea.","Manager Gu then said: \"Young Master, please sit for a while.\"","\"Alright!\"","Mo Hua nodded, then found a spot that looked pleasing, cool, and in a favorable \"feng shui\" position to sit.","Manager Gu glanced at Mo Hua, then at the somewhat empty table, and softly said: \"Shall I serve you some dishes first?\"","\"Let’s wait for Uncle Gu together,\" Mo Hua replied.","\"It’s fine,\" Manager Gu said, \"it serves as my ’meeting gift’ to Young Master. No need to be polite.\"","Manager Gu’s hospitality was hard to refuse, and Mo Hua’s stomach was indeed hungry, so he agreed smoothly:","\"Then I’ll trouble Manager Gu.\"","Manager Gu smiled and said: \"Just a moment, Young Master.\"","After he withdrew, it wasn’t long before dishes were served.","Though called a \"meeting gift,\" they were all exquisite dishes with full color, aroma, and taste.","When Gu Changhuai, with a cold expression, entered with the equally cold Xia Canonical Official, they saw Mo Hua already happily feasting on the spread before him.","Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but ask: \"Why did you start eating first?\"","\"I was hungry,\" Mo Hua confidently replied, \"Besides, Manager Gu treated me.\"","Gu Changhuai sighed.","This kid, no matter where he goes, can easily become familiar with the place.","Even at the Gu family’s restaurant, the manager would give him special treatment.","Gu Changhuai shook his head and could only find a place to sit, pouring himself a cup of tea.","Xia Canonical Official also took her seat.","She came here to discuss proper matters, so naturally wouldn’t care about the food and drinks.","However...","She glanced at Mo Hua, then at Gu Changhuai, her heart curious.","These days, she had gained some understanding of Gu Changhuai.","This person was cold, solitary, rigid, tactless, had poor interpersonal skills, a bad temper, was hard to approach with a distant demeanor towards everyone...","Only his appearance barely considered pleasing.","Apart from this, cold and hard, like a stone.","The only one who could truly anger him, and even cause him to lose his composure a bit, was this boy at the table, munching on a chicken leg.","And Gu Changhuai’s attitude towards this boy was also very peculiar...","It was evident that Gu Changhuai’s attitude towards him wasn’t quite friendly, sometimes even impatient, and his words weren’t particularly polite.","But even if Gu Changhuai was angry, he showed great restraint.","Even with impatience, he seemed to have no way of dealing with this boy.","Even perhaps... a bit apprehensive?","Xia Canonical Official slightly furrowed her brow, lost in thought.","\"Sister Xia, this chicken leg is very delicious, have a taste...\" Mo Hua handed a chicken leg to Xia Canonical Official.","One chicken, two chicken legs.","Mo Hua ate one, leaving the other for Xia Canonical Official.","Gu Changhuai watched silently from the side.","Xia Canonical Official appreciated Mo Hua’s kindness, but as she was also Canonical Official, her temperament was cold, so she said lightly: \"Thank you.\"","\"Also,\" Xia Canonical Official corrected, \"Call me ’Xia Canonical Official.’","\"Mhm, Xia Canonical Official,\" Mo Hua replied.","After they sat, Manager Gu served the dishes.","These dishes were arranged by Gu Changhuai.","As a member of a prominent family, the dishes were refined and exquisite.","Of course, in Mo Hua’s eyes, it was a bit \"extravagant.\"","But food is innocent, so Mo Hua still ate.","Xia Canonical Official only sampled a few bites, then put down her chopsticks and asked Gu Changhuai: \"Supervisor Gu, why did you invite me here? What do you want to discuss?\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t speak, and continued to drink his wine."]},{"number":1547,"title":"Chapter 1547 - 823: Xia Canonical Official (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The expression of Canon Xia gradually turned unfriendly.","Mo Hua sighed, a bit helpless, and said:","\"Canon Xia, do you know Water Yama?\"","Canon Xia’s expression shifted slightly, but only for a moment, then returned to normal, \"What about Water Yama?\"","Mo Hua observed her expression, suspecting she might know something, but wasn’t sure how much she actually knew.","Mo Hua concisely said, \"Uncle Gu also wants to capture Water Yama, he wants to team up with you.\"","Canon Xia pondered for a moment, then said thoughtfully:","\"Although Water Yama is a scourge and deserves to be punished, what the Taoist Court currently needs to focus on is not Water Yama.\"","\"Aren’t you investigating the Gui Water Sect? Water Yama has close ties with Gui Water Sect.\" Mo Hua said.","Upon hearing this, Canon Xia was stunned for a moment, then her gaze turned slightly cold, looking at Gu Changhuai, she sneered:","\"Supervisor Gu, how dare you casually talk about the affairs of the Taoist Court?\"","Gu Changhuai took a sip of wine, snorted coldly, \"I didn’t say anything.\"","\"If you didn’t say, how would this kid know?\" Canon Xia’s gaze was sharp.","Gu Changhuai said blandly, \"I didn’t say, yet he knows all the same. He likely knows more about the affairs within the Qianxue State Boundary than you, the Supervisor...\"","Canon Xia first sneered, then upon seeing that Gu Changhuai wasn’t intending to speak further, she was a bit taken aback. She turned her head to glance at Mo Hua, unable to resist asking:","\"You...\"","Mo Hua said, \"My surname is Mo, my name is Mo Hua, a disciple in the Middle Phase of Foundation Establishment at the Taixu Gate.\"","\"Surname Mo?\" Canon Xia was a bit surprised, \"You’re not named Gu?\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","\"Mo...\" Canon Xia mused for a moment, puzzled, \"Near the Qianxue State Boundary, there doesn’t seem to be any Great Family with the surname Mo...\"","\"I’m not a noble family’s son, I’m a Loose Cultivator.\" Mo Hua said truthfully.","\"Loose Cultivator!\"","Even Canon Xia, who was always cold, had a noticeable change in expression.","A Loose Cultivator?","She was truly from a Great Family in the Taoist State, although she knew that in this world, Loose Cultivators were the most numerous.","But she was born and raised in the Taoist State, and almost without exception, all her interactions were with members of noble families or Great Sects.","Loose Cultivators do exist, but there are only a handful who can carve out a place for themselves in the heart of the Taoist Court without becoming a servant or underling.","At the very least, she had only heard of them, never actually met one.","In the Qianxue State Boundary, none who could cross the sect’s threshold as Loose Cultivators were very few and far between.","Canon Xia scrutinized Mo Hua again, discovering that although his appearance was somewhat naive and playful, his demeanor was certainly not ordinary, which astonished her even further.","\"How did a Loose Cultivator like you join the Taixu Gate?\"","She remembered that the Taixu Gate was still one of the Eight Great Gates in the Qianxue State Boundary.","\"This is a long story...\" Mo Hua sighed.","To really tell it, one would have to start with the matter of Yu Er, so he chose not to speak of it further.","Mo Hua immediately got to the main point, \"In my hand...\"","He thought for a moment and brought Gu Changhuai into the conversation as well.","\"... In the hands of my Uncle Gu and I, there is a clue to Water Yama, but Water Yama is at the Peak of Foundation Establishment, proficient in water system skills, elusive in Mistwater River, making capture extremely difficult.\"","Canon Xia frowned, \"How is it that you have a clue about Water Yama in your hand?\"","Mo Hua’s expression was humble, but his tone carried a bit of \"arrogance\" as he said:","\"Sister Xia, to be honest, in the vicinity of the Qianxue State Boundary, I barely count as a ’minor local tyrant,’ I know more or less about the happenings nearby.\"","Canon Xia stared at Mo Hua with a blank expression.","When she first encountered Mo Hua at the Taoist Court, she thought he was merely a pampered and lively little master from the Gu family.","How, in the blink of an eye, did he become a \"local tyrant.\"","Canon Xia turned to glance at Gu Changhuai, seeing his indifferent expression, she understood that Gu Changhuai evidently agreed with this statement, which left her even more incredulous.","Yet, she was still somewhat skeptical, so she asked:","\"How much do you know about Water Yama?\"","Mo Hua understood that Canon Xia was testing him, to see if he truly knew some inside information.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then said:","\"Water Yama, at the Peak of Foundation Establishment, practices Water Prison Sect techniques, wields the Water Punishment Whip, proficient in Water Shadow Step, his eyes can condense Evil Qi, executing strange pupil skills.\"","\"The Taoist Court’s record on Water Yama is scant, but this man has killed countless, undoubtedly having committed numerous murders early on.\"","\"And over a year ago, the Yu family’s water stronghold downstream of Mistwater River was exterminated by Water Yama’s hand...\"","...","Mo Hua recounted some of what he knew.","The more Canon Xia listened, the more shocked she became.","Many things she already knew beforehand, but there were news, she hadn’t heard from any source yet...","Canon Xia looked at Mo Hua, her heart slightly shaken, and asked:","\"How did you know all these?\"","Mo Hua smiled cheerfully, without responding.","Canon Xia paused for a moment in silence, then didn’t ask further.","She then solemnly said, \"I’ll ask you one last question... You probably have no vendetta with Water Yama, so why do you want to capture him?\"","Mo Hua’s gaze flickered slightly.","To say there was no vendetta, wasn’t quite accurate.","At least Water Yama probably already harbors a grudge against him.","He likely thought Mo Hua was a \"remnant of the Water Prison Sect,\" wanting to kill him at all costs.","Of course, that wasn’t the main reason.","Some things weren’t convenient to mention.","Mo Hua put on an upright expression and said:","\"I am a disciple of the Taixu Gate, taught by the sect to uphold integrity, devote myself to the way, take the elimination of demons as my duty. Water Yama is full of evil deeds, deserves death without remorse, if not executed, more cultivators would inevitably fall victim to his hands.\"","\"Thus, capturing Water Yama and putting him in the Taoist Prison to face the punishment he deserves is the responsibility of every cultivator with a righteous heart!\"","Mo Hua spoke with great excitement.","Gu Changhuai held his forehead with his hand.","This kid, up to it again...","Canon Xia, however, upon seeing Mo Hua’s righteous expression, seemed to be moved somewhat.","She thought it over, nodded, and said:","\"Alright, we can team up to catch Water Yama together!\"","Mo Hua was overjoyed, thus poured Canon Xia a cup of wine, then raised his glass and said:","\"It’s a deal!\"","Canon Xia laughed, seeing his expression \"It’s a deal.\"","When the two of them raised their glasses, they silently looked towards Gu Changhuai on the side.","Gu Changhuai wore a look of impatience.","Mo Hua tugged on his sleeve, \"Uncle Gu, only you remain.\"","Gu Changhuai hesitated for a moment, then slowly raised his wine glass, clinking it with Mo Hua and Canon Xia.","The three made an agreement from that day forth.","But after finishing the meal and leaving Gu’s Restaurant, Gu Changhuai still did not forget to throw a cold blanket over Mo Hua.","\"She is someone from the Taoist Court, and a member of the Xia family.\"","\"The Taoist Court is strict, noble families are indifferent, each with their own share of cunning, her agreement might not harbor truly good intentions.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"I know, Uncle Gu, don’t worry.\"","Gu Changhuai glanced at Mo Hua, then said no more.","Later, Canon Xia took the opportunity to give Mo Hua a Letter Token for ease of communication.","Now, Mo Hua possessed two Letter Tokens from Dao Court Supervisors, one from Gu Changhuai, the other from Canon Xia.","Mo Hua used the Letter Token to relay some clues to Canon Xia.","And with the backing of the Taoist Court and the Xia family, Canon Xia’s power and capabilities were not insignificant, within a few days, she had again caught a trace of Water Yama.","She didn’t hold back, telling Mo Hua all the information she had found.","Mo Hua looked at the map of the Mistwater River with the circled and dot-marked spots, his gaze flickered.","The plan to hunt down Water Yama could begin..."]},{"number":1548,"title":"Chapter 1548 - 824: River Bandits","paragraphs":["The power of the Taoist Court is immense, the relationships are intricate, and the intelligence network is very strong. Although for the truly hidden secrets, it may not reach such depths, at least by utilizing \"official\" means, the surface clues are investigated in great detail.","This also saved Mo Hua a lot of trouble.","If he were to search for these things himself, investigating one by one, there likely wouldn’t be much progress in a few months.","\"Indeed, the methods must be flexible, and occasionally one must learn to take shortcuts.\"","\"Clinging to the Taoist Court’s thigh is not necessarily impossible...\"","Mo Hua nodded and then began to focus on the map of the Mistwater River he held.","The map marked the locations where the Water Yama had previously appeared, as well as the areas along the Mistwater River he might have been active in.","Mo Hua didn’t know how Xia Canonical Official had managed to find out.","But considering Xia Canonical Official’s backing by the Taoist Court, uncovering these things didn’t seem surprising, at least it was within Mo Hua’s expectations.","The Water Yama is a big fish.","Next, a net can be set up to catch this big fish.","On the Mistwater River map, there were many places circled and dotted.","These spots may just be small areas on the map, but placed upon the vast Mistwater River, they represented a large stretch of the river territory.","\"The area is still too large; it needs to be narrowed down more.\"","In Mo Hua’s mind appeared his understanding of the Mistwater River, judging the locations where the Water Yama had appeared at ferry crossings, pondering on the Water Yama’s personality and habits, and at the same time, merging all the clues previously found...","All these became the causes.","Mo Hua’s gaze was deep, his Divine Sense flowing, deducing the effects from these various \"causes.\"","On the Mistwater River map, strands of cause and effect lines faintly appeared, sketching into a net.","Without the Heavenly Secret Skill or any guidance from predecessors, Mo Hua could only use objective facts and his intuition and experience to explore the use of the Heavenly Secret Technique bit by bit like this.","After a short while, cause and effect lines stretched along the river, overlapping with some markings.","Mo Hua noted down all these places and then forwarded them to Xia Canonical Official.","\"Sister Xia...\"","\"Call me ’Xia Canonical Official.’\" came the Transmission from the other side.","\"Oh, Xia Canonical Official,\" Mo Hua said, \"according to my information, these places on the map are very suspicious.\"","In the Taoist Court, Xia Canonical Official, who was busy with tasks by candlelight, slightly frowned, \"How did you know about these places?\"","I calculated it...","Mo Hua silently thought.","Of course, he couldn’t say that.","Mo Hua vaguely said, \"I don’t know either, someone else told me.\"","Xia Canonical Official shook her head slightly, sending a Transmission, \"Alright, I’ll find a time to personally go to the Mistwater River for a look.\"","A line on the map is a stretch of river in reality.","Without personally seeing it, it indeed is difficult to understand the inside story.","\"Xia Canonical Official, it would be best to go the day after tomorrow,\" Mo Hua suggested.","\"Why?\" Xia Canonical Official was puzzled.","\"Because the day after tomorrow is my rest day,\" Mo Hua said frankly.","Xia Canonical Official was silent for a moment, raising her brows slightly, \"You want to go together too?\"","\"Mm!\" Mo Hua said.","\"But... you’re only in the Foundation Establishment Middle Stage; it’s quite dangerous,\" Xia Canonical Official had some concerns.","\"No worries,\" Mo Hua said, \"I’ll bring Uncle Gu along, he will protect me.\"","Xia Canonical Official’s expression turned strange.","This child spoke as if Supervisor Gu was his bodyguard...","Gu Changhuai, bodyguard...","Xia Canonical Official thought of Gu Changhuai’s cold demeanor and inexplicably felt he was quite suitable for being a \"bodyguard.\"","\"Alright,\" Xia Canonical Official said.","\"Thank you, Xia Canonical Official,\" Mo Hua said joyfully.","So two days later, it was the rest day.","Early in the morning, Mo Hua had already packed up, hired a carriage, and went to Qingzhou City.","To cover his tracks, he didn’t go to the Gu Family but waited at a teahouse in Qingzhou City.","This was the agreed-upon place.","At the teahouse, Mo Hua looked up and found that Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official had already arrived early.","Both were experienced Supervisors, and both were decisive in action. If it were not for being delayed by Taoist Court affairs, they were always very punctual in their actions.","But although they had arrived early and sat at the same table, each of them had ordered a pot of tea, drinking on their own without saying a word.","They looked like two strangers who were as unfamiliar as passers-by.","Mo Hua shook his head and sighed.","Stone doesn’t get it.","The iron tree doesn’t bloom either.","It’s really worrisome.","Mo Hua walked up, greeted the two, had a simple drink of tea, ate some pastries, then all three stood up and left.","After confirming no one was following, the three hired a discreet carriage, left Qingzhou City, and headed downstream along the Mistwater River.","Near a downstream ferry, Gu Changhuai rented a small boat.","The three took the small boat and paddled toward the depths of the Mistwater River.","The Mistwater River basin is broad, with many branches diverging from top to bottom, the water formations are also intricate and complex.","Many ferocious water demons lurk below the riverbed.","Mo Hua had previously only stayed by the banks of the Mistwater River; sitting on a small boat paddling to the middle of the Mistwater River was a first for him.","The boat’s edge pressed against a patch of emerald green river water, and looking around, there were waves as far as one could see, stretching endlessly, without land, without roads.","Mo Hua found it novel, but as the boat swayed on the water, he also felt a peculiar sense of discomfort.","The three, while paddling, followed the river lines sketched out by Mo Hua’s cause and effect Calculation on the Mistwater River map, drifted downstream, and at the same time released their Divine Sense, searching for clues.","The sun slowly rose, and the sunlight became gradually brighter, casting the river water into a dazzling mirror-like brilliance that was somewhat blinding.","The three searched for a while and indeed discovered something.","\"There are some shallow shoals between the rivers, with footprints on them.\"","\"There are some water demon corpses soaking in the water, already rotten, but the wounds on the bodies are very strange, as if pierced through the chest by someone using a powerful Evil Artifact...\""]},{"number":1549,"title":"Chapter 1549 - 824: River Bandits (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"There’s a strong scent of blood nearby...\"","\"There are some remnants of a spiritual artifact, sunk at the bottom.\"","...","\"There should be a group of Sin Cultivators around here, but...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned.","But with the vast Mistwater River and its raging currents, most traces are concealed, making it impossible to track these people’s whereabouts.","The surrounding waterways are also very complicated, with interlacing tributaries, stretching as far as the eye can see, so it’s hard to know which direction to investigate.","While puzzled, a small boat came from the distance.","On the boat were a few Fish Cultivators, wearing conical hats, enduring the sun, and casting their nets.","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, \"Shall we ask them?\"","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official pondered for a moment and nodded.","As the fishing boat approached, the three of them boarded and met it.","The two boats met. Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official greeted briefly and then asked:","\"Are there any suspicious cultivators around?\"","There were four Fish Cultivators on the boat, fishing. Seeing Gu Changhuai and the others, they looked somewhat nervous and shook their heads repeatedly.","Xia Canonical Official asked a few more questions but didn’t get much information.","After that, these Fish Cultivators cupped their hands in respect but didn’t say anything else and cautiously poled away.","Mo Hua sighed, \"Uncle Gu, Xia Canonical Official, you won’t get anything by asking like this. Even if they know something, they won’t tell you.\"","Both are Taoist Court Supervisors, naturally carrying authority, and they are Golden Core Cultivators.","Mo Hua is familiar with them, so it might not seem much.","But to these ordinary Fish Cultivators, Gu Changhuai and the others are considered \"mysterious\" figures. Encountering them on the vast and empty Mistwater River, these Fish Cultivators are inevitably fearful and dared not speak much.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was indifferent.","Anyway, this is his demeanor; he won’t change.","Xia Canonical Official also slightly frowned.","She was born into the Xia family and rarely interacted with these grassroots Loose Cultivators.","Mo Hua sighed and said, \"Let me ask.\"","After a while, another fishing boat came.","Mo Hua stood at the bow, greeted them, and when the boat approached, he jumped on and cheerfully said, \"Hello, big brothers,\" and then took out some spiritual wine and dried meat to give them, saying he and his group were traveling to visit relatives but got lost and didn’t know which way to go, so they wanted to ask for directions on the waterway.","His gaze was clear, appearance handsome, figure not tall, not appearing aggressive, and with a gentle demeanor, he seemed amiable, easily earning good favor.","Moreover, he offered spiritual wine and meat.","To the Fish Cultivators, these are good things.","In no time, the Fish Cultivators on the boat warmly welcomed Mo Hua.","Mo Hua sat with them, drinking and eating, chatting amicably for a while, and when he said goodbye, these Fish Cultivators affectionately called Mo Hua \"little brother\" and invited him to visit their homes.","Mo Hua gave them another pot of wine and waved goodbye.","Back on his boat, Mo Hua nodded and said:","\"I found out everything!\"","Xia Canonical Official and Gu Changhuai were somewhat astonished.","Mo Hua recalled the conversation just now, pointed to the river ahead, and said:","\"The river forks here, invisible to the naked eye, but within these dense water plants, there are four or five more channels, making it easy to hide tracks.\"","\"There indeed are suspicious cultivators nearby.\"","\"According to these big brothers, there’s a group of murderous river pirates, elusive in these waters, killing anyone they see.\"","\"But this group only appears at night, so the Fish Cultivators nearby rush to finish fishing by day and hurry back when the sun sets.\"","\"If it’s late at night, going by water and encountering these river pirates, one’s life might be forfeit here.\"","Xia Canonical Official frowned, \"If they encounter river pirates, why don’t they report it to the Taoist Court?\"","Mo Hua helplessly said, \"Even if reported, it wouldn’t help. This isn’t an Immortal City. Many Fish Cultivators don’t even have a Cultivator Registration. The Taoist Court doesn’t want to manage it, and even if they do, the river conditions are too complex to act.\"","Xia Canonical Official was somewhat stunned.","The Taoist State is almost all Immortal Cities, with strict control over cultivator registration, making such situations rare.\"","She turned her head, silently glancing at Gu Changhuai, and coldly said:","\"This shows that the Taoist Court in the Qianxue State Boundary is incompetent and ineffective.\"","Gu Changhuai coldly said, \"Don’t forget, you are now also a Canonical Official of the Qianxue State Boundary Taoist Court.\"","The two exchanged cold stares.","Mo Hua nodded.","Indeed.","These two have made progress in their relationship, as they now bicker.","Afterwards, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official exchanged a few more reproaches and then ceased hostilities.","They are, after all, Supervisors and know the importance of the situation.","The immediate priority is to find Shui Yama.","Xia Canonical Official looked at the intricate waterways ahead, pondered for a moment, and with a slight focus in her eyes, said:","\"I’ll go back and bring more people. Starting from here, we’ll search through each channel and examine this entire water body.\"","Gu Changhuai, however, said, \"No rush; too many people and you’ll alert the enemy.\"","Xia Canonical Official looked unfriendly, asking Gu Changhuai:","\"Then what do you suggest?\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, his eyes twinkling slightly, and nodded towards Mo Hua, saying:","\"Ask this kid.\"","Xia Canonical Official was taken aback, her expression puzzled, \"Mo Hua?\"","Mo Hua originally wanted to remain low-key, but now seeing the situation, he couldn’t afford to be.","Capturing Shui Yama is crucial.","\"That Water Demon’s body, is the residual sword fragment still there?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai handed a crimson sword fragment to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua placed the sword fragment at the bow of the boat, then sat cross-legged, concentrating.","Xia Canonical Official silently watched, not knowing what Mo Hua intended, and just as she felt curious, she suddenly noticed Mo Hua’s demeanor abruptly shifted from clear and sunny to deep and eerie."]},{"number":1550,"title":"Chapter 1550 - 824: River Bandits (Part 3)","paragraphs":["It’s as if...","From a familiar young man, he turned into an unknowable evil monster.","At the same time, a mysterious aura spread from Mo Hua.","Moments later, the strange atmosphere dissipated, and Mo Hua’s expression returned to normal. He pointed to a waterway in front of him and said, \"Turn right at the middle, and you can find the owner of the broken sword...\"","Xia Canonical Official’s expression slightly shook.","\"So this is... finding the way?\"","She looked puzzled, thought for a moment, and then her pupils shrank as she exclaimed:","\"Heavenly Mechanism Skill?!\"","Gu Changhuai was also startled upon hearing this, and quickly looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua, however, asked in confusion, \"What is the Heavenly Mechanism Skill?\"","Xia Canonical Official looked into Mo Hua’s clear eyes, a little surprised, \"You don’t know what the Heavenly Mechanism Skill is?\"","Mo Hua nodded.","He actually knew a little bit.","But what he knew was something he had guessed and cobbled together, summarized purely from experience.","It’s a wild method, not something elegant or respectable.","The true, systematic, academic Heavenly Mechanism Skill, he had no idea about.","So claiming not to know what the Heavenly Mechanism Skill is wasn’t a false statement.","Xia Canonical Official frowned, \"Then what were you just using?\"","Mo Hua blinked, \"It’s something I learned back home in Li State from an old Taoist who was passing by, wearing tattered clothes but kind-hearted and benevolent-faced.\"","\"It’s a divination pathfinding method that can use divine sense perception to ’divine’ the correct path, making it easier to find people or things lost in the mountains.\"","Mo Hua spoke with great seriousness.","Xia Canonical Official herself was also clueless about the Heavenly Mechanism Skill, having heard only a little about it, and after some thought, found Mo Hua’s words reasonable.","The so-called \"divination pathfinding method\" should be some folk-level, lower-tier Heavenly Mechanism Technique circulated among lower-level cultivators.","Occasionally, it can perceive some minor causes and effects, but compared to true Heavenly Mechanism Skill, it’s like clouds and mud.","As for the old Taoist, shabby clothes, kind-hearted, benevolent face...","That also seemed plausible.","There are indeed many experts or quirky alchemists in the cultivation world who like traveling.","It’s normal for them to master some strange spell points.","Xia Canonical Official secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","She thought, how could someone at the mere Foundation Establishment Realm learn the Heavenly Mechanism Skill...","But Xia Canonical Official still cautioned Mo Hua:","\"This kind of spell point, don’t use it recklessly in front of others in the future, nor divine carelessly...\"","\"Why?\" Mo Hua asked.","Xia Canonical Official said solemnly:","\"Even though it’s just a simple minor causal spell point, the word ’cause and effect’ is involved, which can overly deplete divine thought, and it’s easy to cause fluctuations in one’s own fortune. The most severe is that if you ’divine’ the cause and effect of some powerful cultivators, you might provoke experts and suffer causal backlash, and you are only at Foundation Establishment...\"","Xia Canonical Official looked at Mo Hua with concern, \"...This severe causal backlash is something you, a child, cannot withstand.\"","There is actually causal backlash...","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart, nodded solemnly.","He then thought about how, along the way, he seemed to have calculated a lot of causes and effects, yet he hadn’t seemed to provoke any \"experts\" or suffer any causal backlash.","He didn’t know whether he was lucky, or if his master had secretly arranged some means of protection.","In any case, he decided to be more cautious in the future.","However, for now, the matter of the Water Yama should be fine, at least regarding causes and effects, there shouldn’t be too many concerns.","After that, the three drove the boat, quietly moving forward along the waterway divined by Mo Hua.","The further they went, the more complex the river became, making it harder to discern direction.","This area was downstream, with silt accumulation, and occasionally there were shoals overgrown with waist-high weeds.","So, as the small boat moved forward, it often had to stop.","Mo Hua would take out the broken sword and divine again, then re-determine the direction.","Xia Canonical Official silently watched Mo Hua, feeling more and more puzzled as she did.","All heavenly mechanism causality and even divine thought skills consume divine sense, especially those involving the heavenly mechanism path and causal calculations, which consume even more divine sense.","But this young boy, after so many divinations along the way, still hadn’t exhausted his divine sense.","Just how deep was his divine sense?","Xia Canonical Official was a little shocked.","Of course, no matter how strong Mo Hua’s divine sense was, it couldn’t be used indefinitely.","Moreover, such calculations involve two types of heavenly mechanism algorithms, which are quite difficult.","After a few more calculations, Mo Hua’s divine sense was almost depleted.","But in front of them were still clumps of water plants, and the surroundings were dim and obscure, with no sign of people or any other clues.","Mo Hua then patiently sat down for meditation, to recover his divine sense.","About an hour later, Mo Hua opened his eyes, with his divine sense mostly restored.","But he didn’t dare to calculate anymore.","Heavenly secret tricky calculations amplify heavenly secret calculations, which damage the Sea of Consciousness.","He had already calculated too many times, and his Sea of Consciousness felt faintly painful.","Divine sense can be restored through meditation, but damage to the Sea of Consciousness cannot.","Furthermore, waterways are different from land routes, especially in such complex water zones, where pathfinding through heavenly secret calculations is much more challenging.","Mo Hua sighed.","This Water Yama really knows how to find a place to hide.","Gu Changhuai saw Mo Hua’s face slightly pale and asked softly, \"Are you okay?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"It’s okay, it’s just...\"","He looked at the water plants, mud flats, and shallows before him, the mixed and varied waterways, and said helplessly:","\"It seems it won’t work today...\"","Xia Canonical Official looked up at the sky and said:","\"It’s getting late, and if these water bandits are active at night, we’ll easily be discovered if we delay until evening.\"","\"Moreover, at night it’s pitch black, the river is dangerous, and water demons appear, which might be risky...\"","There was nothing for the two Golden Cores to fear.","The danger was for Mo Hua.","After all, Mo Hua was only at the Foundation Building Middle Stage, with weak Blood Qi, and facing dangers at night, he might not survive.","Gu Changhuai then said, \"Let’s head back first, and return tomorrow.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","But he felt somewhat reluctant in his heart.","Having come this far, they now had to turn back.","Although they could return tomorrow, some things are better done sooner rather than later, who knows what might change after a day.","As Mo Hua was pondering this, Gu Changhuai had already turned the boat around, and the small boat drifted leisurely back the way they came.","After a moment of sailing, Mo Hua suddenly froze, as if sensing something unusual, and quickly closed his eyes, extending his divine sense to its fullest to perceive everything around.","Soon, a faint, intermittent sound reached his ears.","\"Benefactor...\"","Mo Hua paused, and following the sound, he looked down.","He then discovered along the edge of the boat, a small silver fish, frantically wagging its tail, chasing after his small boat.","\"...Little Silver Fish?\""]},{"number":1551,"title":"Chapter 1551 - 825: Little River God","paragraphs":["\"Uncle Gu, stop.\"","Mo Hua immediately shouted.","Gu Changhuai stopped the boat, turned his head in confusion, and saw Mo Hua leaning over the side of the boat, sticking his head into the water, looking at something unknown.","At the same time, Mo Hua lowered his voice and quietly called out:","\"Little Silver Fish~\"","The Mistwater River was a jade-like expanse, its depths invisible.","After a while, a glint of silver flashed across the surface, and a small, thin fish, almost imperceptible, swam up.","\"Benefactor, I’m here...\"","It wagged its tail joyfully.","It really was the Little Silver Fish!","Mo Hua’s expression lit up with delight, then he asked in confusion: \"Weren’t you in the small fishing village? How did you end up here?\"","The Little Silver Fish said something, but its voice was so faint that it was hard to make out.","Mo Hua leaned his head closer to the water’s surface and only then heard the Little Silver Fish’s soft voice saying:","\"...Thanks to you, benefactor... I have a shrine to reside in, offerings to fill my belly, and incense to nurture my spirit. I am much better now.\"","\"The River God’s authority has also recovered somewhat, allowing it to merge with the Mistwater River, but the authority is still weak, and the range of activity is limited...\"","\"This section of the river is near the small fishing village.\"","\"I sensed your presence while enjoying the incense in the small fishing village, so I swam over to see you...\"","The Little Silver Fish swam back and forth in the water before Mo Hua, occasionally splashing water, indeed looking much more lively.","Mo Hua nodded.","So that’s how it is...","The nearby Mistwater River routes were intricate and confusing, difficult to navigate, and he hadn’t expected this place to be so close to the small fishing village.","But thinking about it, it seemed reasonable.","The Water Yama led the group of Evil Cultivators to destroy the Yu Family’s water fortress, and they also chased Elder Yu near the small fishing village.","So the place where they were stationed should not be far from the small fishing village either.","Xia Canonical Official saw Mo Hua leaning at the edge of the boat, head close to the water, muttering who knows what, and couldn’t help but ask in confusion:","\"Mo Hua, who are you talking to?\"","Because her Divine Sense hadn’t undergone Dao Hua, she couldn’t see the Little Silver Fish.","Mo Hua turned his head, put his finger to his lips as if to say \"shhh,\" and whispered:","\"Sister Xia, keep your voice down, I’m chatting with the Little River God...\"","The Little Silver Fish’s voice was very soft; a little noise and he wouldn’t be able to hear it.","Xia Canonical Official: \"...\"","Her train of thought momentarily drifted, unable to understand what Mo Hua was talking about.","What Little River God?","Xia Canonical Official glanced at the water surface, but there was nothing there.","She also glanced at Mo Hua, frowning.","A perfectly good child, why suddenly so strange...","On the other hand, Gu Changhuai was already used to seeing such things.","It’s just that...","Gu Changhuai’s gaze slightly narrowed.","He couldn’t tell if Mo Hua was telling the truth or if he just made up an excuse to fool them.","Based on his understanding of Mo Hua, both scenarios were possible.","Mo Hua knew things that ordinary cultivators didn’t, could see things others couldn’t, so Gu Changhuai wasn’t actually surprised.","If Mo Hua were lying and making stuff up, he wouldn’t be surprised either.","Mo Hua definitely wasn’t lying.","At this moment, he leaned over the side of the boat and softly asked, \"Little Silver Fish, do you know the way?\"","The Little Silver Fish nodded, \"I know all the nearby waters.\"","\"Then do you know if there are any water bandits nearby?\"","\"What’s a water bandit?\" The Little Silver Fish wagged its tail curiously, \"Is it a Water Demon?\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua thought for a while and replied, \"It’s a human, and a bad person at that, carrying a bloody aura with killing taints on their hands.\"","After Mo Hua said this, the Little Silver Fish got excited and nodded repeatedly.","\"There are some people; their auras are filthy, both fishy and foul, and they are haunted by killings... They gather together, and I’m afraid of getting dirty, so I don’t dare approach.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened, \"Take me there, I’ll help cleanse their sins.\"","\"Mm-hmm,\" the Little Silver Fish nodded repeatedly, \"I’ll take you there now.\"","Although it didn’t know how to cleanse sins exactly, since benefactor commanded, it was naturally willing to comply.","It’s rare to have a chance to repay benefactor’s kindness.","The Little Silver Fish was quite joyful.","It wagged its little tail and swam forward, saying in a soft voice, \"Benefactor, follow me quickly.\"","Mo Hua nodded, then pointed in the direction the Little Silver Fish swam, saying to Gu Changhuai: \"Uncle Gu, this way.\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment.","Mo Hua then said, \"The Little River God knows the whereabouts of the water bandits; it will lead the way for us.\"","The Little River God...","Gu Changhuai turned his head and glanced at the empty water surface, silently sighing.","\"Alright then...\"","Hopefully, this kid isn’t joking.","Gu Changhuai habitually followed the direction Mo Hua pointed and rowed the boat forward.","Xia Canonical Official watched but didn’t stop him.","However, her internal confusion grew deeper, and the way she looked at Mo Hua became more perplexed.","The Little Silver Fish wiggled its small body, leading the way in the water.","Mo Hua followed the faint silver glow to guide Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai rowed the boat, Xia Canonical Official remained silent, and only the sound of the boat breaking the water, the water murmuring below the hull, was heard.","The Little Silver Fish was the River God; though it had only recovered a small part of its authority, it still knew its domain exceptionally well.","No one knew Mistwater River better than it did.","And naturally, no one was better suited to lead the way.","After some time passed, and they entered a new stretch of water, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official suddenly sensed something, their expressions changing.","They released their Divine Sense, scanning around, then couldn’t help exchanging glances in surprise.","They had actually found it...","Meanwhile, the Little Silver Fish also stopped, turning back to say to Mo Hua:","\"Benefactor, we’re here.\"","Mo Hua looked up, seeing a vast riverbank before him.","The riverbank was overgrown with wild grass."]},{"number":1552,"title":"Chapter 1552 - 825: Little River God (Part 2)","paragraphs":["But Mo Hua knew this was not a simple riverbank, but rather a small island formed by accumulated silt from the river over many years.","The surrounding marshes resembled a natural maze, isolating this island.","Without the guidance of the Little Silver Fish, other external cultivators would never see this island.","Mo Hua scanned the island again carefully.","The island’s outskirts were overgrown with water plants, looking desolate and deserted, but Mo Hua could perceive the presence of many cultivators within the island.","These presences carried a bloody and sinister aura, clearly not people of virtue.","In addition, there was the aura of formations.","Near the island, there were numerous formations set up without surprise, including warnings, traps, and a number of water and earth defensive formations.","\"A group of water bandits is unlikely to set up formations, so these formations should have been set up by... the Gui Water Sect for them?\"","Mo Hua frowned and then turned to ask:","\"Now that the water bandits have been found, what should we do?\"","Xia Canonical Official pondered for a moment, glanced at Gu Changhuai, and slowly said:","\"According to the information, there are no Golden Cores among this group of water bandits. Shall we two join forces and try to capture them?\"","Gu Changhuai thought for a moment, shook his head, and said, \"We can’t capture them...\"","\"This is a Second Grade State Border, a small area, unlike those Great Province Boundaries where cultivation in your Taoist State needs no reservations.\"","\"In a Second Grade State Border, a Golden Core Realm match requires rigorous suppression of one’s cultivation without the slightest neglect.\"","\"Do you have experience in suppressing your cultivation to engage others?\"","Gu Changhuai asked.","Xia Canonical Official was stunned, frowned, and replied somewhat reluctantly, \"No...\"","\"That’s it,\" Gu Changhuai said, \"suppressing cultivation is constraining; one can’t exert much of their cultivation power, making it impossible to capture this group of water bandits, and there’s a risk of falling into their traps if careless.\"","\"Golden Core suppressing Foundation Establishment happens when unrestricted.\"","\"When it truly comes to a fight, every aspect must be considered, making the outcome unpredictable.\"","\"Moreover, Water Yama is not as simple as you think.\"","\"This person is no ordinary Foundation Establishment; his skills are mysterious and unpredictable. Without an advantage in cultivation, capturing him with a restraining method is no simple task...\"","After Gu Changhuai finished speaking, he pointed to the island, \"Moreover, this island is surrounded by water. If these water bandits are defeated, they can escape into the water. Since neither of us practice Water Nature Skills, how can we catch them?\"","\"This is their lair. If planned properly, it’s a great opportunity to catch this group of water bandits all at once. Conversely, acting rashly with oversight will undoubtedly waste this opportunity...\"","\"It’s easy to lose an opportunity, but trying to find it again, might be as hard as reaching the sky...\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression was indifferent, and his tone was not polite.","Uncertain if it was to vex Xia Canonical Official, Gu Changhuai, who usually didn’t speak much, suddenly became quite talkative.","Xia Canonical Official’s complexion indeed frosted over.","Though she understood some of the reasoning.","But having little experience handling cases in such a Low Grade State Realm, she hadn’t noticed until being explicitly and implicitly ridiculed by Gu Changhuai.","Xia Canonical Official was indeed a bit angry, but she soon calmed down, looking at Gu Changhuai with a somewhat unfriendly gaze but then sincerely said:","\"Then according to Supervisor Gu, what should we do?\"","Her tone was calm, without any other emotion, purely inquisitive.","Gu Changhuai’s eyes hesitated, showing some surprise, and after a momentary silence, his tone unconsciously became gentle:","\"First, we should scout the enemy, ascertain their numbers, confirm if there are any Golden Cores, and thoroughly verify the local terrain before returning to mobilize our forces and plan properly...\"","\"The more critical the moment, the less we should rush for merit.\"","Xia Canonical Official’s eyes flashed slightly, glanced at Gu Changhuai, and nodded slightly.","Mo Hua stood to the side, alternately looking at Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, nodding approvingly.","After discussing, it was time for specific reconnaissance.","It was already late, dusk had fallen, and the sky was gradually darkening.","The three of them took a small boat, using the lush water plants for cover, and circled the island.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were Golden Cores, with powerful divine senses.","Mo Hua, although at Foundation Establishment, had a divine sense approaching Foundation Establishment Peak, only one pattern away from Golden Core.","Though this pattern was currently beyond reach.","But that is compared to a Golden Core.","In comparison with this group of Foundation Establishment water bandits, Mo Hua’s divine sense was naturally \"far ahead.\"","Thus, the three were careful, but not afraid of being discovered.","The island was also sparsely lined with outposts, but due to the large difference in divine senses, Mo Hua could discover these outposts, yet these outposts couldn’t detect Mo Hua and the others.","Additionally, the Little Silver Fish was guiding them.","The formations set as alerts in the water were identified by Mo Hua.","So until after more than an hour, the three completed their reconnaissance without alarming the water bandits on the island.","By then, night had fallen.","The night merged with the water, and both the sky and the water were pitch black, with only a few stars twinkling in the sky.","The originally silent island suddenly came alive with noise.","A little green fire ignited.","Then came the sounds of shouting, laughing, and cursing, the noise drawing closer from the inside of the island towards the shore.","After that, came the sound of boats entering the water.","The voices and sounds of water mixed together, creating quite a racket.","\"Damn it, finally night has fallen...\"","\"I wonder what we can loot.\"","\"Haven’t killed anyone for days, even my blade is rusting.\""]},{"number":1553,"title":"Chapter 1553 - 825: Little River God (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"I haven’t been with a woman for a month either, I’m getting rusty...\"","\"Screw you, no manners...\"","...","A group of people noisily boarded the boat and set off, lighting green ghostly fires, resembling yakshas at night, patrolling the Mistwater River.","Gu Changhuai silently counted the heads.","Once this group of water bandits sailed far away, the surroundings returned to silence.","Gu Changhuai said: \"The ones who went out, roughly more than two hundred people. According to the habits of water bandits, they generally send out half, leaving the other half. There are probably around two hundred water bandits left on the island.\"","\"In total, there should be around four hundred.\"","\"At present, there are no Golden Cores. Of course, it’s also possible that the Golden Core is not on the island.\"","Meanwhile, Mo Hua had roughly completed the topographic map of the island’s Formation.","\"Should we go back now?\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment, then shook his head and said, \"No rush, let’s wait until dawn. This group of water bandits is roaming the Mistwater River. If we go out now, we’ll easily run into them.\"","\"At that time, killing is not an option, nor is not killing.\"","Killing them would alert the enemy.","If not killed, with the nature of these water bandits, they won’t give up easily.","Thus, the three waited on the small boat.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official took turns keeping watch.","Mo Hua, on the other hand, took out a small blanket and wrapped himself tightly, lying down in the cabin to sleep, letting his Divine Sense sink into his Sea of Consciousness, practicing the Formation on the Taoist Stele.","The Dao of Formations emphasizes persevering effort, hence diligence is necessary.","Nothing should interrupt the practice of Formations unless absolutely necessary.","As for safety issues.","In the Second Grade State Border, with two Golden Core Realm Supervisors acting as bodyguards, Mo Hua was quite at ease.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official watched the Mistwater River with vigilance, then turned their heads to see Mo Hua curled up in the cabin, sleeping peacefully like a little cat, prompting a sigh from both.","This child truly has a big heart.","In this situation, how is he able to sleep?","Both silently stared at Mo Hua for a moment, then looked up simultaneously and, meeting each other’s eyes, were momentarily stunned, before silently looking away without saying a word.","Thus, Mo Hua practiced Formations all night.","As dawn approached, Mo Hua opened his eyes, neatly folded the small blanket, stored it in the Storage Bag, then took out a jug of fruit wine, and began eating two pieces of jerky.","While eating, he noticed two gazes watching him.","Mo Hua grabbed another handful of jerky, handed it over, and said, \"Uncle Gu, Sister Xia, would you like some?\"","\"Go ahead and eat...\"","Both of them had complex expressions.","\"Oh.\"","Mo Hua didn’t insist.","Once he finished breakfast on time, the sky had already brightened with the dawn. Sounds came from afar as the water bandits returned.","Their faces were undisguised excitement, with blood on them, unsure whether it was human blood or water demon blood.","Dozens of boats returned laden with loot.","Some carried blood-drenched water demon corpses.","Other boats were heavily laden, packed with gold-encrusted Storage Boxes, seemingly plundered from merchant ships.","Several other boats had fresh corpses, both male and female, piled together like dead fish, purpose unknown.","Xia Canonical Official turned pale, her gaze icy, murder intent flickering in her eyes.","Gu Changhuai glanced at her silently and softly said, \"Don’t act impulsively.\"","Xia Canonical Official didn’t respond, but her fingers turned white from gripping tightly.","Thus, under the cover of rivergrass, Mo Hua and the others silently watched the water bandits return to the island.","They seemed somewhat unsatisfied.","\"Dawn again, damn it, not yet satisfied.\"","\"I hardly did anything...\"","\"Damn Taoist Court dogs, it’ll be good when they’re all dead so we don’t have to hide like this.\"","\"Or if there were no sun, and all twelve hours were nighttime, there would be nothing to worry about...\"","\"Damn sun, it’s up again...\"","Mo Hua, with equally cold eyes, watched the swaggering water bandits and silently thought:","\"Don’t worry, soon you won’t see the morning sun again...\"","...","After the water bandits entered the island, Mo Hua and the others waited a while longer, and seeing no movement around, quietly rowed away.","The Little Silver Fish led the way, guiding Mo Hua and the others safely to the shore.","As he stepped onto solid ground, feeling the \"ground beneath his feet,\" Mo Hua’s heart inexplicably felt much more at ease.","He turned his head, approached the bank, and waved to the Little Silver Fish by the river, saying:","\"Thank you this time, go back early, next time I come to visit, I’ll bring you something tasty.\"","The Little Silver Fish cheerfully twirled twice, said \"Goodbye, benefactor,\" and transformed into a silver light, swimming into the depths of the Mistwater River, melding with the waves, disappearing without a trace.","Gu Changhuai followed Mo Hua’s gaze, seeing nothing, frowned, and couldn’t help asking:","\"Were you talking to the River God? Why does it sound like talking to a ’pet’?\"","Mo Hua replied, \"I have a good relationship with the River God. Besides, Uncle Gu, your words are disrespectful to the River God. Be careful next time you’re on a boat; the River God might capsize it.\"","Gu Changhuai shook his head, somewhat helpless.","Later, they returned to Qingzhou City and discussed matters in a private room at the Gu Family teahouse.","Since returning, Xia Canonical Official had an unpleasant expression, her gaze icy as she coldly said:","\"Not a single bandit cultivator should be spared!\"","\"And that Water Yama is also deserving of death!\"","\"I’ll go gather people now and capture these villains within three days!\"","Gu Changhuai, having no objections this time, merely reminded her:","\"Though your Xia family is a Great Family, here is the Qian Learning State Boundary, and three days may not be enough.\"","\"And hurriedly gathering people, some may not be reliable...\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze was slightly focused.","Xia Canonical Official replied: \"No problem, leave the manpower to me.\"","Seeing her composed demeanor as if confident, Gu Changhuai said no more.","\"Also, concerning the Formation...\"","Gu Changhuai continued: \"It needs to be discreetly stripped off from the island’s Formation without alerting anyone...\"","\"Furthermore, preferably set Formations around the island to trap the water bandits. Otherwise, at the time of a mixed battle, the bandits might escape in all directions, and we won’t be able to handle it all, potentially letting some slip through.\"","\"If other water bandits escape, it’s not too problematic, but if Water Yama escapes, it’ll all be for nothing.\"","Xia Canonical Official pondered for a moment, frowning as she said:","\"It may not be that simple...\"","\"I’ve observed the island’s terrain before; it seems barren and crude but contains a layout of the Eight Trigrams. Its embedded Formation is divided into Eight Gates.\"","\"This Eight Gates, instead of being for defense, is more for escape. As long as the water bandits are on the island, unless completely blocked, there will always be a Life-gate for them to flee.\"","\"How do you plan to break the Formation or blockade it?\" Xia Canonical Official turned to Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai fell silent.","How could he know how to break the Formation or blockade it?","His knowledge system of Tao Cultivation was almost \"insulated\" from Formations.","Of course, not entirely \"insulated.\" He could still recognize the Formations commonly used by most cultivators and knew some basic principles of Formations.","In the past, he thought he \"knew a little\" about Formations.","But that was all in the past.","Gu Changhuai silently glanced at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua accepted Gu Changhuai’s \"plea for help\" and nodded, saying:","\"Sister Xia, rest assured, leave the Formation matter to me!\""]},{"number":1554,"title":"Chapter 1554 - 826: Eight Trigrams and Eight Gates","paragraphs":["\"Leave it to you?\" Xia Canonical Official looked at Mo Hua with a skeptical expression and couldn’t help but say, \"You’re a Formation Master, too?\"","\"Don’t I look like one?\" Mo Hua replied.","Xia Canonical Official scrutinized Mo Hua for a moment and shook her head slightly.","Mo Hua was indeed very young.","A truly accomplished Formation Master, even if not with a head full of white hair, would mostly be middle-aged.","Some young array geniuses, though they have remarkable formation achievements at a young age, often have insufficient experience.","Lacking practical experience, they can only talk about strategies on paper.","The problems involved in the Taoist Court cases concerning formations are real-world issues.","When dealing with them, experience is often more important than talent.","The formation encountered this time was rather complex, integrated with the island, involving the offensive and defensive efforts of many cultivators, demanding even more rich formation experience and insight.","As for Mo Hua...","Xia Canonical Official looked at Mo Hua and frowned.","If he hadn’t said he was a Formation Master himself, others would never have guessed it.","Furthermore, even at the Foundation Building Middle Stage, with some formation talent, he could at most draw some primary second-grade, twelve to thirteen-pattern formations.","Such formations wouldn’t be of much use.","And moreover...","Xia Canonical Official sighed, \"Array Formation, capturing water pirates, isn’t as simple as being able to draw formations.\"","\"From how things stand now, we might even need to customize a batch of formation media to match the formations...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, \"I have a way with that too!\"","\"You...\" Xia Canonical Official frowned, \"aren’t you a loose cultivator?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"but I’m quite well-connected, know a few more people, and among them happens to be a third-grade Artifact Refiner.\"","Xia Canonical Official fell silent, turned to glance at Gu Changhuai, and found him calmly sipping tea. His demeanor seemed to confirm Mo Hua’s words, leaving her surprised.","Gu Changhuai had a poor temper, aloof nature, and especially harsh words.","Yet now, he had no objections to what Mo Hua said.","This signified that he had absolute trust in Mo Hua’s abilities, at least in formations...","Xia Canonical Official was perplexed.","A little cultivator at the Foundation Building Middle Stage, what kind of formation abilities could he possess to earn such belief from Gu Changhuai, a Golden Core Cultivator from a family background, serving as a Court Official at the Fifth Grade Taoist Court?","Xia Canonical Official wanted to agree with Mo Hua to see if he truly had such formation strength.","But this matter was crucial.","If it got messed up, she wouldn’t be able to explain it to her uncle upon returning.","Seeing her hesitating expression, Mo Hua was understanding and said after some thought:","\"Sister Xia, how about I take some time to draw up the Formation Diagram first and send it to you for a look. If you think it’s okay, then I can proceed to customize the formation media, arranging and setting up the formations.\"","\"This...\" Xia Canonical Official pondered momentarily and nodded, \"could work, though there may not be much time.\"","\"One day, I’ll send it to you by tomorrow!\"","Mo Hua vowed confidently.","\"One day?\"","Xia Canonical Official was taken aback, somewhat doubtful, \"Isn’t that too rushed...?\"","\"One day is enough!\" Mo Hua strived to assure.","Catching the Water Yama was also a major event for him, and he wasn’t at ease leaving it to others.","Only then did Xia Canonical Official nod slowly, \"Alright, let’s see your Formation Diagram once it’s done.\"","She kept some leeway, not really agreeing.","Mo Hua didn’t mind, but upon remembering something, he added, \"There’s also another issue... Customizing spiritual tools might require a considerable amount of Spirit Stones.\"","Xia Canonical Official stated, \"The Taoist Court will reimburse.\"","Mo Hua’s expression brightened with a smile, \"Great!\"","He had also pulled in a large number of orders for Master Gu over there.","Without wasting any more time, Mo Hua greeted them and returned to the Taixu Gate to start designing the Formation Diagram for the hunt against the water pirates.","Xia Canonical Official watched Mo Hua’s departing figure, turned to Gu Changhuai, and asked:","\"Are you really assured, leaving the formation matters to Mo Hua?\"","Gu Changhuai raised an eyebrow slightly.","Why not?","If I can’t draw formations, who else should I entrust but him?","Yet such words that would undermine Mo Hua’s prestige and exalt his own difficulties, he wouldn’t utter.","\"Does your Xia family have any reliable Formation Masters in the Qianxue State Boundary?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","Xia Canonical Official nodded, \"Yes, our Xia family’s own Formation Master.\"","\"Third Grade?\"","\"A Third-Grade Array Master isn’t easy to invite, and for such matters, a second grade suffices,\" Xia Canonical Official said.","\"That’s the case,\" Gu Changhuai stated plainly, \"if it’s merely a Second Grade Array Master, you might as well go directly to Mo Hua. If he can’t solve it, it’s unlikely others can either.\"","Xia Canonical Official was momentarily stunned.","After speaking, Gu Changhuai got up and left.","Xia Canonical Official watched Gu Changhuai leave in silence, a slight change in her expression.","She previously assumed that Mo Hua was a descendant or nephew of Gu Changhuai, and thus, despite his poor temper, Gu Changhuai was still being tolerant.","However, it seemed the situation was quite different.","Gu Changhuai likely regarded Mo Hua with high esteem, maybe even treating him as an equal...","That said, it was still impossible for her to pin the crisis of eradicating water pirates entirely on Mo Hua, a little cultivator she had only met a few times.","Upon returning, Xia Canonical Official also contacted a few Second Grade Array Masters from the Xia family.","She didn’t specify what needed to be done, simply showed them the Formation Method Map around the nearby island.","Yet, before the Xia family’s Formation Masters could form any clues, Mo Hua had already handed over the planned Formation Diagram to Xia Canonical Official through Gu Changhuai.","Xia Canonical Official glanced at it once and her pupils constricted.","Taking advantage of Mo Hua’s free time after class, she set up a meeting in Tai Xu City.","Mo Hua explained some of his formation thoughts to her:","\"I spent some time researching after returning, meanwhile checking formation classics and confirming with my Sect Instructor...\""]},{"number":1555,"title":"Chapter 1555 - 826: Eight Trigrams and Eight Gates (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"The formation on the island is a special kind of Eight Trigrams Eight Gates Formation.\"","\"This formation follows the post-heaven Bagua positions, with Li on the top, Kan on the bottom, Zhen on the left, Dui on the right, Xun and Kun as shoulders, Gen and Qian as feet. Each trigram corresponds to a position, and each position is set with a corresponding Eight Trigrams Array, while also establishing a gate.\"","\"With this formation, a barrier is constructed, which combines defense, trapping, and escape functions.\"","\"If the enemy cannot penetrate, this set of formations is used for defense.\"","\"If the enemy breaks the formation and invades, then the formation is mobilized, the positions are confused, the trigrams flow, and they will use the formation’s layout to trap the enemy.\"","\"Even if ultimately unable to trap the enemy, it can provide an escape.\"","\"This set of formations leaves eight gates. With the eight gates rotating and the Life-gate constantly changing, in other words, it equates to having eight Life-gates, enough for them to escape amidst chaos.\"","\"Therefore, to break this formation, there are three key points: First, find a way to invade, second, avoid being trapped, third, block the Life-gate to prevent anyone from escaping...\"","Mo Hua spoke clearly and in detail.","Xia Canonical Official looked at Mo Hua with some distraction.","She also understood some formations, and compared to Gu Changhuai, she was actually quite stronger.","She could draw most common Second Grade Middle Stage Arrays.","She could also draw a few high-level Second Grade ones, but not many, and her pen technique would be somewhat rusty.","But upon hearing Mo Hua’s words, she suddenly felt that her learning of second-grade arrays seemed wasted...","Understanding such formations requires practicing second-grade arrays to a high level of proficiency, especially an in-depth study of the Eight Trigrams Formation theory.","Otherwise, not to mention deducing the rotation of the Life-gate, even recognizing which Eight Trigrams Arrays are present would take considerable effort.","Only then did Xia Canonical Official believe that Mo Hua was not lying.","But at the same time, she was somewhat incredulous.","When did the formation level of the Sect Disciples at the Qian Learning State Boundary reach this height?","This level, even in Taoist State, could be considered a rare Array Dao Genius.","Even within the venerable and well-established Xia family, disciples who reached this level of formation understanding at this age were few and far between.","Xia Canonical Official was dazed for a moment, and then sighed.","She turned back, looked solemnly at Mo Hua, and nodded, saying:","\"Alright, the formation matter is entrusted to you, but as for ordering customized spiritual tools, there are only three days, will you be on time?\"","Mo Hua replied, \"The time is a bit tight, but I should manage.\"","Xia Canonical Official nodded, \"I will mobilize personnel, if you have no issues, we will act in three days.\"","\"Okay!\" Mo Hua nodded.","...","Later on, Mo Hua discussed some formation details with Xia Canonical Official, then returned to the Sect.","After returning to the Sect, the first thing he did was to request leave from Elder Master Xun.","Elder Master Xun seemed to know something, didn’t inquire much, only instructed Mo Hua: \"Stay safe, don’t take risks.\"","\"Understood, Master.\"","Mo Hua answered.","This time, he was just following the Taoist Court, not needing to take risks himself.","After taking leave, Mo Hua made a trip to Solitary Mountain City to find Master Gu.","\"There’s a big order requiring the refinement of some iron chains, Water Net, traps, and the like of Spiritual Artifacts, as much as possible within two days.\"","Mo Hua had already informed Master Gu beforehand, so Master Gu wasn’t surprised, only asked: \"Very urgent?\"","\"Extremely urgent.\"","\"Alright.\"","Master Gu nodded and immediately gave orders, \"Everyone in the refinery shop, stop what you are working on, follow the young master’s instructions, work day and night to rush this batch of spiritual tools and formation materials.\"","\"For these two days, the fire should not go out, nor should the furnace be unattended.\"","A group of tall artifact refining disciples responded in unison:","\"Yes!\"","Mo Hua had been a great help to their refinery shop.","If it weren’t for the refining routes Mo Hua brought them, they would still be struggling like before, unable to get any work, barely affording meals.","Now, they were busy every day, their hands were more financially secure, they could occasionally enjoy a good meal, all thanks to Mo Hua.","So, upon hearing Mo Hua’s request for help, everyone worked hard.","Moreover, it was also a big business deal, completing it would earn a lot of Spirit Stones.","In the refinery shop, things were bustling with activity.","Everyone rushed the schedule, worked diligently, and within two days, a total of over one hundred and fifty sets of formation materials and spiritual tools were refined.","Mo Hua painted formations on them overnight.","Because these formation materials and spiritual tools varied in size, the formation carved on them differed in shape and grade, so technically, not all one hundred plus needed to be drawn.","Yet even so, it was not less than eighty or ninety.","Mo Hua painted continuously for an entire day and night, until his head spun, his Divine Sense nearing exhaustion several times, and his Sea of Consciousness faintly aching.","Fortunately, he completed it in the end.","After refining the formations, Mo Hua checked them again to ensure no mistakes, then informed Xia Canonical Official.","Xia Canonical Official also inspected them upon arrival at the refinery shop, finding the formation materials exquisite, the formations precise, each stroke perfectly uniform as if engraved with a mold, leaving her in awe.","However, she was somewhat puzzled:","\"It’s normal for Spiritual Artifacts to be identical when refined with a mold, but how can these formations, stroke by stroke, all be the same?\"","Because it’s drawn by the same person...","Mo Hua thought silently.","But on the surface, he said, \"Perhaps it’s because all the Formation Masters painting these were taught by the same master...\"","\"I see...\""]},{"number":1556,"title":"Chapter 1556 - 826: Eight Trigrams, Eight Gates (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Xia Canonical Official nodded.","She never expected that these formations were drawn by Mo Hua alone in such a short time.","The formations and spiritual artifacts were all ready, and Xia Canonical Official’s personnel were also assembled.","Everything was prepared, and three days later, under the cover of night, the group set off towards the Mistwater River.","Naturally, Mo Hua followed along.","Xia Canonical Official was reluctant to bring Mo Hua, \"This time we are engaging in mixed battles with the river bandits; it’s quite dangerous, you’d better not follow us.\"","\"If I don’t follow, who will guide you?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"This...\" Xia Canonical Official hesitated for a moment, and then asked with uncertainty, \"That Little River God? Can it guide us?\"","\"You can’t see it, can you?\" Mo Hua replied, \"If you can’t see it, how will it guide you?\"","Xia Canonical Official had no response.","Although she roughly remembered the route at that time, with the battle imminent, she couldn’t afford any oversight, and relying solely on her memory wasn’t very reliable.","\"Fine, you can come, but be careful of your own safety,\" Xia Canonical Official compromised.","\"Alright! Sister Xia, don’t worry,\" Mo Hua replied.","He had made full preparations; unless something unexpected happened, there shouldn’t be any problems.","Gu Changhuai, who stood aside, also didn’t say anything.","He and Mo Hua were considered \"old acquaintances,\" knowing Mo Hua’s disposition; once this kid wants to do something, he won’t stop until he achieves his goal, so there’s no point in trying to dissuade him.","As for Mo Hua’s safety...","Gu Changhuai still vividly remembered how the Fire Buddha ended up dead.","Once everything was in place, the group traveled through the night, arriving at a desolate ferry by the Mistwater River.","Before long, teams of cultivators arrived one after another.","They wore black clothes and masks, blending into the darkness, their steps steady, and after reaching the ferry in separate batches, they saluted Xia Canonical Official.","These were cultivators from the Xia family.","To conceal their movements, they didn’t act all at once but scattered first, gathering at the ferry after nightfall in separate groups.","After a while, a considerable number of cultivators had gathered nearby.","There were roughly over three hundred of them.","About two hundred of them belonged to the Xia family.","The remaining under a hundred were from the Gu family.","Without exception, these individuals possessed water attribute spiritual roots and were skilled in water nature skills and Taoist skills, possessing a certain command of water.","Finding people wasn’t difficult, but specifically selecting cultivators with water spirit roots and some mastery over water was quite challenging.","Within the Gu family, there were only about eighty cultivators who met the standards for Foundation Building.","The others either didn’t meet the criteria or had other tasks to attend to, so they couldn’t come.","The Xia family was much stronger in this regard.","Despite being in the Qian Learning State Boundary, the Xia family leveraged their network and managed to assemble over two hundred people, all of whom had impressive cultivation levels and rich experience.","\"Three hundred plus, should be enough...\"","Mo Hua silently thought.","However, Xia Canonical Official remained impassive, seemingly still waiting for something.","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Sister Xia, are more people coming?\"","Initially, Xia Canonical Official didn’t want Mo Hua to call her \"sister,\" but having heard it often from him, she had grown used to it and didn’t care about the address anymore.","She nodded, \"More people are coming.\"","Mo Hua frowned, somewhat confused.","Who else would come?","But since Xia Canonical Official wasn’t saying, he could only wait silently, and after a while, shadows moved in the darkness, and another group of cultivators arrived.","This group of cultivators held their breath, traveling through the night directly towards the ferry.","Xia Canonical Official maintained her composure, evidently expecting this.","Once the leader reached the ferry, he removed his mask, revealing his face, and bowed to Xia Canonical Official, \"Greetings, Xia Canonical Official.\"","This person was very young, at Foundation Establishment Peak level.","Mo Hua glanced at him and abruptly widened his eyes.","This person was...","Xiao Tianquan?!","The direct lineage Heavenly Pride of the Xiao family, working in the Taoist Court, known as Howling Celestial Dog!","Mo Hua’s thoughts momentarily jumbled.","\"How could it be Xiao Tianquan? Did he betray the Xiao family? No, that’s not it...\"","Mo Hua examined the people behind Xiao Tianquan, noticing their demeanor and every movement bore the distinct style of the Taoist Court.","These people were all Enforcement Leaders from the Xiao family.","Mo Hua’s eyelids twitched, and he couldn’t help but glance at Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai furrowed his brow, his gaze heavy, evidently as surprised as Mo Hua to find that these reinforcements were from the Xiao family.","Yet, Xia Canonical Official nodded faintly, asking, \"Is everyone here?\"","Xiao Tianquan respectfully replied, \"Reporting to the Canonical Official, all 112 from the Xiao family are present, awaiting your orders.\"","\"Good,\" Xia Canonical Official nodded, \"You all know the plan. Later, we shall embark on boats and follow me to the depths of the Mistwater River to encircle and eradicate the river bandits and eliminate this scourge.\"","Xiao Tianquan cupped his hands and said, \"Understood!\"","He then lifted his head, casting a sharp glance at Gu Changhuai, but said nothing, turning instead to convey orders to the cultivators of the Xiao family.","Gu Changhuai kept a stern face, remaining silent.","Afterward, everyone embarked; the Xia family’s cultivators placed over thirty spirit boats into the water.","Then, according to plan, everyone boarded the boats methodically.","Xia Canonical Official took the lead on the foremost boat, with Gu Changhuai alongside her.","Mo Hua needed to guide the way, so he was on this boat as well.","As for Xiao Tianquan, who also seemed eager to board the same boat as Xia Canonical Official,","Xia Canonical Official hesitated for a moment, then said:","\"Xiao Zhisi, may we trouble you to lead your people at the rear.\"","Xiao Tianquan nodded perceptively, cupping his hands and replying \"Yes,\" before moving to the rear boats.","With everyone on board, over thirty spirit boats silently embarked under the veil of night.","Mo Hua led the way in the front.","All the other cultivators followed behind.","The night was quiet, the water calm, with only the gentle sound of flowing water accompanying the journey forward.","In the midst of this silence, as they reached the midway point, Gu Changhuai finally couldn’t hold back and asked Xia Canonical Official:","\"How is it the Xiao family?\"","His voice was low, tinged with confusion and a hint of inquiry.","Mo Hua immediately perked up his ears.","\"What about the Xiao family?\"","Xia Canonical Official’s tone was calm, nonchalant.","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Do you seriously not know?\"","The Gui Water Sect and the Xiao family had long been bound together, like locusts on the same rope.","Xia Canonical Official paused for a moment, clearly having words she couldn’t speak.","But looking into Gu Changhuai’s clear and questioning eyes, she contemplated for a while, ultimately choosing to speak softly:","\"The Xiao family has already defected to our Xia family...\"","\"This whole affair began with the Xiao family secretly reporting the many misdeeds of the Gui Water Sect to my uncle, which led the Taoist Court to investigate the Gui Water Sect.\"","Gu Changhuai’s eyes trembled.","Mo Hua, eavesdropping from the front, also inhaled sharply.","Good heavens, this mole from the Xiao family turned their back.","Previously, they were whispering sweet nothings with Gui Water Sect, only to stab them in the back..."]},{"number":1557,"title":"Chapter 1557 - 827: Night Assassination","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai, slightly displeased, said coldly:","\"Aren’t you afraid that these people from the Xiao family, while ostensibly siding with the Xia family, are secretly colluding with the Gui Water Sect, ruining this plan?\"","Xia Canonical Official shook her head, replied calmly, \"It’s not up to me. Uncle Gu knows what he’s doing.\"","\"Uncle?\" Gu Changhuai’s eyes narrowed, \"Are you referring to... Master Xia?\"","\"Yes,\" Xia Canonical Official nodded, \"This time, the Xia family came to the Qianxue State Boundary, and all matters are solely handled by Uncle.\"","Gu Changhuai remained silent.","Involving a Dao Court Inspector, as a Supervisor, he could only keep quiet.","Gu Changhuai turned his head, no longer looking at Xia Canonical Official, but instead gazed at the dark river water, with furrowed brows, pondering something.","Xia Canonical Official also stopped looking at Gu Changhuai.","She appeared calm, looking straight ahead, her gaze firm.","The two seemed to have a falling out, refusing to look at each other.","Mo Hua sighed slightly, but at the same time, he was also silently pondering.","Master Xia... Who on earth is this?","Inspector...","It seems their status should be higher than a Supervisor, able to suppress Uncle Gu. Their cultivation must at least be Feather Transformation, and it seems their authority is also vast.","\"This Master Xia, received intelligence from the Xiao family, and using the incident at the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons as an excuse, citing the lack of scholarly atmosphere at the Qian Learning State Boundary, extended his influence into the Taoist Court of Qianxue State Boundary...\"","The first step is to investigate the Gui Water Sect.","But what is the reason for investigating the Gui Water Sect?","To show loyalty to the Taoist Court, to uphold the Taoist Law?","Mo Hua shook his head.","And after investigating the Gui Water Sect?","What will the Xia family, or rather, this \"Master Xia\" do?","Mo Hua furrowed his brows, feeling the situation becoming increasingly chaotic.","Everyone wants to interfere, and the Qianxue State Boundary is about to become a mess.","\"Think about it slowly later...\"","For now, the immediate priority is to capture the Water Yama.","Originally, Mo Hua was quite confident, but with the Xiao family mixed in, he felt a vague sense of unease.","Things are getting more and more complicated.","And, does Master Xia really trust the Xiao family that much? For such a crucial matter as eradicating water bandits, capturing the Water Yama, would he really let the Xiao family interfere?","Mo Hua found it a bit hard to believe.","He couldn’t figure it out, and at this moment, he remembered the words Elder Master Xun had taught him before:","\"Don’t only consider things from your own perspective, or you will inevitably be short-sighted and have limited understanding, getting caught in dead ends without realizing it.\"","\"Learn to stand at a high vantage point and look down from above.\"","\"Put yourself in the shoes of an ’Ancestor’ and think about how they see things...\"","\"Consider yourself an Ancestor...\"","Even if Master Xia isn’t an Ancestor, they hold a high position, and naturally view matters from a top-down perspective.","Mo Hua put himself in their shoes for a moment.","The Water Yama is important to him.","But to a cultivator of Master Xia’s level, it probably doesn’t even matter to him.","The Water Yama is just one of his pawns.","Even the Xiao family and Gui Water Sect are his pawns.","This time, he drove a tiger to swallow a wolf, letting the Xiao family consume the Water Yama pawn while also using it to grab a handle on the Gui Water Sect, and perhaps...","Testing the Xiao family?","If the Xiao family obediently kills the water bandits and captures the Water Yama, it would show their allegiance is sincere.","If the Xiao family schemes behind the scenes, it would reveal their ulterior motives.","If the Xiao family indeed harbors ulterior motives, feigning compliance while acting against orders, then once Master Xia finishes dealing with the Gui Water Sect, he might turn his hand and take care of the Xiao family as well...","Driving a tiger to swallow a wolf, and then killing both the tiger and the wolf.","The more Mo Hua thought about it, the more it made sense, and he couldn’t help but mutter to himself:","\"These people, so many schemes, and such dirty minds...\"","...","Under the night sky, the river was murky, and the fleet continued forward.","Mo Hua sat at the bow of the ship, pointing the direction.","And at the bow, a silver line swam freely in the water, it was the Little Silver Fish.","It happily led the way for Mo Hua.","However, no one else could see it.","After crossing the wide river area, they reached the natural marsh \"Maze,\" where the waterways narrowed, mud accumulated, making it difficult for the ships to advance.","Xia Canonical Official ordered all the ships to connect stern to bow, forming a long snake-like line, proceeding through the \"Maze\" so they wouldn’t get lost or stuck in the mud.","After an unknown period, they arrived in front of the island.","Mo Hua looked up, the moon cool and wind high, the night deep, the small island remained as quiet as that day, silently lurking in the Mistwater River, like a dormant beast.","Xia Canonical Official waved her hand, \"Conceal.\"","All Spirit Boats trembled slightly, emitting a faint humming sound; a light veil rose, covering the ship bodies, concealing them.","Mo Hua was taken aback at the sight.","Concealment Spirit Boat!","These more than thirty ships are actually Spirit Boats with concealment capabilities!","Concealment Spiritual Artifacts are expensive, not to mention for such large-sized Spirit Boats.","The Xia family surely has deep pockets.","Mo Hua silently sighed to himself.","Once all the ships were concealed, they hid among the water grasses surrounding the small island.","Xia Canonical Official gathered some leading Enforcement Leaders, then informed them of the more detailed encirclement plan:","\"This is the Formation Diagram of the small island, created by...\"","Xia Canonical Official glanced at Mo Hua, said quietly, \"...a highly skilled Formation Master, who personally examined and designed it...\"","\"On the Formation Diagram, the layout of the island’s formations is drawn, with the positions of the Eight Trigrams Eight Gates marked...\"","\"At approximately 10 p.m., we will take action. At this time, the water bandits will go out to plunder, the village gates open wide, and we will intercept them halfway as they leave, first killing a batch, then breaking open the gates and storming inside.\"","\"Once inside, it becomes crucial.\"","\"The gate used by the water bandits to exit the village is the Kan Gate. If the plan goes smoothly, then our time to crash through the Kan Gate would be 1 p.m.\"","\"After 1 p.m., once we rush onto the island, the water bandits will surely activate the formation, then, about every hour, the eight gates within the formation will rotate once.\""]},{"number":1558,"title":"Chapter 1558 - 827: Night Assassination (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"Here is the flow of the Eight Gates situation, all of you who are leading teams, remember it well.\"","\"Don’t bother with the other gates, just block the Du Gate, Jing Gate, the two level gates, and the Kai Gate, Xiu Gate, and Sheng Gate, the three auspicious gates, especially the Sheng Gate, to prevent the water bandits from escaping.\"","\"Of course, relying on manpower alone won’t work.\"","\"On the periphery of the island, besides the initial Kan Gate, at the entrances of the other seven gates, we need to set up trap formations to capture, besiege, and even annihilate these water bandits.\"","\"These formations have also been prepared in advance.\"","\"Later, Supervisor Gu and I will be responsible for eliminating the hidden sentries around the island, everyone else must set up these formations before the battle begins...\"","...","After Xia Canonical Official finished instructing, the enforcement leaders’ expressions were solemn, and they all cupped their hands and solemnly said:","\"Yes!\"","But at the same time, they also sighed in their hearts.","Especially Xiao Tianquan, he opened his mouth and praised:","\"The Xia family truly deserves to be a Great Family, with such deep resources, they can invite such an outstanding Formation Master in a short time to decipher the formations on this island.\"","\"I wonder...\" Xiao Tianquan curiously asked, \"What is this gentleman’s name and origin? May I have the honor to meet him?\"","Mo Hua, standing next to Xiao Tianquan, couldn’t help but blink.","\"This ’gentleman’ is standing right next to you...\" Xia Canonical Official thought silently.","But she couldn’t reveal Mo Hua’s identity, so she just said, \"This matter is confidential and cannot be disclosed.\"","Xiao Tianquan also said, \"I was too presumptuous.\"","\"Alright,\" Xia Canonical Official was decisive in her methods and ordered:","\"Time is of the essence, let’s act now and not give the water bandits a chance to escape, surround them with swift and decisive action!\"","The enforcement leaders bowed their heads and responded solemnly:","\"As you command!\"","Thereafter, in the dark of night, concealed spirit boats quietly dispersed, weaving a large net over the Mistwater River, gradually enveloping the small island where the water bandits resided.","The first step was to eliminate the hidden sentries.","This task required stealth, without a hint of error, so it was entrusted to the two Golden Core Cultivators, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official.","As the night deepened, a drowsy water bandit on lookout near the small island yawned, feeling a bit sleepy.","The small island was desolate, and no outsiders ever came, over time, these water bandits became somewhat lax and far less vigilant than before.","Just as he was yawning, a white palm suddenly covered his mouth.","The water bandit’s pupils widened in shock, ready to shout, when a sword tip pierced through his chest, wind-based spiritual power flowed from the wound cut by the sword tip, slicing through his meridians, turning his internal organs into a bloody mess.","The water bandit struggled a bit, and shortly after, his gaze dimmed, his breath ceased, and he died thus.","Gu Changhuai killed one person and turned to see that Xia Canonical Official had already used a short sword to slit another water bandit’s throat.","The short sword was enveloped in a layer of frost.","At the moment of cutting the water band’s throat, this layer of frost sealed the bandit’s mouth and nose, leaving him unable to make a sound, and even his blood began to slowly freeze.","In just a moment, the water bandit’s face turned purple, his entire body froze solid, and he died instantly.","Gu Changhuai raised an eyebrow.","This was his first time seeing Xia Canonical Official in action.","Ice-bound, assassination, killing with one sword.","It certainly matched this woman’s always cold personality.","Watching from afar, Mo Hua was also somewhat surprised.","\"Ice Spiritual Root...\"","This was the first time he had seen a cultivator with an Ice Spiritual Root.","In the cultivation world, the common spiritual root attributes are divided into Five Elements and Three Exceptions.","The Five Elements are metal, wood, water, fire, and earth; the Three Exceptions are \"wind, ice, thunder.\"","Among them, Wind Spiritual Root is not too uncommon, but occasionally seen; for example, Gu Changhuai is one.","Ice Spiritual Root is quite rare; Mo Hua has only seen the one in Xia Canonical Official so far.","As for naturally endowed Thunder Spiritual Roots, capable of powerful Thunder Dao Skills, they are even rarer.","After removing the sentries, Mo Hua led people closer and began setting up trap formations on the island’s edges against the water to entrap the enemy.","In the water, he laid fishnets.","These fishnets were specially made, with formations, barbs, and even poison coated on them.","After laying them, the group began to change locations.","As per usual, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, the two Golden Cores, were responsible for assassinating the sentry posts, and once safety was confirmed, Mo Hua led people to place the drawn formations and some trap spiritual artifacts.","However, the Water Island was larger than Mo Hua had previously estimated, and given the limited time, the hastily refined formation coals were not quite enough.","Thus, they managed to cover six gates with over a hundred formation coals and spiritual artifacts already used up.","Yet, there were still two gates left.","One Kan Gate, which the water bandits would use to leave the island, and the Taoist Court Officials would use to storm inside, could be ignored.","But the other Li Gate, precisely opposite the Kan Gate, could not be disregarded.","\"I’ll arrange for people to guard this position,\" Xia Canonical Official said.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then shook his head, \"We can’t disperse our forces, or it will disrupt the previous plan.\"","\"Then this gate...\"","\"I have a way,\" Mo Hua said.","He took out a few bottles of ugly and pungent blood pills from his storage bag, along with some fishy-smelling seaweed.","These were all things he had prepared earlier.","\"These pills are made from the innards of monster beasts, so they have a strong smell that cultivators avoid, but monster beasts love.\"","\"This seaweed, called fish-scent seaweed by the fish cultivators in the small fishing village, is also used to attract water demons.\"","\"If the traps aren’t enough, we’ll make up for it with water demons.\"","\"Throw these blood pills and fish-scent seaweed at the Li Gate to ’bait,’ drawing in nearby water demons.\"","\"Thus, this Li Gate will become an artificial ’Gate of Death.’","\"If the water bandits try to flee the island and jump into the water from here, they’ll find a group of water demons waiting for them.\""]},{"number":1559,"title":"Chapter 1559 - 827: Night Assassination (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"Their swimming skills are excellent, but they stand no chance against a group of Water Demons. Once they enter the water, they’re doomed.\"","This group of water robbers can die, but they cannot escape.","Xia Canonical Official paused for a moment, then looked deeply at Mo Hua, nodded and said, \"Alright.\"","She couldn’t help but sigh in her heart.","This young boy is really clever.","In such a short time, he could come up with a method. Although it’s a bit sinister, it’s just right for dealing with this group of wicked water robbers.","Gu Changhuai, on the other hand, seemed unfazed.","He knew that Mo Hua must have planned this early on.","Even using Monster Beasts to trap and kill others, Mo Hua definitely wasn’t doing it for the first time.","Probably someone had fallen into his trap before...","After the discussion was finished, Mo Hua began to \"bait the hook.\"","He threw the fishy-smelling algae and Blood Pills refined with the help of Monster Beasts into the water.","The smell of the Blood Pills was extremely unpleasant.","Xia Canonical Official couldn’t help but cover her mouth and nose, then curiously asked:","\"Are these Blood Pills originally this shape? Why do they look so ugly like misshapen fruits?\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua said calmly, \"because they were refined by me...\"","His alchemy skills are really poor.","This pill is not a proper medicinal pill; he just threw in everything he believed the Monster Beasts would like to eat randomly, muddling through the refining process, which resulted in this ugly appearance.","Mo Hua felt a bit helpless.","He could draw Formations beautifully, but the pills he refined were ugly, and there was nothing he could do about it.","Xia Canonical Official looked at the handsome and elegant Mo Hua and the ugly pills in his hand and remained silent.","After the baiting, everything was ready.","Everyone then began to lurk in the water plants, waiting for 22 p.m. to arrive.","The night became increasingly deep, with a crescent moon hanging in the sky like a sharp scimitar, exuding a cold gleam.","The atmosphere was oppressive, filled with a sense of imminent slaughter.","Not knowing how much time had passed, Gu Changhuai, who was resting with his eyes closed, opened his eyes.","There was a sound coming from the Water Island.","The sound of a door creaking open was heard.","It seemed like a large gate was being opened, followed by the noise of boats entering the water, accompanied by rough and noisy human voices.","\"Gone hunting...\"","\"Wonder what we’ll catch today.\"","\"It’s okay to kill the men quickly, but be careful with the women, don’t chop their heads off with one blow, it’s off-putting.\"","\"Damn you, killing men but not women, are you biased towards women?\"","\"Nonsense, aren’t you too?\"","...","The number of boats increased, and the voices grew louder and more chaotic.","When a group of water robbers, about fifty or sixty people, had taken their boats and exited the island, floating on the water with no escape,","a Wind Blade came suddenly unnoticed.","A water robber with a scar on his head, who was chatting and laughing, immediately had his head sliced off, blood spattering, his body falling like a wooden stake into the river.","The chaotic voices abruptly ceased.","Instant silence fell all around.","Then a water robber exclaimed in panic: \"What was that?\"","\"Why is his head gone?\"","\"Water Demon decapitating?\"","The night was dark and heavy, and a mist hung over the water, with a faint sense of impending violence emanating from the mist.","Soon, some water robbers realized something was wrong and shouted in alarm:","\"Someone... kill...\"","A short sword imbued with icy spiritual power sliced through his throat, sealing his voice, freezing his blood, and taking his life.","Behind the water robbers, Xia Canonical Official sheathed the short sword, his expression stern, and commanded in a solemn voice:","\"Kill!\"","Then shouts of killing erupted suddenly.","The previously empty and dark water surface suddenly appeared crowded with the silhouettes of numerous boats.","On every boat, there were about a dozen Court Officials with exquisite Spiritual Artifacts, their expressions fierce and murderous.","At Xia Canonical Official’s command, the Court Officials simultaneously drew their longswords, leaped onto the water robbers’ boats, and started slashing, mingling their spiritual power with blood, which splattered everywhere.","In the blink of an eye, more than a dozen water robbers were killed.","Some had their heads chopped off, some had their arms severed, and others had their hearts pierced, blood gushing like a fountain, dyeing a section of the river red.","The water robbers were terrified.","\"Enemy attack!\"","\"Damn it!\"","\"Where did these bastards come from?!\"","\"Issued Spirit Swords, damn Court Dogs!\"","The water robbers shouted and cursed.","The Taoist Court and the smell of blood aroused their ferocity as desperate criminals, naturally not lacking in the recklessness to fight back.","The water robbers also drew their swords and knives and took out blood-colored Evil Artifacts, engaging in combat with the Taoist Court.","But they were outnumbered, caught on the water’s surface, and ambushed unexpectedly, naturally not a match for the well-prepared Court Cultivators.","Moreover, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, both Golden Core cultivators, were leading the attack.","The water robbers were being defeated step by step.","One after another, they were slain.","Finally, some water robbers became terrified, turned to flee toward the Water Island, but were blocked by other water robbers behind them. As they advanced and retreated, they became a tangled mess and were reaped one by one by the Court Officials.","At the Kan Gate of the Water Island, there was a large gate.","The gate was constructed of wood and stone, with formations flowing on it.","Behind the gate was the hideout of the water robbers.","The Taoist Court advanced toward the island, taking a few lives with every step.","At that time, a water robber shouted, \"Quick! Close the gate! These bastards are going to storm in!\"","The gate was halfway closed when the water robbers outside blocked it.","The water robbers being slaughtered by the Taoist Court outside the gate shouted angrily, \"Damn it! Don’t close the gate! I’m not inside yet!\"","As they pushed and shoved, Gu Changhuai reached the gate.","He took out a feather fan, channeled his spiritual power, waved it once, and sent out several extremely sharp Wind Blades, instantly shredding a few water robbers.","Then Gu Changhuai leaped forward, like a gale, rushing directly into the gate of the stronghold.","The water robbers inside the gate surrounded and attacked Gu Changhuai.","But they were just ordinary Foundation Establishment cultivators. Although they were ruthless killers, in direct combat, they were no match for the academically trained and deeply knowledgeable Gu Changhuai.","Xia Canonical Official also seized the opportunity to enter, with a sword glowing with cold light, ice shards flashing, and each strike was fatal.","In just a moment, a large number of water robbers were slain at the Eight Trigrams \"Kan\" Gate.","Gu Changhuai activated his spiritual power and, following Mo Hua’s instructions, forcibly broke several formations inside the Kan Gate.","The gate, without the support of formations, was merely ordinary earth and stone and collapsed in an instant.","With that, the main gate to the water robbers’ lair stood wide open.","Over four hundred Court Officials, eyes sharp, wielding swords and knives in hand, like a pack of hungry wolves, charged in to kill.","At that time, it was exactly 1 p.m.","Within the stronghold, the Eight Gates began to revolve.","The Taoist Court started the assault, the water robbers began to struggle, then fled according to the Eight Gates...","Everything was as Mo Hua had planned.","But Mo Hua did not enter.","The mixed battle among cultivators was still somewhat dangerous.","He sat alone in a concealed small boat, poured himself a glass of sweet lychee wine, squinted his eyes, and drank it leisurely.","Inside the stronghold, the battle grew fiercer, and the smell of blood became more intense..."]},{"number":1560,"title":"Chapter 1560 - 828: Snatching the Tiger’s Tooth","paragraphs":["Mo Hua isn’t worried about the situation on the island.","Firstly, in this operation, he was \"borrowing power\", relying on the Taoist Court’s strength to eradicate these water bandits.","The Xia family is not yet his concern.","Another reason is because of the formation.","The formation on the island uses the formation principles of the Eight Gates and Eight Trigrams, with an exquisite design.","However, the Formation Master’s skills were insufficient, and the solitary, deserted island offered limited conditions, resulting in a relatively crude formation.","The layout used the Eight Gates as a framework, but the internal Eight Trigrams Array was cut corners.","Though there are Eight Gates, there are no Eight Trigrams.","A complete Eight Trigrams Formation is very difficult to assemble.","Li Fire, Kan Water, and Gen Mountain are better, having commonalities with the usual Five Elements Formation, making them easier to learn.","However, the other trigrams, like the Zhen Hexagram symbolizing thunder, the Xun Hexagram symbolizing wind, the Kun Hexagram symbolizing earth, and the Qian Hexagram symbolizing heaven.","These types of Eight Trigrams Formation are vastly different from the Five Elements layout, with profoundly mysterious principles and rare formation diagrams, and their inheritance is scarce.","Aside from a few simple Xun Formation diagrams, there were no formation diagrams for Zhen Formation, Qian Formation, and Kun Formation even from Elder Master Xun.","Even Mo Hua was like this, let alone other disciples within the Taixu Gate.","Similarly, among this group of water bandits, even those from the Gui Water Sect would not have a Second Grade Formation Master truly proficient in all Eight Trigrams Formations.","And the Eight Gates Eight Trigrams formation on this water island is inherently incomplete.","Because the eight trigrams are not fully assembled, most of the formations within actually use other Five Elements formations to make up the numbers.","In fact, some areas even lack substitute formations.","This was a conclusion Mo Hua deduced after pondering himself and consulting with Elder Xun Zixian.","According to Elder Xun Zixian, the true \"Eight Gates Eight Trigrams\" formation is easy to learn but difficult to master, with a straightforward layout but endless variations, a type of formation only a \"master\" can truly wield.","Mo Hua wants to become a formation master.","Therefore, he needs to study, research, and improve this formation thoroughly.","The formation on the small island is rather crude and imperfect.","But based on this foundation, with gradual improvement, perfecting the trigrams, and simultaneously adding multiple variations to the Eight Gates, especially the circulation of the Life Gate and Gate of Death, he can gradually unearth the formation’s power.","This formation placed on the small island is a bit of a waste. Only in his hands can it be used to its full potential.","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","Time dripped away as night deepened.","In the dense night, there was a pervasive blood qi.","The island’s formation operated according to Mo Hua’s trajectory of deduction, with the Eight Gates continuously shifting as per his predictions.","The Taoist Court’s Enforcement Leader carried out the plan to encircle and kill the water bandits.","Soon, the defeat of the water bandits became apparent.","Some water bandits fled the island, escaping along the Life Gate.","But as soon as they stepped outside the gate, originally empty grounds suddenly turned into muddy water, transforming into a swamp, trapping the water bandits within.","Simultaneously, the swamp turned into a whirlpool, as if invisible hands were pulling the water bandits deeper into the sludge.","\"Damn it, who set up the trap...\"","Before the water bandit could finish speaking, their mouths were sealed by the swamp, unable to borrow strength and struggling desperately but in vain.","The cultivators from the Taoist Court caught up and ended their lives one by one.","Eight Trigrams Dui System Formation -","Mud Swamp Trap.","This is the formation Mo Hua thought would be most suitable for use on the island.","The island has soil, and beside the soil, there’s water; when water and soil merge, they transform into marsh.","Most of the water bandits were trapped in the Mud Swamp Formation, their struggles futile, later beheaded one by one by the Taoist Court Enforcement Leader.","Those who escaped from the Mud Swamp Trap and jumped into the river were caught by fishing nets.","The fishing nets are reinforced with formations, making them extremely sturdy and hard to break free from, with barbs soaked in poison; once ensnared by the nets, they can only be butchered like fish.","If unlucky enough to enter the \"Gate of Death\" trap Mo Hua set up, they would be gnawed to death by numerous water demons.","With Mo Hua’s meticulous preparation, the water bandits had almost no chance of escape.","The killing continued.","The bodies of water bandits on the island increased steadily.","Mo Hua estimated the time, thinking the water bandits were almost eliminated, the scale of the mixed battle reduced, and the threat on the island lessened, only then did he set off, quietly arriving on the island.","The soil on the island soaked with blood, stepped on felt sticky and thick.","The ground was covered with the corpses of water bandits.","Mo Hua cast the Minor Five Elements Stealth Skill and released his Divine Sense, bypassing the Kan Gate, heading into the depths of the bandit camp.","Whenever he found a water bandit pretending to be dead on the ground, he’d casually cast a Fireball Technique, sending them to hell, like a \"Little Yama\" harvesting lives.","Inside the bandit camp, it was a complete mess.","The killing continued.","Fiery light, blood light, mud, haphazardly strewn bodies, dense footprints, all intertwined.","Mo Hua slightly deduced and roughly calculated the positions of Gu Changhuai, Xia Canonical Official, and a large group of Court Officials.","After all, their route to break the formation was planned by Mo Hua himself.","But he himself did not need to follow that route.","At this point, no one understood the formations within the bandit camp better than him, not even Shui Yan, the water bandit leader.","Within his Divine Sense, the transformations of the formation were clearly discernible.","Mo Hua’s glance was deep, perceiving the flow of the formation, then identified a direction, moving towards the core of the formation.","Along the way, there were also some miscellaneous trapping and killing formations.","But in Mo Hua’s eyes, these small trapping and killing formations were exceedingly basic, unable to trap him at all, let alone kill him.","Mo Hua effortlessly bypassed these formations, stealthily moving for a while, avoiding scattered water bandits, casually dispatching a few seriously injured bandits, and arrived at the center of the bandit camp."]},{"number":1561,"title":"Chapter 1561 - 828: Snatching Food from the Tiger’s Mouth (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Because at present, everything is advancing according to plan.","So this timing is just right, enough for me to do some small maneuvers.","If Mo Hua’s guess is correct, the Water Yama is at the center of the island’s Formation.","Even if the Water Yama is not here, this is the control hub of the Formation and the key to the entire bandit’s lair, there are definitely secrets hidden inside.","I can sneak in first and see if I can fish in troubled waters and gain some benefits.","This Water Yama, carrying the legacy of the Water Prison Sect, is a treasure trove, and I absolutely cannot let him get away.","But this siege of the water bandits is led by Xia Canonical Official, with involvement from the Xiao family, Uncle Gu has no say, and I can’t seek a backdoor way either.","If the Water Yama really gets caught and falls into the hands of the Xia family, then all the good things on him won’t be mine.","At most, I’ll get some Spirit Stones and Merit Points afterward.","Although Spirit Stones are good, I’m not lacking them now.","As for Merit Points, there’s no need to mention.","Mo Hua has plenty of Merit Points now.","And the things on the Water Yama cannot be exchanged with Spirit Stones and Merit Points.","Therefore, if you want a piece of the pie, you must learn to seize the opportunity.","If there is no opportunity, then create one.","This timing now is the \"opportunity\" carefully crafted by using the principles of the Eight Gates and Eight Trigrams, and by advising on Xia Canonical Official’s siege plan.","At this moment, most of the water bandits have been killed.","The Formation can’t stop me.","The Water Yama is besieged by the Taoist Court Officials and must be running for his life.","It’s perfect for me to use invisibility and fish in troubled waters.","And in about an hour, Uncle Gu along with Xia Canonical Official will lead the Taoist Court Cultivators to attack here.","This is the retreat route.","If there are any changes, I just need to find a way to hold off for an hour until Uncle Gu and the others come to rescue me.","And whether I can get a piece of the pie depends on this hour.","Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed slightly, shining with a hunter’s intent in the darkness.","He concealed himself and moved closer to the center of the bandit’s lair.","The center of the bandit’s lair is a large stone fort, surrounded by wooden fences.","This seems to be the Leader’s residence and the place where the water bandits gather for meetings, as well as the center protected by the Eight Gates Eight Trigrams Formation.","Outside the stone fort, many water bandits are guarding, and some Formations are laid out.","But these Formations are not sophisticated.","Most importantly, there is no deliberate set of revelation or dust-revealing Formations specifically to counter concealment.","Generally speaking, they indeed don’t have much use for them.","But the current situation is a bit unusual.","Mo Hua, with his superb Minor Five Elements Stealth Skill, moved into the stone fort like a Ghost or Specter.","No one noticed him.","Entering the stone fort, Mo Hua immediately noticed the Water Yama in the hall.","At this moment, the Water Yama was gathering with several people who seemed to be small leaders of the water bandits, discussing something at the table in the middle of the hall.","Rather than discussing, it’s like \"arguing.\"","\"...Who brought those Taoist Court dogs here?!\"","\"How the hell would I know?\"","\"Someone must have leaked the information...\"","\"There’s a traitor among us!\"","\"The terrain around the lair is treacherous, even I don’t know the way.\"","\"Without an insider leading these dogs, I don’t damn believe they could have snuck into the lair.\"","\"And the Formation too...\"","\"Wasn’t this Formation supposed to be as solid as gold soup, that no one could break it? Why the hell does it seem like paper?\"","\"Every advance and retreat is within others’ calculations.\"","\"What’s the damn use of talking about this now? The urgent task is to find a way to fend off the enemy!\"","\"One must settle internal affairs before dealing with external threats, don’t you understand?\"","...","The group of people argued noisily, each holding their views, debating endlessly.","\"Enough!\"","Sitting on high, the fair-skinned, defiant-browed Water Yama appeared deadly serious.","The Water Yama seemed to hold significant authority, as the water bandits sitting below fell silent and dared not speak further.","After a moment, finally, someone spoke in a deep voice:","\"Big Brother, the Taoist Court is about to break in, what do we do now?\"","Someone then shouted: \"Big Brother, let’s kill these dogs!\"","\"How do you kill them? There’s a Golden Core on the other side,\" a nearby water bandit sneered.","\"So what about the Golden Core? This is a Second Grade State Border. If we truly fight to the death, it’s not certain who will die...\"","\"What the hell are you boasting about? Foundation Establishment defeating a Golden Core, show me you can kill one?\"","\"Damn it, you look down on me...\"","...","The group of fierce bandits started arguing again.","Water Yama’s face was icy, internally cursing, as they were a bunch of idiots, who only knew how to fight, without a shred of brains.","\"Enough!\" Water Yama said impatiently, \"As long as the green hills remain, there will be no lack of firewood to burn. I have a backup, and we will escape through a secret passage.\"","\"Big Brother, how can this be? We’ve lost so many brothers, to just flee like this is too... cowardly...\"","Water Yama swung his hand, and a vicious water torture whip was lashed forward.","The speaking small leader of the water bandits had a bloody mark on his face, causing him unbearable pain.","Water Yama’s gaze was icy: \"Didn’t you hear what I said?\"","The small leader immediately looked alarmed, and dared not speak further, while the others also shut their mouths.","Water Yama nodded slightly, with a cold glint in his eyes, \"The vengeance for our brothers will be exacted sooner or later; there’s no rush. The urgent task is to evade their sharpness, settle these accounts later.\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Big Brother is right!\"","\"We follow Big Brother’s command entirely!\"","...","The group of water bandits agreed one after another.","Water Yama said: \"You all retreat first, you have 30 minutes to tidy up; after that, we will depart...\"","\"Yes!\"","The group of water bandits rose to take their leave and gradually exited the hall.","Only Water Yama was left in the hall.","Water Yama remained with a stern face, then muttered, spitting out, \"There really are Taoist Court dogs here...\""]},{"number":1562,"title":"Chapter 1562 - 828: Snatching the Tiger’s Tooth (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Although the words were spoken softly, they still reached Mo Hua’s ears.","Mo Hua, concealed in the corner, frowned upon hearing them.","What does this mean?","Did Water Yama hear something in advance? But he didn’t fully believe it, so he didn’t take extra precautions?","Who told him?","While Mo Hua was pondering, Water Yama had already stood up and was heading to the stone chamber within the hall.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and silently followed.","Based on his experience, Water Yama was likely packing up and preparing to flee.","With the Taoist Court officials at the doorstep and calamity impending, the items he packed were undoubtedly treasures crucial to his life.","Mo Hua followed Water Yama into the stone chamber.","Inside the stone chamber, there was a secret room.","Water Yama, in front of Mo Hua, opened the secret room’s door and entered.","Perhaps being faced with a formidable enemy, Water Yama was somewhat agitated and didn’t notice Mo Hua quietly following him.","Once in the secret room, Mo Hua was somewhat taken aback.","This secret room was entirely different from what he had imagined.","In his mind, this secret room should have had an altar. He just needed to find a way to make Water Yama leave, then sit on the altar, and it would be like \"ordering dishes\" for himself.","After that, he could wait to return to the Sect for a feast.","With a Nineteen Patterns Divine Sense, he could advance further.","But in the secret room before him, there was no altar he desired.","Not to mention an altar, there weren’t even any statues of the Evil God.","It was just a simple secret room used for storing various Spirit Stones, Pills, and loot.","Mo Hua was greatly disappointed.","Although the secret room contained Water Yama’s years of plundering, with invaluable treasures, it was still far inferior compared to a true altar.","As Mo Hua was feeling disappointed, his pupils suddenly contracted.","He saw Water Yama disregarding the dazzling treasures in the room, heading straight to the deepest part, turning a candlestick, and retrieving a box from a hidden compartment in the wall.","The box was wrapped in black cloth.","An icy, sinister aura, full of Evil Qi, instantly spread out.","\"The box...\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","Water Yama, who was always stern and indifferent, suddenly became extremely agitated upon seeing the box, his eyes gleaming with excitement, and even his hands holding the box trembled slightly.","It seemed the box was as important as life itself to him.","Water Yama carefully unwrapped the black cloth.","Underneath the black cloth was a water-blue Jade Box.","On the Jade Box was intricately carved a grim and cold Daoist Prison Map.","The diagram depicted a prison filled with various torture devices, with each device in action, tormenting and torturing, eliciting screams, struggles, and desperate cries for help.","The Jade Box was water-blue, but the diagram was blood-red, seemingly containing a ruthless intent and cold Evil Qi.","Water Yama was mesmerized at a glance.","As if the prisoners in the Daoist Prison, who were tortured to death in despair, were the most beautiful scenery in the world.","He couldn’t help but caress the Jade Box lovingly, reluctant to let go, before he remembered that the crisis was imminent and escaping was the priority.","Water Yama carefully checked the Jade Box once more, ensuring it was undamaged and without anomalies, before he felt relieved.","He covered the Jade Box with the black cloth again, intending to stash it in his Storage Bag...","At this moment, a chill ran straight up to his head.","An extremely gloomy yet intensely ferocious killing intent surged from his back.","Water Yama felt his soul shudder.","\"Someone... is trying to kill me?!\"","As the Death Omen descended, in this critical moment, he bit his jaw until it bled, pushing his entire Spiritual Power to the extreme to dodge the killing intent from behind and simultaneously swung a long whip recklessly towards the back.","His efforts paid off.","The killing intent from behind was dispelled.","Water Yama reacted swiftly, and coupled with his vicious and rapid whip action, forced the cultivator behind him to withdraw their unformed spell and dodge quickly.","Out of the corner of his eye, Water Yama only caught sight of a few extinguished flames.","Though only remnants of an aura were left, it exerted a considerable oppressive force on him.","It seemed that if this spell had succeeded and he couldn’t dodge, his life would have ended on the spot.","\"What exactly... is this spell?\"","Water Yama’s eyes trembled in shock.","And who is ambushing me?!","As the fear in Water Yama’s heart subsided, it was replaced by immense anger.","Just a little more, and he would have been overturned in the gutter!","The Water Yama released his aura to the extreme, his muscles knotted, sinister water power circulating in the meridians, his eyes filled with evil qi.","But before he could uncover his enemy’s tracks, a wave of killing intent came from behind him.","A twisted firelight appeared.","A slight burning sensation, chilling to the heart.","The Water Yama was shocked and immediately flashed at great speed, whipping behind him.","The firelight extinguished once more.","The skill pattern was interrupted again.","The dreadful spell did not coagulate.","The Water Yama breathed a sigh of relief.","And the despicable villain in the shadows, unsuccessful in two stealth attacks, seemed a bit unwilling and anxious.","The Water Yama’s heart stirred slightly, angrily saying:","\"Such a beast, daring to pull a tooth from the tiger’s mouth, truly bold! Even if a great enemy stands before me today, I will capture you and torture you to death with endless punishment!\"","His eyes were filled with killing intent.","This person only knew to conceal and sneak attack, not a threat to face directly.","As long as he was cautious and vigilant, once he caught a flaw, the enemy would surely die.","But before he could think further, a faint red light appeared in the dark secret room.","\"Behind again!\"","The Water Yama sneered.","Having experienced two stealth attacks, he felt himself fully grasping the attacker’s methods and immediately operated his sinister spiritual power, attacking behind him.","But this move was different.","The firelight congealed extremely fast, the skill pattern formed in an instant, the flames pressed against his back, bringing a slight burning sensation.","The Water Yama was initially alarmed, but swiftly calmed down.","The burn on his back was minor, seemingly just a common Fireball Technique, not the terrifying fire spell that made his heart palpitate.","\"What does this mean?\"","This Fireball Technique only serves to itch.","At that moment, another Fireball Technique hit his arm.","His arm felt some burning pain, a bit numb, but nothing more.","The Water Yama even lazily ignored the injury, sneering disdainfully: \"With just this little spell, you want to kill me?\"","But no one responded around him.","The Water Yama frowned.","\"Escaped?\"","So easily gave up?","Truly a coward...","The Water Yama’s lips curled in mockery.","But in the next instant, he sensed something amiss...","The Fireball Technique hit his arm, bringing slight burning pain, numbing his perception. But as his water spiritual power operated several rounds, the burning sensation decreased, perception slowly returned, and the Water Yama suddenly realized, the weight in his hand was off...","It seemed lighter?","The Water Yama’s pupils widened, immediately looking down, heart shaken.","The black cloth clutched in his hand contained a jade box. Even in life and death battle, he never let go.","But now, a cut had been made in the black cloth by someone, and the jade box within...","Was gone?!","The Water Yama’s lips turned white, trembling in rage.","He instantly understood!","First using terrifying spell to create extreme crisis, unable to be distracted.","Then using common spell, causing him to be careless.","Finally, quickly hitting him with Fireball Technique, targeting his left arm.","Taking advantage of the few breaths while his arm burned and perception dulled, cutting the black cloth, stealing the jade box!","The Water Yama instantly lost his mind, eyes crimson.","\"Damned thief!!\"","\"I will tear you to pieces, grind your bones and scatter your ashes!!\"","Meanwhile, outside the stone fortress.","Having seized the moment, Mo Hua pushed the Water Passing Step to the extreme, hugging the jade box, sprinting crazily, eyes gleaming.","Good stuff!","Big profit!","Run quickly!","Then he sent out a firework signal, shouting: \"Uncle Gu, save me!\""]},{"number":1563,"title":"Chapter 1563 - 829: Plundering","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai was standing quite a distance away and didn’t hear Mo Hua’s shout, but he did see that firework signal.","He was very familiar with that firework signal.","\"Mo Hua!\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression tightened.","\"Mo Hua?\" Xia Canonical Official paused, slashing the throat of a water bandit with her icy short sword, and turned to look at Gu Changhuai, frowning, \"Wasn’t he supposed to stay on the boat outside?\"","Gu Changhuai remained silent.","Mo Hua was as wily as a ghost, so he was never surprised by whatever Mo did.","And given his temperament, if he could actually stay still on the boat without stirring up some trouble, that would be a real shock.","After a moment’s thought, Gu Changhuai said, \"I’ll go take a look...\" With that, he used his movement technique, his silhouette like the wind, heading toward the direction of the firework signal.","\"Gu...\"","Xia Canonical Official did not have time to finish her words. Seeing that Gu Changhuai had already left, she shook her head, gave a few instructions to several members of the direct lineage of the Xia family beside her, and also used her movement technique to follow.","Outside the stone fortress, Mo Hua used the Water Passing Step, sprinting wildly with extreme speed, leaving a faint trail of water threads as he weaved through a group of water bandits who were stunned, not knowing what had happened.","Behind him, the Water Yama was going crazy, eyes red, frantically chasing after him, gritting his teeth and shouting:","\"Scoundrel, don’t run!\"","Mo Hua ran even faster.","He had calculated; now, he could only run.","Originally, he wanted to use a Mini Meteorite Spell to sneak attack and take out the Water Yama and seize his jade box.","But the Mini Meteorite Spell has too long a preparation time, and the Water Yama was too vigilant, failing him several times.","Time was also too pressing; there was no time to set up a Formation or use Sword Control.","If he delayed any longer, the jade box would be stashed away into the Water Yama’s Storage Bag.","Once the jade box was in the Water Yama’s Storage Bag, it would be many times harder to snatch it back.","Luckily, with some effort, and taking advantage of the Water Yama’s rush and negligence, he managed to grab the jade box like snatching a tiger’s tooth.","Now that he had the jade box, he definitely couldn’t afford a fight to the death with the Water Yama.","Although Mo Hua didn’t know exactly what the jade box was, judging from the Water Yama’s expression, it was probably more precious than his own life.","With his lifeblood stolen, the current Water Yama was the \"furious\" Water Yama.","Mo Hua wasn’t about to tempt fate.","Moreover, there were a bunch of water bandits around.","So the best solution was to \"run.\"","It wasn’t like he didn’t have \"backup.\"","Mo Hua set off the firework and, under the Water Yama’s mad-dog-like chase, ran for a while. Looking up, he suddenly saw Gu Changhuai, swift as a gale, and immediately delighted, he shouted:","\"Uncle Gu, the Water Yama is here!\"","Water Yama!","Gu Changhuai’s pupils contracted instantly, and his gaze became sharp. The green wind around him transformed into feather-like blades, attacking the Water Yama who was pursuing Mo Hua.","Behind Gu Changhuai, the moment Xia Canonical Official heard Mo Hua shout \"Water Yama,\" her sense of killing intent intensified, and three icy Sword Qi coalesced on her short sword, cutting through the air with chilling sword light, straight for the Water Yama.","\"Two Golden Cores!\"","The Water Yama’s eyes widened in shock.","The feather blades were dazzling, the ice sword chilling, arriving in an instant.","The Water Yama had no choice but to abandon Mo Hua and focus all his energy on confronting Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official’s deadly attacks.","Mo Hua took the opportunity to catch his breath, quietly retreating to one side, taking a moment to put the jade box into his Storage Ring.","In doing so, the Water Yama would never see this precious treasure of his ever again.","Meanwhile, the furious Water Yama was now too occupied to care about anything else.","In terms of raw power, Gu Changhuai at the Golden Core Realm, even with his cultivation limited, could easily suppress him.","Just one Gu Changhuai was enough for him to handle.","Now there was also a Xia Canonical Official.","The Water Yama felt enormous pressure, and within a few exchanges, he had incurred five or six injuries. If it continued like this, in a dozen more moves, he feared he’d be taken down.","The Water Yama’s heart was filled with shock and fury, his eyes turning blood-red, Evil Qi coalescing.","Since his last encounter with the Water Yama, Gu Changhuai had gained experience. The moment the Evil Qi emerged, he felt a sensation in his heart, immediately warning Xia Canonical Official:","\"Don’t look into his eyes!\"","Xia Canonical Official was briefly startled by the warning, but sheeded Gu Changhuai’s advice, avoiding the Water Yama’s eyes, keeping her gaze focused solely on the Water Yama’s heart.","All her sword moves targeted the Water Yama’s heart.","The Water Yama was furious, cursing in his heart:","\"Damn it, how do these two Golden Cores know to guard against my Pupil Skill?!\"","\"Which insider leaked my techniques?\"","Previous encounters with Gu Changhuai saw his face masked, wielding a lesser-used sword, and his identity was related to the \"Water Prison Sect.\"","But the current Gu Changhuai was a Golden Core Steward of the Taoist Court, using a feather fan to activate the Wind Blade Skill, employing spells he usually excelled at, with strength significantly greater than before.","The Water Yama hadn’t recognized him immediately.","A few more exchanges passed, weighing heavily on the Water Yama’s mind.","\"At this rate, I’m going to die! I must escape!\"","\"But if I flee, that jade box...\"","The Water Yama felt as if his heart were being sliced, his eyes turning a blood-red, nearly bleeding.","Then he clenched his teeth fiercely, \"Enough! As long as I’m alive, there’s room to turn things around. What’s lost, I’ll just snatch back later!\"","Decisively, the Water Yama used the Water Shadow Step to evade under Gu Changhuai’s Wind Blades, barely dodging an ice sword, then maximally circulated his Spiritual Power.","His figure suddenly transformed into several water shadows.","These water shadows, like ghosts, lunged at Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, momentarily hindering them.","By the time Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official distinguished the true body among the water shadows, the Water Yama had already escaped nearly ten zhang away.","At this moment, a Water Prison appeared out of thin air, forming six water-shaped Spiritual Locks, tightly binding the Water Yama."]},{"number":1564,"title":"Chapter 1564 - 829: Plundering (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The spells of the Water Prison Sect have \"levels.\"","The three Spiritual Locks are almost useless against the Water Yama.","But with six Spiritual Locks, it indeed trapped the Water Yama for a moment.","Even though this time was still very short, not even a breath.","But the Water Yama’s expression changed:","Water Prison Technique!","He turned his head, looked at Mo Hua hiding in the shadows, and said coldly, \"It’s you?!\"","The remnant of the Water Prison Sect who excels at the Water Prison Technique from the dock?!","No wonder he found this thief’s aura so familiar...","And he instantly realized why this little thief, lurking in the dark, was so painstakingly trying to steal the Water Prison Forbidden Box from his hand.","Because this is the supreme inheritance of the Water Prison Sect.","But immediately, the Water Yama became suspicious.","No, it can’t be...","This thief’s Water Prison Technique has more than doubled in proficiency compared to before.","Even if he were a true disciple of the Water Prison Sect, it would be impossible to advance the Water Prison Technique to such a level in a short time.","Who really is this little thief?","While pondering, Gu Changhuai’s Wind Blade attacked again.","The Water Yama had no time to think deeply, so he had to retreat.","Mo Hua used the Water Prison Technique to trap him again.","But this time, the Water Yama was prepared, and he spread his water strength throughout his body, breaking free as soon as he touched the Water Prison.","Mo Hua’s Water Prison Technique, which could form six Spiritual Locks, was less effective this time.","Thus, the Water Yama fought and fled, accumulating more wounds from the Wind Blade and Ice Sword.","Under the combined attack of Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, the Water Yama was under immense pressure and fled with difficulty.","Moreover, he knew very well that if this continued, he wouldn’t escape the island alive.","Gritting his teeth, the Water Yama conjured several Ghosts and Specters around him.","This time, there were more Water Shadows, as many as seven or eight.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official released their Divine Sense, focusing their eyes, quickly identifying the real body of the Water Yama among the Water Shadows.","Gu Changhuai, eyes sharp, waved his fan, and the Simurgh Feather Wind Blade rose swiftly, ready to slay the Water Yama.","At this moment, one of the Water Shadows’ eyes suddenly turned red, as if soaked in blood.","In its pupils, tormented and wailing souls struggled.","Deadly evilness spread.","\"Not good!\"","Gu Changhuai was startled.","Blood Evil Pupillary Skill!","He actually mixed Pupil Skill into the Water Shadows of the Water Shadow Step!","This Water Yama is truly cunning!","To distinguish the Water Shadows, one must focus on these illusions. But once seen, it undoubtedly gave him the chance to deploy his Pupil Skill.","Gu Changhuai quickly turned his eyes away to avoid the blood-red pupils.","But in the hurried moment, his peripheral vision still caught a glimpse of the blood color, slightly affected by the Pupil Skill.","The Evil Qi seeped into his mind, causing Gu Changhuai’s Divine Sense to blur for a moment.","After a moment, he shook it off, but by then, the Water Yama had already escaped ten feet away.","Mo Hua wasn’t affected by the Pupil Skill, but it wasn’t of much use.","He cast a Water Prison Technique, which hit, but it was ultimately meaningless, failing to hold the slippery Water Yama.","Gu Changhuai turned his head, shook Xia Canonical Official’s shoulder, frowning:","\"Hey, wake up...\"","Xia Canonical Official was caught for the first time, clearly not accustomed to the bloody Deadly Evil Pupillary Skills, so her Divine Sense remained hazy a bit longer.","After being shaken several times, she finally snapped out of it.","Once clear-headed, Xia Canonical Official’s gaze sharpened, not uttering a word, she exchanged a glance with Gu Changhuai, and the two pursued Water Yama together again.","Mo Hua also followed.","But after only a few steps, Mo Hua came to a halt.","Holding his chin, pondering for a moment, he thought deeply: \"Why am I chasing him?\"","The Water Prison Technique is useless.","The small meteorite and Sword Control are useful, but the timing is hard to grasp, plus with Uncle Gu and Sister Xia, both Golden Cores, there’s no lack for his little killing moves.","If Uncle Gu and Sister Xia can catch Water Yama, then they’ll catch him.","If they can’t, going there doesn’t seem to help much either.","Especially since outside the small island lies the Mistwater River.","On land, he can still \"draw the ground into a formation.\"","But in the water, he couldn’t set up formations temporarily.","Moreover, his swimming skills, though not bad, are no match for a ferocious water bandit like Water Yama.","If by any chance Water Yama has reinforcements outside?","Any way you calculate it, chasing over there seems risky and not very meaningful.","In that case, there’s no need to follow and watch the excitement.","Mo Hua lifted his head, surveying all around, taking in the entire small island, a thought struck him.","On the contrary...","Water Yama ran away...","Then on this island, no one can truly threaten him anymore.","Wouldn’t that mean he could do as he pleased?","Even if he digs three feet into the ground on this small island, no one can stop him?","Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel tempted.","If he doesn’t thoroughly search this small island now, once things settle and the items are confiscated by the Taoist Court, he won’t be able to search even if he wants to.","Mo Hua nodded and then, with eyes brightening, began to officially \"loot.\"","At this point, the encirclement had entered its final stages.","The water bandits either dead or ran; those who escaped would likely be caught in the formation traps Mo Hua set or eaten by the Water Demons attracted by the bait.","It’s likely there’s some secret escape route on the island.","But such things, estimated only Water Yama knows.","Mo Hua couldn’t be bothered to manage that.","At least currently, on this small island, the water bandits were no longer a threat.","Mo Hua could use his hands and feet freely.","Based on the island’s geography, the formation layout, and his rich \"looting\" experience, he began scouring each room like a locust."]},{"number":1565,"title":"Chapter 1565 - 829: Plundering (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Even the smallest corners weren’t spared.","Hidden chambers and passages were all found, every box and jar was opened.","Even the skull in the basement left by some unknown deceased person was counted to avoid any omission.","The Water Yama and his band of pirates had killed countless people and stolen countless treasures; the cultivation resources accumulated on the island were indeed abundant.","To hide these items, numerous hidden chambers and warehouses were constructed on the island.","Some pirates with ulterior motives even left many secret compartments.","But none of these could fool Mo Hua.","With his Dao Hua-enhanced Divine Sense and keen Perception, Mo Hua found each of these things.","This included a large number of Spirit Stones, Pills, and Spiritual Artifacts, along with some bizarre Evil Artifacts.","However, Mo Hua took none of these.","The Taoist Court’s people risked their lives to wipe out the pirates.","Now Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official were still pursuing the Water Yama, so he certainly couldn’t take advantage behind their backs.","Otherwise, it would be unfair to everyone.","Moreover, according to the Taoist Court’s rules, these \"stolen items\" would be converted into Merit Points and distributed later.","Mo Hua would also get a share.","Every confiscated stolen item meant a settlement of Merit Points, which counted towards him, so there was no need for Mo Hua to take anything now.","Just finding all the hidden items would benefit everyone, as everyone could share the benefits.","However, one exception existed.","That was the Formation Diagram.","Spirit Stones and Pills didn’t matter, but the Formation Diagram was something Mo Hua must take.","As a Formation Master, the more Formation Diagrams, the better.","And on the island, there were quite a few Formation Diagrams.","Especially in Water Yama’s secret chamber, a large number of Formation Diagrams were hidden.","Part of them related to the Eight Trigrams Array, involving formation patterns, formation principles, Formation Pivot structure, Eight Gates’ routes, and location changes among others.","They were much more detailed than what Mo Hua had deduced himself.","Besides these, there were various other Formation Diagrams.","Some were complex, some were simple, ranging from Five Elements to Eight Trigrams, even some obscure minor formations, there was everything.","Presumably, they were all looted by the Water Yama and his gang.","The Water Yama himself wasn’t proficient in Formation, but he likely understood their value, which is why he collected all these Formation Diagrams.","But this turned out to be to Mo Hua’s advantage.","Mo Hua carefully selected, leaving behind some simple, common, easy-to-comprehend Formation Diagrams.","All the rest, which were complex, profound, rare, ones he hadn’t seen before or wasn’t familiar with, he gladly accepted.","The Storage Bag was packed full.","Mo Hua nodded, very satisfied.","He continued to scavenge along the way.","Mo Hua found some more Formation Diagrams, and also discovered some hidden chambers with Spirit Stone treasures, but only one thing puzzled Mo Hua.","The altar was still not found.","\"How could there be no altar on this island?\"","\"It shouldn’t be...\"","Mo Hua muttered, frowning.","According to his original idea, as the Water Yama, holding the title of \"Venerable,\" he must have been guarding an Evil God Altar like the Fire Buddha.","The cultivators of the Yu Family water fortress were the \"sacrifices\" of this altar.","But the island where the Water Yama stationed showed no sign of any altar, nor any trace of \"sacrifice.\"","This was very strange...","\"Where exactly is the altar?\"","Mo Hua couldn’t fathom it. After a moment, he shook his head.","\"Forget it, let’s see if Uncle Gu and Sister Xia catch the Water Yama later and then find a way to ask about the altar...\"","He continued to scavenge room by room.","The entire small island had been almost completely scavenged by him, with only a few hidden chambers remaining.","Once the search was finished, he could wrap things up.","But when Mo Hua searched a chamber by the water’s edge, somewhat remote, he found it already occupied.","This person was rummaging through boxes and cupboards, seemingly searching for something.","When he noticed Mo Hua, he suddenly turned his head, a fierce light in his eyes, but upon recognizing Mo Hua, this light faded.","He put on a friendly smile, \"Little... Young Master Mo, what brings you here?\"","Mo Hua had the same puzzled look, \"Brother Xiao, what are you doing here?\"","This person’s eyes flickered slightly and then he smiled:","\"Pirates are cunning, I came to see if there were any that escaped the net...\"","Mo Hua nodded.","\"And you? What are you doing here?\" the man’s gaze narrowed, quickly asking.","Mo Hua brought up Gu Changhuai, \"Uncle Gu asked me to search around to see if there were any hidden stolen goods on the island.\"","After saying this, Mo Hua looked around cautiously and nervously asked, \"Are there any ferocious pirates here?\"","\"No...\"","\"That’s good...\" Mo Hua obviously breathed a sigh of relief.","After a while of silence inside, the person said:","\"I’ve checked, it’s very safe here. You might find some stolen goods if you look further. I have something to attend to, so I won’t accompany you.\"","Mo Hua also smiled, \"Okay, thank you, Brother Xiao.\"","The person in the chamber smiled kindly at Mo Hua and then got up and left.","After the person left, Mo Hua’s smile gradually faded, revealing a thought-provoking expression.","Xiao Tianquan...","What was he doing in this chamber?","What was he... searching for?","Mo Hua slightly frowned, looked around, and found the chamber to be simple, clean yet empty, easily surveyed with a glance.","He extended his Divine Sense but sensed nothing.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and then left the chamber.","Just after leaving the chamber, Mo Hua looked up to find Xiao Tianquan not far away.","Xiao Tianquan didn’t seem to have gone far.","Perhaps he pretended to walk far away, but actually didn’t leave.","Seeing Mo Hua emerge, Xiao Tianquan feigned some surprise and smiled, \"Young Master Mo, didn’t find anything?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"Nothing at all, so poor, I’ll check elsewhere.\"","Xiao Tianquan nodded and said, \"Okay, be careful, watch out for pirates.\"","\"Mm!\"","Mo Hua nodded and left.","After Mo Hua left, Xiao Tianquan’s expression turned blank as he silently watched Mo Hua’s back, his gaze obscure and ever-changing.","As Mo Hua nonchalantly walked away, he vaguely sensed a piercing, chilling presence on his back.","This was killing intent.","\"This Xiao Tianquan, has murderous intentions. He wants to kill me...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze turned slightly cold.","But it was only killing intent; Xiao Tianquan hadn’t actually made a move.","Behind Mo Hua stood Gu Changhuai, and for some reason, he also had a decent relationship with Xia Canonical Official from the Taoist Court.","Xiao Tianquan’s gaze held caution, quietly hiding his intentions, his face once again donning a subtle smile as he turned to walk in another direction.","However, while passing a corpse of a dead pirate, he drew a longsword and stabbed multiple holes into the body, watching as it became bloody and flesh-torn, blood flowing all over the ground before calmly stopping."]},{"number":1566,"title":"Chapter 1566 - 830: The Forbidden Casket","paragraphs":["Xiao Tianquan’s killing intent has subsided.","The chill behind Mo Hua disappeared, but the doubts in his heart grew deeper.","This Xiao Tianquan... what exactly is he looking for?","Is he related to the water pirates?","Does he know the Water Yama?","Mo Hua recalled various signs from Xiao Tianquan along the way.","During the eradication of the water pirates, at least on the surface, Xiao Tianquan didn’t have any problems nor was he secretly up to anything.","He fulfilled all the tasks arranged by the Xia Canonical Official without any deviation.","When he was killing the water pirates, he truly slaughtered them, leaving no room for sentiment.","He was even more ruthless than others.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","\"The Xiao family, Xiao Tianquan... is a bit strange.\"","Then he searched all the remaining secret rooms, obtained one formation diagram, and found some stolen goods.","After that, there was nothing else.","Searched what should be searched, found what should be found, and what couldn’t be found was simply gone.","Mo Hua then picked a scenic high platform on the island to sit and look at the distant misty moonlit Mistwater River, waiting for news from Uncle Gu and Sister Xia.","About one hour later, Gu Changhuai and the Xia Canonical Official returned.","Both were weary, their expressions stern.","Mo Hua sighed, guessing in his heart that the Water Yama had escaped again.","Gu Changhuai’s face was a bit unsightly, \"There is a hidden passage on the island, the Water Yama had a backup plan and escaped through the passage...\"","\"We chased after him, but the Water Yama’s skills in the water are too good. Once he touches the water, he becomes like a dragon, his Taoist skill stronger, movement technique faster, riding the waves in the river, coming and going as he pleases.\"","\"But he was injured before, lost vital energy, ultimately falling behind. Seeing he was about to fall into dire straits, he suddenly swam toward the adjacent Third Grade river region...\"","\"Third Grade?\" Mo Hua was a bit surprised.","\"Yes.\" Gu Changhuai nodded.","Mo Hua thought, \"In the Third Grade, wouldn’t the Water Yama... be an even match for you and Sister Xia?\"","After all, the Water Yama was only at Foundation Establishment Peak, relying on Heavenly Dao’s suppression to contend with Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official, who were at the Golden Core Realm.","Entering the Third Grade Territory, wouldn’t he be seeking his own end?","Gu Changhuai’s gaze turned cold, \"This beast was indeed seeking death. As soon as he entered the Third Grade waters without cultivation restrictions, I used the Golden Core Power. With just one Wind Blade, I severed his arm.\"","Mo Hua was quite shocked.","Gu Changhuai seemed to understand Mo Hua’s thoughts and glanced at him, \"You wouldn’t really think I, a Golden Core, couldn’t defeat Foundation Establishment, would you?\"","Mo Hua shook his head repeatedly, sheepishly saying, \"Of course not.\"","Gu Changhuai looked displeased, and then he frowned:","\"Watching the next Wind Blade about to take Water Yama’s life... Right at that moment, someone intervened to save him.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed, \"Who?\"","Gu Changhuai shook his head, his expression grave, \"This person’s cultivation is deep, but he hid himself, not using any of his Taoist skills. After saving Water Yama, he submerged into the water and disappeared, nowhere to be found.\"","\"It’s as if a layer of mist covered everything...\"","\"Mist...\" Mo Hua’s heart trembled.","The Xia Canonical Official, silent until now, sighed:","\"Although Water Yama escaped, at least the pirate village was broken, and the water pirates eradicated. This raid was quite effective, and there will be rewards from the Taoist Court.\"","She then glanced at Mo Hua, her voice softening, \"Thanks to your help in this raid, I will apply for more Merit Points for you.\"","Mo Hua said, \"Thank you, Sister Xia.\"","The Xia Canonical Official had become accustomed to being called \"Sister Xia.\"","Especially after witnessing Mo Hua’s talent and expertise in formation during the mission, the Xia Canonical Official felt even less opposed to Mo Hua calling her \"sister.\"","\"I have some aftermath to handle, take care of yourself. After dawn, we’ll return home.\" The Xia Canonical Official said.","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua nodded.","The Xia Canonical Official gave Mo Hua a gentle look and then left.","Mo Hua was curious, quietly asking Gu Changhuai, \"The Water Yama escaped; Sister Xia doesn’t seem anxious?\"","Gu Changhuai cast a faint glance at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua stared back at Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai helplessly sighed before speaking:","\"The Water Yama is the fish, but also the bait. Now there’s a bigger fish that has taken the bait, naturally nothing bad about that.\"","\"Although this big fish swallowed the bait and ran away, at least it surfaced.\"","\"This is Qian Learning State Boundary, still within the Taoist Court’s setup. No matter how big the fish exposed on the surface is not to fear, what’s fearsome is when you hide in the depths without showing yourself.\"","Mo Hua understood and nodded.","For the Taoist Court and the Xia family, this raid on the water pirates is not the end, but the beginning.","Future situations are likely to be more complicated.","Wondering if he could still profit amidst the chaos...","While Mo Hua was pondering, Gu Changhuai suddenly asked him, \"By the way, why did the Water Yama chase you with red eyes?\"","Mo Hua paused.","Because I took his lifeline...","Gu Changhuai silently looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua coughed and said vaguely:","\"Because... he was secretly packing to escape, and I accidentally found out, so he was embarrassed and enraged, wanting to kill me. Uncle Gu, you know, people like Water Yama have very petty characters...\"","Gu Changhuai knew instantly that Mo Hua was speaking nonsense.","But then he thought, the thought of these bandits wanting to kill Mo Hua seemed only natural.","Sometimes he couldn’t help but want to strangle this kid.","Gu Changhuai suddenly empathized and decided not to pursue the issue further.","\"I also have things to do, you stay honest here, we’ll return together later.\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua agreed.","Then Gu Changhuai got up and left as well."]},{"number":1567,"title":"Chapter 1567 - 830: Forbidden Casket (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were busy handling the aftermath.","The surroundings were empty; besides the bodies of the water bandits scattered around haphazardly, only Mo Hua was left.","Feeling a bit bored, he jumped back onto the high platform, sat on its edge, and gazed at the distant scenery.","An hour later, it was 6 A.M.","The east had brightened, the sun gradually rose, driving away the water mist on the island, and the radiant morning sun shone on the bodies of the water bandits littering the ground.","Mo Hua sat on the high platform, silently watching the sun rise.","But the water bandits beneath his feet would never see it again.","...","Another two hours passed, and the Taoist Court had finished handling the aftermath.","It was quicker than Xia Canonical Official had expected.","Because Mo Hua had already searched the island, all they had to do was count the heads, tally the loot, and bring everything back to the Taoist Court.","Mo Hua’s thorough search had saved them a lot of effort.","Xia Canonical Official sighed in his heart.","After tallying everything, they assembled their manpower.","Some water bandits who weren’t dead were knocked unconscious, chained up, and taken back to the Taoist Court as well.","Then everyone boarded the Spirit Boat and headed back home.","On their way there, it was night, the river water was chilly, and the surroundings were dim and oppressive.","On their way back, it was already morning, the sunlight was clear, scattering on the river’s surface, sparkling brightly.","Everyone felt slightly more at ease in their hearts.","Only Xiao Tianquan was expressionless, lost in thought.","After traveling for another hour, the Spirit Boat docked, and everyone stepped onto the ground, feeling much more secure.","Upon returning, they would handle the treatment for the injured and compensation for the casualties, and the matter of the water bandits would be temporarily concluded.","Fighting always involves casualties and injuries.","The cultivators who worked in the Taoist Court for years understood this well.","Though Mo Hua felt regret, he had done everything he could.","Otherwise, breaking the Eight Gates Eight Trigrams Array on the island with the water bandits and the tough battle under their formation would have resulted in even more severe casualties for the Taoist Court.","Compared to the results of eliminating the bandits, the casualties this time were already considered very small.","Afterwards, there wasn’t much for Mo Hua to do.","He planned to return to the Sect to study the good things he had just acquired, but at that moment, he heard a voice by his ear saying:","\"Xia Canonical Official, should we examine the Storage Bags?\"","Everyone was stunned by this statement.","Xia Canonical Official was also a bit puzzled.","Gu Changhuai’s gaze was somewhat cold as he looked at the speaker.","The speaker was none other than Xiao Tianquan.","Xia Canonical Official said calmly, \"Weren’t they already checked?\"","According to the Taoist Court’s rules, all the cultivators of the Taoist Court are not allowed to carry their own Storage Bags during missions.","For special missions, the Taoist Court provides standardized Storage Bags for the Supervisors and Enforcement Leaders to store their Spiritual Artifacts and some Spirit Stones and Pills specifically supplied by the Taoist Court.","After the mission is completed, the Storage Bags are collected and verified one by one.","This is to ensure that the cultivators within the Taoist Court do not secretly stash \"spoils\" and pocket them during missions.","Although this rule can’t completely eliminate \"private hoarding,\" it can prevent about eighty to ninety percent of it.","And that’s enough.","No rule can be a hundred percent effective, but preventing the majority of corruption is considered quite effective.","Previously on the island, Xia Canonical Official had, of course, followed the procedures and checked all the cultivators’ Storage Bags.","\"Yes, checked, but not all...\" Xiao Tianquan said, then silently glanced at Mo Hua, \"This little brother’s Storage Bag wasn’t checked.\"","He wore a serious expression, adhering to a \"business is business\" attitude.","Xia Canonical Official couldn’t help but frown.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was indifferent, \"He’s not part of our Taoist Court.\"","Xiao Tianquan said solemnly, \"Even though he’s not from the Taoist Court, since he’s working with the Taoist Court, he should follow the Taoist Court’s rules...\"","Xiao Tianquan looked at Gu Changhuai with eyes full of keen light, \"Could it be that Supervisor Gu is trying to protect this little brother?\"","Gu Changhuai’s eyelids twitched slightly, and his gaze grew even colder.","The atmosphere turned somewhat stiff for a moment.","Xia Canonical Official turned her head, glanced at Mo Hua, and looked troubled.","Logically speaking, it should be checked.","But Mo Hua’s situation was special; if no one had mentioned it, no one would have been so tactless as to think of checking a little cultivator’s Storage Bag.","But now that Xiao Tianquan had brought it up, it had to be rigorously addressed.","Otherwise, as Xia family’s Canonical Official, it would be hard for her to command respect.","The Xia family was full of geniuses, and the pressure of competition among the disciples was immense.","She could command everyone, but behind her back, tongues would undoubtedly wag and gossip.","Just, if they were really to examine Mo Hua...","Xia Canonical Official glanced at Mo Hua, her eyes probing.","Mo Hua touched his right thumb, where the Storage Ring that was connected to his flesh and unseen by others was, nodded and said:","\"Everyone else’s was checked, I shouldn’t be an exception.\"","He was straightforward, handing the Storage Bag over to Xia Canonical Official.","Xia Canonical Official looked at Mo Hua with some surprise, then sent her Divine Sense into the Storage Bag and took everything out inside.","There were some Spirit Stones, but not many.","There were some backup Pills with the Taixu Gate’s Sect imprint, some with the Gu family’s mark.","These Pills were gifts from Elder Murong and Wenren Wan to Mo Hua.","In addition, there were some Spirit Swords, Spiritual Artifacts, formation coals, etc.","But all of them appeared to be legally obtained, without a single piece of water bandit \"loot.\"","The only unusual thing was the Formation Diagrams.","A large pile of Formation Diagrams, densely packed, layered on top of each other.","Moreover, the composition of these Formation Diagrams was extremely complex."]},{"number":1568,"title":"Chapter 1568 - 830: Forbidden Casket (Part 3)","paragraphs":["There are those from the Taixu Gate, the Shangguan Family, the Wenren Family, the Gu Family, and some items scavenged from the island.","From First Grade to High-level Second Grade, they all abound, encompassing a broad range.","The Five Elements of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth, the Gen Mountain Formation in the Eight Trigrams, Fire Formation, Dui Ze Formation, Kan Water Formation, and some Original Magnet Formations, a myriad of arrays.","Everyone took a slight gasp of breath.","Even cultivators who don’t understand formations generally know how profound and complex these formations are.","The more one knows about formations, the more one understands the difficulty of delving into these formation diagrams.","To be able to carry so many, such complex formation diagrams with him, this young brother must indeed have an extremely profound lineage in Formation Study, and his formation attainments are undoubtedly superior. His perseverance and determination in learning formations are also extraordinary. His future in formations is likely unlimited.","A group of Court Officials looked at Mo Hua with eyes full of respect.","Even Xia Canonical Official was somewhat amazed.","A storage bag full of formation diagrams...","No wonder someone so young has such superior attainment in formations.","With such talent, perceptiveness, and diligence, at his age, it’s truly admirable...","Xia Canonical Official sighed in relief.","Previously, she did have some anxiety in her heart.","She thought that after all, Mo Hua was young, lacking restraint, and after turning over the small island, he might ’withhold’ a little.","This is common human behavior, even some Supervisors can’t avoid it.","But she didn’t expect that Mo Hua’s nature was so upright and candid, not taking a penny of illicit gains.","As for these formation diagrams... their origin is already complex and difficult to verify.","Even if some of these formation diagrams were indeed scavenged by Mo Hua from the island, nobody dared to gossip at this point.","A Formation Master is naturally respected.","It is only right for a Formation Master to take a few formation diagrams.","Moreover, Mo Hua broke the formations on the island and did not demand special compensation, so taking a few formation diagrams is naturally justified.","She realized she had judged a noble heart with a petty mind.","With this unexpected guilt, Xia Canonical Official looked at Mo Hua with newfound respect.","This child in the future, if he enters the Taoist Court, to become a Supervisor who upholds his integrity, he might achieve great things.","Xia Canonical Official expressed appreciation in her heart and then glanced at Xiao Tianquan, saying calmly:","\"Xiao Zhisi, what do you think?\"","Xiao Tianquan’s eyes lingered over Mo Hua’s storage bag several times, finally with some reluctance, but he still cupped his hands and said:","\"No problem.\"","Then he saluted Mo Hua again, smiling and saying: \"It was rude of me, please forgive me, young brother.\"","Mo Hua happily said: \"It’s nothing, it’s nothing.\"","Seeing that Mo Hua didn’t mind, Xia Canonical Official nodded slightly and instructed:","\"Alright, let’s head back.\"","Afterward, everyone returned smoothly without any incident on the way.","But Mo Hua had already confirmed...","This Howling Celestial Dog was indeed looking for something.","And this thing is extremely important.","Even at such a critical moment, it couldn’t help but come forward at the wrong time, risking offending Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official to check his storage bag.","\"Because if it’s not checked now, once we return to the Qianxue State Boundary and go our separate ways, the Howling Celestial Dog would never know if I really found something on Water Island...\"","\"What does it want to find on me?\"","\"What is so crucial?\"","\"Could it be... that Jade Box from Shui Yan’s lair?\"","Mo Hua gently rubbed his thumb, contemplating for a moment, his gaze focused.","\"No matter what, this ledger, I’ll remember it...\"","\"To openly target me, show killing intent to kill me...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes turned slightly cold.","...","Arriving at the Qianxue State Boundary, Xia Canonical Official and the others returned to the Taoist Court.","Gu Changhuai, though silent, personally escorted Mo Hua back to the Mountain Gate of the Taixu Gate.","He seemed to have realized something but didn’t say much, only advising Mo Hua:","\"Be careful of the Xiao family, focus on your cultivation in the sect, and don’t wander unnecessarily.\"","\"Hmm, don’t worry Uncle Gu,\" Mo Hua replied.","Gu Changhuai nodded lightly and turned to leave.","Mo Hua then presented the Taixu Token and entered the Mountain Gate alone.","Back at the sect, it was just noon.","Mo Hua first sought out Elder Song to cancel his leave, then returned to the Disciple’s Residence, bathed, burned incense, dispelled blood qi, and changed into the Taixu Gate Taoist Robe, then nonchalantly went to attend classes.","The teaching elder, knowing that Mo Hua had Elder Master Xun’s support and was a ’special case’ in the sect, said nothing more.","The other disciples, knowing that Mo Hua often went out to ’draw formations’, had gotten used to it over time and were therefore not surprised.","Just like that, Mo Hua spent the morning drawing formations to eliminate bandits and returned to the sect in the afternoon to attend class obediently.","In the evening, after dinner, Mo Hua practiced formation with Yu Er for a while, then returned to the Disciple’s Residence, secured the doors and windows, sealed the formations, and then carefully retrieved from the Storage Ring the Jade Box he snatched from Shui Yan.","The Jade Box was heavy in his hand, made of an unknown water-blue jade material from its appearance.","On the Jade Box was engraved a diagram.","In the secrecy of Shui Yan’s lair, Mo Hua had no time to look closely, but back in the sect, he could finally inspect it carefully.","Stern prisons, grim torture devices, various tortured prisoners struggling, crying out, and wailing.","The water-blue Jade Box and the bloody Prison Diagram.","It contained intense evil qi.","\"Is this... a Contemplation Map?\"","Mo Hua was somewhat puzzled.","He released his divine sense, fully focused, staring at the prison diagram on the Jade Box for a long time, but found nothing unusual."]},{"number":1569,"title":"Chapter 1569 - 830: Forbidden Casket (Part 4)","paragraphs":["There are no evil spirits emerging.","It seems there are also no vengeful ghosts or the like residing within the map.","Apart from the cold evil qi, Mo Hua sensed nothing else.","\"Not a contemplation map? Just a box?\"","Mo Hua frowned and tried to open the jade box.","But after several attempts, the jade box didn’t budge at all.","Mo Hua squinted his eyes to take a closer look, only to realize that although it looked like a \"box,\" it had no seams, no lid, no lock, just like a single piece of \"flawless\" jade brick...","\"Not a contemplation map, no evil spirit.\"","\"No lock, no seams, can’t be opened.\"","\"And no idea what’s inside.\"","Mo Hua felt a bit at a loss for the moment.","\"Should I capture the Water Yama and ask?\"","This thought had just arisen when Mo Hua dismissed it.","The Water Yama had been rescued by a Golden Core, whereabouts unknown now; it’s really not easy to capture him.","Even if captured, it probably wouldn’t be useful.","Knowing the nature of the Water Yama, if he found out someone stole his jade box, he’d definitely want to swallow that person whole, bones and all, so it was absolutely impossible for him to reveal the secrets of the jade box.","So what to do with this jade box?","Can’t just sit there watching, right?","Mo Hua was curious and suddenly felt an urgency.","He really wanted to open the jade box and see what’s inside.","Since understanding a bit of the Heavenly secret Calculation and learning about the Way of Cause and Effect, Mo Hua occasionally had some inexplicable \"intuition.\"","At this moment, he vaguely had such an intuition that the jade box was perhaps crucial to him...","Could it be...","Mo Hua’s heart skipped slightly, filled with anticipation.","\"Can’t seek the Water Yama, then I can only find another person.\"","The other, a descendant of the Water Prison Sect.","A few days later, during a rest period, Mo Hua found time to visit the Gu Family again, but this time he wasn’t looking for Gu Changhuai, he found Yu Canghai instead.","This elder of the Water Prison Sect was probably the only surviving Golden Core of the sect now.","When Yu Canghai saw Mo Hua, he was very courteous, cupping his hands in salute and said:","\"My young friend, long time no see.\"","He was a Golden Core, and Mo Hua was in Foundation Establishment, but his treatment of Mo Hua was more like addressing him as an equal.","After all, in front of Mo Hua, this \"strong background,\" \"deep connections,\" disciple of a great sect, this fallen Golden Core of the Water Prison Sect didn’t dare to act superior at all.","Mo Hua exchanged a few pleasantries, then subtly inquired about matters of the Water Prison Sect, especially its form of inheritance.","But Yu Canghai, having a deep mind, answered just enough, without leaking any information.","Neither evasive nor offensive to Mo Hua.","Yet, not saying too much, to avoid revealing sect secrets.","Unable to get the information he wanted, Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly, then lowered his voice and quietly asked: \"A few days ago, I went to capture the Water Yama...\"","Though deeply thoughtful, Yu Canghai’s heart skipped at this moment, and he stood up abruptly, his expression shocked.","Seeing Elder Yu’s reaction, Mo Hua realized that Uncle Gu hadn’t told him about the Water Yama incident.","Yu Canghai wanted to ask but didn’t know how to begin, finally stammering:","\"That evil beast... he...\"","Mo Hua sighed, \"Not dead, escaped.\"","Yu Canghai sat down in disappointment, utterly deflated.","\"But in the hands of the Water Yama, he seems to have something very unusual...\" Mo Hua frowned.","\"Something?\" Yu Canghai frowned.","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, feigning ignorance, and described to Yu Canghai, \"It’s a jade box, water blue, with patterns engraved on it, depicting a prison with someone inside suffering torture, looking pained and desperate...\"","Mo Hua hadn’t finished when he noticed Yu Canghai suddenly widen his eyes, utterly astonished, his body trembling uncontrollably:","\"The... Water Prison Forbidden Box...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly.","So that’s the name of it."]},{"number":1570,"title":"Chapter 1570 - 831: Righteous Evilness","paragraphs":["Water Prison Forbidden Box.","There is a \"Forbidden\" character within...","Mo Hua’s eyes gradually brightened and he quietly asked: \"Elder Yu, what is the Water Prison Forbidden Box?\"","Yu Canghai was suddenly taken aback when Mo Hua mentioned this box, momentarily losing his composure. Regaining some calm, he looked at Mo Hua’s curious face and hesitated to speak, vaguely saying:","\"It’s nothing, just a lost inheritance of our Water Prison Sect. I heard it fell into the hands of that beast, and I was momentarily indignant.\"","\"Oh...\"","Seeing he wasn’t going to say more, Mo Hua felt a bit displeased.","This Elder Yu, in his speech, was secretive, which was quite annoying.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and then sighed, regretfully saying:","\"It’s a pity, two Golden Core Stewards from the Taoist Court made a move, but still let Water Yama escape. With his cunning, I’m afraid we’ll never catch him again, and this Jade Box might never be recovered...\"","Upon these words, Yu Canghai’s body trembled and he stood up in shock.","\"Never be recovered again...\"","\"Hmm,\" Mo Hua nodded, helplessly saying: \"After all, it was in the Second Grade State Border. As long as Water Yama enters the water, he’s afraid of no one. Never mind two Golden Cores, even if there were seven or eight, it would probably be difficult to catch him...\"","Mo Hua appropriately \"praised\" Water Yama.","But Yu Canghai believed him.","He had tangled with Water Yama before and deeply knew Water Yama’s cunning and difficulty.","Moreover, this was in Mistwater River.","The vast waters and complex river of Mistwater River itself were the best barriers for Water Yama, as proficient in water as a water dragon.","Yu Canghai’s expression became extremely grave, filled with intense anxiety.","If Water Yama couldn’t be caught, and the Water Prison Forbidden Box couldn’t be recaptured, wouldn’t the top-tier inheritance of his Water Prison Sect forever, forever be in others’ hands?","Mo Hua observed, inwardly understanding, and pretended not to know, softly asking:","\"Elder Yu, is this forbidden box a very important inheritance?\"","Elder Yu was startled, and then, with dry eyes, reluctantly smiled, \"It’s somewhat important... but not tremendously so, it’s not a truly superior inheritance...\"","\"I see...\" Mo Hua was relieved, saying in a relaxed tone, \"Then I am reassured. If it’s just a general inheritance, even if it falls into Water Yama’s hands, it’s no big deal.\"","\"I’ll go and tell Uncle Gu later, no need to rush regarding the box. We can take it slowly; in a hundred years or decades, we can capture Water Yama and retrieve it...\"","Elder Yu had a bitter face.","A hundred years or a few decades.","Others may have time to look, but he may not have so much time to live.","If he dies and the Water Prison Forbidden Box is still not found, then...","Elder Yu sighed deeply and glanced at Mo Hua.","At this moment, how could he not know that Mo Hua was \"pressuring\" him with the issue of the Water Prison Forbidden Box, seeking his attitude?","If he shared the information, Mo Hua would use his connections to catch Water Yama and find the Jade Box.","If he kept silent, Mo Hua would wash his hands of the matter.","Elder Yu was helpless.","This is the inheritance of the Water Prison Sect, a genuine secret he originally didn’t want to tell anyone, unless he found someone who could truly inherit the Water Prison Sect’s Taoist legacy.","But now, it seemed that he had to say it.","If he didn’t, these secrets, along with the Water Prison Sect’s legacy, would be buried in his grave.","In the netherworld, how could he face the ancestors of the Water Prison Sect?","\"Forget it... it might be better to tell this young fellow.\"","\"Even if in the end, this box falls into this young fellow’s hands, it’s better than leaving it with that beast Water Yama.\"","Yu Canghai remained silent for a moment, then slowly spoke: \"Brother, you are a sensible person, wise people speak straightforwardly, so I will... not hide it anymore...\"","He sighed, his expression incredibly solemn, saying, \"This Water Prison Forbidden Box is the... highest inheritance of my Water Prison Sect, historically passed only from Sect Leader to Sect Leader!\"","Mo Hua was shocked.","He already knew that the Jade Box was not simple, but he hadn’t expected it to be so precious.","Not passed except to a Sect Leader!","In the present, that means in a Twelve Streams level sect, surpassing the Outer Gate, Inner Gate, direct lineage, and core direct lineages, only the Sect Leader can learn this Taoist legacy!","The level of inheritance is much higher than what he currently has at the Taixu Gate.","Moreover, this was a sect from a thousand years ago among the \"Twelve Streams.\"","Compared to now’s Twelve Streams sects, the Taoist legacy is purer, more profound, and more unique.","Seeing Elder Yu speak, Mo Hua no longer held back, and directly asked:","\"In the Water Prison ’Forbidden’ Box, does the ’Forbidden’ character refer to... Forbidden Techniques?\"","Yu Canghai’s eyelid twitched.","The words Forbidden Techniques do not exist in a regular cultivator’s consciousness.","Aside from madmen who chase after Forbidden Techniques, ordinary cultivators avoid such Taoist Court prohibitions and forbidden spells.","But Mo Hua said it casually, as if Forbidden Techniques were no big deal...","What kind of Tao cultivation education has this young man received in his sect?","Yu Canghai’s eyes narrowed slightly, pondering for a moment, then he nodded, slowly saying:","\"It has that meaning...\"","\"The ’Forbidden’ character in the Water Prison Forbidden Box first refers to a prohibition. This Jade Box is, for the entire Water Prison Sect, a forbidden item not to be touched by anyone except the Sect Leader. Those who violate this, at the very least will have their cultivation abolished and be expelled from the sect, at the worst will be thrown into the Water Prison, sinking for life, never to see daylight...\"","Mo Hua’s expression became serious.","The Water Prison Sect, indeed once a \"Hawk Dog\" of the Taoist Court, even established a Water Prison and set up private punishments..."]},{"number":1571,"title":"Chapter 1571 - 831: Righteous Evilness (2)","paragraphs":["Subsequently, he thought to himself, \"Luckily, I am not a disciple of the Water Prison Sect; otherwise, having touched the Water Prison Forbidden Box, wouldn’t my cultivation be abolished, and I’d be thrown into the water prison, never to see the light of day?\"","Yu Canghai was unaware of Mo Hua’s little thoughts and continued:","\"The second point refers to the ’Forbidden Technique.’","\"What Forbidden Technique?\"","Yu Canghai hesitated for a moment, then solemnly said, \"It’s a pupil skill.\"","Mo Hua thought it indeed was, \"The kind of pupil skill Shui Yan uses?\"","Unexpectedly, Yu Canghai was shocked and said, \"Shui Yan knows pupil skills?\"","Mo Hua was also surprised and said, \"You don’t know?\"","Yu Canghai’s face turned slightly pale, and he shook his head.","\"That’s not right,\" Mo Hua frowned, \"Didn’t you have a confrontation with Shui Yan? He didn’t use pupil skills on you?\"","Yu Canghai’s expression was complex, \"No, I fell into their ambush, trapped by nearly a hundred foundation building cultivators, consumed by them in turns, with Shui Yan secretly attacking.\"","\"In such a situation, let alone being unable to use the Golden Core power, even if I could use my Golden Core cultivation, I would not be a match for them...\"","\"Apart from those exceptionally talented cultivators with outstanding killing techniques, generally speaking, a Golden Core early stage cultivator’s cultivation power is approximately ten times that of the foundation establishment late stage.\"","\"I possess Golden Core middle stage cultivation, which is considerably strong, yet even so, it would be impossible to remain unscathed amidst the assault of nearly a hundred foundation building cultivators.\"","\"Moreover, there’s the suppression by the Heavenly Dao, as most of these water brigands have practiced evil skills, inherently being desperadoes, slaughtering ruthlessly...\"","\"Oh.\"","Mo Hua nodded in agreement, but then felt somewhat confused.","Why wouldn’t Shui Yan use pupil skills in front of Elder Yu?","Could it be, he was afraid of being recognized?","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, feeling slightly surprised.","This Water Prison Jade Box likely also has an \"improper origin.\"","Hence, in front of Elder Yu, a person from the Water Prison Sect, he dared not use pupil skills.","He feared being seen through by Elder Yu, letting others know that this forbidden box is in his possession.","And previously at the pier, when they had an unexpected encounter, Shui Yan noticed Mo Hua could perform the Water Prison Technique, mistaking him for a remnant of the Water Prison Sect, intending to kill him to silence the witness.","Besides other reasons, it was very likely because he felt great pressure confronting Uncle Gu and had to resort to using pupil skills.","Afraid the origin of his pupil skills would be recognized by Mo Hua, this \"Water Prison Sect remnant.\"","That being said, could this Water Prison Forbidden Box have been stolen by Shui Yan from somewhere?","From where? Gui Water Sect?","Mo Hua frowned and contemplated.","Yu Canghai then asked solemnly, \"What is Shui Yan’s pupil skill like?\"","Mo Hua recalled for a moment and said, \"The evil qi is heavy, the eyes are red, as if soaked in blood water, within which are many strange figures, resembling humans yet appearing like demons, seemingly trapped in purgatory, constantly struggling, suffering, howling...\"","Yu Canghai furrowed his brows even more.","Mo Hua asked, \"Is this your Water Prison Sect’s pupil skill?\"","Unexpectedly, Elder Yu pondered for a moment but shook his head, saying, \"Not exactly...\"","Mo Hua was stunned, \"Not exactly?\"","Yu Canghai nodded and said, \"This pupil skill of Shui Yan is bloody and sinister, heavy with malevolent qi, evidently a Demon Path spell point.\"","\"My Water Prison Sect is a Righteous Sect. Even if our actions are harsh and ruthless, we would certainly not treat such a bloody pupil skill as a sect-protecting faction technique. Even if we wished to do so, the Taoist Court wouldn’t allow it.\"","Mo Hua pondered and couldn’t help but nod, \"Indeed.\"","Then he questioned, \"So, what exactly is Shui Yan’s pupil skill about?\"","\"I haven’t seen it firsthand, so I cannot say for sure, but generally speaking...\" Yu Canghai frowned and said, \"This Shui Yan is very likely trying to rush success, disguising my Water Prison Sect’s pupil skill, while secretly using a slaughter refining skill from the Demon Gate...\"","Slaughter Refining Skill...","True Manual of Demonic Path Cultivation!","These six words abruptly surfaced in Mo Hua’s mind.","This true manual was treasured by the Fire Buddha and later stolen by Mo Hua along with the Meteor Fire Skill.","Both Fire Buddha and Shui Yan should be \"Venerables\" among the followers of the Evil God Cult.","That means, both might have learned this \"True Manual of Demonic Path Cultivation.\"","Transforming evil means turning killings into evil qi.","The evil qi cultivated by Fire Buddha through killings is condensed into Meteor Fire Techniques.","While the evil qi refined from killings by Shui Yan is condensed into pupil skills.","Mo Hua’s gaze became somber.","Yu Canghai continued to say, \"I don’t know what slaughter refining skill this wretched beast Shui Yan has practiced, but he must be exploiting the situation, grafting this Demon Path spell point onto the pupil skills of my Water Prison Sect, using pupil skills to refine evil qi, to capture people’s souls.\"","\"Then what is the Water Prison Sect’s pupil skill like?\" Mo Hua asked, \"If it doesn’t refine evil qi, what does it cultivate?\"","Yu Canghai hesitated for a moment, then helplessly replied, \"My Water Prison Sect also cultivates evil qi...\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","He thought for a moment and summarized a bit, \"Shui Yan cultivates evil qi using pupil skills, and your Water Prison Sect also cultivates evil qi using pupil skills?\"","Yu Canghai: \"Yes...\"","Mo Hua softly \"interrogated\" and said:","\"Didn’t you say your Water Prison Sect is a righteous sect? Your pupil skill doesn’t seem to differ much from Shui Yan’s, doesn’t it also rely on killings to refine evil?\"","Yu Canghai shook his head and said bitterly:","\"This is precisely the reason I was reluctant to explain the specifics to you before...\"","\"Slaughter refining is something that straddles between righteousness and evil; a slight negligence could lead one astray into a wrongful path.\"","\"Thus, this inherited jade box is called the ’Forbidden Box.’","\"This pupil skill is categorized as a ’Forbidden Technique.’","\"Historically, only the sect leader of the Water Prison Sect is allowed to cultivate this Taoist skill.\"","Mo Hua became interested, \"Is there some significance in this?\"","Yu Canghai said solemnly: \"The so-called ’evil qi’ is also a form of ’qi’ within the world; however, this qi, fusing with cause and effect, divine soul, death, and other aspects, inflicts an unascertained lethal effect on cultivators, thereby not listed as a righteous Dao.\""]},{"number":1572,"title":"Chapter 1572 - 831: Righteous Evilness (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"As for the subdivisions of the Evil Qi, there are many types, such as Heavenly Evilness, Fateful Evilness, Corpse Evilness, Evil Evil, Ferocious Evilness, Demon evilness, Annual Evilness, Deadly Evilness... and so on and so forth.\"","\"These types of Evil Qi, I only know them by name. The knowledge contained within is extremely profound, and unless one is a cultivator who has thoroughly studied this Dao, it’s impossible to distinguish them or understand...\"","\"However, fundamentally, all these types of Evil Qi are related to ’death and injury’. These deaths and injuries can be caused by natural disasters or human calamities.\"","\"Natural disasters are hard to predict, but human calamities are easy to create.\"","\"Therefore, if a cultivator wishes to refine Evil Qi, they must inevitably personally create killings. Simply put... they must kill people!\"","Yu Canghai’s expression was grave.","Mo Hua slightly furrowed his brow.","\"The more people you kill, the greater the sin of killing, and the stronger the Evil Qi you refine naturally becomes. My young friend, let me ask you this,\" Yu Canghai said, \"Is killing people right?\"","Mo Hua wanted to say it’s wrong, but after pondering a bit, he shook his head, \"Not necessarily.\"","\"Indeed!\" Yu Canghai said, \"On the surface, killing people is wrong, and killing people to refine Evil Qi is even more an act of heretical demons, but...\"","\"What if someone deserves to die, someone is supposed to be killed?\"","\"Should such a person be killed or not?\"","Mo Hua’s gaze was profound, but he said nothing.","Yu Canghai sighed, \"Having a good heart is a good thing, but good and evil are inherently one, too much is as bad as too little.\"","\"Too much kindness becomes ignorance, and ignorance gives birth to evil.\"","\"If someone says that life is precious and that making a grave mistake should not result in death as long as one repents, or that one can lay down the butcher’s knife, instantly becoming a Buddha and the past sins should be forgiven... then such a person is truly sinning beyond redemption!\"","\"Those who should die must die. Those who should be killed must also be killed.\"","\"By killing evil people, one can also refine Evil Qi. Such Evil Qi, in our Water Prison Sect’s tradition, is called ’Righteous Evil’!\"","Mo Hua’s eyes trembled, \"Righteous Evil...\"","\"That’s right!\" Yu Canghai nodded solemnly, \"Our Water Prison Sect has always joined the Taoist Court to punish criminals with severe penalties, suppress evil villains with the Taoist Prison, slay all sinister elements, monsters, and fallen demons, using slaughter to foster intimidating Evil Qi, imbuing oneself with righteousness, making all vile elements tremble in fear, this is called ’Righteous Evil’!\"","Yu Canghai spoke with righteousness and fervor.","Mo Hua was shaken within, but soon became puzzled, \"This ’Righteous Evil’, it seems easy to cause problems, right...\"","Yu Canghai was taken aback, then sighed helplessly.","This young brother, indeed, has a meticulous mind, not a single issue could escape him.","Yu Canghai sighed:","\"Young brother is right, Righteous Evil is very hard to nurture...\"","\"A person nurturing Righteous Evil must have extremely strong perseverance, an incredibly steadfast Taoist Heart, and cannot make even the slightest mistake.\"","\"Once nurturing Righteous Evil, creating killing sin, the vengeful spirits entangled are mostly extremely evil people. These vicious thoughts constantly invade your mind, and once there is a crack in your mental state, making it unable to resist these vicious thoughts, you will suffer a backlash, and your mental state falls, causing the Evil Qi to mutate and completely transform from Righteous Evil into an even more extreme Evil Evil...\"","Upon hearing this, Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart.","But he knew that it might not stop just there.","Killing evil people, refining Righteous Evil.","If, on any day, even mistakenly killing a good person, wouldn’t this Righteous Evil fall short of being called \"Righteous\", completely losing its value?","Thinking from another perspective, if I were a great evil person, coming up with a way to frame or trap a cultivator nurturing \"Righteous Evil\" and have him accidentally kill an innocent good person would be all too simple...","This flaw is truly significant.","Moreover, this is only about a mistake killing.","As a cultivator of the Taoist Court, if someone has an improper heart and a paranoid character, they might even fabricate \"false accusations and wrong cases\" to create \"criminals\", and then rightfully kill these \"criminals\", contentedly nurturing Righteous Evil, becoming a hypocritical \"cruel officer\".","Carefully thinking about it, it’s quite terrifying.","These words, Elder Yu, considering the Sect’s reputation, definitely wouldn’t say out loud.","But Mo Hua guessed that the reason this pupil skill was classified as a Forbidden Technique, only learnable by the Sect Leader, is somewhat related to these factors.","Nonetheless, Mo Hua wasn’t too bothered by it.","The Water Prison Sect was destroyed a thousand years ago, old grievances are not something for him to settle.","He was only curious about one thing.","After a moment of thought, Mo Hua asked Yu Canghai:","\"Elder Yu, how exactly is the pupil skill of the Water Prison Sect used? After nurturing Righteous Evil, how can one use the eyes to intimidate others? Is there something else behind this?\"","\"This...\" Yu Canghai smiled wryly, \"My young friend, you are putting me in a difficult position. I am just an ordinary elder, how could I possibly know the secrets of a forbidden technique that only the Sect Leader can learn?\"","Mo Hua just looked at him silently.","Being gazed upon by Mo Hua’s clear but insightful eyes made Yu Canghai’s scalp tingle slightly, and finally, he sighed:","\"I only know a little bit...\"","\"A little bit is fine.\"","Yu Canghai sighed, helplessly saying, \"It is the picture on the Jade Box.\"","\"A picture?\"","Yu Canghai nodded, \"The picture contains a visualization method, allowing one to merge Righteous Evil into the Divine Soul through visualizing the picture, then releasing a formidable intimidating Evil Qi through the Eye Acupoint, that is, through the eyes, to deter others’ minds.\"","\"It’s a unique kind of Divine Soul attack method.\"","\"It might look unremarkable, but in a life-or-death fight when timing is crucial, having the eyes contain Evilness to intimidate the opponent, even for a few seconds, is enough to determine life and death. What’s even more terrifying is that this pupil skill is unrelated to Spiritual Power and can be used simultaneously with spells, making it highly unpredictable and easy to suffer a great loss if one is not careful.\"","Unconsciously, Mo Hua nodded.","He had crossed paths with Water Yama and knew this spell point was not powerful but extremely troublesome.","Unexpectedly, even a Golden Core could be trapped.","If it weren’t for his strong Divine Sense, unaffected by Water Yama’s pupil skill, he might have fallen into his hands back at the ferry.","What’s more terrifying is if others don’t know you can use pupil skills, and you hit them with a surprise move, that’s truly deadly.","However...","Mo Hua was still puzzled.","\"The picture on the Jade Box depicts a prison, with eight cells, each holding a criminal receiving different punishments, varying criminals... where is the visualization method in this?\"","Upon hearing this, Yu Canghai was also puzzled.","He was genuinely puzzled.","Although he was a Water Prison Sect elder, it was the first time he knew what the sacred Water Prison Forbidden Box of the Water Prison Sect depicted.","\"Eight cells, eight kinds of punishment, eight criminals...\"","Yu Canghai frowned in contemplation for a moment, suddenly startled, and looked at Mo Hua: \"Wait, isn’t this the item in Water Yama’s hands? My young friend, how do you know it so well?\"","Even knowing specifically how many cells, how many punishments, and how many criminals there are.","Mo Hua was startled for a moment.","Fortunately, although his complexion was pale, his face was thick-skinned.","Mo Hua maintained a calm demeanor and said:","\"I have a good memory, and I can remember everything at a glance. When Water Yama was fleeing with the box, I happened to see it all clearly!\""]},{"number":1573,"title":"Chapter 1573 - 832: Divine Soul","paragraphs":["Mo Hua didn’t even blink, speaking with utmost seriousness.","Elder Yu Canghai nodded, \"I see...\"","He contemplated the matter with common sense. He never would have imagined that the invaluable Water Prison Forbidden Box, something he dared not even dream of, was now in Mo Hua’s possession.","He certainly couldn’t have foreseen that Mo Hua, in the Foundation Building Middle Stage, could wrest this supreme inheritance of the Water Prison Sect from the cunning and malicious Water Yama.","Mo Hua feared Elder Yu might overthink things and quickly asked him another question:","\"Does Shui Yan’s mastery of Pupil Skills mean that although he doesn’t know how to nurture righteous evil, he still knows something about the Contemplative Jade Casket Dao Prison Map method?\"","Elder Yu Canghai’s expression tensed, indeed drawn in by this question.","After pondering for a moment, he nodded and said, \"It’s very possible. If he can use the Pupil Skill, it means he’s somewhat grasped a part of it.\"","\"Then wouldn’t he be formidable once his Pupil Skill reaches perfection?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"He won’t achieve that,\" Elder Yu Canghai shook his head.","\"Why?\" Mo Hua was puzzled.","Elder Yu Canghai’s expression was solemn as he sighed:","\"Pupil Skills are not that simple. The inheritance of Pupil Skills in the Cultivation World is extremely rare. Aside from those requiring a powerful bloodline to cultivate, all other inheritable Pupil Skills, without exception, are related to the Divine Soul.\"","\"The path of the Divine Soul is mysterious and unfathomable.\"","\"Since it involves the Divine Soul, it’s not something that can be understood just by looking at diagrams.\"","\"That Pupil Skill of Shui Yan might have decent power, but it’s just a facade. Ultimately, it’s still a deviant path vastly inferior to the authentic Pupil Skill inheritance of the Water Prison Sect.\"","Mo Hua asked, \"Is it related to the Divine Soul or to Divine Sense?\"","\"The Divine Soul.\"","\"What’s the difference?\"","\"This...\" Elder Yu was stumped again, looking troubled, \"The Water Prison Sect’s Taoist inheritance has declined. I only know there is a difference between Divine Soul and Divine Sense, but I can’t explain it clearly...\"","Mo Hua scrutinized Elder Yu and saw the bitterness in his gaze, realizing he wasn’t lying, so he didn’t probe further.","After considering for a moment, Mo Hua asked another question:","\"On the Water Prison Forbidden Box, there’s a Dao Prison Diagram containing a cultivation method for Forbidden Techniques... So what’s inside the box?\"","\"Since it’s called a ’Forbidden Box,’ it should be able to open, right?\"","\"And what’s inside the box?\"","Elder Yu still sported a wry smile, \"The Forbidden Box belongs to the Sect Leader, only the Sect Leader can open it. I don’t know what’s inside, but I assume it should be superior Daoist Magic that only the Water Prison Sect Leader can learn.\"","\"Like the Water Prison Skill you mentioned?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"It’s possible.\" Elder Yu nodded.","\"Anything else?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Elder Yu shook his head, indicating he was unsure.","Mo Hua continued, \"Then how can this box be opened...\"","The whole box seemed like a single piece of jade, with no lock, no key, and not even a seam...","These words were on the tip of his tongue, but Mo Hua swallowed them back down.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box wasn’t officially in his possession, and saying such a thing would likely raise Elder Yu’s suspicions.","Elder Yu pondered, \"The conditions to open the box are very stringent. One must learn Pupil Skills and feed it with the Sect Leader’s essence blood, but I, as an Elder, am not clear on the specifics.\"","Mo Hua glanced at Elder Yu and sighed inwardly.","This Elder Yu keeps going in circles, never getting to the point, always skimming the surface and knowing nothing of the core issues.","If the Water Prison Sect’s Taoist inheritance is lost, it wouldn’t be undeserved at all.","Whether he truly doesn’t know or is pretending not to know is unclear.","Mo Hua shook his head.","Continuing to ask would yield nothing, so Mo Hua stood up and bade farewell. Just before leaving, he remembered something and asked Elder Yu:","\"By the way, what’s the name of the Water Prison Sect’s Pupil Skill?\"","Elder Yu hesitated for a long time before slowly speaking, \"According to the sect records, this Pupil Skill is called... Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil.\"","\"Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil?\"","Mo Hua nodded, committing the name to memory, and was about to leave when Elder Yu stopped him again.","\"Young brother...\"","Elder Yu looked worried, his eyes holding a glimpse of hope as he asked, \"Can this Forbidden Box still be retrieved?\"","\"Rest assured,\" Mo Hua comforted him, \"I will have Uncle Gu expedite the pursuit of Shui Yan. As soon as he’s caught, it can be retrieved.\"","Elder Yu felt somewhat comforted, bowing, \"Thank you, young brother.\"","Leaving Elder Yu, Mo Hua pondered:","Should this Forbidden Box be returned to Elder Yu?","Since it’s the supreme inheritance of the Water Prison Sect, it should naturally be returned to its rightful owner. I can’t bring myself to secretly covet it.","However, there’s no rush now; I’ll wait until I’ve thoroughly understood it myself.","Moreover, given Elder Yu’s current circumstances, living under others’ roofs and facing daily uncertainty, returning it might instead bring him disaster.","I’ll secretly give it back once he’s more stable.","This is for his own good!","Mo Hua righteously found an excuse for his own little thought.","Currently, this Forbidden Box is safest in my hands!","Afterward, Mo Hua had a meal with Aunt Wan, returned to Taixu Gate, and continued studying the Water Prison Forbidden Box in the Disciple’s Residence.","\"There must be something inside the box...\" Mo Hua mused.","But for now, I can’t open it, and even if I could, whatever is inside would definitely be superior Taoist Skill, something I couldn’t learn.","Even if I could, given my modest spiritual power, I couldn’t use it at all.","So, there’s no rush to open the box; mastering the Pupil Skill is good enough.","Mo Hua vaguely felt that this Pupil Skill might be even more suited for him than those precious superior Water System Dao Law inheritances exclusive to the Water Prison Sect Leader."]},{"number":1574,"title":"Chapter 1574 - 832: Divine Soul (2)","paragraphs":["Without using Spiritual Power, concealment can trap people.","Moreover, generally speaking, with the strength of one’s Divine Sense, there should be no fear of any backlash.","But the problem is, how to learn?","Mo Hua pondered over the conversation with Elder Yu for a moment and roughly summarized a few points:","The method of cultivating Pupil Skill is hidden within the Daoist Prison Map.","To learn this Pupil Skill, one must cultivate ’righteous evilness.’","The mystery of this Pupil Skill is also related to the ’Divine Soul.’","This Pupil Skill is called the Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil.","Seven Souls...","Mo Hua looked again at the Jade Box in his hand, \"But the prison on the map, the criminals, and the punishments, aren’t they all eight?\"","What does Seven Souls mean?","Furthermore, if Seven Souls might be related to the Divine Soul, what then is the connection between the Divine Soul and Divine Sense?","Mo Hua sighed.","\"It’s somewhat troublesome...\"","Any random word is a challenge in itself.","These unconventional Taoist cultivation methods are indeed profound and obscure, making them hard to comprehend.","\"According to Elder Yu, the Pupil Skill is related to the Divine Soul. Then the words ’Divine Soul’ might be the key to decoding this ’Seven Souls Blood Prison Diagram,’ and the crux to cultivating the Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil...\"","\"How exactly to understand the Divine Soul? And what kind of knowledge does it contain?\"","A clever cook cannot prepare a meal without rice.","There are too few clues; Mo Hua cannot guess anything based solely on a name.","Even though he is on the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao, after barely starting, his master was no longer there, and the road ahead had to be explored by himself.","\"Divine Soul...\"","Mo Hua began counting heads in his mind, listing the people he knew, to see who would be the best person to ask.","First of all, Elder Master Xun surely knows.","But the elder seems to be worried about something lately and is quite busy, so it’s not convenient to disturb him.","Lord Yellow Mountain should also know; after all, it is the Mountain God. Although it’s not what it used to be, it still has some insight.","But it’s quite far away.","After thinking it over, Mo Hua decided to ask Elder Xun Zixian.","Elder Xun Zixian is in the Late Golden Core Stage and a Third-Grade Array Master, with deep attainments in formations and a great interest in the Path of Divine Sense.","Most importantly, he gets along well with Elder Xun Zixian.","Elder Xun Zixian is also very kind, with no airs, and as long as it’s something that can be said, he’ll most likely tell him.","Mo Hua then took some time to visit the Elder’s Residence, to seek Elder Xun Zixian.","It was his first time visiting Elder Xun Zixian’s Elder’s Residence. Wherever his eyes landed, it was all formations, Jade Slips, and classics aligned in rows. Beyond this, nothing else, clearly demonstrating Elder Xun Zixian’s profound knowledge.","Upon entering, he was greeted by a young servant.","These young servants are also from prominent families, sent at a young age to serve tea and water to elders, strengthening bonds of friendship.","At the same time, by being in close interaction with highly cultivated elders, they subtly receive the influence of Taoism, laying a foundation for future cultivation.","Don’t underestimate these young servants, but the fight for these positions is intense.","Those who become young servants are usually of extraordinary background.","After explaining his purpose, Mo Hua sent the young servant to report to Elder Xun Zixian.","While Elder Xun Zixian was painting formations, upon hearing that Mo Hua had come, he thought for just a moment before setting down his pen, inviting Mo Hua in, and ordering the young servant to serve tea.","The young servant respectfully complied with a \"Yes,\" but was somewhat surprised in his heart.","Elder Xun Zixian’s attainments in formations are very high and highly valued by the Sect, but he is reclusive and has never been so polite to anyone.","Usually, if someone disturbed him while painting formations, he would be very angry, so why is he in such a good mood today?","With these thoughts in mind, the young servant couldn’t help but secretly size Mo Hua up after serving the tea.","Mo Hua, while drinking tea, chatted with Elder Xun Zixian.","\"Divine Soul?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua said, \"Recently, I encountered an elder from another Sect who mentioned the ’Divine Soul.’ I was a bit puzzled and couldn’t figure it out myself, so I came to consult you, Elder...\"","Elder Xun Zixian took a sip of tea and looked at Mo Hua with deep eyes, \"Some things are not to be learned carelessly.\"","Mo Hua smiled awkwardly, \"I’m just curious.\"","Elder Xun Zixian said calmly, \"Tell me the origins and causes, and then I’ll decide whether to tell you or not.\"","Mo Hua sighed inwardly.","Elder Xun Zixian, indeed learned and shrewd.","Truly a master of formations like himself.","But the matter of the Water Prison Forbidden Box is difficult to speak about.","Seeing Mo Hua hesitate, Elder Xun Zixian said, \"Just give me a brief description, no need to be too specific, just so I have an idea, otherwise I won’t be able to explain to the Ancestor.\"","After pondering for a moment, Mo Hua nodded, \"Alright!\"","He slightly organized his words in his mind and said, \"I helped the Taoist Court a bit, investigating a case, and encountered a Sin Cultivator, who knows a peculiar Pupil Skill...\"","Elder Xun Zixian raised an eyebrow, \"Pupil Skill?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua said, \"This Pupil Skill can capture one’s mind, very tricky, and it’s said that one must visualize a picture to cultivate it.\"","\"I asked an informed elder, who said this visualization method is related to the Divine Soul, but he wasn’t proficient in the Path of Divine Sense, so the specifics were unclear, hence I came to ask you...\"","\"Pupil Skill, Divine Soul, visualization...\"","Elder Xun Zixian pondered silently for a moment and then nodded, \"I understand.\"","\"Then...\"","\"The matter of the Divine Soul, I can tell you.\"","Mo Hua was overjoyed, \"Thank you, Elder Xun!\"","\"However, let me say first,\" Elder Xun Zixian said with a slightly stern expression to Mo Hua, \"Spiritual Power and flesh are tangible, while Divine Thought is intangible. Thus, the Path of Divine Sense, including the knowledge of the Divine Soul, is often inferred by cultivators based on experience, and may not be entirely accurate.\"","\"What I’m telling you is only the Taoist knowledge I’ve heard, learned, or researched over hundreds of years.\""]},{"number":1575,"title":"Chapter 1575 - 832: Divine Soul (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"I feel these insights may not be gravely mistaken, but should errors be present, it’s not impossible. Therefore, when you listen, you must pay attention yourself. Do not trust blindly, yet cannot fully trust. The distinction here can only be determined by yourself.\"","Xun Zixian spoke with great precision.","Mo Hua nodded earnestly.","Seeing Mo Hua’s solemn gaze, Xun Zixian knew he understood his meaning and nodded slightly, \"First and foremost, the Divine Soul and Divine Sense are distinct.\"","\"Low-level cultivators only know about Divine Sense, rarely engaging with the ’Divine Soul’ level of concepts, even if they occasionally talk about souls, they mostly don’t understand.\"","\"In fact, not only are low-level cultivators unknowing, most cultivators, upon reaching the Golden Core and even Feather Transformation, still remain potentially ignorant of the path of the Divine Soul.\"","\"Because the current cultivation system is focused on Spiritual Power and the physical body, Divine Sense is always merely supportive; except for the rare few who pursue unconventional paths, almost no one primarily cultivates Divine Sense...\"","Xun Zixian gazed profoundly at Mo Hua, then extended his slender finger to touch his own forehead.","\"The Sea of Consciousness within a person accommodates the Three Souls and Seven Souls.\"","\"The Three Souls are: Heavenly Soul, Earth Soul, Life Soul.\"","\"The Seven Souls are: Corpse Dog, Fushi Arrow, Bird Shade, Swallow Thief, Non-Poison, Filth Exclusion, Putrid Lung.\"","\"Among the Three Souls, the Heavenly Soul and Earth Soul wander outside the cultivator’s body, residing in Heaven and Earth, elusive and indescribable. Only the Life Soul remains within oneself, vital to one’s existence.\"","\"The Life Soul is fundamental, with the Seven Souls parasitically attached above it. Without the Soul, a Soul cannot live; without the Soul, the essence does not thrive.\"","\"Together, these Three Souls and Seven Souls are collectively referred to as the Divine Soul.\"","\"The Divine Soul is the foundation of a cultivator’s Divine Thought; the derived Telekinesis is called ’Divine Sense’.\"","\"Only with a Soul can there be Thought, and then Sense.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes widened, suddenly enlightened.","Elder Xun’s words unveiled more secrets of the Path of Divine Sense to him, yet the more he learned, the more bewildered he felt.","\"Divine Sense is not the fundamental of the Sea of Consciousness but merely the derived Telekinesis?\"","Xun Zixian nodded and explained:","\"You are a Formation Master, you should have deep insights...\"","\"Every time Divine Sense is expended, it will recover.\"","\"If Divine Sense itself were fundamental, once exhausted, it would cut its root, how could it then recover?\"","\"Precisely because Divine Sense is derived from the Divine Soul, as long as the Divine Soul remains, Divine Sense naturally regenerates from it once depleted.\"","Xun Zixian illustrated: \"The Divine Soul is like a tree trunk, Divine Sense is just branches and leaves on the trunk. When branches break and leaves fall, as long as the tree’s root remains, branches and leaves can grow again.\"","Mo Hua nodded repeatedly, \"I understand, just like leeks, as long as the roots remain, even if trimmed, they grow back!\"","Xun Zixian fell silent for a moment.","He found Mo Hua’s analogy somewhat awkward yet, after further thought, quite fitting.","\"I suppose...\"","\"Then what relation does the Divine Soul have with Pupil Skill? Must Pupil Skill be executed through the Divine Soul?\" Mo Hua inquired.","Xun Zixian nodded, \"Correct. You must understand one thing, Divine Sense itself is passive, lacking killing power.\"","Mo Hua froze.","Elder Xun’s statement was a bit counterintuitive.","Because he had always relied on Divine Sense in the Sea of Consciousness to wreak havoc.","But upon deep reflection, it seemed true.","His vast destruction was powered by his Divine Thought avatar, and the catalyzed Divine Thought Power, not Divine Sense itself.","Pure Divine Sense was what the Demon Wraiths penetrating his Sea of Consciousness lusted after, attempting to devour it as refined Telekinesis.","Xun Zixian saw that Mo Hua understood and nodded slightly, continuing:","\"You should be familiar with External Release of Divine Sense. But the External Release of Divine Sense is actually not release but a kind of ’sensing’.\"","\"It’s like when you see things, it’s not you ’looking’, but the myriad lights and shadows of the world pour into your eyes, giving you a ’seeing’ feeling.\"","\"Seeing, at its core, is passive. External Release of Divine Sense is similarly a passive sensing.\"","\"External Release of Divine Sense lacks power.\"","\"In the Qi-refining Realm or the Foundation Establishment Realm, even in the Golden Core Realm, Divine Sense can be externally released, yet amongst them, Divine Sense won’t harm each other, at most they sense each other—if you can sense them.\"","\"And to refine Divine Sense, imbuing it with the power to kill, beguile, intimidate, etc., it’s essential to infuse Divine Soul into the Divine Sense.\"","\"With the Divine Soul, Divine Sense gains the Power of Killing!\"","\"Divine Soul possesses the Power of Killing...\" Mo Hua’s expression was stunned, muttering it quietly.","He recalled all his encounters in Divine Thought duels, deeply contemplating, gradually gaining some insights.","According to Elder Xun’s discourse, all the Mind Bodies he had encountered until now indeed comprised two layers:","Soul and Thought.","Ghosts have Ghost Spirits, Corpse Evil Spirits have Corpse Souls, Demon Wraiths have Demon Spirits.","This ’Soul’, though complex, boils down to the Evil Spirit’s ’self-will’.","With this self-will, Evil Spirits can kill and devour.","Once obliterated, Evil Spirits are left with only pure Telekinesis.","Thus, Evil Spirits can harm because within them exists a greedy, malevolent ’Evil Soul’.","Once this soul is erased, the Evil Spirit ceases to exist, what’s left is simply ’Telekinesis’.","This Telekinesis, lacking killing power, can be ’absorbed’ by oneself.","Mo Hua’s thoughts gradually cleared up and he slowly said:","\"The reason why cultivators’ externally released Divine Sense has no killing power is because... the externally released Divine Sense is merely pure ’Telekinesis’, lacking in Divine Soul, in other words, not containing any special ’will’, hence it cannot harm.\"","\"Conversely, hypothetically, if wanting to use Divine Sense itself for killing, one must infuse some ’Divine Soul’ into the external Divine Sense, embedding a certain ’will’?\"","\"Exactly.\" Xun Zixian said with gratification.","\"But can Divine Soul be externally released?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Xun Zixian shook his head, \"It’s not called external release, rather in the Path of Divine Sense, there’s a special term for it, called...\"","Xun Zixian’s gaze grew solemn, speaking in a low voice: \"Soul Emergence!\"","Soul Emergence?!","Mo Hua’s heart leapt.","Then in saying this, the Daoist Prison Map on the Water Prison Forbidden Box is essentially a pathway to cultivate ’Soul Emergence’?","Soul Emergence...","In Mo Hua’s mind, numerous thoughts surged, still somewhat chaotic, yet he faintly felt a grand Gate of Divine Path gradually opening for him.","His Divine Thought transformed sword seemed ready to ’unsheathe’..."]},{"number":1576,"title":"Chapter 1576 - 833: Soul-Shocking Sword","paragraphs":["\"Qi Refining cultivators can externally release their Divine Sense; in the Foundation Establishment, they can manipulate objects with their Divine Sense; by the Golden Core stage, Object Manipulation reaches mastery, and cultivators’ ability to control objects and swords advances further.\"","\"Only upon reaching the Late Golden Core Stage can one dabble in the techniques of Soul Emergence. Upon Feather Transformation, they can truly master Soul Emergence.\"","\"This is the general progression of a cultivator’s Divine Thought power...\"","Elder Xun Zixian said.","Mo Hua asked in confusion, \"But Shui Yan... the Sin Cultivator I encountered, he was only at the Foundation Establishment Peak and could already use pupil skills, doesn’t that mean he mastered the Soul Emergence technique in the Foundation Establishment Realm?\"","\"That’s why I said, this is the situation for typical cultivators,\" Elder Xun Zixian explained, \"Foundation Establishment cultivators can indeed achieve Soul Emergence, but their Divine Sense is weak, which makes emergence very dangerous.\"","\"This pupil skill of his, if targeted towards a typical cultivator, is fine. But if he encounters a cultivator adept in Divine Thought Slaughter, he would be defeated instantly. The real fear is encountering other evil spirits or unknown existences, where even the soul might be at risk of being devoured.\"","\"If a part of the Seven Souls of the Life Soul is devoured by evil spirits, the cultivator may easily become demented, or worse, go insane or have their soul extinguished and Dao withered.\"","\"The soul is far more precious than flesh and Spiritual Power and cannot be easily damaged.\"","Mo Hua glanced secretly at Elder Xun Zixian and asked, \"Elder Xun, you are in the Late Golden Core Stage, have you learned ’Soul Emergence’?\"","Elder Xun Zixian shook his head, \"I haven’t learned it.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, greatly surprised, \"You haven’t learned it?\"","He thought, given Elder Xun Zixian’s interest in the Dao of Divine Thought, he would at least try to learn it himself.","\"The Ancestor forbids it,\" Elder Xun Zixian sighed.","After speaking, he shook his head again, \"It’s not just forbidden, it’s strictly prohibited.\"","\"All the elders of Taixu Gate are not allowed to practice the Soul Emergence techniques, this is a strict order set by the Ancestor.\"","Mo Hua frowned, softly questioning, \"Is it because of... Divine Thought into sword?\"","Elder Xun Zixian’s gaze flickered, staring at Mo Hua, \"Have you been secretly inquiring about it?\"","\"Inquired a little bit...\" Mo Hua replied.","\"Did you find out anything?\" Elder Xun Zixian raised an eyebrow slightly.","\"No,\" Mo Hua shook his head, \"I found out nothing, it seems everyone is very secretive about it and unwilling to mention it.\"","Elder Xun Zixian nodded, \"That’s natural, as the sect has already established rules, classifying this swordsmanship as a Forbidden Technique, preventing disciples from practicing it anymore, and naturally, the elders won’t mention it. Of course, there is another reason why you can’t find out about it...\"","\"Another reason?\"","Elder Xun Zixian nodded, looking at Mo Hua, \"The Ancestor specifically instructed us elders not to allow anyone to tell you a single word regarding ’Divine Thought into sword’...\"","Mo Hua opened his mouth, astonished:","\"The Ancestor targeting me, surely not...?\"","\"You must understand,\" Elder Xun Zixian looked up at Mo Hua, saying, \"Your situation is unique, your physical and Spiritual Root aptitudes are average, but your Divine Sense talent is outstanding, and you’re intelligent and curious. If you knew that Taixu Gate had a sword technique called ’Divine Thought into Sword,’ you would surely rack your brains trying to learn it...\"","\"This...\"","Mo Hua couldn’t deny it at all.","Indeed, he was racking his brains to learn it.","Elder Xun Zixian sighed, \"This is precisely what the Ancestor fears. This sword technique cannot be learned anymore.\"","\"Why?\" Mo Hua couldn’t help but ask.","Elder Xun Zixian’s gaze was complex, even with some pain, \"Have you ever been to the back mountain?\"","\"The back mountain?\"","\"The back mountain of Taixu Gate.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, shaking his head, \"Isn’t that a Forbidden Land? I’ve never been.\"","Elder Xun Zixian nodded slightly, \"I went there once before...\"","\"In the back mountain, there’s a ’Sword Tomb’, and within it, countless broken swords are buried, as well as countless... corpses of Sword Cultivators.\"","Elder Xun Zixian took a deep breath, his tone mournful, \"These Sword Cultivators practiced the Divine Thought into Sword technique, and they are the predecessors of my Taixu Gate.\"","Mo Hua’s pupils shook.","\"This is the reason...\" Elder Xun Zixian sighed, \"Those who practiced the Divine Thought into Sword died faster than others. The higher the disciple’s talent, the quicker they learned the sword technique, and the more likely they were to die young.\"","\"Soul Emergence, sword transformation slaughter, walking the line between life and death.\"","\"Strong as it may be, but too rigid can easily break, leaving no room for maneuver.\"","\"Amidst Divine Thought, there are far too many terrifying killing intents... the enemies of blood, flesh, and Spiritual Power are visible. Yet those on the plane of Divine Thought are more powerful, more obscure; sometimes what you’re facing are terrifyingly strong foes, and you’re completely unaware.\"","\"Thus, within Taixu Gate, those who can cultivate to the Heaven Void and become predecessors of the Ancestor are very few.\"","\"In other sects, when encountering talented disciples, sects often place high hopes, these disciples, as long as they cultivate steadily, can hold their own in the future.\"","\"But in our Taixu Gate...\"","Elder Xun Zixian showed a hint of bitterness, \"When meeting talented disciples, instead there’s anxiety.\"","\"No matter how astonishing the talent is, as long as they practice Divine Thought into Sword, they’ll face layers of unseen danger, the path of cultivation littered with thorns. If injured, the Life Soul will be harmed, meaning at best, their path is interrupted; at worst, they die halfway through...\"","Elder Xun Zixian was deeply pained.","Mo Hua also showed emotion and reflection.","No wonder...","Clearly an extraordinarily clever sword technique, yet it’s locked away and no longer passed down.","Previously, he speculated that the side effects of this sword technique were surely significant, so the sect chose not to pass it on.","Now, after listening to Elder Xun’s explanation regarding the soul, he truly understood the dangers within.","Others expend swords in practice, but Taixu Gate expends lives.","When a sword breaks, it can be repaired. When a life soul is damaged, repair is no longer an option.","And now, in the peaceful cultivation world, noble families’ sons are pampered, even if the sect wanted to pass on this technique, likely few disciples would dare to learn it."]},{"number":1577,"title":"Chapter 1577 - 833: Soul-Shocking Sword (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"Then, in our Taixu Gate, if we don’t pass down the technique of Divine Thought into Sword, nor learn Soul Emergence, wouldn’t we fall far behind other sects?\" Mo Hua asked again.","\"Falling behind is natural,\" Xun Zixian said, \"but it’s still alright.\"","\"Without Divine Thought into Sword, there are other miscellaneous inheritances. Though not superior, they are sufficient in some ways, and we can still blend in among the Eight Great Gates, though we will surely be at the bottom...\"","\"Some elders within the sect, including a few ancestors, are also researching ways to improve Divine Thought into Sword, no longer solely relying on the divine soul, but using a different kind of sword intent to amplify the power of the sword qi’s killing force.\"","\"If this research is successful, it may become a superior Sword Dao heritage that takes a different path, though its power still falls short of Divine Thought into Sword.\"","\"As for Soul Emergence...\"","Elder Xun Zixian paused, then said, \"This kind of spell point is unconventional. The vast majority of cultivators, even when reaching Feather Transformation, do not specially learn the technique of ’Soul Emergence’.","Mo Hua was somewhat puzzled, \"Not learned even at Feather Transformation, because it’s dangerous?\"","\"Yes,\" Xun Zixian nodded, \"Divine Thought into Sword involves Soul Emergence and executing kills, which is extremely dangerous.\"","\"Even simple Soul Emergence, without using it for killing, is not considered safe either.\"","\"After all, if the divine soul is not strong and Divine Dao Knowledge is lacking, one simply does not know what kind of demon monsters are drifting in this world. Once the divine soul emerges, if it gives these evil spirits an opportunity, the trouble would be immense.\"","\"Cultivators at the Feather Transformation Realm, even within great families, are the backbone. Once they take the risk of Soul Emergence and consequently get ’possessed’, it would be a massive loss.\"","\"Additionally, for ordinary cultivators, Soul Emergence serves no great purpose.\"","\"Whether a cultivator kills or fights, it’s about ’the strong overcoming the weak’. But divine souls cannot be cultivated, and your divine soul is not much stronger than others. So what use is Soul Emergence?\"","\"Moreover, Soul Emergence is an extremely difficult spell point to cultivate.\"","\"Most cultivators in this world train their bodies and become tyrannical, or they condense spells with spiritual power for sharp attacks, but very few are willing to calm their minds, introspect, and ponder over matters above their divine souls...\"","Mo Hua slowly nodded.","Xun Zixian looked at Mo Hua, and advised earnestly, \"The ancestor did not allow the elders in the sect to tell you these things because they were worried about you. But ’it’s better to guide than to block’. You are a smart child with a strong thirst for knowledge. If you don’t understand, you certainly won’t give up. So, it’s better to explain the pros and cons to you clearly, so you know how to make choices.\"","Mo Hua sincerely said, \"Thank you, elder.\"","Xun Zixian waved his hand, suddenly remembered something, and sincerely said:","\"I’ve told you everything I know. Now it may not be possible, but if in the future, as your cultivation gets higher and your experience broadens, and you learn some more profound Divine Daoism knowledge, don’t forget to tell me...\"","Mo Hua nodded repeatedly, \"Hmm, definitely!\"","The two talked quite a bit, and then Mo Hua got up to take his leave.","The young boy escorted Mo Hua to the door, watching Mo Hua’s receding figure silently in a trance.","He had overheard some of the conversation between Mo Hua and Elder Xun Zixian, but didn’t understand a single word.","\"I don’t know the background of this big brother surnamed Mo, yet he is so formidable, and he doesn’t seem much older than me, yet he can already discuss Tao cultivation knowledge with the learned Uncle Zixian...\"","The young boy’s eyes unknowingly carried some yearning.","\"Shuer...\"","From inside came the voice of Elder Xun Zixian.","Only then did the young boy come back to his senses and said, \"Elder, I’m here.\" Then he reluctantly took another glance at Mo Hua and turned back to the Elder’s Residence.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua was wholly absorbed in thoughts about \"Soul Emergence\" and did not notice there was a young boy sneakily watching him the whole time.","Like this, he walked and thought all the way back to the Disciple’s Residence.","After reaching the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua closed the doors and windows tightly, took out the Water Prison Forbidden Box, and started pondering.","The blue forbidden box had a bloody and sinister Prison Diagram, looking somewhat grim.","This was not a simple diagram.","In fact, it wasn’t a simple pupil skill either, its core is a kind of ’Soul Emergence’ spell point.","And the Soul Emergence spell point, Elder Xun Zixian doesn’t know either.","In the Taixu Gate, teaching Soul Emergence knowledge is also forbidden.","According to Elder Xun Zixian, even ordinary cultivators reaching Feather Transformation would not learn Soul Emergence intentionally.","But Mo Hua was different.","He was now certain that \"Soul Emergence\" was indeed the prerequisite spell point for \"Divine Thought into Sword\".","If one wanted to draw the sword of Divine Thought, one must first master Soul Emergence.","As for the drawbacks of Soul Emergence, Mo Hua had considered them. Speaking for himself, they’re not too severe either.","After all, his strongest attribute is Divine Thought.","Even a water bandit like Water Yama, who isn’t even a Formation Master, could learn some basics of Soul Emergence. How could he not have a reason to learn?","But the question now is, how to learn?","Mo Hua placed the Water Prison Forbidden Box in front of him, staring at the Daoist Prison Map on it.","\"According to Elder Xun Zixian, the divine soul consists of Three Souls and Seven Souls. If one wants to emerge, the spell point to emerge must be related to ’soul’.\"","\"Any pattern is a kind of symbol.\"","\"Then this Daoist Prison Map might not only refer to the Taoist Prison but also some kind of... symbol related to the divine soul?\"","\"Eight prisons, eight punishments, eight prisoners...\"","\"The number eight doesn’t match with Three Souls and Seven Souls either?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","He carefully pondered over what Elder Xun Zixian had said again and suddenly had an epiphany.","\"Though humans have Three Souls and Seven Souls, the Heavenly Soul and Earth Soul wander outside the body, residing in heaven and earth. Only the Life Soul remains within oneself.\""]},{"number":1578,"title":"Chapter 1578 - 833: Soul-Shocking Sword (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"In reality, a person has only one soul and seven spirits within, adding up to exactly ’eight’.\"","\"On top of the Life Soul, the seven spirits are parasitic...\"","Mo Hua glanced again at the forbidden box.","On the pattern of the forbidden box, eight prisons are depicted; the largest is in the center while the other seven are distributed around it, centered on the middle.","This aligns with the principle of \"seven spirits parasitic on the Life Soul.\"","The seven outer prisons each have a lock, with chains connecting them, converging upon the gate of the central prison.","The prisoners in the seven prisons suffer different penalties, but upon closer inspection, it’s discovered they are all parts of the penalty suffered by the prisoner in the central large prison...","Mo Hua’s train of thought suddenly became clear.","The Daoist Prison Map on the forbidden box, one prison with seven cells, corresponds to a cultivator’s one soul and seven spirits, resembling a \"symbolic image\" of the Divine Soul.","What is displayed in the diagram is the heart image of a cultivator.","Cultivators meditate on this image for years, imprinting the likeness of the punished prisoners firmly in their hearts to form a \"heart image,\" which is then carved into the Divine Soul.","This way, the Divine Soul inherently carries the majesty and evil Qi of the prison.","The prison’s role is to kill and punish.","A Divine Soul containing the \"prison\" likeness can damage others’ Divine Sense upon soul emergence, causing fear, terror, and even death from shattered organs.","Therefore, the Water Prison Sect’s \"nurturing of evil\" at its core is actually \"nurturing the soul.\"","Through upholding Taoist law, and slaying sinful people, one cultivates righteousness and evil Qi, incorporating it into the Divine Soul, making villains fear it.","But Water Yama is different; he doesn’t know how to nurture a soul, only how to nurture evil, even going so far as to adopt the Evil Spirit Transformation Skill of the Demon Path to commit immense killings.","If he merely nurtured these evils, that would be one thing.","If one day, he reaches the point where evil Qi merges into his soul, the \"deadly evilness\" he nurtures by wantonly killing innocents may immediately rebel, counterattacking his Divine Soul, driving him insane, living a life worse than death.","Mo Hua’s thoughts flashed.","Involuntarily, he came up with a way to \"trap\" Water Yama to death without lifting a finger...","Mo Hua’s eyes slightly brightened.","However, he hasn’t found Water Yama yet, so he can’t act for now.","For now, it’s better to learn the Pupil Skill first.","Mo Hua began practicing according to the theory he summarized.","He calmed his mind and focused, meditating on the Daoist Prison Map on the forbidden box, firmly memorizing these images as \"heart images.\"","Initially, nothing happened.","The images remained images, without any phenomena.","Mo Hua’s state of mind didn’t change in the slightest.","But he was not discouraged.","Any spell, when first learned, is difficult, requiring step-by-step exploration, constant trials, and incremental research.","Just like learning those complex and profound formations, it requires perseverance, never achieved overnight.","Mo Hua, having studied formations daily, was very familiar with this process.","He concentrated his attention to the utmost, fully immersing himself in the Daoist Prison Map.","After an unknown length of time, Mo Hua’s heart trembled, his Divine Thought finally reacted.","Something mystical seemed to change in the Divine Sense dwelling in his Sea of Consciousness, as if something was \"self-awakening.\"","Mo Hua’s spirit lifted, and he began to concentrate, tracing back to the origin.","He sensed from the external Divine Sense, gradually feeling inward, sensing the source from which the Divine Sense derived.","Again, after some indeterminate time, after a vague, indescribable exploration, Mo Hua’s mind shook, finally tracing back to a certain presence in his inner heart, belonging to him, but something he hadn’t previously realized—","\"Divine Soul.\"","This feeling was extremely subtle.","Mo Hua \"sensed\" his own Divine Soul.","It seemed as if he saw himself from an observer’s perspective, glimpsing at those deepest lurking \"selves\" within him.","His \"Divine Soul\" was remarkably complex.","In it were various indescribable, indistinguishable clear and turbid auras, interweaving and ebbing, a chaotic mix.","Mo Hua thus realized he seemed to not entirely understand \"himself.\"","After perceiving the Divine Soul, the subsequent process seemed somewhat simpler to Mo Hua.","He merged the \"heart image\" into the Divine Soul.","Mo Hua began to integrate the \"heart image\" of punishing prisoners depicted in the Daoist Prison Map into his Divine Soul.","This act felt akin to \"remodeling\" his conscious perception of the Divine Soul.","The integration process went smoothly.","Mo Hua simply felt his Divine Soul tremor, an overwhelming desire for \"hatred of evil\" surged from his heart, as if all wrongdoers in the world deserved to die!","All sinners should be thrown into the prison, subjected to severe torture, tormented to death by cruel means, only then would their sins be eradicated...","This realization seemed etched into his Divine Soul with the Daoist Prison’s heart image.","Mo Hua’s expression turned slightly fierce, his eyes filled with an intensifying evil Qi, his whole demeanor enveloped in the ruthless aura of a \"severe official.\"","\"No!\"","Mo Hua immediately became alert.","He forcibly gathered his thoughts, calming his emotions to prevent these prison heart images from further engraving into his Divine Soul.","By isolating his Divine Soul’s perception and cutting off the heart image integration, Mo Hua finally relaxed, his gaze returned to clarity, with all trace of evil Qi dissipated.","Mo Hua involuntarily sighed in relief.","\"Almost learned in the wrong direction...\"","Embedding the Water Prison Sect’s prison heart image in his Divine Soul, once successful, would mean this heart image was deeply engraved within his Divine Soul.","Though he would then be able to use the Water Prison Sect’s pupil skill, Mo Hua pondered and felt this wasn’t what he wanted.","He had no desire to nurture the Water Prison Sect’s \"righteous evil.\"","Even though he constantly reminded himself that he was a Righteous Cultivator, who should seek the Great Dao with integrity, he also understood that some \"righteousness and evil\" in this world aren’t so easily distinguished.","Where there’s righteousness, there must be evil.","Strictly separating them, pursuing extreme \"righteousness,\" could very well lead one onto a \"evil\" path.","Primarily, it didn’t align with his own disposition.","Mo Hua felt that he had a good rapport with people.","Even if he wasn’t \"loved by everyone, praised by all,\" he believed he was fairly amiable.","Even Uncle Gu, though not overtly affectionate, was quite caring when it counted.","In times of danger, he would protect Mo Hua behind him.","His master often reminded him that being a righteous cultivator meant seeking the Great Dao with integrity and uprightness, and he also understood that harboring too much alarming severity was not the right path.","Thus, he decided that he must not let the prison’s heart image infuse into his soul.","He must carve no portion of it into his Divine Soul to avoid becoming cold and detached like Uncle Gu, with a demeanor that is only stern and fear-inducing.","Moreover, Mo Hua aspired to focus on the Great Dao of formations in the future.","If the Water Prison Sect’s heart image were to be carved into his Divine Soul, it would mean he could only concentrate on the strictness of the penal system, destined to follow the path of the Court Official.","Thus, nurturing the Water Prison Sect’s righteous evil cannot be pursued, nor can the fusion of the prison’s heart image.","I can’t merge the prison method, so perhaps... merge with Swordsmanship?","Merging Divine Thought into sword?!","How exactly to merge it?","Mo Hua’s mind was suddenly illuminated by the thought of a sword technique’s name:","Soul-Shocking Sword!","Some images and sounds began to emerge in Mo Hua’s mind.","These were things he had conjured, from a variegated and enigmatic delve into his own consciousness.","\"Xuan Er...\"","\"I originally shouldn’t teach you this swordsmanship...\"","\"Your foundation is already solid, so today I will teach you...\"","\"The Soul-Shocking Style!\"","...","Mo Hua drew out the broken sword from his Storage Ring that he found in the blood-colored fishing village, his mind flooding with images and sounds.","This was his first time drawing the broken sword within the Tai Xu Mountain Gate."]},{"number":1579,"title":"Chapter 1579 - 834: Sword Fiend","paragraphs":["This broken sword obtained from the blood-colored fishing village had never been taken out, nor handed over to the Sect by Mo Hua, mainly because its origins were somewhat unclear.","Moreover, the broken sword contained the \"Cause and Effect\" of \"Taixu Divine Thought Sword,\" which he wanted to study.","Once handed over, all would be lost.","However, the True Technique of Divine Thought into Sword, apart from the basic \"Transforming Sword Skill,\" requires a profound Sword Dao foundation for more advanced sword forms. It requires an expert’s guidance to comprehend, which is not something he could understand with just a glance.","Mo Hua had studied it several times before, but to no avail, so he temporarily set it aside.","Later, with so many matters at hand, he simply forgot about it.","He had too many secrets, and too many things whose origins were unknown, so one more wouldn’t matter.","This broken sword naturally got buried at the bottom of the trunk.","Now, obtaining the Water Prison Forbidden Box, and learning the path of \"Soul Emergence\" through the \"Forbidden Diagram\" on the Taoist Prison, Mo Hua suddenly remembered the broken sword.","Mo Hua touched this ancient, battle-worn broken sword, feeling a bit emotional.","The owner of this sword must have been a senior of the Taixu Gate.","To cultivate Divine Thought into sword to such a degree, he must have been a Heaven’s Chosen Son of phenomenal talent back then.","From the sparse scenes deduced from the Cause and Effect of the broken sword, it can be seen that this senior, in his youth, had condensed Sword Qi all over his body and possessed a brilliant Sword Intent, radiating an astonishing might. He must have delved deep into the Sword Dao and been an exceptional Sword Dao genius.","Mo Hua sighed.","\"Such a phenomenally talented senior had even his Lifebound Sword broken.\"","\"I wonder how he is now?\"","\"With the Lifebound Spirit Sword broken, his Vital Energy must be greatly damaged, and his path impaired...\"","At this thought, Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat, \"Could this senior have... already fallen? If he truly has fallen, then his remains should be buried in the back mountain?\"","Mo Hua felt inexplicably sad.","\"If there is a chance in the future, I could go to the back mountain to take a look and find a way to return this broken sword to its original owner...\"","After all, to a Sword Cultivator, the sword is just like a second life. The sword and the Sword Cultivator live to fight together, die to be buried together.","So doing would repay the grace of this senior, who mysteriously granted him the method of Divine Thought into Sword.","Mo Hua nodded.","Soon after, Mo Hua thought again: \"This senior seems to be named ’Xuan Er’?\"","This is how elders call their juniors, and Mo Hua felt it was too disrespectful, so he silently addressed in his heart:","\"Senior Xuan.\"","Mo Hua remembered this name, then began to formally study the sword technique.","\"Soul-Shocking Stance,\" is the Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue, a sword form a step further from the basic Transforming Sword Skill.","Mo Hua inferred again from the Cause and Effect of the broken sword, revisiting the process of \"Senior Xuan\" learning Divine Thought into sword: Soul-Shocking Stance during his youth.","This time, with further inference, the visions within the broken sword faded a bit more, and the sounds became more fragmented.","Clearly, the Cause and Effect on the broken sword were gradually dissipating.","The inference process accelerated this.","Mo Hua only inferred once, then dared not to continue, fearing the Cause and Effect on the broken sword would completely vanish. He engraved deeply in his mind the scenes and sounds he saw and heard, then carefully stored the broken sword back into the Storage Ring.","Within the Cause and Effect, the images and sounds of the \"Soul-Shocking Sword\" were no different than before, perhaps even more blurred.","But the Mo Hua of today was no longer the same as before.","He couldn’t understand before.","But now, having mastered the Transforming Sword Skill and understood the principle of \"Soul Emergence,\" as he recalled the various scenes in the Cause and Effect, Mo Hua gradually achieved an inner comprehension.","The Taixu Divine Thought Sword, with the Transforming Sword Skill as its foundation.","From the perspective of \"Divine Soul,\" the so-called Transforming Sword Skill is essentially the Heart Image of the Life-transforming Sword.","It means having a sword in one’s heart.","And the Soul-Shocking Stance, on the foundation of sword transformation, integrates the Heart Image of the sword into the Divine Soul, thereby condensing a true \"Sword Intent\" capable of containing the power of the Divine Soul.","The Soul-Shocking Sword intimidates others and all evil spirits with its overwhelmingly fierce Sword Intent, striking fear without battle.","This is much like the principle in the Water Prison Sect’s Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill, where the heart image of the prison is merged into the Divine Soul, nurturing Evil Qi within.","The two delve into completely different realms, one being the Sword Dao, the other punishment, with vastly different practical applications.","\"Soul-Shocking Sword Skill...\"","Mo Hua closed his eyes to meditate, sinking his Divine Sense into the Sea of Consciousness.","Within the Sea of Consciousness, his Divine Thought avatar opened its eyes, and, simultaneously, began to gather Divine Thought, manifesting a rough Sword Weapon in hand.","\"This is the ’Heart Image’ of the sword within my heart...\"","Mo Hua sighed, feeling a bit helpless.","How shabby...","Though it gleamed with Golden Light, its shape was too simple, just a primitive prototypical \"sword.\"","\"Well, I’ll make do with this...\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","Coming halfway on the path of the Sword Dao, one cannot ask for too much.","He then formally began cultivating the sword technique according to the method of the Soul-Shocking Sword deduced from the broken sword.","He infused his understanding of the Sword Dao into the \"Heart Image.\"","He engraved the \"Heart Image\" of this sword into the Divine Soul.","Simultaneously, as per the Soul-Shocking Sword’s sword technique, he refined the Divine Soul over and over, activating Sword Qi, to merge the Divine Soul with the Heart Image into a true \"Sword Intent.\"","The methods of the Divine Soul are formless and intangible, elusive and profound.","But for Mo Hua, already adept at the Dao of Divine Thought, manipulating his consciousness to undergo all sorts of transformations was rather a familiar routine.","Mo Hua could feel his Sword of Divine Thought gradually merging with the Divine Soul.","This process was accompanied by some pain."]},{"number":1580,"title":"Chapter 1580 - 834: Sword Fiend (Part 2)","paragraphs":["And this thread of pain also made Mo Hua’s perception of his own Life Soul and Seven Souls more distinct.","He felt that his Divine Soul was being tempered by the Sword Technique.","And after several temperings, the Sword Intent within Mo Hua’s Divine Soul gradually emitted an indescribably astounding aura.","The fierce Sword Intent was frightening.","Mo Hua’s gaze also gradually sharpened.","The presence of Sword Intent within him was also climbing bit by bit...","But after rising for a while, it quickly halted, unable to advance any further.","It seemed that this was the limit...","No matter how he used the \"Soul-Shocking Sword Skill\" to refine his Divine Soul and integrate his Sword Intent, the momentum of the Sword Moves would not rise any further.","Mo Hua had a vague sense that this was his current limit.","He opened his eyes, took out a mirror, and looked at his obedient and delicate face, then his gaze focused, activating the \"Soul-Shocking Sword Skill.\"","Through the mirror, he could clearly see his gaze gradually brightening, and at the same time, the Sword Intent shining in his eyes was hard to look at directly.","But that was all.","Compared to Shui Yama’s pupil skill, it was far inferior.","At least when Shui Yama performed the pupil skill, his eyes were blood-red, as if immersed in blood, with demonic and monstrous presences inside, screaming fiercely, full of intense Evil Qi.","In terms of momentum and effect, both were far stronger than his Sword Dao \"pupil skill.\"","\"Even worse than Shui Yama, how can that work...\"","Mo Hua propped his chin, pondering where the problem lay.","After thinking it over, Mo Hua concluded that it could only be due to two reasons:","One, the foundation of Sword Dao.","Another, the method of soul emergence.","Subjective Divine Sense is based on objective external things.","In other words, \"Sword Intent\" must be based on the foundation of Sword Dao.","The foundation of Sword Dao refers to the blood, sweat, and tears poured into Sword Dao by a Sword Cultivator from childhood to adulthood.","Including years of learning, practicing, comparing the sword, the honing, thinking, and understanding of Swordsmanship, all these experiences combined into a kind of Sword Dao experience.","These are not conjured from nothing.","They are the Dao painstakingly refined by Sword Cultivators over the years, the integration of their Swordsmanship skills, insights, and perceptions.","This thing, if there is, then there is; if not, then there isn’t.","Clearly, Mo Hua didn’t have it.","Moreover, this is not something that can be \"suddenly enlightened\" upon suddenly.","Sudden Enlightenment is built upon long-term practice and contemplation.","Just like his daily Formation Painting, constantly pondering the principles of formations, one day in the future, he may achieve \"Sudden Enlightenment\" in formations.","But someone who doesn’t study formations cannot have sudden enlightenment in formations.","Likewise, someone who doesn’t practice sword cannot achieve sudden enlightenment in Swordsmanship.","Before entering Qianxue State Boundary, Mo Hua had hardly touched a sword and hadn’t learned even half a move of Swordsmanship. Naturally, he couldn’t have any foundation in Swordsmanship skills, experience, or insights.","His Sword Dao foundation was extremely poor.","This also determined that the \"Sword Intent\" he cultivated would also be weak, and the pupil skill containing Sword Intent would naturally lack power.","This is one point.","Furthermore, there’s also the aspect of the method of soul emergence.","The owner of the broken sword, namely \"Senior Xuan,\" used a method of \"emerging by borrowing the sword.\"","That is, after the Sword Intent emerges, it attaches to the sword, amplifying the power of the Sword Qi and enhancing the killing aura of the Sword Intent.","Not only Senior Xuan, but previous generations of Sword Cultivators in Taixu Gate possibly all used the method of \"borrowing the sword to emerge.\"","The problem precisely lies in this \"sword.\"","Mo Hua didn’t have a Spirit Sword.","His Sword Dao foundation was weak, and he wielded a \"self-destructive style\" Spirit Sword, lacking the type of sword other Sword Cultivators had, which was nurtured over time, connected with the heart, and used as a personal name sword as a Magical Treasure in the future.","Therefore, he couldn’t borrow the sword to emerge.","The Sword Intent was inefficient, and the pupil skill’s power was insufficient.","Without the amplification method of a Sword Weapon, the power further decreased.","As a result, this Taixu Shocking God Sword Skill lost a lot of its power and instead seemed rather useless.","But Mo Hua was still somewhat unwilling.","Divine Thought into Sword, how can such power do?","\"But what to do?\"","Mo Hua frowned and pondered hard for a long time, finding no clue, and somewhat disheartened, he lay back on the meditation cushion, his eyes staring blankly at the ceiling.","One is Swordsmanship, the other is pupil skill...","Swordsmanship emphasizes Sword Intent, borrowing the sword for emergence.","Pupil skill nurtures Evil Qi, borrowing the eyes for emergence.","Now he has abandoned Evil Qi, replacing it with Sword Intent, borrowing the eyes for emergence.","Lacking the deterrence of Evil Qi, without sharp Sword Intent, and unable to borrow the amplification of a Sword Weapon, it is akin to abandoning the advantages of both techniques while instead maximizing the weaknesses of one’s Sword Dao...","\"Endure and slowly practice the sword in the future?\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","Too slow.","The foundation of Sword Dao emphasizes the grind of water drops stone wear, which cannot be achieved overnight.","What’s more, starting to practice now, by the time Sword Dao has a minor achievement and this Soul-Shocking Sword can exert its power, who knows how long it will take...","\"Need to think of a way...\"","\"Cannot be inflexible in facing problems, must know how to adapt.\"","\"All Techniques in the world, ever-changing, the wonder of application, lies in the heart...\"","Mo Hua continued to ponder.","Now, he was essentially using the \"soul emergence method\" of the Water Prison Sect’s Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil to cast the Soul-Shocking Sword.","If the Soul-Shocking Sword were strong enough, there would be no problem.","But now, his Sword Dao foundation was weak, and the Soul-Shocking Sword was not strong enough.","Then he couldn’t abandon the original framework of the Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill for the time being.","\"Then...\" Mo Hua’s mind flashed, \"Integrate the Soul-Shocking Sword Skill into the framework of the Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill?\"","\"But how to integrate?\"","Mo Hua continued to frown in deep thought."]},{"number":1581,"title":"Chapter 1581 - 834: Sword Fiend (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Soul-Shocking Sword cultivates Sword Intent, using the sword for Soul Emergence; Blood Prison Pupil nurtures Evil Qi, using the eyes for Soul Emergence.","Firstly, I am not a Sword Cultivator, the method of \"using the sword for Soul Emergence\" can be directly ignored.","That leaves only, cultivating Sword Intent, nurturing Evil Qi, and... using the eyes for Soul Emergence.","In this way, has it become fusing Sword Intent and Evil Qi, borrowing both eyes for Soul Emergence?","If the Sword Intent isn’t strong enough, then use Evil Qi to make up for it...","At the same time, use the dignified Tai Xu Sword Intent to neutralize the sinister Evil Qi in the Taoist Prison?","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat, and his gaze grew brighter.","\"It seems... I could give it a try?\"","Mo Hua suddenly sat up and took out the Water Prison Forbidden Box again.","With a thought in mind, what follows is how to specifically execute it.","How to fuse the Sword Intent of the Soul-Shocking Sword with the Evil of the Water Prison Sect’s Penalty Prison?","Mo Hua pondered for a long time, and couldn’t help but scratch his head.","One inherits a Sword technique, the other a Forbidden Diagram.","The two don’t overlap at all, how can they be merged together?","\"Indeed, some things are easy to conceive but difficult to execute...\"","Mo Hua sighed in his heart.","He recalled once more the process of Senior Xuan’s cultivation of the \"Soul-Shocking Sword\" from the Cause and Effect Image, then stared wide-eyed at the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","Sword, prison, instruments of punishment, criminals...","By a whim, Mo Hua’s heart suddenly skipped.","The Sword is a tool for wounding.","Wounding or killing people would produce Evil.","The Penalty Prison is for punishing criminals.","Isn’t using the Sword instead of instruments of punishment to punish criminals also a way of nurturing Evil?","Moreover, it’s nurturing both Sword Intent and Evil Qi together!","In this way, without altering the original structure of the Water Prison Forbidden Map, the Soul-Shocking Sword Skill can be seamlessly integrated into the Blood Prison Pupil Skill.","Using the Sword as punishment, Sword Fiend in unity!","Mo Hua was excited.","He immediately began meditating, according to his own conception, to start fusing the technique points.","The method of cultivation is the same as before, visualizing the Heart Image of the Prison, inscribing it into the Divine Soul, thus nurturing the Power of Killing of the Divine Soul.","But unlike before, when visualizing the Water Prison Forbidden Map, Mo Hua \"deceived himself\" with some tricks.","Relying on his proficiency in the Divine Thought, he \"altered\" his own perception, replacing all the instruments of punishment in the Heart Image of the Prison with the Soul-Shocking Sword.","Thus the Penalty Prison Map became the Sword Penalty Map.","All the criminals were punished under the sharpness of the Soul-Shocking Sword, trembling and wailing.","This little trick of the Divine Way was something Mo Hua explored on his own, akin to \"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart\", more like planting a sort of \"suggestion\" to his own Taoist Heart.","Once the Sword Penalty Map formed, the entire Taoist Prison shed its sinister aura, becoming extremely sharp and imposing, like a Divine Thought \"Sword Prison\" full of Sword Qi.","This Sword Prison, fusing Sword Intent and Evil Qi, was inscribed into Mo Hua’s Divine Soul.","A majestic, fierce Sword Fiend bloomed from Mo Hua’s eyes, radiating sharpness, the Sword Dao imposing, the Evil Qi ominous, as if to sweep away all sins in the world, causing evil and malicious beings to tremble in fear.","In an instant, Mo Hua seemed like a ruler of the Nine Nether, the might of the Sword Fiend making it hard for anyone to meet his gaze.","This was the true Soul-Shocking Sword!","And it was different from what all the former seniors of the Taixu Gate cultivated, capable of being displayed through the eyes, with the Soul-Shocking Sword containing Evil Qi!","A moment later, all the sharpness withdrew.","Mo Hua’s eyes returned to clarity.","He looked around, showing a look of regret.","\"It’s a pity, Shui Yama isn’t here, otherwise I might have been able to have a staring contest with him, to see whose eyes are stronger...\"","But without a single enemy around, Mo Hua felt inexplicably lonely.","\"Not even a bad guy to show me his eyes...\"","But at least I’ve learned it!","\"Soul-Shocking Sword!\"","Mo Hua let out a silly grin, then suppressed his inner excitement, and sank his Divine Sense into the Sea of Consciousness, to continue practicing Formation.","Not to delight in things, nor to grieve at oneself.","At any time, maintaining a calm mind, diligently studying Formation, without slacking off.","Mo Hua closed his eyes and calmly started sketching Formations on the Taoist Stele in the Sea of Consciousness...","...","And before this.","At the moment when Mo Hua took out the Broken Sword, a trace of Cause and Effect aura had already spread out.","In the back mountain Sword Tomb, an old man with a full head of white hair and a long beard suddenly opened his eyes, his pupils trembling.","\"Xuan Er...\"","\"How can there be Xuan Er’s aura within the Taixu Gate?\"","He released his Divine Sense, his powerful Divine Thought spreading in an extremely subtle manner, sweeping across the entire Taixu Mountain Range, seeking the source of this aura.","But he was not what he used to be, his Divine Sense severely damaged. Suddenly using it caused needle-like pain.","Though his Divine Sense spread out, he searched very slowly.","Meanwhile, the aura of \"Xuan Er\" grew stronger.","It seemed someone was touching Xuan Er’s Cause and Effect, inferring something.","\"Who...\"","The old man’s heart tightened, continuing to trace with his Divine Sense, but just when he was about to sense the source of the aura, everything disappeared again.","Completely vanished.","As if someone deliberately hid it.","And hid it in a place neither within the state boundary nor within Cause and Effect.","The old man wore an angry expression, then gradually calmed down.","Inside, he took note once again.","Suddenly, a stabbing pain in his Divine Sense increased, and he heard a demonic hum beside his ear.","The old man’s gaze sharpened, immediately withdrawing his Divine Sense, gathering all his aura, holding his breath and concentrating, controlling himself and guarding his heart.","After a long time, the demonic hum subsided, and his Divine Sense no longer chaotic.","Only then did the old man slowly open his eyes, but his expression was weary, as if he had aged a little more.","He was all alone, looking around, gazing at the countless rusted Broken Swords in the Sword Tomb, and the withered bones buried within.","These swords once shone brightly.","These people, once were his junior brothers, senior brothers, and even mentors.","And Xuan Er was the last Sword Dao successor upon whom he pinned his deepest hopes amidst reluctance and despair.","But he was wrong.","He shouldn’t have passed it down...","The junior brothers, senior brothers, and mentors, their Broken Swords, their dead corpses can at least be buried in this Sword Tomb to keep him company in his old age.","But Xuan Er, his remains are gone, even his sword is nowhere to be found...","The old man’s silhouette unconsciously hunched, bringing a sense of desolation.","A bitter voice echoed lowly in the Sword Tomb:","\"Is it truly... to be severed...\""]},{"number":1582,"title":"Chapter 1582 - 835: White Dog","paragraphs":["In the entire Taixu Gate, no one yet knows what kind of spell point Mo Hua has secretly learned.","Mo Hua feels like he has veered off course again.","But this time, the deviation isn’t much, just a little.","The Soul-Shocking Sword remains the Soul-Shocking Sword.","The Blood Prison Pupil remains the Blood Prison Pupil.","It’s just that the two have borrowed from each other and fused a bit.","Mo Hua pondered for a bit, thinking that nobody had probably practiced like this before.","It makes sense, since Divine Thought into Sword is the sect-protecting inheritance of Taixu Gate, and the Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil is an extremely secret pupil skill not passed on by the Water Prison Sect except to the Sect Leader.","Previously, no one could have obtained both inheritances at the same time.","As for the fusion of sword technique and pupil skill, it looks simple, but it involves many ways of changing the Divine Sense, and even includes some techniques of \"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart.\" Besides the Uncle who has immersed himself in this for a long time, there aren’t many who could master it.","Mo Hua felt like he had \"created\" a very powerful Taoist Skill, and was elated for the following few days.","He really wanted to find someone to test the power of his Soul-Shocking Sword... no, now it should be called \"Seven Souls Shocking God Sword.\"","But looking around, he saw no opponent.","He couldn’t just find a fellow disciple in the sect to spar with.","This Soul-Shocking Sword contains the power of killing in the Divine Soul.","If he accidentally injured the Divine Soul of any of his Junior Brothers while sparring, that would be problematic.","After all, his Junior Brothers couldn’t compare with him; their Divine Souls are quite fragile.","Mo Hua sighed, feeling a bit regretful.","On this day, Mo Hua was eating in the dining hall, gnawing on a chicken leg while pondering the usage of the Soul-Shocking Sword, when suddenly Situ Jian came in with Yu Er.","Yu Er seemed frightened, looking distressed, his face pale.","Situ Jian was continuously comforting him on the side.","Mo Hua was stunned at the sight, and then his expression darkened.","Someone dared to bully Yu Er in Taixu Gate?","Mo Hua was a bit incredulous.","Among the disciples of the same cohort, Mo Hua is the \"Junior Brother.\"","The other disciples also knew that Yu Er was \"mixed\" with Mo Hua, being Mo Hua’s little follower, and usually treated Yu Er kindly, naturally not daring to bully him.","The Junior Brothers and Sisters from the lower cohort, having just joined not long ago and busy familiarizing themselves with various matters and cultivation courses at the Mountain Gate, were probably too dizzy themselves to dare bullying Yu Er, who obviously seems to have a \"prominent background.\"","The Senior Brothers and Sisters from the higher cohort, in theory, wouldn’t be so childish as to bully Yu Er, a child.","Besides, they have the upcoming Dao discourse conference and are too busy themselves.","Of course, if it was really them who acted...","Mo Hua thought about it and wasn’t afraid at all.","He has some network among the Senior Brothers and Sisters too.","Even without using his network, he isn’t afraid to fight.","Even the Senior Brothers and Sisters from a higher cohort are just in the Late-stage Foundation Establishment Cultivation; with proper planning, he has plenty of ways to deal with them.","And then, there’s the Sect Elders.","If it really were Sect Elders making things difficult for Yu Er... then he’d go find Elder Master Xun to \"complain!\"","Mo Hua quickly ran through all the possibilities in his mind, felt that there was nothing to fear, and then confidently asked:","\"What’s going on?\"","Situ Jian sighed, \"It’s a dog.\"","Mo Hua was left dumbfounded.","He pondered for a long time, and never imagined that the one bullying Yu Er would be a dog.","How absurd!","To be safe, Mo Hua still asked, \"Whose dog is this?\"","Situ Jian shook his head, \"I don’t know whose it is, it doesn’t look like it has an owner, tied outside a secluded, waterside library in the north, probably used as a guard.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Then there’s nothing to fear.","Just a mere guard dog.","Situ Jian glanced at Yu Er, feeling a bit sorry:","\"Yu Er finished his homework and was playing outside, seemingly chasing a mystical crane drinking water, and happened to run outside that library. The guard dog, initially dozing, suddenly woke up for some reason, bared its teeth, and viciously tried to bite Yu Er, looking savage. Yu Er was caught off guard and got scared.\"","\"Luckily, the dog was chained; otherwise, in its fury, it might have injured Yu Er.\"","\"I was just passing by, witnessed it, and brought Yu Er back...\"","Mo Hua frowned.","Suddenly barking at Yu Er?","He turned his head, saw Yu Er still looking frightened, face pale, gently patted his head, and said:","\"Don’t be afraid, it’s just a mere guard dog, I’ll get back at it for you!\"","Situ Jian felt a bit helpless.","This Junior Brother of his, stays calm amidst big matters. At critical moments, he’s indeed calm, thoughtful, and very reliable.","But also, from time to time, he’s just a bit... \"childish.\"","It’s just a guard dog, what scene can there be to reclaim?","Situ Jian sighed.","Mo Hua didn’t care about any of that, instructed Situ Jian to take good care of Yu Er, and stormed off to the library alone.","The entire map of Taixu Mountain is roughly in his mind.","He had a bit of an impression of that library indeed.","However, its location is secluded, the environment tranquil, and it’s not along the paths where disciples go for their classes or cultivation, so very few people visit there.","But Mo Hua didn’t remember any big dog in front of the library.","Of course, it could have been there, but he had overlooked it.","Arriving in front of the library, the pavilion and halls, with a serene little pond.","Cranes are raised in the pond, koi swim in the water, alongside some golden phoenixes and spirit rabbits, a scene full of mystical energy.","But these weren’t the focus.","Raising his eyes, Mo Hua saw in front of the library a big dog shackled by a gold thread chain.","This big dog was pure white all over; its appearance neither ugly nor handsome, just a plain dog’s look, currently lounging on the ground, its gaze disdainful, with an air of contempt for people."]},{"number":1583,"title":"Chapter 1583 - 835: White Dog (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua raised an eyebrow and pointed at it:","\"Vile creature, such nerve!\"","The big dog seemed to understand a little human nature, and knew Mo Hua was scolding it. Immediately, its white hair stood on end, it slowly stood up, looking at Mo Hua with a fierce gaze.","When it stood up, it revealed its figure, taller than Mo Hua by a head, baring its teeth, indeed somewhat intimidating.","Yet Mo Hua remained unafraid.","Because the dog was chained.","Even though he was shorter by a head, he still faced off with this Big White dog with a commanding presence.","But after watching for a moment, Mo Hua felt a bit conflicted.","What to do next?","Beat up the dog?","Or find a way to slaughter it, stew it into a meat pot, and calm Yu Er?","As if sensing Mo Hua’s \"great disrespect,\" this Big White dog suddenly became enraged, its expression turning even more hideous, a powerful, intimidating pressure spreading from its body.","Within its vertical pupils, something seemed to be swirling with light.","Mo Hua was startled, feeling uneasy in his heart.","This Big White dog doesn’t seem like an ordinary dog?","Not a Monster Beast, nor does it resemble a Spirit Beast, could it be... some kind of special Exotic Beast?","Exotic Beast? Likely not easy to deal with...","Should he just let it go?","As soon as this thought emerged, it seemed the big dog sensed it.","It looked at Mo Hua with a gaze mixed with disdain and contempt.","Seeing this, Mo Hua became angry.","A mere guard dog, actually looking down on me?","Fine!","Can’t fight, can’t kill, can’t stew, then I’ll scare you, make you suffer a bit, know the mountain beyond the mountain, the person beyond the dog!","Mo Hua snorted coldly, focusing his gaze, Divine Thought Manifestation Soul-Shocking Sword, operating Seven Souls Pupil Skill, sharp light erupted from his eyes, like Sword Qi swirling, threads of evil leaked out.","Soul-Shocking Sword!","This was the first time he performed the Soul-Shocking Sword Skill, not to a person, but to a dog.","According to Mo Hua’s expectation, this big dog should instantly be blinded, then howl for mercy.","But this Big White dog actually had its vertical pupil tremble, pure white light swirling in its eyes, transforming into a blurry virtual shadow, rising and falling, constantly changing.","In front of the secluded and beautiful library pavilion, one person and one dog glared at each other.","One is a young boy, one is a Big White dog, both opposing each other.","It seemed childish, but where their gazes crossed, invisible to ordinary Cultivators, faint golden sword light and pure white virtual shadow constantly entangled, ebbing and flowing, slaughtering without end.","Moments later, it was a draw.","Both sides gave up.","Mo Hua pointed at it and said: \"You wait for me, after class tomorrow, I’ll come find you again.\"","The Big White dog also looked at Mo Hua disdainfully, as if saying, \"I’m waiting, come if you dare.\"","Mo Hua snorted coldly, then turned and left.","Returning to Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua collapsed on a chair, looking dejected, feeling greatly defeated.","\"How absurd, couldn’t beat a dog...\"","He thought that with his Soul-Shocking Sword complete, once used, he could \"dominate all,\" but ended up humiliated by a mere dog...","Strictly speaking, Mo Hua felt his Sword Dao Pupil Skill, in the confrontation, ought to slightly surpass this big dog, but a loss is a loss, can’t make excuses for himself.","\"What exactly is this big dog’s background...\"","Mo Hua frowned, but the more he thought, the more annoyed he became.","\"No, no matter what its background, have to show it something.\"","Otherwise, his original creation, the fusion of Tai Xu Shocking God Sword Skill and Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill, wouldn’t it be a great embarrassment.","First battle failed, can’t even handle a dog.","Mo Hua rekindled his fighting spirit, determined to compete with this big dog.","\"This Soul-Shocking Sword needs more practice...\"","Mo Hua took out the Water Prison Forbidden Box and began visualizing again.","The Seven Souls Blood Prison transformed into the Seven Souls Sword Prison.","Ideally, to integrate Corpse Dog, Fushi, Spirit of Sparrow Shade, Swallow Thief, Non-Toxic, Remove Filth, Stinking Lung all Seven Souls into Sword Prison Heart Image, sensing each, activating the Divine Soul, then using both eyes as apertures, transforming into \"Sword Intent,\" merging the Evil Qi Divine Soul as a means of slaughter.","There are eight in the Sword Prison, first integrate Seven Souls, then integrate Life Soul.","Previously, Mo Hua only engraved a Sword Prison Heart Image in the Divine Soul, integrated one soul of \"Corpse Dog,\" beyond that, must integrate the other six souls, for this improved Soul-Shocking Sword to truly mature.","With Seven Souls integrated, then Life Soul, thus completing the construction of the Sword Prison, Sword Fiend unified, this Soul-Shocking Sword can be considered grandly successful.","Mo Hua’s mood gradually calmed down.","\"Still early...\"","Whether the Soul-Shocking Sword or Seven Souls Pupil Skill, countless profound secrets remain undiscovered, many deep mysteries to learn, not something solved just integrating one soul.","Currently, only learned the beginning.","Must continually refine, perfect the Soul-Shocking Sword!","Mo Hua cast aside all distractions, focused intently, continued delving deeper into Seven Souls Soul-Shocking Sword.","Using Life Soul as a foundation, building Seven Souls Sword Prison, forming the Soul-Shocking Sword technique.","\"Corpse Dog Soul, has integrated into Heart Image, forming one Sword Prison, next soul is... Fushi Soul...\"","\"Visualize Forbidden Diagram, replace instrument with Sword Weapon, use sword instead of punishment...\"","\"Use sword in Heart Image, merge Heart Image with Divine Soul, lead Divine Soul to Soul Emergence...\"","...","Mo Hua gradually comprehended, repeatedly practicing, the more he grasped, the more he could experience the profoundness and mystery inherent in the Soul-Shocking Sword Skill and Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill.","His Sword Prison of Fushi Soul also began taking shape bit by bit.","The pace was considerably slower.","It seemed that this Divine Thought Technique, inherently progresses slower as cultivation deepens.","Yet, even though slower, Mo Hua spent an entire night, still integrated half of it."]},{"number":1584,"title":"Chapter 1584 - 835: White Dog (Part 3)","paragraphs":["His Shocking God Sword Pupil skill had become much stronger than before.","The next day, he couldn’t wait to once again challenge that big dog.","In front of the library pavilion, by the small pond.","The man and the dog started glaring at each other again.","To Mo Hua’s surprise, he still didn’t win, but compared to last time, he had definitely gained the upper hand.","After a while, both he and the big dog’s divine souls were a bit weary, so they temporarily called a truce.","\"I’ll be back in a few days!\" Mo Hua was not ready to give up.","The big dog’s expression was equally disdainful, baring its teeth fiercely at Mo Hua.","But this time, its gaze was much heavier, and it didn’t dare to truly underestimate Mo Hua anymore.","After returning, Mo Hua had no appetite and continued to practice the Soul-Shocking Sword diligently.","Finally, three days later, he made rapid progress, fully integrating a Sword Prison within the soul of Fushi.","With that, he had fused two of the seven souls: one Corpse Dog and one Fushi.","The power of his pupil skill greatly increased.","The next day, Mo Hua returned to the library pavilion full of vigor and confidence.","This time, he intended to finally determine the victor with the big dog.","The atmosphere turned somewhat tense.","The big white dog clearly recognized Mo Hua’s prowess, and sensing the sharper aura emanating from him, it shed its usual disdain, replaced by a fierce demeanor suited for facing a formidable opponent.","Both man and dog took the battle seriously.","They resumed glaring at each other as always.","But this time, the clash of divine souls was even fiercer than before.","Mo Hua’s sword intent transformed into the shape of a sword, forming into a prison filled with an intense evil qi, enough to instill fear at a glance.","The big dog seemed to have triggered some bloodline power, as the phantom in its eyes grew more solid, transforming into an entirely white, holy divine beast apparition, too sacred to be gazed upon directly.","It’s unclear how long the standoff lasted, but ultimately, Mo Hua was superior by a slim margin.","His divine thought had already undergone Dao Hua, bringing his divine soul closer to being a \"deity\"; in direct contests of divine thought, he feared no one.","The big white dog was defeated, its pure white phantom dissipating, suffering a backlash as a result.","It was also stabbed in the eyes by Mo Hua’s sword intent, and in pain, it had to cover its eyes with its paws, howling painfully.","Mo Hua, on the other hand, was proud and full of spirit.","Though his own divine soul hurt a bit and he felt somewhat head-heavy and foot-light, in front of this \"formidable opponent,\" the big white dog, he couldn’t afford to lose face.","\"Do you still dare to look at me?\"","Mo Hua arrogantly taunted.","Afterwards, he ran to the Disciple’s Residence to call Yu Er over.","In front of the big dog, Mo Hua, pointing at Yu Er, commanded the dog:","\"Apologize.\"","Unexpectedly, as soon as the big dog saw Yu Er, its expression turned ferocious, ignoring the pain in its eyes, and it roared, attempting to pounce on Yu Er.","Yu Er turned pale.","Mo Hua’s face turned stern, his eyes gleamed, and the big dog immediately became well-behaved.","It glanced at Yu Er, then at Mo Hua, who was protecting Yu Er with an upright posture, unwillingly made a soft \"whine\" towards Yu Er, as if apologizing.","Standing behind Mo Hua, with him backing up, Yu Er no longer felt afraid. Seeing the fluffy white big dog, Yu Er even wanted to reach out and pet its head, but recalling its ferocity, ultimately restrained the urge.","No matter what, the matter was settled.","Mo Hua nodded, fairly satisfied.","Just as he was about to scold the big dog a bit more, a gentle voice suddenly rang out:","\"What are you all doing here?\"","Mo Hua was startled, turning his head to see a middle-aged cultivator with a fair complexion, black hair, slightly plump figure, and a kind expression walking out of the library pavilion at some point.","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"Sect... Sect Leader?\"","This middle-aged cultivator was the Taixu Sect Leader.","Mo Hua wasn’t familiar with him and had never talked with him alone, only seeing the Sect Leader speaking at the Great Dao Field during the annual sect founding ceremony.","The Taixu Sect Leader glanced at Mo Hua, raised an eyebrow as if recalling something, \"Your name is... Mo Hua?\"","Mo Hua opened his mouth, \"You... recognize me?\"","The Taixu Sect Leader thought to himself, thanks to Ancestor Xun, there probably aren’t many within the Taixu Gate who don’t recognize you...","The Taixu Sect Leader nodded gently, turned to look at Yu Er, and asked, \"This is the little kid from the Shangguan family, right?\"","Yu Er nervously performed a salute, stammering:","\"Hello, Sect Leader.\"","\"Hello.\"","The Taixu Sect Leader replied kindly and then turned his gaze to notice the big white dog, which seemed to have been \"bullied\" just now, and his expression froze.","Mo Hua suddenly realized something and softly asked:","\"Sect Leader, this big dog... doesn’t belong to you, does it?\"","Big dog?","The Taixu Sect Leader was startled, his expression somewhat subtle as he nodded, \"I suppose so...\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","Uh-oh!","The dog indeed respects its owner.","I bullied the dog raised by the Sect Leader!","Just then, the Taixu Sect Leader asked, \"What were you two kids doing just now?\"","Mo Hua’s mind raced as he quickly said, \"We... saw this big dog was hungry and pitiful, so we decided to feed it something, right...\"","Mo Hua shot a sharp glance at the big white dog.","The big dog, yielding to Mo Hua’s \"tyranny,\" instinctively whined.","The Taixu Sect Leader’s expression was strange.","After Mo Hua finished speaking, he immediately added, \"Sect Leader, um... the disciple will take his leave, so as not to disturb you...\"","Then Mo Hua, accompanied by Yu Er, saluted the Sect Leader and quickly slipped away.","The Taixu Sect Leader watched Mo Hua’s retreating back, smiling slightly, and muttered:","\"An interesting child, no wonder the Ancestor likes him.\"","He turned his head to look at the \"big dog\" lying on the ground with interest, his tone calm but somewhat gloating:","\"Usually, you bark at everyone, not even giving me face; how come you’re so obedient today?\"","The big dog lay listlessly, giving the Taixu Sect Leader a sideways glance.","Afterwards, it also turned its gaze far away, first looking at Mo Hua, then inadvertently shifting its gaze to Yu Er, the look in its eyes revealing a fierceness akin to facing a \"natural enemy.\"","This hint of fierceness was also caught by the Taixu Sect Leader.","His gaze paused slightly, turning his head to look at Yu Er, whose hand was held by Mo Hua and who was walking away, his brow gradually furrowing..."]},{"number":1585,"title":"Chapter 1585 - 836: Lantern Festival","paragraphs":["Mo Hua, using his self-created Seven Souls Frightening Divine Sword Style, which combines the Taixu Gate’s Soul-Shocking Sword Forms and the Water Prison Sect’s Seven Souls Blood Prison Diagram, defeated a big white dog spectacularly. He returned triumphant under Yu Er’s admiring gaze.","After returning, he suffered greatly.","His divine soul hurt intensely.","And it wasn’t the pain of divine sense exhaustion; it was the pain from the core, due to the depletion of his divine soul and the shaking of the seven souls.","\"Overestimated myself...\"","Mo Hua deeply regretted it in his heart.","\"If only I hadn’t pushed myself so hard... What is that dumb big white dog’s background? How is it so strong...\"","Mo Hua clutched his head, curled up on the bed, unable to move due to the pain.","No way.","With the depletion of the seven souls and the instability of the life soul, if this continues, once one soul breaks and the life soul is harmed, he might become an idiot...","Think of a solution...","Mo Hua, enduring the intense pain, focused his mind, sank his divine sense into the Sea of Consciousness, and then calmed his mind for meditation.","But meditation was ineffective.","He then sensed the Taoist Stele, but although the Taoist Stele contained the profound meaning of the Great Dao capable of expelling evil and calming spirits, it couldn’t repair his damaged divine soul.","Mo Hua tried many methods, but none were effective; his incarnated divine thought felt like it was being cut by swords, causing unbearable pain.","An incarnated divine thought is transformed from the divine soul.","When the divine soul is injured, the incarnated body is naturally damaged as well.","On the incarnate, there were already fine cracks, indicating the aftereffects of his divine soul clashing with others.","Mo Hua frowned.","Just then, his thoughts shifted, noticing that not every part of his incarnated divine thought had cracks.","The pale gold areas were intact.","The thicker the gold, the more stable the incarnation.","This pale gold was... divine marrow!","Mo Hua’s heart tensed. Having no other choice at the moment, he mobilized the divine marrow within his incarnation, transforming it into thread-like \"blood\" to flow throughout his body.","The dazzling divine marrow, like melted golden water, flowed within Mo Hua.","When it touched the cracks on the incarnated divine thought, caused by the struggle of the divine soul, it slowly melted into them, \"repairing\" those injuries.","The pain in the divine soul was also alleviated.","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief.","Then, without delay, Mo Hua mobilized all the divine marrow he had accumulated before, circulating it within his incarnated divine thought, repairing the injuries on his divine soul.","The pale gold divine marrow was consumed little by little.","The cracks on the incarnated divine thought were also being repaired little by little.","After a long time, Mo Hua opened his eyes and exhaled deeply.","The pain in his divine thought had eased, and the cracks were mostly repaired, though the lingering pain remained.","He also confirmed one thing:","The injuries on the divine soul can be repaired using \"divine marrow.\"","Mo Hua’s brow furrowed slightly...","Elder Xun Zixian once said that a cultivator’s divine sense is a derivation of their divine soul.","So, by this logic, is the divine marrow of a deity also a derivation of the deity’s divine soul?","Can a deity’s divine soul, besides deriving telekinesis, also derive divine marrow?","Much like how a cultivator’s heart contains blood and essence blood?","And due to the fundamental difference between the divine souls of deities and cultivators, whether one can derive divine marrow also represents the most essential distinction between them?","So, after all, what exactly is divine marrow?","Is it soul, or telekinesis?","Or is it the materialization of the Dao Laws?","What is the divine soul of a deity really like, and how does it differ from a cultivator’s?","The more Mo Hua learned, the more questions he had.","He could only suppress these questions in his heart, planning to ponder them slowly as he gained more Tao cultivation experience in the future.","For now, he understood one thing:","He should stockpile more divine marrow in the future.","The more the better.","This divine marrow, it’s needed for divine sense sublimation, for breaking through cultivation bottlenecks, and even for battles involving the divine soul, one should probably keep more divine marrow as \"healing medicine.\"","It’s truly a versatile solution.","Yet from this battle with the big white dog, Mo Hua’s divine soul was damaged, and repairing it almost consumed over half of the divine marrow he had painstakingly accumulated by devouring so far.","Within his incarnated divine thought, the golden marrow resembling blood threads had faded considerably, with some areas even regressing to silver.","Mo Hua sensed a bit of a crisis.","A cultivator can only advance, never retreat!","Need to consume more.","Consume telekinesis to supplement divine sense.","Consume divine marrow to replenish the divine soul.","Tao cultivation is endless, there’s no room for slack!","Mo Hua revived his spirits.","But he couldn’t exert himself now because his divine soul had just been repaired and still retained some pain, so it wasn’t advisable to strain it rashly.","Only now did he truly understand why the sect had completely cut off the tradition of \"Divine Thought into sword,\" preventing disciples from learning this sword technique.","Injuring the divine soul is no joke.","It’s just that he had walked the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao, with a strong foundation, having learned many divine sense skills, coupled with some fortuitous encounters, and even evil gods \"delivered meals,\" allowing him to offset some flaws.","Otherwise, the so-called \"Divine Thought into sword\" is actually \"Life Soul into sword,\" literally risking one’s life when wielding the sword, the stronger the sword, the greater the danger.","\"I should use this move cautiously in the future.\"","If it can be avoided, do not use it, otherwise, even if the divine soul isn’t diminished, the loss of divine marrow would cause heartache.","Divine marrow is not easy to obtain.","In this world, not everywhere has \"kind,\" dozing evil gods delivering divine marrow.","That being the case...","The big white dog, which once matched him in the Divine Thought confrontation, doesn’t seem simple after all...","Mo Hua stroked his chin.","The next day, Mo Hua bought a few chicken legs from the dining hall and then went to that remote book pavilion.","In front of the book pavilion, the big white dog was still there.","Only now, it had lost its former arrogant demeanor, looking sickly and listless, clearly not in good spirits either."]},{"number":1586,"title":"Chapter 1586 - 836: Lantern Festival (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua saw that there was no one around, the Sect Leader was probably not here either, so he sneaked over.","The big white dog saw Mo Hua and immediately shivered.","Mo Hua handed over a few large chicken drumsticks and sincerely said, \"I admit, you’re still quite impressive.\"","The big dog was stunned.","\"You know, fighting brings understanding. Consider these drumsticks a greeting gift,\" Mo Hua said.","Although they were called large chicken drumsticks, in front of the big white dog, they still seemed small. However, they were complete in color, aroma, and taste, with crispy skin and tender meat, Mo Hua’s favorite.","The big dog hesitated for a moment, glanced at Mo Hua, and silently swallowed the drumsticks, accepting the \"greeting gift.\"","Mo Hua was delighted, reached out his hand and said:","\"Let’s shake hands and make peace!\"","The big white dog was somewhat reluctant.","But it had already lost, and had eaten the drumsticks. Mo Hua also gave it enough face, so it followed the steps, silently stretched out its big paw, and placed it on Mo Hua’s hand, shaking it.","This was mutual recognition among Divine Way strong ones.","Mo Hua nodded in satisfaction.","Inside the library, the Taixu Sect Master, who had actually been present all along, witnessed the scene of Mo Hua shaking hands with the \"big dog\" and couldn’t help being a bit stunned. Then his expression became increasingly peculiar...","...","After that, Mo Hua would occasionally visit the big white dog and bring it some food.","The person and the dog could be considered quite familiar now.","However, for a long period, the big white dog was listless, lacking energy.","Mo Hua couldn’t do anything about it.","During this time, Mo Hua was busy studying the Soul-Shocking Sword and the Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill on the Water Prison Forbidden Box. Unknowingly, he had put Shui Yan Luo out of his mind.","But he forgot, others wouldn’t.","The Taoist Court was still investigating.","Several days later, Gu Changhuai sent a transmission to Mo Hua: \"There’s news of Shui Yan Luo.\"","Mo Hua was shocked, then delighted.","Indeed, knowing more people is beneficial. When you don’t have time to do something, someone else will do it for you.","Mo Hua quickly asked, \"Where is Shui Yan Luo?\"","Gu Changhuai said, \"On a Rouge Boat.\"","\"Rouge Boat...\" Mo Hua’s gaze faltered slightly.","Gu Changhuai continued, \"The trace of Shui Yan Luo has been investigated continuously by the Taoist Court. He lost an arm, was seriously injured, rescued by someone, all the land routes along the way were sealed, all the islands large and small in the Mistwater River were searched. The only place he can hide is on the water, and it can only be a ship...\"","\"Recently, there were reports from informants that Shui Yan Luo’s hiding place happens to be the... Rouge Boat secretly operated by the Gui Water Sect.\"","Gu Changhuai paused and asked Mo Hua, \"Rouge Boat, you should be familiar with it, right?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment.","Rouge Boat...","Speaking of knowing it, he indeed does, might even have seen it personally.","But he truly doesn’t know the specific inside story.","Moreover, in this situation, facing the Supervisor of the Taoist Court, even if familiar, he definitely can’t reveal it.","\"Not very familiar,\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai didn’t care whether Mo Hua was truly unfamiliar or pretending, but transmitted a message:","\"The term Rouge Boat has been on the Taoist Court’s investigation list since decades ago.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback.","Gu Changhuai continued, \"It’s an industry chain developed along the Mistwater River, primarily led by Gui Water Sect, with several sects and family clans pushing from behind.\"","\"These forces are like locusts on a string, making mouths full of oil through this romantic trade.\"","\"However...\"","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"The Taoist Court can’t intervene. This time they can continue the investigation only because the Xia family is leading from behind, borrowing the momentum of the Taoist Court...\"","Mo Hua had an epiphany.","He thought, it was impossible for the Taoist Court not to know about the Rouge Boat, but truly wanting to investigate must be met with heavy resistance.","At least, under the watchful eyes of family clans, relying solely on the power of the state boundary’s Taoist Court is definitely not enough.","Coupled with the internal politicking and scheming within the Taoist Court, genuinely accomplishing something is even more difficult.","Uncle Gu really has it tough...","\"So where is the Gui Water Sect’s Rouge Boat hidden?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"It’s still unclear,\" Gu Changhuai responded, \"The Gui Water Sect’s Rouge Boat is mixed with ships from various sects, family clans, commercial ferries, and Spirit Boats. The forces are so intertwined, it’s impossible to investigate.\"","\"Previously, when things were tense, the Gui Water Sect lay low for a while, but recently, the Taoist Court received new clues, suggesting that in a few days the Gui Water Sect will take the opportunity to host another Rouge Boat gathering.\"","\"Another gathering?\" Mo Hua frowned, \"Gui Water Sect isn’t afraid of the Court’s investigation?\"","Gu Changhuai pondered and replied, \"On the surface, the Court has taken down a group of water bandits, reported achievements to the higher-ups, and the subsequent actions were much smaller, causing any big stir anymore. The Gui Water Sect might think the storm has passed, hence they’re stirring again.\"","\"It’s always been like this, the investigations from above are merely formalities, killing a few to warn the rest, the Gui Water Sect likely thinks this time is the same.\"","\"This is just one aspect; another point...\"","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"You aren’t a family clan descendant, so you don’t quite understand... A large ship is difficult to turn.\"","\"Once a family grows large, and people multiply, becoming intertwined, when interests have deeply rooted, trying to change is already impossible.\"","\"This trade earns Spirit Stones too fast.\"","\"The Gui Water Sect, from top to bottom, relies entirely on this romantic industry, drinking the blood, and once it stops, losing its parasitic interests, the sect will instantly fall into chaos.\"","\"It’s like drinking poison to quench thirst, with a certain death coming in the future, but without drinking the poison, you’ll die immediately.\"","\"So Gui Water Sect can only bravely keep going, with no turning back...\"","...","Mo Hua was momentarily stunned, feeling an emotional resonance in his heart.","Perhaps it’s not just the Gui Water Sect, the entire Cultivation World’s forces are all like this."]},{"number":1587,"title":"Chapter 1587 - 836: Lantern Festival (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Once you succumb to the allure of profit and take the wrong first step, you will continue to be drawn by the profit, making mistakes step by step.","Until finally, when the grave mistake is made, even if everyone knows it’s wrong, the profit is so deeply rooted that it cannot be changed at all.","In the end, everyone can only watch helplessly as the towering edifice topples little by little, crushing everyone beneath it.","Perhaps for the cultivators with a conscience inside the Gui Water Sect, this is how they feel...","Mo Hua sighed.","Then he contemplated for a moment and asked, \"Uncle Gu, do you know when exactly the Gui Water Sect will launch the Rouge Boat? Any clues?\"","\"I have some...\"","\"What clues?\"","Gu Changhuai did not hide it from Mo Hua, \"Three days later, the annual lantern festival of Mistwater City will take place, bringing together cultivators, as usual, releasing river lanterns, taking boat rides, and taking a night cruise on the Mistwater River. According to information from the Taoist Court, during that time, the Gui Water Sect will slip the Rouge Boat among the pleasure boats, releasing it into the Mistwater River, then diverging at a predetermined point, ultimately converging at their destination, where they will begin their business of amorous services...\"","\"I see... quite a few tricks they have...\" Mo Hua mumbled, and then immediately noticed something was off, asking curiously, \"Uncle Gu, why tell me this?\"","\"Don’t you want to know?\"","\"I want to know, but...\"","Usually, Uncle Gu keeps things to himself until he’s really pressed about it, so why is he acting so abnormally today?","When something unusual happens, there must be ghosts lurking about.","\"...Do you have some request from me?\" Mo Hua asked shrewdly.","Gu Changhuai sighed.","It’s good for the child to be clever, but being too clever can be a bit unappealing.","\"It’s not a ’request,’ it’s an assignment from the Taoist Court.\" Gu Changhuai insisted.","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow, \"Oh... what do you need me to do?\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t correct his wording anymore and said helplessly, \"You need to sneak in as well...\"","\"There are two types of Rouge Boats: one for sect disciples to indulge in and another for family cultivators across the cultivation world to entertain themselves with.\"","\"To avoid any oversight, there must be insiders on both kinds of boats.\"","\"As for the family cultivators’ side, I can infiltrate. But on the sect disciples’ boat, I don’t have a good informant.\"","Initially, Gu Changhuai thought about finding someone from the Shangguan Family or the Gu Family to board and investigate.","But those disciples either have enough cultivation but lack agility or are clever enough but slightly lacking in strength, and when it comes to sneaking in and gathering intelligence, the aptitude compared to Mo Hua is vastly different.","And many sect disciples, including those from the Shangguan and Gu Families themselves, he couldn’t trust.","After much consideration, in Gu Changhuai’s heart, he actually felt Mo Hua was the most reliable.","\"You sneak in, and if you find anything, you can tell me. After all, even if I don’t tell you, you would eventually sneak in yourself...\" Gu Changhuai said.","Mo Hua nodded; that was true, Uncle Gu knew him quite well.","He was definitely going to the Rouge Boat on this mission.","However, he had a concern.","\"Uncle Gu, the Rouge Boat... seems to be that kind of place, right? If I’m going to gather intelligence, you need to give me a ’proof.’\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai was stunned, \"What proof?\"","\"It’s just,\" Mo Hua said, \"there’s a record at the Taoist Court proving that I boarded the boat to assist the Taoist Court with investigations, not for personal leisure!\"","Otherwise, if the Taoist Court conducts a ’purge’ and sweeps him up in it, he’d lose face terribly.","Gu Changhuai paused and sighed helplessly.","One has to admit that Mo Hua, this kid, is quite thoughtful, leaving no room for error.","\"Alright.\" Gu Changhuai agreed.","\"So, how do I sneak in?\" Mo Hua asked again.","\"That’s for you to find out by yourself.\" Gu Changhuai said.","With Mo Hua’s shrewdness, Gu Changhuai had no doubt he would be able to sneak in.","\"If you need anything, just let me know.\"","Gu Changhuai finished speaking and said nothing more.","Mo Hua, on the other hand, was pondering in his heart how exactly he could sneak onto the Rouge Boat.","\"Mistwater City, Lantern Festival, Rouge Boat...\"","Mo Hua pondered over it and figured that he could only turn to Hao Xuan and the people from Gui Water Sect, like Wang Chen, for help.","In the following days, he was busy preparing for this matter.","With Hao Xuan’s help, he also got in touch with Wang Chen from Gui Water Sect, gathered some clues, prepared some Formations and Pills, and set off on the day of the ten-day break.","He first visited the Gu Family and discussed specific matters with Gu Changhuai, planning to head directly to Mistwater City afterward.","But before he could leave the Gu Family’s house, Elder Gu Hong blocked his way.","Elder Gu Hong pulled Mo Hua to a small pavilion nearby and said sternly, \"Have you colluded with Changhuai and kept something from me?\"","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat, \"You’ve found out?\"","Indeed, ginger only gets spicier as it gets older.","Elder Gu Hong snorted lightly, \"Spit it out, what’s going on?\"","\"It’s nothing major...\" Mo Hua said with an awkward smile.","Regarding the Rouge Boat, Elder Gu Hong might not know.","What she’s concerned about is probably just Uncle Gu’s matchmaking matter.","Mo Hua contemplated for a moment and then said:","\"It’s just that Uncle Gu approached me and made a deal... I cover for him on this matchmaking matter with you, and in return, if he has any tasks from the Taoist Court, he’ll take me along to earn some Merit Points.\"","Mo Hua just sold out Gu Changhuai, throwing the blame on him.","Elder Gu Hong was a bit angry, \"Taking you to earn Merit Points should be a given. But letting you, a child, deal with me to avoid matchmaking? This Gu Changhuai is really regressing as he ages; he’s become a Supervisor, his wings have hardened, and I won’t let him off easily...\"","Elder Gu Hong was about to get up in a rage.","Mo Hua quickly pulled her back, \"Elder Hong, don’t be hasty, this could be good news.\"","Elder Gu Hong gave Mo Hua a light glare, \"How is this good news?\"","\"Think about it,\" Mo Hua glanced around and whispered, \"Uncle Gu doesn’t want to meet for matchmaking, and if you force him, he gets even more reluctant. Doesn’t that backfire? Why not let me secretly help you!\"","\"Help me?\" Elder Gu Hong was taken aback.","Mo Hua nodded, \"I’ll help you. If there’s really a suitable sister or aunt, I can play matchmaker for Uncle Gu...\"","Elder Gu Hong still seemed a bit hesitant.","Mo Hua then took the opportunity to ask, \"Do you not find Instructor Hua suitable?\"","Elder Gu Hong hesitated, then frowned and said, \"I heard later on; this girl seems off...\"","\"What’s off?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"I always felt her actions were a bit sneaky, and her makeup smell is rather strong, with chaotic aura, possibly...not very self-respecting.\"","Elder Gu Hong’s words were quite straightforward.","But in her eyes, Mo Hua was like a nephew, so she didn’t hold back.","To reassure Elder Gu Hong, Mo Hua whispered secretly:","\"Elder Hong, actually... I found someone who matches Uncle Gu very well, an ’elder sister’...\"","As expected, Elder Gu Hong perked up, her eyes sparkling, \"Who?\"","\"I can’t tell you yet...\" Mo Hua teased.","\"You child...\"","Elder Gu Hong was somewhat helpless, but thinking over it, she smiled and said, \"Fine, I won’t ask then. You better put your heart into it. If this works out, treat the Gu Family as your own. If anything happens...\"","Elder Gu Hong felt she might have spoken too boldly, so she corrected herself, \"...as long as it’s not a grave offense like defying the Taoist Court, if anything happens, I’ll support you!\"","Mo Hua’s expression brightened, \"Thank you, Elder Hong!\"","After a few more words of casual conversation, Mo Hua took his leave of Elder Hong and left Qingzhou City, arriving inside Gui Water City.","In Gui Water City, Mo Hua met with Wang Chen, confirmed the accuracy of the information, and reunited with Hao Xuan, Cheng Mo, and Situ Jian.","The group then set off together for the Third-grade Immortal City—Mistwater City.","Meanwhile, the annual Lantern Festival in Mistwater City had already begun, attracting cultivators from all sides.","In the city, there were local Mistwater City cultivators, visiting cultivators, and cultivators from various family sects.","And within the Qian Learning State Boundary, there were numerous sect disciples from different sects..."]},{"number":1588,"title":"Chapter 1588 - 837: Hatred","paragraphs":["The lantern festival was approaching, and Mistwater City was bustling with activity.","The streets were packed with people and vehicles, cultivators of all kinds crossing paths, the market town was dense, and the sounds of people filled the air.","Mo Hua and a few others found a small tavern, requested a private room, and only after confirming no one was eavesdropping, did they begin to converse quietly.","\"At this critical moment, the sect above seems reluctant to set sail...\"","\"But there’s quite a commotion below, as everyone is counting on this for some extra cash.\"","\"Moreover, the furor has already passed, the Taoist Court has withdrawn, there’s no visible action.\"","\"As for the higher Taoist Court, they always put on a show, and when something goes wrong, a little Spirit Stone here and there smooths things over.\"","\"Several other noble families are also exerting pressure, after all, it’s not just us... it’s not just the Gui Water Sect in this, others also need to earn their keep...\"","\"Therefore, this time the ship will still set sail, though it will be more discreet.\"","...","Wang Chen told Mo Hua everything he knew about the inside story.","Mo Hua nodded, seeing Wang Chen’s worried expression, he said:","\"Don’t worry, I left a record for you at the Taoist Court, you were coerced by the sect into doing this. As long as you remain loyal and don’t make any major mistakes, when the Gui Water Sect incident breaks out, you can be exonerated.\"","Wang Chen was overjoyed and saluted: \"Thank you...\"","He glanced at Mo Hua, unsure of how to address him.","Hao Xuan promptly reminded him: \"Junior Brother.\"","\"Oh,\" Wang Chen confusedly followed suit, \"Thank you, Junior Brother.\"","Mo Hua nodded, accepting it.","\"All the Gui Water Sect’s ships dock during the day, and after sunset, around 5 p.m, they will set sail all at once, heading into Mistwater River.\"","\"Some of the ships are just regular pleasure boats for tourists to release lanterns and enjoy the scenery; while others, externally identical, have different destinations and purposes entirely...\"","Wang Chen said to Mo Hua.","\"Wait for sunset...\" Mo Hua murmured.","Wang Chen nodded, \"But you can board early, I’ve spoken to the senior brother in charge, you can head over in advance. You can spend some time on the ship, familiarize yourself with the situation, and naturally, when it’s 5 p.m, you’ll sail to your destination with the ship.\"","\"Is your senior brother reliable?\" Cheng Mo asked.","Wang Chen considered, \"He’s not very reliable, but he’s very greedy. I gave him some Spirit Stones, with that, he should be reliable.\"","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua nodded.","After finalizing the plan, Wang Chen led Mo Hua and the others to a large, luxurious pleasure boat.","There were Gui Water Sect disciples guarding the entrance, tourists needed tokens to board.","\"Junior Brother, hang on a second.\"","Wang Chen said to Mo Hua and the others, then ran ahead to speak with a senior brother from Gui Water Sect.","The senior brother glanced at Mo Hua and the group from a distance, nodded slightly, then waved them over.","Mo Hua and the group walked forward.","\"Come with me...\"","This Gui Water Sect senior brother said, and then led the way ahead.","However, he didn’t take Mo Hua and the others onto the ship but brought them to a secluded little storeroom nearby. As soon as he opened his mouth, he said:","\"A hundred thousand Spirit Stones per person.\"","Mo Hua was shocked, \"So expensive?\"","The Gui Water Sect senior brother sneered, \"Do you know where you’re going? What a place of intoxicating pleasures it is? A hundred thousand Spirit Stones is already a discount, thanks to Junior Brother Wang’s face, otherwise, it would be at least a hundred and ten thousand.\"","Mo Hua hesitated, finally, with reluctance, he said: \"Alright then...\"","This is all for the sake of the investigation, if it were up to him, he’d never spend this kind of unjust Spirit Stone.","And he planned to ask Uncle Gu for \"reimbursement\" later.","Hao Xuan and the others also felt the pinch, but they were noble family’s sons, not to the point of not being able to afford it, and Mo Hua said this was a commission from the Taoist Court, capable of earning a lot of merit points.","Merit points can’t be bought with Spirit Stones.","As long as they could earn merit points, spending some Spirit Stones was worth it.","If they didn’t have enough Spirit Stones, they could also use some equivalent valuable Spiritual Artifacts to offset.","They all handed a storage bag filled with Spirit Stones or containing a Spiritual Artifact to the Gui Water Sect senior brother.","But when it was Mo Hua’s turn, the Gui Water Sect senior brother scrutinized Mo Hua, left and right, pondered for a moment, then suddenly changed his mind, shaking his head:","\"He’s not allowed.\"","\"Why not?\" Wang Chen asked, puzzled.","The Gui Water Sect senior brother looked serious, \"Do you know where I’m taking you to?\"","\"Look at him,\" he pointed at Mo Hua, lowering his voice, \"...does he look like he’s going to a brothel?\"","Mo Hua couldn’t take it anymore.","Being refused once was bad enough, but being refused twice?","Mo Hua angrily said: \"Why don’t I look like someone who would go to a brothel?!\"","Situ Jian quickly tugged his sleeve with a helpless expression.","This isn’t exactly a good thing...","No need to argue over this.","But the Gui Water Sect senior brother just wouldn’t let Mo Hua on the ship, no matter what, not even for more Spirit Stones.","Wang Chen’s plea was also ineffective.","\"Though I have this minor hobby of liking to earn Spirit Stones, I can’t break the rules from above, at least not make it too obvious.\"","\"He looks too young, it’s just no good, really no good...\"","Ultimately, with no resolution feasible, Mo Hua had no choice but to be excluded, watching helplessly as Cheng Mo, Situ Jian, and Hao Xuan boarded.","Mo Hua was a bit angry but also worried for Hao Xuan and the others.","Luckily he had prepared some measures beforehand.","Cheng Mo and the other two each had formations prepared by him for self-defense, in case of unexpected events."]},{"number":1589,"title":"Chapter 1589 - 837: Hatred (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Besides, Mo Hua also gave each of them a set of water-avoiding armor and taught them some water-repelling and demon-avoiding spells, so that if something went wrong, they could jump ship and escape.","Situ Jian had a letter token in his hand.","This was something specifically for the Taoist Court, and Mo Hua had specially requested it from Gu Changhuai.","Mistwater City is quite far from the Taixu Gate. Without the Yuan Magnetic Core as a relay, with the Yuan Magnetic weakened upon reaching the Mistwater River, the Taixu Token might not transmit a message.","Therefore, this kind of letter token, which doesn’t rely on the Yuan Magnetic Array for relay and can transmit one-on-one within a certain range, became very necessary.","As for Mo Hua himself, he had to think of another way to sneak in.","Mo Hua wandered around outside.","In Mistwater City, a branch of the Mistwater River flows through, so there are many ferry ports in the city, and now at each port, there are plenty of exquisite boats.","All these boats set off together onto the Mistwater River at 5 p.m.","But the problem is, from the surface, all the boats are mixed together, colorful and indistinguishable, making it impossible to tell which ones are regular boats and which are the \"Rouge Boats\" filled with hidden pleasures.","After finding them, he still had to figure out how to sneak in.","Mo Hua tried several times but found he couldn’t locate the Rouge Boat nor figure a good way to sneak onto the boats.","Seeing the sun nearing noon, he had to first find a place to fill his stomach and see if he could think of any other ideas after eating.","With limited time, Mo Hua opted for convenience, so he just looked for a small food stall near the market town, picked some of his favorite small dishes, and ate them with noodles until he was full.","When settling the bill, it was a total of five Spirit Stones.","The shop owner, holding the five Spirit Stones, beamed with joy and kept complimenting Mo Hua.","Mo Hua, however, suddenly felt a bit dazed.","Five...","Ordinary cultivators with diligent businesses usually earn Spirit Stones one by one, and when they spend Spirit Stones, they spend them one by one too.","But on the boat.","A single ticket costs a hundred thousand Spirit Stones.","Mo Hua turned to glance around.","Most of the market town consisted of small vendors, doing business that involved a few Spirit Stones transactions.","Even so, they live their lives through hard work, without complaint.","In this world, some cultivators struggle to get by on a few Spirit Stones.","But there are also cultivators who squander hundreds of thousands or even tens of thousands for momentary pleasure.","Mistwater City holds a lantern festival, bustling with traffic, seemingly prosperous.","But is this prosperity truly prosperity?","Underneath this prosperity, who would spare a glance at these poor cultivators?","Mo Hua’s pupils shrank slightly, a complex feeling welling up within.","\"The Human Dao diminishes from those who lack to serve those with excess.\"","The so-called \"prosperity\" itself might just be an expression of human \"exploitation\" reaching a certain level.","Things that reach an extreme must reverse, prosperity that reaches an extreme must decline.","The prosperity gained through exploitation is, in essence, just a process toward \"decline.\"","Mo Hua inexplicably thought of the Ancestor of the Qian Family on Big Black Mountain, thought of the Uncle who raised a \"Taoist Demon,\" and silently sighed.","...","After the meal, Mo Hua continued to roam around Mistwater City.","But there was still no progress with the Rouge Boat.","\"Perhaps I should find Uncle Gu and mix with him?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then shook his head.","Uncle Gu has many Taoist Court people. A covert investigation like this must absolutely not be done with them.","You cannot put all your eggs in one basket.","Moreover, Uncle Gu cannot know that I got rejected from the ship because I \"didn’t look like someone who frequented brothels.\"","\"So what to do?\"","Mo Hua racked his brain, unable to think of a solution, and decided to cast a divination.","He found a teahouse, ordered a private room, ordered a pot of Cloud Mist Tea, and in the swirling mist, took out three copper coins.","\"What to divine? The Rouge Boat?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then wanted to toss the copper coins, but suddenly, he felt a sharp pang in his heart.","It seemed as if there was a black-purple cause-and-effect entwining, a giant poppy flower opening its maw, wanting to swallow him whole...","Mo Hua’s pupils shook, and he clenched the copper coins abruptly, halting the divination.","\"Cannot divine...\"","The three words \"Rouge Boat\" seemed to contain great cause-and-effect.","It felt like once divined, it would trigger something, be sensed by certain people, and lead to some unknown danger...","The earlier scene was an intuitive omen of cause-and-effect.","\"Cannot divine, then what should I do?\"","Mo Hua thought for a bit, and with a flicker of his Divine Thought, suddenly realized that it was not that he couldn’t divine at all, but that the three words \"Rouge Boat\" couldn’t be divined.","Rouge Boat can’t be divined, divining it leads to cause-and-effect hidden risks, but it doesn’t mean nothing else can be divined.","He could take an indirect approach, start from other matters.","What other matters?","Water Yama? Gui Water Sect? Mistwater River’s altar?","The causes and effects attached to these didn’t seem small...","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, suddenly thought of something, and his eyes lit up.","\"Senior Sister Ye!\"","Senior Sister Ye might just be an \"insignificant\" victim in the Rouge Boat incident, but her cause-and-effect could be used as a trigger.","Mo Hua opened his palm again, silently reciting \"Ye Jin’s death,\" then tossed the copper coins, and when they fell back into his hand, Mo Hua looked at the hexagram.","Two heads and one tails.","The two heads were stacked together.","\"What does it mean?\"","Mo Hua was a bit confused.","After all, without systematic heavenly secret inheritance, he couldn’t understand the basic copper coin divination hexagrams.","Does this mean the culprit is two people?","One head one tails.","But why is one of the heads two stacked together?","Mo Hua couldn’t figure it out, so he decided to make it even simpler.","\"The culprit who killed Ye Jin...\"","No, Senior Sister Ye Jin committed suicide.","The one who forced her to death?"]},{"number":1590,"title":"Chapter 1590 - 837: Hatred (Part 3)","paragraphs":["There might be many people, it’s hard to calculate...","Then it can only be those \"related to Ye Jin...\"","Mo Hua tossed the copper coins again, this time the divination was much simpler. Three coins formed a line, with white threads of cause and effect floating above.","Was it pointing to a... direction?","Mo Hua guessed and felt that his calculation should be correct.","He put away the copper coins, paid for the tea, and left the teahouse, following the direction indicated by the white threads of cause and effect on the copper coins, moving straight ahead.","He passed through streets, crossed the market town, reached the dock, and moved past rows of colorful spirit boats, where the threads eventually settled before a noticeably smaller and somewhat old boat where the aura remained dense and unmoving.","Mo Hua looked up and examined it carefully.","This boat had no obvious markings, unknown if it belonged to any sect or family.","Moreover, this boat was evidently quite old, with a somewhat outdated layout, originally not meant for what it was used for now, temporarily remodeled into a leisure boat.","Among the numerous ornate boats, this one was quite unremarkable.","At this time, people were crossing paths, some boarding the boat, others disembarking, requiring tokens for access.","\"Is there a connection of cause and effect with Senior Sister Ye Jin on this boat?\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","The boat had an Expose Shadow Formation, and without a token, he couldn’t mix in, so he found a teahouse nearby, sat down, and drank tea while observing for a while.","After about an hour, as Mo Hua drank tea, his heart suddenly skipped a beat, and looking up, he saw a green-clothed cultivator disembarking from the boat.","This man was of middle age, with a cultivation status around Foundation Establishment Peak, half-white hair, calm demeanor, indifferent gaze, but with a hint of sorrow and stubbornness in his eyes.","Passing cultivators all greeted him politely.","He returned the gestures one by one.","\"Water Yama?\" Mo Hua’s eyes glinted sharply, then he thought, \"Seems not...\"","Water Yama had an arm cut by Uncle Gu and was seriously injured.","But this green-clothed cultivator had no wounds on him.","His aura was also different from Water Yama’s.","While thinking, the green-clothed cultivator disembarked and went straight into a nearby restaurant.","Mo Hua hesitated a moment, then followed, seeing the green-clothed cultivator go alone to the second floor, entering a private room as if discussing business, shortly after which two other cultivators came down.","These two, though in plain clothes, radiated strong water spiritual power Mo Hua could perceive.","\"They’re from Gui Water Sect...\"","And these two, as they walked, murmured:","\"This old thing, renting his boat without bargaining...\"","\"...swindling a tidy sum...\"","Seemingly discussing some sort of deal.","Their voices were low, but Mo Hua still heard them.","After they left, Mo Hua pondered for a bit, and formulated a plan in his mind.","He stood up, went upstairs to the private room of the green-clothed cultivator, and without pretense, directly pushed the door open.","Inside the room, the green-clothed cultivator frowning in thought, on seeing the room abruptly opened and himself interrupted, showed slight anger.","But upon seeing Mo Hua’s face, he was taken aback.","\"Young sir, we seem to... not know each other?\"","The green-clothed cultivator’s gaze deepened.","\"Knowing or not is not important, we’re acquainted now...\"","Mo Hua spoke directly without nonsense, \"I would like to ask you for a little favor.\"","The green-clothed cultivator frowned deeply, asking tentatively: \"What favor?\"","Mo Hua replied slowly: \"Take me aboard, I’m going where you are headed tonight.\"","The green-clothed cultivator changed his expression, immediately sneering:","\"Young sir, don’t joke, Ye’s boat is already full and cannot carry more.\"","With that, he flung his sleeve, intending to leave.","Mo Hua raised a brow, speaking in a deep voice: \"Ye Hong!\"","The green-clothed cultivator paused, turned to look at Mo Hua, gaze solemnly: \"You know Ye?\"","Then he pondered briefly, realizing in his mind.","If he didn’t know him, he couldn’t have come so openly.","He examined Mo Hua again.","Mo Hua wasn’t wearing a sect Taoist robe, only ordinary clothes, though simply dressed, his face was handsome as jade, gaze clear as water, and his air was unusual, not inferior to him who served as an elder in the family for years.","The green-clothed cultivator knew this young man, with an unclear background, wasn’t someone easy to provoke, so he said:","\"Even if sir knows Ye, it doesn’t matter, the boat is already full, can’t take others, young sir sees to yourself, Ye bids farewell...\"","The green-clothed cultivator gave a perfunctory bow, stood and left.","Without looking at Mo Hua, eyes straight ahead, as he moved past Mo Hua, almost out of the private room, he heard Mo Hua’s cold voice from behind:","\"Your pair of children, all dead, aren’t they...\"","The green-clothed cultivator’s body shook, suddenly turning back, eyes red as he looked at Mo Hua, voice trembling:","\"You... who exactly are you?\"","Mo Hua calmly replied: \"Do you want revenge?\"","The green-clothed cultivator suppressed his emotions, calmly said:","\"Life and death are natural, with life comes death, for all humanity. My pair of children merely left before me...\"","Mo Hua said: \"Your son died on Mistwater River, the boat was capsized, throat slit, and was dismembered and eaten by a water demon...\"","\"Your daughter died in the sect. She lit a great fire, burning herself alive, intending to turn into a fierce ghost to seek revenge against those who wronged her...\"","Mo Hua’s words cut into the man’s heart like daggers.","The man clenched his fists, nails digging into his flesh, eventually sighed, indifferently said:","\"They’re all dead already, speaking of this serves no purpose, I’m just lingering to end my remaining days...\"","\"No,\" Mo Hua shook his head, looking at the green-clothed cultivator, silently said: \"You want revenge.\"","He could perceive the deep anger and boundless hatred in the man’s divine soul.","Middle-aged, bereaved of both children.","This unwilling hatred, red as blood.","The green-clothed cultivator, his hidden thoughts exposed by Mo Hua, his expression drastically changed, eyes even showing a hint of killing intent.","Mo Hua, however, calmly said: \"Not trusting me, you’ll never avenge in your lifetime.\"","Never avenge in a lifetime...","Never avenge in your lifetime!!","This sentence seemed to infuriate the green-clothed cultivator, his expression angered, the long-suppressed malice surged, even disrupting his sanity.","In an instant, his eyes were full of blood threads, fiercely looking at Mo Hua, as if taking him for an enemy.","Mo Hua showed no emotion, eyes briefly flashing with a golden sword light.","In just a moment of eye contact with this sword light, the green-clothed cultivator’s long-suppressed killing intent and malice disintegrated like an avalanche.","He only felt a piercing pain in his divine sense, his mind muddled.","But Mo Hua’s hand was light, stopping at an appropriate point, and soon enough, the man regained his senses, malice dissipated, and his mind cleared.","He glanced at Mo Hua with lingering fear, eyes full of deep apprehension:","\"You... who are you?\"","Mo Hua maintained a calm demeanor, saying nothing.","The man, perceiving Mo Hua’s reluctance to reveal his identity, asked no more.","Then he furrowed his brows, hesitating for a long while, finally heaving a deep sigh, slowly said:","\"Alright, if I can avenge my unjustly dead children, I can do anything...\""]},{"number":1591,"title":"Chapter 1591 - 838: Fallen into the Trap","paragraphs":["The green-clothed cultivator, named Ye Hong, holds the Foundation Establishment Peak cultivation and is an Elder of the Ye family.","When Mo Hua divined, it was about \"people related to Ye Jin.\"","And the cause and effect of the divination pointed to this person.","Since he is related to Senior Sister Ye Jin, and his appearance has some resemblance to her, he is most likely her father.","The name \"Ye Hong\" was what Mo Hua saw when he checked Ye Jin’s place of origin at the Taoist Court before.","Time was limited, so Mo Hua could only visit directly, reveal his identity and bluntly state his purpose.","As for the intent for revenge, Ye Hong indeed concealed it on the surface.","But as a father, how could he not avenge the son and daughter’s deaths?","Moreover, Mo Hua now has a deeper understanding of the Dao of Divine Soul, and that deep soul-penetrating anger and hatred cannot be hidden from him.","Ye Hong previously had hesitations, but since he agreed verbally, he had made up his mind not to renege.","Indeed, many things are beyond his capability.","After contemplating for a moment, Ye Hong said to Mo Hua:","\"This is a boat hired by the Gui Water Sect, and most people on board are sect disciples; they rely on a token to board. I don’t have this token, so if you wish to board, young master, you might have to endure a bit of inconvenience and disguise yourself as a servant, serving tea and water.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"No problem.\"","To enter the Hundred Flower Valley, he had even worn a Taoist robe of the valley, so disguising as a servant is, of course, no trouble.","Ye Hong found a servant’s attire for Mo Hua to change into and then led him towards the cruise ship.","At the entrance, they were stopped by people from the Gui Water Sect.","Ye Hong said, \"My family’s servant, following me to do some chores.\"","The Gui Water Sect person hesitated for a moment but figured that since the boat was hired by Ye Hong, him bringing along a servant is normal, so they did not make things difficult.","\"Elder Ye, please go ahead.\"","Ye Hong nodded and led Mo Hua onto the ship.","Once on board, Ye Hong didn’t move around much but directly took Mo Hua to his room, closed the doors and windows, and said to Mo Hua with clasped hands:","\"There are too many people and ears at this time, and it’s not convenient to go out, so I ask the young sir to bear with it and wait here until 5 p.m.\"","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","He also doesn’t plan to go out now.","Going out now wouldn’t reveal much, and it’s expected that the real show will begin after sunset, once the ship reaches its destination.","Seeing Mo Hua agree, Ye Hong exhaled slightly in relief, and then invited Mo Hua to sit and personally brewed tea to entertain him.","Mo Hua sat steadily, drinking tea in a composed manner, appearing just like a handsome and amiable youth with elegant manners, lacking the sharpness displayed earlier.","The more Ye Hong observed him, the more he felt puzzled and secretly alarmed.","He didn’t know what identity or background Mo Hua had.","On the surface, Mo Hua only had Foundation Building Middle Stage cultivation, not very strong.","But the sharp gaze like a sword earlier left a deep impression on Ye Hong, causing his heart to tremble.","Moreover, this young sir said he would help him avenge.","True or false, Ye Hong didn’t dare to neglect.","After taking a few sips of tea, Mo Hua was curious and asked Ye Hong, \"Is this boat yours?\"","\"Yes.\" Ye Hong replied.","\"Why did you rent it to the Gui Water Sect?\"","Ye Hong pondered for a moment, sighed, and finally spoke slowly, explaining the whole story:","\"It’s a long story...\"","\"Xiuer died on the Mistwater River, and his death has been a lingering pain for me, but due to family pressure, I dared not investigate. I thought this ’unworthy son’, dead was dead, saving me some trouble, so I placed all my hopes on Jin Er.\"","\"But I didn’t expect, now Jin Er also...\"","Ye Hong’s expression was bitter, \"At first, I only thought my life was full of hardships, destined to be like this until later, I discovered a jade slip left by Xiuer...\"","\"Jade Slip?\" Mo Hua’s gaze slightly focused.","\"Yes,\" Ye Hong nodded, \"It’s some things he casually recorded, saying that he found his sister, Jin Er, becoming much more withdrawn than before, speaking less, and looking pained when alone, suspecting she was being bullied.\"","\"As a brother, he usually indulged in eating and idling, didn’t pay much mind to cultivation, but he pampered her since childhood as his only sister.\"","\"So he went to investigate, seemed to have found something, and then... died on the Mistwater River...\"","Ye Hong sighed deeply.","Mo Hua’s gaze also appeared somewhat somber.","\"And then?\"","\"Then...\" Ye Hong gathered his emotions and continued, \"felt both heartache and anger, so I decided to investigate personally.\"","\"If before I had numerous concerns, I dared not probe. But now, being alone, I have nothing to fear.\"","\"Upon investigation, I discovered...\"","Ye Hong’s speech paused slightly, as if reluctant to say those words.","Mo Hua then said, \"Rouge Boat?\"","Ye Hong froze, only then did he believe Mo Hua truly knew the inner affairs.","He nodded, then frowned deeply:","\"The matter of the Rouge Boat, I had also heard rumors before, merely thinking it was some baseless rumor on the Mistwater River and didn’t take it seriously.\"","\"But I didn’t expect it to be true... and the power behind it is unfathomable, not something a small third-grade family elder like me can interact with.\"","\"I was thinking, could I find some way to make a connection...\"","\"So you rented the boat?\" Mo Hua said.","\"Yes,\" Ye Hong said solemnly, \"I used my lifetime savings to secure this Spirit Boat, doing rental business on the Mistwater River, and my prices were lower than others. However, after months, there was still no progress.\"","\"It happened just a few days ago, someone came and wanted to rent the boat to entertain some ’honored guests’, which is when my heart was startled, and I grabbed this clue...\"","Ye Hong divulged everything to Mo Hua without holding back."]},{"number":1592,"title":"Chapter 1592 - 838: Falling Into the Trap (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua nodded and asked again, \"What about Senior Sister Ye Jin’s death? Do you know who killed her?\"","Ye Hong was taken aback, \"Senior Sister?\"","Mo Hua nodded, not hiding anything, \"I had some acquaintance with Senior Sister Ye Jin. In terms of seniority, I should call her Senior Sister.\"","Even though this acquaintance was just a brief encounter.","Mo Hua had only ever called her \"Senior Sister\" once—and only had the chance to do so once.","Ye Hong’s heart trembled, his gaze softened considerably, and he looked at Mo Hua with a bit more trust.","\"This poor child Jin Er, there is someone who remembers you...\"","Ye Hong murmured in his heart, then did not hide anything further, his expression serious as he said:","\"I investigated. It’s said that someone saw Jin Er near Mistwater River, accompanied by a man.\"","\"Later, when I went through Jin Er’s relics, I found some scattered clues about this man.\"","\"I don’t know who he is, but I know he has a fair complexion, handsome appearance, but occasionally has a sinister gaze, and enjoys tormenting others.\"","Mo Hua was slightly taken aback.","Fair, handsome, sinister gaze, likes tormenting others...","The image of the Water Yama naturally surfaced in his mind.","Water Yama.","So, it was you again...","Mo Hua’s gaze turned icy, and he silently added another note of \"cause of death\" to the Water Yama.","Ye Hong, speaking to this point, felt a bit desolate and sighed:","\"I am powerless as a father, I... can’t protect my own children...\"","He knew in his heart that the Ye family relatives were selfish and would not seek justice for him.","As a Foundation Establishment cultivator, even if he knew who the murderer was, he might not have the strength to take revenge.","Moreover, the identity of the murderer might be someone he could not afford to provoke.","At this thought, Ye Hong, amidst his grief, felt a sense of despair.","Mo Hua looked at Ye Hong with a sorrowful face and gently sighed:","\"Don’t worry, those who deserve to die will die...\"","...","Then Mo Hua stayed in the cabin for most of the day.","By the time the sun began to set and the sky darkened, it became noisy outside, as if many cultivators were celebrating something.","Lanterns were placed into the Mistwater River.","The sky was dusky, the river water misty, but a bit of splendid lantern light lit up on the water, drifting with the waves.","In the quiet, there was a sense of beauty.","But within the beauty, there was hidden decay...","By 5 p.m, the boats set sail.","Mo Hua still did not go out, only opened a window, noting the direction of the boats and the location of the tour boat where Cheng Mo and the others were.","He had specifically determined the position during the day, so even though it was getting dark now, he could vaguely make out the position of Cheng Mo’s tour boat.","Cheng Mo’s tour boat and the spirit boat Mo Hua was on were indeed heading in the same direction, towards an unknown area of the Mistwater River.","Mo Hua silently breathed a sigh of relief.","The direction was correct, although there was some deviation, he had managed to get on board.","Now he just needed to wait for those seemingly ordinary tour boats to change course midway, converge together and become the \"Rouge Boat,\" so he could follow them to the destination.","Mo Hua lay at the window, paying attention to the boat’s direction, while also watching the night scenery of the Mistwater River.","By this time, night had fallen, and countless lanterns floated on the water.","These lanterns came in various shapes and colors, rich and colorful.","A flotilla of spirit boats shone with brilliant lights, like a school of colorful fish swimming in a river full of lanterns, extremely gorgeous and spectacular.","Mo Hua watched quietly, feeling a bit dazed.","The spirit boat sailed for an unknown amount of time, and just as Mo Hua started to get a bit tired of watching, there was movement from the tour boat ahead.","Mo Hua’s Divine Thought activated, discovering some tour boats quietly changing course.","The tour boat with Cheng Mo and the others also changed direction.","\"As expected...\"","Mo Hua’s spirits lifted, his Divine Sense concentrated more, but after perceiving for a moment, his expression changed.","\"Something’s wrong.\"","Cheng Mo’s boat had changed direction, but the spirit boat he was on had not, and was still sailing along the predetermined course like other tour boats.","Mo Hua’s heart tightened, he turned to ask Ye Hong, \"Was your boat really rented by someone from the Gui Water Sect?\"","Ye Hong, at this point, was also unsure of the situation, only nodded and said:","\"It should be, they had the sect token of the Gui Water Sect.\"","\"Then why? The course is wrong... Did they notice something amiss?\" Mo Hua frowned.","He turned his head again, looking towards the vast Mistwater River, watching as Cheng Mo’s boat parted ways with his own, drifting further apart, Mo Hua’s heart sank.","What to do?","At this point, it was not advisable to jump into the river and chase after them.","Although he had learned some water-based movement techniques and spells to drive water and ward off demons, having grown up on Big Black Mountain, he wasn’t accustomed to water, and halfway learning some spells, his water skills weren’t very good.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, silently sighing.","In this short time, Cheng Mo’s boat had already taken a completely different river route, disappearing under the cover of night.","He could only wait for the boat to dock and then figure out another way.","Mo Hua was a bit anxious, but forced himself to calm down, considering what to do after docking to find Cheng Mo and the others...","The spirit boat continued to sail.","The scenery around kept alternating.","The accompanying tour boats were also becoming fewer.","Mo Hua, watching, suddenly paused.","\"Something’s wrong...\"","This river route appeared unfamiliar. The spirit boat’s direction was odd, and the number of tour boats dwindling.","Mo Hua’s gaze flickered, and he suddenly understood.","It wasn’t that Cheng Mo and the others had changed course; they hadn’t.","It was the spirit boat he was on that had changed direction.","In other words, the boat Cheng Mo and others were on was just an ordinary tour boat, while the one he was on was the real \"Rouge Boat!\""]},{"number":1593,"title":"Chapter 1593 - 838: Fallen Into the Trap (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua slowly let out a breath, but his gaze also grew somewhat serious.","After sailing for a while longer, there were no other boats around. The Mistwater River was vast, the night was dark, and only his own Spirit Boat was sailing alone.","Mo Hua did not even know where he had ended up.","After a moment, the Letter Token trembled slightly. Mo Hua took it out to check, and it was a message from Gu Changhuai:","\"We’ve been tricked, we boarded the wrong boat.\"","Mo Hua silently replied:","\"No worries, I boarded the right one...\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, seemingly unable to understand, \"Why is the boat you boarded not wrong?\"","Mo Hua also found it hard to explain at the moment, so he simply replied:","\"A stroke of luck...\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t dwell on it; time was tight, and this was not the time to discuss such matters.","\"Do you know which part of the river you’re in now?\"","Surrounded by pitch darkness, Mo Hua thought for a while and sighed, \"I don’t know.\"","This is troublesome...","Gu Changhuai frowned.","Mo Hua recalled for a moment, then sent a message to Gu Changhuai:","\"I only remember the first half of the route and the direction we veered. You can try to find Cheng Mo and Hao Xuan, compare routes, and you should figure out the general direction.\"","Gu Changhuai’s spirit lifted, \"Alright.\"","Mo Hua then relayed the details of the Spirit Boat’s route to Gu Changhuai, hoping he could deduce the location where the Rouge Boat would dock.","\"I’ll make haste in checking, don’t act rashly on your own.\" Gu Changhuai advised.","But he knew, unless he tied Mo Hua up, immobilizing him, otherwise, it would be impossible for Mo Hua to stay calm.","Gu Changhuai was merely giving routine advice.","Mo Hua symbolically responded, \"Okay.\"","Then Mo Hua sent a message to Situ Jian, telling them the general situation and asking them to cooperate with Gu Changhuai in checking the route.","Besides, Situ Jian and the others should be safe.","Though they couldn’t get on the Rouge Boat and see the novelty, they also wouldn’t have to bear the boat’s temptations and risks.","\"By the way,\" Mo Hua remembered something and sent a message, \"When you return, remember to find that Senior Brother of Wang Chen’s and give him a beating to get back the hundred thousand Spirit Stones’ ticket fee.\"","A hundred thousand Spirit Stones is no small amount.","Even though they’re not his Spirit Stones, the Junior Brothers’ Spirit Stones are still Spirit Stones, and they shouldn’t benefit others.","\"Alright...\"","Situ Jian sighed.","No wonder he’s our Junior Brother, truly doesn’t suffer any loss.","Then he also cautioned, \"Junior Brother, be very careful on your own.\"","\"Mmm, don’t worry.\"","After giving all the instructions, Mo Hua put away the Letter Token, concentrating on watching the night scenery outside the window, waiting for the Spirit Boat to reach its destination and become a real \"Rouge Boat.\"","He wanted to see what kind of business the rumored \"Rouge Boat\" was doing and what it looked like inside.","Ye Hong sat beside Mo Hua, also watching the heavy night outside, looking somewhat serious.","...","Meanwhile, in Mistwater City, inside a luxurious tavern.","Two people were drinking and having a secret conversation.","The room was dark, with only a single candle flickering, making it hard to see their faces.","\"Has the boat set off?\"","\"It has.\"","\"How’s the situation?\"","\"Fairly smooth.\"","\"Good,\" one of them nodded and then sneered, \"Do they really think our Gui Water Sect is blind? A Taoist Court, a Taixu Gate, and that Gu Family, they think they can blend in the boat just by disguising?\"","The other person chimed in, \"Yes, this time, any boat associated with the Taoist Court, Taixu Gate, or Gu Family, we made sure they all disembarked.\"","\"For confidentiality, we aren’t even using Gui Water Sect’s boats. Only some Spirit Boats we’ve hired from outside can reach the place.\"","\"And the boat prepared for the gentlemen.\"","\"Yes, very good!\"","\"However, Elder, the situation now seems a bit off...\"","The cultivator called \"Elder\" raised an eyebrow, \"How so?\"","\"The Taoist Court seems to be investigating...\"","\"You’ve heard rumors?\"","\"Yes...\"","The \"Elder\" was silent for a moment and said, \"No matter, others might eat meat, but we can’t just watch and not participate.\"","\"But what if...\"","The Elder set down his wine glass, not speaking.","The other person, perceptive, immediately poured a glass of wine for the Elder.","The Elder was somewhat pleased and then said solemnly:","\"Gui Water Sect is like a ship, we are all on this ship.\"","\"But Gui Water Sect is only a ship. If the journey is smooth, we can coast along. If the ship sinks, those without skill or foresight will sink with it; but those with ability and vision will find another ship to jump onto before it sinks...\"","The other person pondered for a moment, his expression jolting, \"Elder, could it be that you...\"","The Elder gave him a stern look, making him swallow his words.","\"But, it’s not that easy to jump ship...\"","\"I’ve said,\" the Elder took a sip of wine, speaking calmly, \"only those with abilities and vision have the capability to jump ship; the rest can only sink and die with it.\"","\"There are plenty of opportunities and chances in this world. It depends on whether you know how to maneuver and if you have ’perception.’","The Elder set down his wine glass.","The other person quickly grasped the meaning, his demeanor becoming even more respectful, as he poured another glass of wine for the Elder:","\"Thereafter, I will completely rely on the Elder’s guidance, willing to go to great lengths for you.\"","The Elder, with an arrogant attitude, nodded slightly, then remembered something and confirmed:","\"Have all the Sect Disciples on the list boarded the ship?\"","\"Following the Elder’s instructions, they have all been placed on board.\"","\"Good.\"","\"However...\" the other person remained somewhat puzzled, \"some arrangements this time seem very strange, that place... is it really fine not to have someone guard it?\"","The Elder’s expression sharpened, sternly saying, \"Is this something you should be considering?\"","\"Yes.\" The other person immediately bowed with hands clasped.","The Elder paused slightly, his expression softened a bit, and he pointed upwards with his hand:","\"The higher-ups have their own reasons for the arrangement. The depths of these waters are profound; even touching a little can drown an ordinary cultivator. Not asking you to inquire is for your own good.\"","\"The Elder’s lesson is correct...\"","The Elder nodded slightly and said no more, sipping his wine quietly.","A moment later, he turned his head, looking towards the Mistwater River, illuminated by lanterns yet still shrouded in darkness.","Some things he indeed could not understand, but he didn’t need to.","As a pawn, one must be aware of their role.","The big influences above and those monsters manipulating things behind the scenes, how they want to shift the Qianxue State Boundary’s layout and what they aim to kill are not for him to know.","He only needed to obey orders and act accordingly.","An obedient pawn is a good pawn.","...","Amidst the surging undercurrents, on the other side, above the Mistwater River.","It was unclear how long had passed before the Spirit Boat Mo Hua was on finally halted.","Unaware of the situation, Mo Hua held his breath, not making any move.","After a moment, the sound of water arose around, as if other Spirit Boats were approaching, gathering together.","Mixed with the sound of chains, it seemed like someone was linking these boats together with chains.","Then the splashing subsided, and the Spirit Boats, forming a long line like a dragon, sailed into the pitch black fog of the Mistwater River.","Mo Hua noticed something unusual concerning this area:","The overwhelming aura... of the Evil God."]},{"number":1594,"title":"Chapter 1594 - 839: Shameless Couple","paragraphs":["The dense fog filled with the aura of the Evil God!","It was very similar to the sinister mist that had enveloped the small fishing village before.","Mo Hua felt a faint sense within him that the thing he desired was getting closer and closer.","Lurking within the dense fog spreading over Mistwater River, there might very well be an altar hidden.","Moreover, this aura was much more intense than the altars at the Bi Mountain Demon Cavern and the fishing village’s River God Temple.","This altar was definitely extraordinary!","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened slightly, and he felt a faint sense of anticipation in his heart.","Yet, at the same time, a sense of warning grew within him, as if something \"terrifying\" was hidden within the fog, inside the altar, bringing with it some unknown danger.","\"What could it be...\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","The Spirit Boat continued to sail deeper into the dense fog, surrounded by an inescapable darkness, oppressive in its gloominess.","After a long while, the Spirit Boat came to a halt.","The dense fog seemed to have thinned a bit.","However, Mo Hua’s Divine Soul began to stir restlessly, as though something was continuously provoking the desires deep within his heart.","This provocation was extremely subtle, and if not for Mo Hua’s practice with the Soul-Shocking Sword and Blood Prison Pupil Skill, and his sensing of the Life Soul and Seven Souls, he might not have detected this subtle change on the level of the Divine Soul.","\"The fog has thinned, but the desire has intensified.\"","\"The dense fog on the outside is to prevent people from spying...\"","\"While this inner fog, though seeming thin, secretly entices people’s ’desires’, making them excited...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze sharpened slightly.","After the Spirit Boat stopped, there was no movement outside. After a moment, someone suddenly knocked on the door and whispered:","\"Honored Guest, please close the door and do not go outside.\"","Mo Hua glanced at Ye Hong, who also frowned, feeling puzzled.","It was his first time here as well, having no idea about the rules of the Rouge Boat or what secrets it harbored.","\"Let’s wait in the room for now and observe quietly...\" Mo Hua suggested.","\"Alright.\" Ye Hong nodded.","After another moment, the sound of water arose outside again, sparse and scattered, moving from a distance to close by.","It seemed other boats were approaching, and then came the sound of light footsteps, as if someone had boarded the boat.","Mo Hua could faintly perceive a cloying aroma of rouge, suggesting that a group of women had boarded the boat.","Simultaneously, there were light and seductive voices floating around, rising and falling, captivating the heart.","Mo Hua frowned, knowing in his heart that the \"business\" of the Rouge Boat had likely begun...","After another 30 minutes, the sounds outside ceased.","Then someone knocked on the door again, saying, \"Thank you for your patience, you may start dining now.\"","The person outside only uttered this sentence before leaving, then knocked on the next door, repeating the same, \"Thank you for your patience, you may start dining now.\"","Footsteps echoed in the hallway.","Everyone left their rooms and headed toward the hall.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then said to Ye Hong, \"I’ll go and see, you... just stay here for now, don’t go out.\"","Although Ye Hong was at the Foundation Establishment Peak, this level of cultivation was virtually meaningless on the Rouge Boat.","Moreover, his demeanor showed clearly that he had spent many years handling family affairs, rarely engaging in combat as a leisurely Elder, with limited experience and means in battle.","Not to mention, he carried the vendetta of his children, his emotions were entangled, and if he encountered any situation, he might not be able to control his emotions and act calmly.","Therefore, it was better for him to stay in the cabin and not go out.","Carrying the vendetta of his children, Ye Hong was reluctant to remain behind, but he was not reckless; knowing that he knew very little about the situation, blindly probing might backfire and ruin everything, so he clenched his jaw and, bowing to Mo Hua, said:","\"Then... I rely on you, young master.\"","Ye Hong gave Mo Hua a deep bow.","Mo Hua nodded, then composed his breath, and slowly opened the room door.","As soon as the door opened, a wave of rouge aroma wafted over, mingling with the dense fog, entwined with the desires within the mist, making it almost irresistible.","Mo Hua, through inner examination with his Divine Sense, held his breath and guarded his heart, discarding all distractions, which finally suppressed the worldly allure and cleansed his heart.","There were already many people outside, gathered in groups of threes and fours, heading towards the hall.","Dressed as a servant, Mo Hua silently followed them.","The cultivators along the way, stirred by desire, were too preoccupied to notice Mo Hua.","Before reaching the hall, he could faintly hear the sound of music and dance. After walking a bit longer, as he entered the hall, Mo Hua looked up and saw that the place where there was a stage performance during the day now featured a different show.","A group of gorgeously dressed women, veiled and wearing thin garments, danced gracefully to the music of strings.","Beneath the thin veils, their bodies, white as snow, were faintly visible.","The people in the hall, their gazes greedy, watched in a trance.","Mo Hua stared absentmindedly for a moment, then felt somewhat bored.","This was it?","Not properly dressed, acting flirtatiously, what was there to see?","Mo Hua shook his head.","Since he was in the hall, naturally he needed to observe the situation.","Mo Hua continued to act as a servant, holding his breath and standing quietly in a corner, occasionally serving tea or pouring wine, without seeming at all out of place.","The hall was noisy and crowded, chaotic enough that no one could see through his disguise.","Mo Hua observed quietly like this.","After watching for a while, he started to discern some patterns.","This was a \"business\", and the women on stage were \"wares\". The so-called music and dance were just means of self-presentation for the wares.","As wares, they naturally had different grades.","The women on stage were divided into ranks, with different \"worth\" and serving different cultivators.","Mo Hua wasn’t sure if they were all truly coerced.","With just a few glances, Mo Hua could only roughly assess that some of the women were indeed forced."]},{"number":1595,"title":"Chapter 1595 - 839: Shameless Couple (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Though they were veiled, their eyes were filled with a layer of sorrow, evidently unwilling.","But others were different.","Some wore indifferent expressions, dismissive, while others were used to it, and some had ulterior motives, their eyes wanton, alluring men.","Some women even appeared joyful.","It seemed that their beauty, which captivated and gained the admiration of so many men, gave rise to vanity and self-indulgence.","\"The human heart is indeed very complex...\"","Mo Hua sighed softly.","Apart from the women, the men in the crowd were also varied.","Some were genuinely there for indulgence.","They ate exquisite dishes, drank fine wine, and watched the enchanting dances of the women on stage, mesmerized.","Some, upon watching, revealed a gluttonous expression, called over a servant, named a dancer on stage, the servant nodded and went off to make arrangements.","Afterwards, this person got up and went to their room, and the dancer on stage was replaced.","What happened after they returned to the room, Mo Hua didn’t quite understand, but could roughly guess.","This was one type of man.","There were other disciples who were entirely different.","Their interests clearly weren’t in women, but rather they held wine cups, offering toasts everywhere, flattery, and networking.","They formed cliques among themselves.","Within the state boundary of Qian Learning, within the sects was one circle.","The private friendships between different sects and family disciples formed another circle.","Outside, visiting guests and making friends was just ordinary acquaintance.","But here, drinking together and engaging in amorous affairs naturally formed an extraordinary bond.","They were all noble family’s sons, heavenly prides of the sects, with extraordinary talent and limitless future prospects, possibly taking on important roles in families, sects, and various forces, even in the Taoist Court and Central Dao Court.","At this time, using beauty as a medium, forming connections would naturally lead to alliances, supporting each other for private gain in the future.","For those born into nobility, making connections could add to their glory.","Those with less noble origins were even more eager to cling on and expand their network.","Mo Hua sighed inwardly.","No wonder this ticket is so expensive, costing a hundred thousand Spirit Stones.","This isn’t just a \"leisure\" ticket.","In the eyes of the discerning, this Rouge Boat ticket is equivalent to an \"entry pass\" to the aristocratic class.","Mo Hua looked around again.","The cultivators at the banquet were all unfamiliar faces, almost none of whom he recognized.","But they appeared young, carried a swagger, and with one glance, it was clear they were all sect disciples of family sects.","They likely included those from the Four Great Sects, Eight Great Gates, Twelve Streams, and even some disciples below the Qian Learning Hundred Gates.","Mo Hua looked on, secretly alarmed, and his gaze grew more solemn.","This situation might be even more serious than he had imagined...","Apart from these people, there were also some special disciples.","Their cultivation was profound, their aura extraordinary, and at this moment, they were drinking alone in the hall, barely sparing a glance at the women on stage, as if these women were merely \"commonplace powder and rouge.\"","Mo Hua continued to pour tea and water while quietly observing them.","Midway through the banquet, some steward-like individuals arrived, walked respectfully to these obviously more distinguished disciples, and whispered something.","The hall was noisy, and Mo Hua was quite far away, but he vaguely heard phrases like \"it’s ready,\" \"please proceed.\"","Then these people seemed to understand, each stood up, leaving the banquet, and headed outside the hall.","Some attendant servants also followed.","Mo Hua’s heart stirred.","\"Something is up!\"","He pondered for a moment, then with a quick shift of his eyes, he quietly moved his footsteps, blending naturally into the group.","There were quite a few servant attendants in the group, one more or less wouldn’t be noticed.","Moreover, his movements were natural, demeanor calm, and he had been pouring wine in the hall for quite some time, so naturally no one suspected him.","Within this group, everyone walked in silence, without speaking; no one questioned him, and he was even less likely to give himself away.","The \"screening\" of the Rouge Boat was mainly strict at the time of boarding.","Once aboard, the rules were much more relaxed.","It was probably because all aboard were \"Honored Guests,\" and being too strict on the boat could easily offend.","A group of people quietly left the hall.","Mo Hua followed earnestly, moving with the crowd, crossing through the corridor, arriving on the deck, where he saw dense night fog around, murky river waters obscuring the scenery, with only interconnected spirit boats lit with lights, sailing on the Mistwater River.","Under the veil of night, these bright lights gave off a somewhat eerie vibe.","The spirit boats were linked by iron chains, with narrow bridges laid out for cultivators to pass between the boats.","At this moment, not only from Mo Hua’s ship, but from all spirit boats, the specially identified \"Honored Guests,\" came to the deck, converging towards the center of the spirit boat fleet along the narrow chain bridges.","Mo Hua bowed his head and followed silently, within a short span of time, reaching the center of the fleet, onto a much larger, more lavishly decorated, and more luxuriously crafted ship.","Everyone boarded the large ship.","Many among them, without anyone knowing when, had donned masks to conceal their faces, as if not wishing to be recognized.","Of course, some were openly unmasked.","Aboard the large ship, the \"grand scene\" that Mo Hua anticipated didn’t appear.","Inside the large ship, there wasn’t a larger or more extravagant hall, nor was there a gathering of people indulging in excess, with obscene \"wine pools and meat forests.\"","On the contrary, inside the large ship, it was quite understated, with many, many secret rooms.","From the outside, all the secret rooms looked about the same."]},{"number":1596,"title":"Chapter 1596 - 839: Adulterous Couple (Part 3)","paragraphs":["And these special identity \"honored guests,\" relying on the tokens in their hands, walked to their respective hidden chambers, opened the doors, entered, and never came out again.","What happens next, Mo Hua could not know.","The group kept moving forward, people continued to enter rooms, leaving fewer and fewer behind.","Mo Hua, taking advantage of passing around a corner, naturally made a turn, followed by a concealment, and disappeared without a trace.","After concealing himself, Mo Hua found a secluded corner in the cabin, quietly hiding, then started pondering on what to do next...","This large boat was completely different from what he had imagined before.","All the secrets were segregated and sealed in separate chambers, leaving him somewhat helpless.","Even if he wanted to investigate, he didn’t know from which room to start.","If he checked the wrong one and exposed himself, got discovered, he’d find himself floating on the Mistwater River, with no village ahead or inn behind, likely facing doom.","Of course, the most important thing was, how could he pry open these chambers?","Mo Hua chose a nearby chamber, with eyes glancing around, inferred multiple times using Heavenly secret Calculation, roughly understanding, silently let out a sigh of relief.","\"Luckily, it’s just a second-grade array...\"","This boat was used to host Foundation Establishment Realm sect disciples, only active within the second-grade state boundary, so the second-grade array was sufficient.","Although it was a second-grade array, it was uniformly made up of second-grade high-level arrays, clearly a considerable amount of work was put in.","The types of formations were also numerous, encompassing the Five Elements and Eight Trigrams, reinforcement, soundproofing, exposure shadow, and isolation formations preventing wall penetration, diverse and varied.","Mo Hua had a very solid foundation in second-grade formations, with extensive knowledge, capable of unraveling these chamber formations, but it would take time.","Moreover, with the hallway bustling with people, any action would surely get him discovered.","No opportunity for him to calmly crack the chamber formations.","\"Is there any other way?\"","While Mo Hua was deep in thought, the sound of footsteps suddenly arose nearby, someone was approaching.","He immediately restrained his thoughts, held his breath, concealed his form and hid.","On this large flower boat, many places had exposure shadow formations set up, but not all areas could have them.","An ordinary cultivator skilled in concealment might not be able to recognize the location of exposure shadow formations.","But Mo Hua, being both a hidden cultivator and a skilled Formation Master, could identify exposure shadow formations at a glance, thus finding a safe spot where he wouldn’t break concealment was not difficult.","Just like that, Mo Hua hid quietly.","In a short while, someone walked past.","It was a woman, wearing a pink gauzy robe, her figure graceful, a faint floral fragrance wafting through wherever she went.","She did not spot Mo Hua and walked straight past him.","Mo Hua initially paid no mind, but out of the corner of his eye, he glimpsed the woman’s face and suddenly felt a bit stunned.","Unrecognizable, yet somewhat familiar...","Why?","Mo Hua was puzzled.","He carefully recalled, and then suddenly remembered.","Hundred Flower Valley!","This woman in pink clothes was a disciple of Hundred Flower Valley.","Earlier, through Hao Xuan, he first contacted Wang Chen, hoping to board the Rouge Boat via a tavern in Gui Water City, but ended in failure.","On the way back, he saw a carriage from Hundred Flower Valley departing from Gui Water City, found it unusual, and followed it all the way to Hundred Flower Valley.","A few attractive female disciples got off the carriage and entered Hundred Flower Valley; among them was the pink-clad woman who just walked past.","\"Hundred Flower Valley...\"","Mo Hua’s mind was stirred, and he immediately sneaked quietly after.","This woman walked lightly, moving adeptly through the chambers, obviously very familiar with the flower boat.","After about thirty minutes, she stopped in front of a chamber and knocked on the door.","After a moment, the door opened, revealing a woman’s face, with exquisite features, but heavily made-up.","This woman was... Hua Ruyu!","Mo Hua subtly startled inside.","She was actually on the boat too!","Hua Ruyu looked around, seeing no one else, she softly reproached: \"Why are you just getting here?\"","\"I...\"","The pink-clad woman hadn’t yet spoken, Hua Ruyu shook her head, \"Come inside and talk.\"","\"Okay.\"","The pink-clad woman nodded and entered Hua Ruyu’s room.","Then Hua Ruyu closed the door.","Mo Hua frowned.","\"Can’t hear anything...\"","Hua Ruyu on the Rouge Boat certainly has some shady dealings, and there must also be secrets between her and the pink-clad woman from Hundred Flower Valley.","But with the door closed, he wouldn’t be able to hear any of it...","\"Need to think of a way...\"","The chamber was adjacent to the corridor, the door tightly shut, the walls couldn’t be breached.","Then... try from the outside?","Mo Hua remembered that outside the boat, where it approached the water, there should be doors and windows.","He nodded, memorized the chamber’s location, then searched for a way nearby, finally at the corridor’s end, around a corner, found a ventilated window.","Mo Hua crawled out the window, then adhered to the flower boat’s wooden beam, heading toward the room where Hua Ruyu was.","Outside the room, sure enough, there was a window facing the water.","But this window was shut tight, unable to see inside or hear the slightest sound.","\"Must break the array on the window.\"","But generally speaking, the arrays outside the Spirit Boat are more stringent than those inside.","The difficulty of breaking the array from outside is much higher than from inside.","Mo Hua was a bit apprehensive, observed the array on the door and window, suddenly surprised to find, the array set up was actually the Divine Mist Array.","Moreover, under the Divine Mist Array, there was a Divine Lock Array, and within the Divine Lock Array, there was a faint aura of evil spirit, as if some demon monsters were sealed inside."]},{"number":1597,"title":"Chapter 1597 - 839: Shameless Couple (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua pondered for a moment, realizing in his heart.","The defense outside the Rouge Boat must be stronger than the inside.","Therefore, someone had laid down a dual Divine Way Array outside this large Rouge Boat, along with sealed demon monsters to prevent others from eavesdropping.","Outside the large Rouge Boat, even with ordinary formations no matter how complex, there would be people who could decipher them.","But the Divine Way Array is different, this formation is nearly lost to history, almost no one knows it, and raising some demon monsters practically guarantees success.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but nod in agreement, \"Indeed a good idea.\"","After that, he unlocked this Divine Way Array, and at the same time, some evil thoughts from the sealed demon monsters in the formation drilled into his Sea of Consciousness, only to be pinched to death in an instant.","For other formations, he would have to exert some effort.","But the Divine Way Array was much simpler.","After breaking the formation, Mo Hua took out a small dagger, quietly dug a small hole in the window, and then peered through it.","Now he could see the scene inside the room.","Pink bedding, a colorful luan screen, a rouge makeup case set in front of the bed, finely crafted jade items placed everywhere, clearly a lady’s boudoir.","At this moment Hua Ruyu was sitting at the table with the female disciple in pink, lips slightly parted, speaking unknown words.","\"No sound?\"","Mo Hua was startled.","It seemed like there was also a Sound Isolation Formation set up in the room.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, took out a silver needle, wrapped in iron wire, and pierced it into the crucial point of the Sound Isolation Formation through the window gap.","On the silver needle, he carved the sound listening formation with a micro-engraving pen technique.","The end of the silver needle’s thread wrapped around his ear, allowing him to hear the sounds inside the room.","...","\"Don’t think so much...\"","\"What’s wrong with that?\"","\"Appearance and figure are gifts bestowed by heaven on us women, naturally ’make use of them’...\"","\"But...\"","\"There’s no ’but’...\"","\"Think about it, your background isn’t great, if you marry normally, you’d only be matched with those ordinary men. With your looks, how can those ordinary men be worthy?\"","\"It’s different on this Rouge Boat, the traveling cultivators are all talented and noble, if not prestigious, then high-status. Even if you can’t marry them, having a few dewdrop encounters wouldn’t be a loss.\"","\"Seize the opportunity, don’t waste your looks...\"","\"Put aside those meaningless feelings of pride and shame, and you’ll experience the taste of it...\"","\"Yes, Instructor...\"","\"Don’t call me Instructor here.\"","\"Yes, elder sister.\"","\"Alright, you go ahead, Young Master Zhao is still waiting for you.\"","\"Hmm.\"","The pink-clad woman nodded, then whether resigning to her fate or having an epiphany, her expression relaxed somewhat and she gracefully left.","Mo Hua frowned.","What an Instructor Hua, truly knows how to \"teach\" people.","Being shameless himself, yet using these words to lead others astray.","After the pink-clad woman left, only Hua Ruyu remained in the room. She began to disrobe, preparing to bathe in the room.","Mo Hua felt there was nothing worth watching, so he decided not to look anymore.","Just at this moment, there was a knock on the door again.","Hua Ruyu’s gaze sank slightly, she donned her robe, walked to the door to look out, then with a full smile, welcomed the person outside in.","The newcomer was a man, wearing a mask, with one sleeve empty, seemingly missing an arm.","\"Missing an arm...\"","Mo Hua’s pupils shrank.","No need for him to think much, as soon as the man entered the room, he took off the mask, revealing a fair handsome face, albeit with a slightly sinister gaze.","Hua Ruyu stepped forward and embraced the man, the two gazed at each other, their brows filled with passion and affection.","\"Master Xie, why did you come only now?\"","\"Did you miss me...?\"","\"Hmm, missed you dearly.\"","\"My dear Miaoer...\"","In their words, all was tenderness.","Mo Hua felt a twinge in his teeth, and somewhat nauseated.","After a moment, he couldn’t help but draw a sharp breath.","It’s really Water Yama!","Moreover, this Water Yama actually has a relationship with Hua Ruyu!","These two despicable people!"]},{"number":1598,"title":"Chapter 1598 - 840: Madam Miao","paragraphs":["Fortunately, Uncle Gu is emotionally oblivious, with a heart as hard as stone, and hasn’t taken a liking to Hua Ruyu, otherwise he’d be wearing a massive green hat.","Blind dates are truly treacherous.","Mo Hua sighed inwardly.","But speaking of which, the terms these two adulterers use for each other do make Mo Hua pay some attention.","Water Yama calls Hua Ruyu \"Miaoer.\"","Miaoer...","Earlier at the ferry, Water Yama also said this carriage belongs to \"Miaoer.\"","Is this Hua Ruyu’s maiden name?","Mo Hua shook his head slightly.","\"I fear it’s not that simple, and moreover, this name feels somewhat familiar...\"","He furrowed his brows and thought for a moment, then his heart skipped a beat as he recalled.","Back when he killed Boss Jiang, on the list he seized from him, there were many Sin Cultivators’ aliases:","\"Poison Raksha, Fireworker Chief, Gold Arhat, Flower Gentleman, Human Butcher, Blood Woodcutter, Yin Thunder Child, Madam Miao, Ghost Face Sha, Crossing River Dragon...\"","These Sin Cultivators were either caught or killed, and Mo Hua had thoroughly \"cleansed\" them when earning rewards for merit points.","Now there are very few Sin Cultivators left on the list.","Among the few who slipped through, there is one called \"Madam Miao.\"","Madam Miao... Miaoer...","Mo Hua suddenly understood.","No wonder, despite capturing Sin Cultivators for so long, he hadn’t run into the one called \"Madam Miao\"—turns out she was hiding within the Sect, outwardly just an instructor...","And Hua Ruyu calls Water Yama \"Master Xie\"...","Could this \"Xie\" possibly be the \"Xie\" from the Xie family of Gui Water Sect?","Mo Hua remembered that Uncle Gu previously had a defeated foe, none other than a Golden Core Sword Cultivator from the Xie family of Gui Water Sect.","So, does this mean Water Yama is actually from the Xie family of Gui Water Sect, only never publicly revealing his identity?","As Mo Hua pondered, the two inside the room were already unable to restrain their affection, whispering sweet nothings.","After some time of intimacy, Water Yama said to Hua Ruyu:","\"You say you miss me, but I fear it’s otherwise. I’ve heard you’ve recently found a new lover, could it be you’re tired of me and don’t want to see me anymore?\"","Hua Ruyu’s eyes fluttered flirtatiously as she gazed at Water Yama, \"Just a performance, he’s a fool with only good looks, lacks finer feelings, like a stone, never as considerate as you, keeping me longing in my heart...\"","Hua Ruyu’s heart swayed, unable to resist pulling Hua Ruyu into his arms again, cherishing her for a while, yet unable to let go, he asked:","\"Who is that man, what’s his background?\"","Hua Ruyu replied: \"He’s a Supervisor from the Taoist Court, with Golden Core cultivation.\"","Upon hearing this, Water Yama’s expression gradually changed, \"Supervisor, Golden Core? What’s his name?\"","Unaware of Water Yama’s thoughts, Hua Ruyu simply asked: \"Are you jealous?\"","Water Yama shook his head, \"Tell me.\"","Hua Ruyu then replied, \"His surname is Gu, named Gu Changhuai.\"","The moment \"Gu Changhuai\" was mentioned, Water Yama’s eyes suddenly widened, word by word, he spat angrily: \"Gu Changhuai...\"","Seeing his unusual expression, Hua Ruyu asked puzzledly: \"What’s wrong?\"","Water Yama’s face twitched, he said bitterly: \"It’s him who severed my arm!\"","Hua Ruyu’s expression changed, murmuring: \"How could it be...\"","\"Did he approach you with another scheme?\" Water Yama’s eyes sharpened.","Hua Ruyu frowned, and after reflecting for a moment, shook her head:","\"I suspected it before, but later dismissed the idea. He was introduced to me long ago by an aunt from the clan, but he’s been evasive, claiming he’s too busy with affairs from the Taoist Court, hence we haven’t met.\"","\"Later, possibly pressed by the elders in the clan, he agreed to meet me a few times.\"","\"To say he schemed to approach me intentionally, he wouldn’t have started so early, dragging it for so long.\"","\"Moreover, Gu Changhuai doesn’t seem quick-witted at all. He’s rigid, not talkative, and his demeanor is cold and distant, clearly an uninteresting commoner. If not for his handsome appearance, decent family background, and cultivation, I wouldn’t even bother with him.\"","Water Yama’s heart was set at ease, but hearing Hua Ruyu repeatedly mention Gu Changhuai’s looks, he couldn’t help feeling a bit jealous.","\"If he’s such an uninteresting person, why have you seen him so many times?\"","Hua Ruyu sighed slowly, \"There’s no other way. Our relationship can’t be made public, and both the clan and Sect assume I’m alone, drawing some criticism. They arranged blind dates for me, I couldn’t refuse, but it’s merely to appease them, my heart is still only for you...\"","Hua Ruyu’s body pressed tightly against Water Yama, \"Both my body and heart are yours.\"","Embracing the soft jade, Water Yama’s heart fluttered, no longer caring, simply smiled and said:","\"Then one day, when I become Golden Core, and kill Gu Changhuai, you won’t be upset.\"","Hua Ruyu playfully said: \"If he’s dead, it’ll save me an eyesore of trouble.\"","Then she looked at Water Yama’s empty arm, her gaze pained, \"Will your arm grow back?\"","Water Yama’s eyes filled with hate, \"That Gu, though he’s a fool, his cultivation stands strong. I was at the Third Grade Territory when he slashed my arm with his Golden Core cultivation, wind-system spiritual power lingered in the wound like blades, cutting the flesh and bones, I’ve tried everything, but with little effect.\"","Hua Ruyu lamented: \"Then won’t you have only one arm for the rest of your life?\"","Water Yama’s hatred for Gu Changhuai deepened in his heart, turning to see Hua Ruyu’s face full of worry, he couldn’t help but pull her by the waist and tease:","\"Even with only one hand, I’ll hold you tight and never let go.\"","Hua Ruyu gently pinched him, \"Smooth talker.\"","\"You don’t like it?\""]},{"number":1599,"title":"Chapter 1599 - 840: Madam Miao (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"What do you think.\"","The two exchanged glances, unable to resist the urge to kiss. Another round of entanglement ensued.","Mo Hua found it offensive to look at.","Thought to himself, these shameless people, truly revolting, not doing anything proper, just dawdling here.","\"Before leaving the Rouge Boat, why not trick these shameless ones to their death together...\"","This Water Yama, full of evil deeds, has long been seeking his own doom.","As for Hua Ruyu, on the surface an instructor, but secretly a shameless \"procuress,\" also no good.","Almost put a hat on Uncle Gu.","Let them be \"locked\" on this Rouge Boat, so they won’t harm others anymore.","Mo Hua patiently watched for a while, hoping they’d mention some important matters.","But after a while, the two seemed about to attend to \"proper business.\"","Water Yama undid his belt, his only hand roamed over Hua Ruyu’s body, undressing her.","Mo Hua couldn’t bear to watch.","Kept watching, might as well grow a stye.","Such filthy scenes would taint his pure Taoist Heart.","Mo Hua sneered contemptuously, intending to leave.","At this moment, a voice sounded in the room:","\"No...\"","Halfway undressed, Hua Ruyu pressed down Water Yama’s restless hand, flushed face, panting, said:","\"Master Xie, now is not the time.\"","Water Yama’s hand didn’t stop, urgently said, \"It’s been so long since we’ve met, I’ve endured hard.\"","\"Really can’t,\" Hua Ruyu said, \"Rouge Boat is a significant matter, can’t afford any negligence.\"","Water Yama’s rage couldn’t be quenched, unwilling to relent.","Hua Ruyu softly said: \"Afterward, I’ll definitely let you enjoy a good time.\"","Water Yama looked at Hua Ruyu’s delicate face, gaze burning hot, voice slightly hoarse said, \"One time is not enough...\"","Hua Ruyu blushed, whispered: \"It’s all up to you.\"","Only then was Water Yama satisfied, no longer pestering.","Afterward, the two lowered their voices, discussing matters of the Rouge Boat.","Mo Hua nodded slightly, feeling a little satisfied, and continued to listen.","\"Are all the people here...\"","\"Yes.\"","\"This time, at the young master’s command, all the disciples from the Sect who need special attention are invited up.\"","\"Except for Taixu Gate, the young master says Taixu Gate has some issues, best not provoke them for now, avoid trouble...\"","\"Aside from Taixu Gate, other Eight Great Gates, Twelve Streams, have core disciples on board. Especially Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, need special hospitality.\"","\"The young master said...\" Hua Ruyu whispered, \"Have them take the pills, lose themselves for a while, so that they relish the taste, never forgetting, forever unable to leave Rouge Boat...\"","Mo Hua heard this, gradually his gaze became intense.","Afterward, the two inside the room said something, Hua Ruyu then pushed Water Yama, said:","\"You better go back, tonight is crucial, don’t be careless, and you’re seriously injured, need proper recuperation, can’t exhaust yourself.\"","Water Yama didn’t move, only sighed:","\"Been so long, do you really want me to leave?\"","Hua Ruyu blushed, \"I’m afraid if you don’t leave... I won’t be able to resist.\"","Water Yama paused, kissed Hua Ruyu’s cheek again, \"Alright, I’ll see to proper business, then come to service you.\"","They entwined for a while again.","Water Yama then got up to leave, but unable to resist his desires, reaching the door, suddenly remembered something, his gaze flickered, asked:","\"By the way, did you bring a ’chick’ on board this time?\"","Outside the window, Mo Hua heard this, paused.","Brought a \"chick\"?","Inside, Hua Ruyu also hesitated for a moment, her tender expression receding, her demeanor cooling a bit, warily said: \"How did you know?\"","\"I heard.\"","Hua Ruyu displeased, \"Such sharp senses... So what?\"","Water Yama just smiled.","Hua Ruyu coldly laughed: \"Don’t blame me for not warning you, this person is prepared for the ’young master’ above, you can’t touch her.\"","Water Yama coaxed her: \"Miaoer, what are you thinking.\"","\"Enough,\" Hua Ruyu said with a straight face, \"I won’t hide from you, this girl is direct lineage from the Sect, her status is not ordinary, originally not to be touched. But the trouble is, she thought she was clever, secretly investigating our affairs all along, unfortunately, she really uncovered the inside story, knew some things she shouldn’t know.\"","Hua Ruyu coldly laughed, \"Since it’s like this, then don’t blame me for being ruthless. Can only find a way to drag her into the mess, make her soak herself, let her learn a lesson, realize the world’s harshness...\"","A direct lineage of bloodline, status is not ordinary, still a chick, appearance also excellent.","Water Yama coveted greatly in his heart, but seeing Hua Ruyu’s cold gaze, outwardly only smiled and said:","\"What are you thinking, I told you, my heart has only you, other women, even if they look like Heavenly Immortals, I wouldn’t give them a glance.\"","Then he vowed and proclaimed sweet nothings to Hua Ruyu, only then did Hua Ruyu’s expression slightly ease.","The two intertwined for a while again, then Water Yama left.","After sending off Water Yama, Hua Ruyu turned back to her room, just sat down, frowned again, constantly feeling uneasy.","\"All these rotten men under heaven, all have the same vile nature.\"","\"Saying their heart holds only you, yet actually loving one wherever they see one.\"","\"There exist damnable mice, yet no cats abstaining from fish.\"","Hua Ruyu thought more and more uneasy.","\"Can’t let this dead man think of sneaking around, ruin my affairs, offend the young master...\"","Hua Ruyu frowned, then immediately got up, left the room.","Mo Hua’s gaze shifted slightly, then also moved to leave, climbed inside the ship along the ventilated window.","But having delayed a bit, after entering the Flower Boat, Hua Ruyu’s figure was already nowhere to be seen."]},{"number":1600,"title":"Chapter 1600 - 840: Madam Miao (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Fortunately, Hua Ruyu’s thickly applied rouge fills the air with its fragrance, lingering for a long time.","Mo Hua followed the scent, turning a few corners before seeing Hua Ruyu’s graceful figure ahead.","Hua Ruyu walked ahead, minding her own business, while Mo Hua quietly tailed from behind.","But as Mo Hua continued to follow, he realized that Hua Ruyu was walking in circles. Initially, he thought Hua Ruyu had discovered him, but after some thought, Mo Hua understood that she was guarding against Water Yama.","She was cautious about Water Yama following her and discovering the place of her \"secret affair.\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","These people’s minds are really filthy.","After a few rounds, confirming that Water Yama hadn’t followed, Hua Ruyu was finally at ease, changed her route, and walked to a secret room. She took out a token, dispelled the formation, opened the door, looked around, and then lightly stepped inside, closing the door behind her.","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow, noted the location of the secret room, and then used the same method to find a nearby ventilated window. He climbed outside the boat, found the window of the secret room by the water, broke the formation, pierced a small hole, inserted a silver needle, and looked inside.","The room was also an exquisitely decorated boudoir.","The decoration layout was similar to Hua Ruyu’s room, but with more hibiscus and lotus leaf carvings, giving it a simple elegance.","The only difference was that a woman was bound on the bed with a Spirit-binding Lock.","The woman was in the prime of her life, dressed in an embroidered gown, with a face as beautiful as the moon, now tied to the bed, her face pale, eyes filled with unyielding resentment, her beauty tinged with a hint of tragic elegance.","Mo Hua sighed lightly.","He was surprised, but upon reflection, not too surprised.","\"It’s Senior Sister Qianqian...\"","A direct lineage of the sect, her identity was special, and she was familiar with Hua Ruyu, secretly investigating the Rouge Boat’s matters...","Thinking it over, it’s Qianqian who has never let go of Senior Sister Ye Jin’s death.","She might have been investigating Senior Sister Ye Jin’s incident and inadvertently traced it to Hua Ruyu, learning some inside information, which Hua Ruyu noticed.","Inside the room, Qianqian was bound and her mouth gagged with a cloth, unable to speak, only looking at Hua Ruyu with eyes full of hate.","Seeing her in such a tragic and beautiful state, Hua Ruyu couldn’t help but feel a pang of pity and walked gracefully forward, stroking Qianqian’s fair face with affection:","\"You silly girl, why go to such lengths?\"","Qianqian’s eyes filled with hatred, her mind full of words, but unable to speak them.","Hua Ruyu thought for a while, then untied the cloth from her mouth.","Qianqian spat at Hua Ruyu.","Hua Ruyu didn’t avoid it, she simply said in a soft voice:","\"I know you’re angry and feel I’ve deceived you, but don’t you see, if you hadn’t meddled and kept investigating until you implicated me, I wouldn’t have been able to conceal it, and you wouldn’t be in this predicament?\"","Qianqian’s face flushed with anger, \"You’re lying, you’re the one behaving scandalously! I always treated you like my own sister, respected you, and now I find out you’ve done such despicable things, pushing fellow sisters into a pit of fire, do you have a conscience?\"","Hua Ruyu shook her head, \"You don’t understand, how could this be a ’pit of fire’?\"","Witnessing Qianqian’s naive look, Hua Ruyu felt both admiration and a faint jealousy.","\"You’re of direct lineage from the Hua family, blessed with talent and beauty, cherished since childhood. The elders of the sect, clan elders, all adore you, fellow sisters yield to you, you don’t understand how those of humble birth are marginalized in family sects, what kind of life they lead...\"","Hua Ruyu sighed, \"Let’s not talk about others, take Jin Er for example...\"","\"She has a good spiritual root, a top-grade pure Water Spirit Root. She’s also beautiful, with a kind of stunning charm within her gentleness. In a great family, she’d naturally be sought after as Heaven’s Chosen Daughter.\"","\"But her misfortune lies in her being just a little legitimate daughter of a Third Grade family.\"","\"No matter her appearance or talent, her birth is a hurdle she can’t overcome, spending her life never setting foot in the high gates of a great family.\"","\"In families, one grade makes a world of difference. Lacking a grade makes everything as different as clouds and mud.\"","\"In this life, she’ll either marry into a Fourth Grade family, to some useless collateral descendant, or else marry equally into the direct lineage of a Third-Grade family.\"","\"Can these ordinary men match her worth?\"","\"That’s why I helped her, acted as a matchmaker, so she could serve some truly talented sons from great families. If she wins their favor in the bedroom, she might genuinely become a phoenix soaring to great heights.\"","\"Even without name or status, having fleeting romances with these Heaven’s Chosen Sons is still preferable to marrying those common men as a legitimate spouse...\"","Hua Ruyu said with a look of deep emotion.","Hearing this, Qianqian felt indignant, but being gentle by nature, she couldn’t say harsh words, only said: \"Shameless!\"","Hua Ruyu didn’t mind, she just chuckled softly: \"You’re still not understanding what I’m saying.\"","She caressed Qianqian’s cheek again.","Qianqian wanted to break free, but her body was bound tight, she couldn’t move. She could only let this woman she once saw as a \"sister\", but now appeared like a \"poisonous woman\", touch her cheek.","\"What a tender face...\"","Hua Ruyu sighed, speaking wistfully, \"But still too young, knowing nothing, not yet experienced many things. Once you’ve tasted those pleasures and understood the affairs of men and women, you’ll see I never lied to you. Everything I did was for your benefit; people must mature eventually.\"","Qianqian was both ashamed and angry, with panic and dread visible in her expression.","Seeing this, Hua Ruyu felt an increasing pity, \"The first time is always frightening, so I found a handsome and steady good man for you, an acquaintance as well, so rest assured.\"","\"Consider this matchmaking for you; once you two are united, savoring the ecstatic taste within, becoming a real woman, you’ll understand my painstaking care.\"","Finishing her words, Hua Ruyu gagged Qianqian’s mouth once more.","\"Tonight is your ’wedding night’, you wait here patiently, while I go fetch your handsome groom.\"","Hua Ruyu said with a gentle smile, then got up and left.","Only Qianqian remained inside.","Bound and unable to move on the bed, the surroundings deathly silent and oppressive, her heart’s panic slowly spreading. Her face turned deathly pale, tears silently flowing from the corners of her eyes.","Mo Hua watched, unable to suppress a sigh, and inwardly confirmed:","\"This Hua Ruyu must be dealt with...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a while, then crawled back into the boat, intending to continue following Hua Ruyu, but upon entering the cabin, he suddenly heard voices.","Hua Ruyu hadn’t gone far and was speaking with a man.","\"Everything ready?\"","\"Mm, all prepared.\"","\"Good, no time to waste...\"","...","Who is Hua Ruyu talking to?","Mo Hua frowned, moved a little closer, and took a peek, and what he saw immediately shocked him.","The man talking with Hua Ruyu was someone he recognized as well.","Tall and thin, with a long face, he was Brother Ma of the Tai’a Sect, whom he once noticed had traces of the Evil God’s aura on him..."]}]);
